window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 Late Core Form Stage!","paragraphs":["1601 Late Core Form Stage!","These nine seals were a technique to condense a golden core. The more seals one had, the more powerful the golden core one could condense. And the higher the number of seals, the higher the probability of condensing a golden core.","Only the sect master had nine seals. Ordinary disciples only had three or four.","According to rumors, nine seals were not the limit for condensing a golden core. There were even more seals than that, and the golden core condensed would be even more powerful.","However, Ye Qiushui did not know that. After all, the sect she was in was only a small sect. It was still worlds apart from the top ten sects and the imperial court. Therefore, to her, even the Nine Seals Golden Core Technique was a rare technique.","As far as she knew, the disciples of large sects would condense their golden cores with the Nine Seals Golden Core Technique. Now that Chu Yunfan had casually imparted the technique to her, she was extremely touched. The reason why she had told Chu Yunfan about all this was because Sister Tang had saved her life, and now she owed Chu Yunfan a favor.","Who knew he would return the favor?","However, she didn’t have the time to think. She quickly comprehended the Nine Seals Golden Core Technique while absorbing the fused origin energy.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan saw this scene and felt relieved. He casually taught Ye Qiushui the method to form the golden core. It was nothing to him.","In terms of achieving a golden core, the Nine Seals Golden Core Method was pretty good. There were many other better methods in his mind. He had a total of eighty-one ninety-nine seals. Ninety-nine was the extreme number of heaven and earth. Therefore, a golden core cultivated with eighty-one ninety-nine seals was unprecedentedly powerful.","However, the more powerful the golden core was, the higher the requirements for the cultivator. If an ordinary person chose to use the Eighty-One Ninety-Nine Seals Golden Core Technique, they would not be able to condense a golden core even in their lifetime. Forcefully condensing a golden core through that technique would result in death.","He had seen Ye Qiushui’s cultivation. At most, she could withstand the Nine Seals Golden Core Technique. She couldn’t withstand more. Chu Yunfan wasn’t trying to be stingy. Not to mention that Ye Qiushui had helped him. She was sent by Tang Siyu to find him, so he would not be stingy.","After dealing with Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai, he could deal with his own matters seriously. It was different from Chu Hongcai who had to digest the energy after taking in a mouthful, or Ye Qiushui who only dared to take in small amounts of fused origin energy at a time.","Chu Yunfan used the Celestial Devouring Art. Every pore on his body was crazily absorbing the fused origin energy. Unlike Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai, he was absorbing the fused origin energy while digesting it.","The power of the Emperor Art and the strength of Chu Yunfan’s body were vividly displayed at this moment. His cultivation level was much lower than Ye Qiushui’s, but the speed at which he absorbed the fused origin energy was clearly ten times faster than her.","Soon, a huge vortex was formed around Chu Yunfan’s body. In this vortex, he was crazily absorbing the fused origin energy. This fused origin energy surged into his limbs and bones, constantly cleansing his physical body. Chu Yunfan’s physical strength, which had not improved for a long time, was improving continuously. Although this improvement was relatively small, it was very shocking if one considered that this was just the beginning.","Soon, Chu Yunfan calmed down and began cultivating. The hou clone appeared around him, protecting him. Some of the masters of the forces of Great Qi who tried to get close to the barrier were killed by a furry claw before they could figure out what was going on. This cut off the thoughts of others who wanted to investigate. At least, before Liang Rui returned, they did not dare to make any other moves.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation increased at an astonishing speed. Originally, he had just entered the intermediate Core Form Stage, but very quickly, he had already reached the peak of the intermediate stage. After reaching the peak, he did not stop and immediately began to charge into the late Core Form Stage.","After an unknown period of time, Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly fluctuated violently. Layers of divine power ripples appeared in his body. After a moment, his aura changed. Then, like an endless bottomless pit, he began to crazily absorb the surrounding fused origin energy. The energy around him was depleted. Following that, he absorbed even more.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. A sharp look flashed through his eyes, and a smile appeared on his face. Finally, he had stepped into the late Core Form Stage.","This rapid progress did not make his foundation unstable. On the contrary, the fused origin energy cleansed his body and made his foundation more stable than before. Compared to the previous time when he had not broken through, his strength had more than doubled.","However, he did not stop absorbing the fused origin energy. Instead, he continued to absorb it. There was still a lot of energy left. This array was not prepared for Liang Ruicai alone. There were several top experts at the peak Golden Core Stage standing behind him.","Moreover, compared to Chu Yunfan’s absorption efficiency, Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai were far inferior, so they didn’t absorb much.","At the same time, Liang Ruicai and the others, who were searching for Chu Yunfan, finally received news from Great Qi. The One-Horn Mountain Suppressor Beast that Liang Ruicai had left behind had been killed by Chu Yunfan, and the barrier of the Origin Energy Fusion Array had been broken. Chu Yunfan had broken into the array and began to crazily absorb the fused origin energy.","In Conglong City, Liang Ruicai and the others gathered together in a vast courtyard. This was the residence of Great Wei’s imperial advisor, but it had been forcibly requisitioned by Liang Ruicai and the others.","“That b*stard! Chu Yunfan is courting death!”","Liang Ruicai smashed an exquisite teacup made in Great Wei’s official kiln. His eyes were bloodshot. He never thought that as he thought of ways to find Chu Yunfan and kill him, Chu Yunfan would give him such a big surprise.","Chu Yunfan took advantage of their absence and raided their nest. Even the beast he left behind was killed.","When Liang Ruicai thought of this, his heart bled. Back then, to subdue the Mountain Suppressor, he had paid a huge price before finally succeeding.","Not to mention the Origin Energy Fusion Array. This was a major event that concerned him transcending the Core Stage, but now Chu Yunfan had destroyed it.","Chu Yunfan deserved to die!"]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 Peak of the Late Core Stage, Strong Enemy Attacks","paragraphs":["1602 Peak of the Late Core Stage, Strong Enemy Attacks","To subdue the Mountain Suppressor, Liang Ruicai had specially invited an elder of his sect to help him. He had paid a high price for this. However, the beast had an extraordinary bloodline and its strength was extraordinary. That was why he had the beast guard the array.","Even if Chu Yunfan dared to attack the array, the Mountain Suppressor should be able to hold him off. At the very least, it should be able to resist him until he returned. Who knew that it would be killed by Chu Yunfan so easily?","From the information he received, the beast was killed by Chu Yunfan without any suspense. The powerful thunder divine ability shocked almost everyone.","After hearing the news from Liang Ruicai, everyone’s expression changed. They all realized that they had been fooled by Chu Yunfan. Just when they thought that they could toy with Chu Yunfan in the palm of their hands and chase him until he was in a state of panic, they did not expect Chu Yunfan to lure the tiger away from the mountain. Taking advantage of the fact that they were not around, he had wiped out their nest.","“I’ve received accurate information. That b*tch Ye Qiushui betrayed us!” Liang Ruicai said with a livid expression.","He had received news that Ye Qiushui and Chu Yunfan had appeared together. There was no doubt that she had betrayed them. That was how Chu Yunfan avoided them and appeared at the array.","The people looked at Lu Hongyuan and Cui Mingjie with unfriendly expressions because they had sworn that Ye Qiushui would never betray them and join Chu Yunfan. No matter how they looked at it, it didn’t make sense. But who knew that Ye Qiushui would do the opposite and rely on Chu Yunfan so openly? This made them, who had vowed before, extremely embarrassed.","Their eyes flashed with an incomparably sharp killing intent.","“Since that b*tch has betrayed us, I won’t let her off easily. She thinks she can get rid of the Yin Yang Energy Sigil by relying on Chu Yunfan. I’ll let her know that it won’t be the sigil that kills her,” Liang Ruicai said coldly.","The only reason he could think of for Ye Qiushui to betray them was the Yin Yang Energy Sigil. If it wasn’t for the sigil, Ye Qiushui wouldn’t have any other reason to betray them. Although they weren’t always on good terms, they stood on the same side when facing the people of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","They had all come here, but not to spread advanced civilization. They had come to plunder resources. Therefore, it was the right time for them to gang up and plunder resources. Ye Qiushui must have come to the Violet Thunder Sword Domain with the same purpose. Other than being threatened by the Yin Yang Energy Sigil, he couldn’t think of any other reason.","Even so, the anger in his heart exploded. The Origin Energy Fusion Array had been disrupted by Chu Yunfan. It felt like he had worked so hard for many years for someone else.","“I want him to die!”","“Kill the adulterous couple!”","“They must pay the price!”","Everyone said indignantly.","“The problem is that to prevent Great Wei from invading them, Great Qi completely cut off all the teleportation circles from Great Wei to Great Qi. We can only teleport to the border of Great Wei, then fly to the border of Great Qi before we can teleport again,” someone said worriedly.","“It will only take a day. The fused origin energy in the array is endless. It was prepared for all of us. How much can the three of them absorb in a day? The key is that Chu Yunfan feels that it’s impossible and will try to destroy the array. At that time, the fused origin energy will scatter and our efforts will be in vain,” someone said worriedly.","Instantly, everyone’s expression fell. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan, Ye Qiushui, and Chu Hongcai were just three people. How much could they absorb? One day was not important. However, if Chu Yunfan destroyed the array, all their previous efforts would be in vain.","“D*mn it. That is a possibility,” someone said through gritted teeth. They judged others by themselves. After thinking about it, if it were them, they would probably do the same.","“If he dares to do this, I’ll tear him into pieces!” someone said.","“No matter what, we have to leave immediately,” Liang Ruicai said worriedly, “I’ll make sure he dies a horrible death!”","These people discussed for a moment and immediately rushed back to the capital of Great Qi.","At the same time, in the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the air. All the fused origin energy around him was depleted. He was like an endless bottomless pit, constantly absorbing the fused origin energy. Compared to Chu Yunfan, Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai combined had absorbed less than one percent of his fused origin energy.","The effect of this energy was truly astonishing. In just a short time, he had already reached the peak of the late Core Form Stage. He was only a little bit away from reaching the peak Core Form Stage.","This was only a matter of time. As long as Chu Yunfan continued to train, he would be able to break through to the peak of the Core Form Stage.","It was not impossible for him to reach the Golden Core Stage. And at that time, Chu Yunfan would use the Ninety-Nine Golden Core Seals to form his golden core and achieve a shocking leap, allowing his combat strength to surpass the Core Stage. Everything he was doing now was just building his foundation.","In addition to him, Ye Qiushui had stepped into the Golden Core Stage and was now consolidating her Golden Core Stage. Chu Hongcai was the weakest, but his improvement was also the most obvious. In a short period, he had stepped into the Core Stage from the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, completing a breakthrough in his cultivation in one go.","Everyone had gained a lot."]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 Ye Qiushui’s Power","paragraphs":["1603 Ye Qiushui’s Power","In a short period, the three of them had made huge gains and their strength had improved by leaps and bounds. But even so, there was still a lot of fused origin energy left. It was not something that the three of them could absorb in a short time.","Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai stopped absorbing the fused origin energy. Their cultivation base had improved greatly in a short time, so they needed time to digest it. Otherwise, it would be detrimental to their future cultivation.","“Since we can’t absorb any more, why don’t we destroy the array?” Ye Qiushui suggested, “If Liang Ruicai and the others make use of it, the consequences will be unimaginable.”","Judging by how their cultivation had improved by leaps and bounds in such a short time by absorbing the fused origin energy, if Liang Ruicai and the others used this energy, their cultivation might surpass the Core Stage. At that time, it would be truly terrifying. Moreover, this was originally for them to use to break through to the Core Stage.","Even though she had also stepped into the Golden Core Stage, she still had lingering fears about how powerful and terrifying those people were.","Chu Hongcai glanced at Ye Qiushui and couldn’t help but be speechless. She was really ruthless. When those people learned about it, they would probably raise their claws.","However, he didn’t say much. His experience over the years has allowed him to grow a lot. He naturally understood that he couldn’t be merciful to his enemies. Otherwise, it would be cruel to himself.","Chu Yunfan pondered for a moment and said, “There’s no need to destroy it yet. This fused origin energy can be used to make the Fused Origin Pill.”","Chu Yunfan recalled a pill from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. It was called the Fused Origin Pill, and the raw material of this pill was fused origin energy. Among the pills refined by alchemists, there was a very special kind. Pills made using special energy were easier to digest and convenient to carry. Spirit energy could be purified and refined into spirit pills. Some high-level cultivators used these pills as currency. Therefore, the higher the level of cultivation, the importance of alchemists did not decrease but instead increased.","Since he couldn’t absorb all this fused origin energy, he might as well refine it into a Fused Origin Pill. In the future, his breakthrough would depend on this pill. He would never leave it for Liang Ruicai and the others.","“All right then.” Ye Qiushui nodded.","She was a little surprised that Chu Yunfan was an alchemist and could refine all kinds of high-level energy into pills. This was not something that ordinary alchemists could do.","“But Liang Ruicai and the others will probably be back soon. You better hurry up,” she said.","“It’s fine. I’m waiting for them. It’s not certain who will kill who now.” Chu Yunfan smiled confidently.","Ye Qiushui suddenly remembered that this person’s strength had improved greatly. The original Chu Yunfan had made her feel that he was unfathomable and invincible. Though she had broken through to the Golden Core Stage, she felt that the gap had not narrowed, but had instead become wider.","“The two of you help me keep watch outside. I’m going to make pills,” Chu Yunfan said.","The two of them immediately left the array. Just as they left, they felt the array began to rumble and rotate. Countless fused origin energy began to boil like boiling water.","Fused origin energy surged toward Chu Yunfan. He opened his hand and grabbed the energy. At the same time, there was a white flame burning on his palm. He did not need an alchemic furnace. He used the sky as the furnace and the earth as the cover to start refining.","In the capital of Great Qi, more than ten figures suddenly appeared. There were scouts from various major forces waiting at the side of the teleportation circle.","“Liang Ruicai and the others are back!”","“As expected, it’s them. Chu Yunfan is extremely bold and hasn’t left yet. I’m afraid he won’t be able to leave now.”","“That’s right. He probably won’t be able to escape.”","Everyone immediately discussed this animatedly. The experts of the various large factions in Great Qi received the news and rushed to the Origin Energy Fusion Array. When they arrived, they saw Liang Ruicai and the others had arrived at the periphery of the Origin Energy Fusion Array. They were confronting Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai.","“B*tch, you betrayed us!” Liang Ruicai roared angrily, his eyes carrying a sharp killing intent. “Don’t think that I don’t dare to kill you. Even if you die here, no one will know that you’re dead.”","Ye Qiushui looked at Liang Ruicai coldly. It was useless for her to regret now. Moreover, she did not regret it.","“Cut the crap!” Ye Qiushui said. She wasn’t afraid because she knew that she had a top-notch master behind her.","Chu Hongcai, who was beside her, set up a defensive formation!","The experts from the various forces of Great Qi who were watching from afar clicked their tongues in wonder. Ye Qiushui and the others couldn’t see through Chu Hongcai’s strength now, but he had clearly only been in the Divine Abilities Stage earlier. Yet, he was now in the Core Stage. What kind of great improvement was this?","They could not help but feel envious, but they did not dare to go forward. Otherwise, they would be courting death.","“Liang Ruicai, let me kill her. This b*tch betrayed us. I want her dead!” Lu Hongyuan stepped forward. His eyes were fixed on Ye Qiushui, and he wanted to tear her into pieces.","“All right, I’ll let you kill her. Hurry up.”","Lu Hongyuan shouted and immediately attacked. Frost began to fly through the sky, covering everything with a layer of white.","“Flying Frost Slash!”","With his half-step Golden Core cultivation, Lu Hongyuan influenced the surroundings to create a phenomenon. Then, a bright saber light slashed out and headed for Ye Qiushui. He had full confidence that she was weaker than him.","However, at this moment, Ye Qiushui shouted. Her pretty face was as cold as ice. Then, she pointed out with a finger. A traceless attack slashed through the sky.","“Divine Delicate Cloud Slash!”","This finger was like an antelope lowering its horn, and it tapped on Lu Hongyuan’s saber light. The saber light was instantly shattered, and the Divine Delicate Cloud Slash headed in Lu Hongyuan’s direction at lightning speed.","Lu Hongyuan knew that this was bad, but it was already too late. The Divine Delicate Cloud Slash pierced through Lu Hongyuan’s head, and his entire head exploded. Blood splattered everywhere.","Lu Hongyuan died.","He was instantly killed."]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 Your Weakness Is a Sin!","paragraphs":["1604 Your Weakness Is a Sin!","Ye Qiushui unleashed her power and killed Lu Hongyuan with just a slash. No one expected this, especially Liang Ruicai and the others. In their opinion, Ye Qiushui’s strength was still a little weaker than Lu Hongyuan’s. Even if she had a breakthrough after absorbing the fused origin energy, she should at most be on par with Lu Hongyuan.","They never thought that there would be such a shocking battle record!","“You broke through to the Golden Core Stage!” Liang Ruicai instantly saw it. Ye Qiushui’s attack just now was clearly the power of the Golden Core Stage, not half-step Golden Core Stage.","Although the half-step Golden Core Stage was only half a step away from the Golden Core Stage, there was still a difference. And the difference was like heaven and earth.","Now, Ye Qiushui had broken through to the Golden Core Stage. Without a doubt, there was only one way for her to do this, and that was to absorb the fused origin energy. Moreover, what they could not figure out was how she had done this in a few days. Even if Ye Qiushui had absorbed the fused origin energy, she should not have broken through in such a short time.","When first condensing a golden core, one how to go into seclusion for several months to slowly fumble around before finally condensing a golden core.","What they didn’t know was that Ye Qiushui had the Nine Seals Golden Core Technique that Chu Yunfan had taught her. It wasn’t just a technique to condense a golden core, but also the experience of many sages. She didn’t need to slowly fumble around. She just needed to follow the map to easily complete the condensation of her golden core.","Hearing Liang Ruicai’s words, everyone’s expression changed. They didn’t put Ye Qiushui in their eyes. Although the half-step Golden Core Stage was not bad, it was nothing compared to them. However, if she was in the Golden Core Stage, then many things were another matter.","Thinking of this, the way these people looked at Ye Qiushui changed.","“You b*tch! I’ll kill you!” At this moment, Cui Mingjie flew out in anger and pounced at Ye Qiushui.","Ye Qiushui wasn’t afraid and pointed out with the Divine Delicate Cloud Slash.","Boom!","The battle between the two of them instantly exploded. It was as if all kinds of missiles were raining down at the same time. The sky shook. Cui Mingjie had entered the Golden Core Stage much longer than Ye Qiushui, but the quality of his mana was not as good as hers after being cleansed by the fused origin energy. For a moment, they were in a stalemate.","Liang Ruicai didn’t even look at them and said, “Who will go in there and catch Chu Yunfan? I want him dead!”","At this moment, a few experts who had already stepped into the Golden Core Stage were eager to give it a try. They all turned into a streak of light and headed deep into the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","Those who were not in the Golden Core Stage did not dare to make a move. After all, Chu Yunfan had killed many Golden Cores before. This meant that his strength was definitely far above the Golden Core Stage. How could they dare to catch him?","There were two intermediate Golden Cores among the experts who entered. The lineup was extremely powerful.","However, before Liang Rui and the others could hear the good news, a terrifying hand made of energy appeared from the void and grabbed the experts of Grand Xia who had turned into light.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","However, they only heard huge explosions. These people were actually caught in the air and exploded. Their flesh and blood were caught in mid-air and turned into a blood rain that was absorbed. Their golden cores were also caught by the big hand.","Only experts at the Golden Core Stage had their golden cores already formed. Even if their bodies were shattered, their golden cores would not be easily damaged. If they were at the Core Form Stage or the Void Core Stage, their bodies would be shattered, and their golden cores would be shattered as well.","“Liang Ruicai, if you want to kill me, you have to do it yourself. Why did you send some small fries to die?” A cold voice came from the array.","At this moment, Liang Ruicai realized that the way the others looked at him had changed. They had already begun to suspect that they had sent them to their deaths. The team that didn’t have much trust in the first place was about to fall apart.","Liang Ruicai couldn’t defend himself, because, in fact, he did have the idea of letting them explore the road. After all, the strength that Chu Yunfan displayed made his heart palpitate.","His thoughts were immediately exposed by Chu Yunfan. Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but feel a little embarrassed.","“Fine, since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish!’ Liang Ruicai shouted, but he didn’t attack the array. Instead, he attacked Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai. His punch was like a mountain falling down. This was his famous ultimate skill, the Mountain Crushing Fist.","With this punch, even a mountain range would be blown into pieces.","Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai immediately felt an extreme danger surging up from the bottom of their hearts. They wanted to dodge, but there was no way. It was as if they were locked in their original position by an aura.","At this moment, Ye Qiushui truly felt how terrifying Liang Ruicai was. Although he was being played by Chu Yunfan, his strength was really terrifying.","At this critical moment, a large hand appeared in the air and blocked the punch.","Boom!","The punch collided with the energy hand, causing a violent explosion that formed a tidal wave that swept in all directions. Taking advantage of this gap, Ye Qiushui and Cui Mingjie quickly separated. The battle here was not something they could interfere with.","Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai retreated to the side, while Cui Mingjie retreated behind Liang Ruicai.","Then, a figure slowly walked out of the array. Liang Ruicai and the others finally saw the person who appeared clearly. It was a young man in black clothes. His face was delicate and handsome with a hint of determination. He was about 20 years old. He looked extremely young, but he had a bearing that was unfathomable.","Liang Ruicai and the others understood that this must be the legendary Chu Yunfan.","Seeing Chu Yunfan appear, Liang Ruicai could not help but grit his teeth in hatred. He thought that he could play Chu Yunfan in the palm of his hand, but who knew that he would be played like a monkey by Chu Yunfan?","“You dare to stay here and not leave. I think you’re tired of living,” Liang Ruicai said through clenched teeth.","“I stayed here to kill you. I have no grudge against you, but you want to kill me. Since that’s the case, don’t blame me for being ruthless.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Kill me? Hahahaha!” Liang Ruicai burst into laughter. “What do you mean by no grudges? You’re weak, but you offended a big shot. That is your sin!”","Liang Ruicai laughed."]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 Chu Yunfan...Is So Strong!","paragraphs":["1605 Chu Yunfan...Is So Strong!","“Weakness is a sin?” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile. This thinking was unreasonable, but to many people, it was the truth.","He knew that if Li Qianyuan, the Huntian Marquis, wanted to kill him, there would be countless people who wanted to work for him because Li Qianyuan was strong enough. Everyone wanted to gain enough benefits from killing Chu Yunfan.","It was a pity that they had all misjudged Chu Yunfan’s strength. His strength was more than just this little bit.","“This logic may be correct, but you’ve overestimated yourself.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Then, he looked at Cui Mingjie, who was standing behind Liang Ruicai. Cui Mingjie felt goosebumps all over his body when Chu Yunfan looked at him. It was as if he was being stared at by a ferocious beast.","“I didn’t expect you to betray me.” Chu Yunfan sighed.","“Betray? We’ve never been your subordinates. You, a native, dared to make us lower our heads to you. You don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!” Cui Mingjie said loudly. He looked down on Chu Yunfan. To him, bowing to Chu Yunfan was a lifelong humiliation.","“I didn’t want to kill you, but since you’re courting death, I don’t mind sending you on your way,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Do you think that you can seal the Yin Yang Energy Sigil with a sealing talisman?”","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan’s fingers formed a seal and he shouted, “Explode!”","At that moment, Cui Mingjie felt the sealing talisman in his body begin to shatter. It exploded at lightning speed. Immediately after, the terrifying power of the Yin Yang Energy Sigil erupted.","Boom!","Cui Mingjie’s body exploded into a cloud of blood mist.","Everything happened too fast, so fast that no one could react in time, and it happened right under Liang Ruicai’s nose. Chu Yunfan attacked as he said. His ferocity was far beyond their imagination.","The experts of Grand Xia were all shocked. They thought that they had been through hundreds of battles, but they did not know that what they had experienced was nothing compared to Chu Yunfan, who had crawled out of a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood.","“You b*stard! You’re courting death!”","Liang Ruicai was furious. Chu Yunfan had dared to attack in front of him. He had no respect for him. This was equivalent to slapping him several times.","“I’m looking for dead? You’re the one who’s seeking death!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan attacked. He turned into a bolt of lightning and disappeared from where he stood. In the next moment, he had already appeared in front of the group of Grand Xia experts behind Liang Ruicai.","These experts of Grand Xia were shocked and furious. Chu Yunfan was treating them as pushovers.","“You’re courting death. You’ve underestimated Liang Ruicai!”","Immediately, an intermediate Golden Core attacked. A spirit weapon flew out. This weapon was a book. There was only one word written in the book: kill.","“A mere middle-grade spirit weapon dares to clamor in front of me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch.","The Killing Path book was blown up, and Chu Yunfan’s punch did not lose its momentum. This intermediate Golden Core did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to blow up his spirit weapon. He was completely unprepared and was hit by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Boom!","His body exploded. His flesh and blood were taken away by Chu Yunfan, and his golden core was also taken away.","Chu Yunfan was too fast. It only took him a second to eliminate an intermediate Golden Core. However, this bought some time for the remaining experts. Those experts joined forces and formed an array, crushing down on Chu Yunfan. They tried to use the power of the array to suppress him.","Just now, Chu Yunfan had casually killed an intermediate Golden Core, which had frightened them so much that they had come here in fear. However, they still underestimated Chu Yunfan’s current strength. After entering the peak of the late Core Form Stage, Chu Yunfan’s strength underwent an earth-shattering change.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","This simple punch blasted out, turning into eight heavenly dragons, each of which bombarded an expert of Grand Xia.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","These experts were struck by the eight heavenly dragons, and their bodies exploded. They died instantly, and their flesh and blood were taken by Chu Yunfan to water the Brahma Tree. He also took golden cores.","With just one punch, more than half of the experts of Grand Xia were instantly killed.","The remaining people were almost torn apart. They had also suffered a backlash from their array that had been broken. At this moment, they did not dare to stay any longer and fled.","Chu Yunfan was already prepared. Countless lightning weapons appeared around him and chased after them at lightning speed.","“Stop!” Liang Ruicai shouted. He was shocked and angry. He turned his hand and threw the Mountain Crushing Fist at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan slapped him with his palm.","Boom!","The two sides collided, turning into a terrifying torrent that rolled backward.","However, Liang Ruicai was still unable to stop Chu Yunfan from killing them. Just as his attack was blocked by Chu Yunfan, the remaining experts of Grand Xia were also killed and their corpses were taken away by Chu Yunfan.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only happened in a short time.","The smell of blood permeated the air, and the wails of these experts of Grand Xia lingered in everyone’s ears.","“You’re dead! You’re dead! You killed them, you native! There’s no place for you in this world!” Liang Ruicai roared angrily, his eyes red.","The various major powers ‘experts were completely dumbfounded. It was as if they were looking at a peerless killing god.","They had never thought that someone could casually slaughter Golden Cores.","“Chu Yunfan...is so strong!”"]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 Great Strength Divine Talisman","paragraphs":["1606 Great Strength Divine Talisman","In their eyes, any Golden Core was an invincible and terrifying existence. Any one of them had the ability to wipe out an entire country.","Xiang Feiyun and Liang Ruicai had already proven that they had the ability. But now, Golden Cores with such terrifying strength had been slaughtered so easily by Chu Yunfan. They did not know how he had such shocking strength.","Some people suspected that Chu Yunfan had obtained the legendary inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect. There shouldn’t be any other inheritance that could nurture such a terrifying existence.","Many people had never heard of Chu Yunfan’s inheritance. In many people’s eyes, the so-called Chu family was just a smokescreen. The Chu family was considered a noble clan in Conglong, but it was nothing compared to the entire Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Therefore, this suspicion began to take root in their hearts. Other than that, they could not think of any other inheritance that could create such a monster.","Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at Liang Ruicai. “Don’t worry. It’ll be your turn soon.”","Liang Ruicai’s heart burned with anger and his eyes flashed with killing intent.","“You’re going to kill me?!” Liang Ruicai roared.","He punched out, and his fists fell like two mountains. Looking from afar, it was as if two mountains had crashed down, and the entire sky seemed to have been overturned.","Compared to the experts of Grand Xia, Liang Ruicai’s strength was at least twice as strong as theirs. A difference of one level was enough to turn the world upside down.","The surroundings of the Origin Energy Fusion Array trembled non-stop. One could imagine how terrifying the power of these punches was.","Chu Yunfan looked at the mountain-like fist but didn’t care. He just sneered and didn’t stop. He formed a seal.","“Mountain Wrap Seal!”","Chu Yunfan used the Mountain Wrap Seal and produced a huge mountain that came crashing down. Immediately, it was as if three divine mountains had collided in midair. The scene was naturally incomparably shocking, especially for many people who had never seen such a soul-stirring battle in their lives.","To them, the attack of a Golden Core was no different from a miracle.","Boom!","The air exploded, and the mountain turned into energy waves that rolled in all directions like a landslide and tsunami.","At this moment, Liang Ruicai was impressed by Chu Yunfan for the first time. Before this, he had looked down on Chu Yunfan. He thought that with his strength, he could completely suppress Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was not inferior to his?","This made him realize that there was something wrong with his previous plan.","“End of the line, Liang Ruicai. If that’s all you have, you should just lie down and leave.” Chu Yunfan sneered. He casually threw a punch, which turned into eight dragons, and instantly crushed Liang Ruicai.","Liang Ruicai was forced to retreat and ran out of breath. Chu Yunfan’s punch was too powerful, but his eyes flashed with a bright light as he shouted, “So you have such a method hidden. No wonder you dare to go against me.”","Liang Ruicai calmed his mind. He formed a seal, and suddenly, a symbol appeared on his body. It turned into an enormous figure and surged into his body.","“Brother Chu, be careful. That’s the Great Strength Divine Talisman of the Divine Talisman Sect!” Ye Qiushui shouted anxiously, “The Great Strength Divine Talisman can greatly increase the user’s strength!”","Chu Yunfan remembered that Ye Qiushui had once mentioned that one of the ten great sects that ruled Grand Xia was the Divine Talisman Sect. They used all kinds of talismans as a means to strengthen themselves. Among the many sects, this sect was famous.","Liang Ruicai was using the famous Great Strength Divine Talisman of the Divine Talisman Sect. After using it, his strength would increase by an astonishing amount.","“Hahahaha, there’s no time to run!” Liang Ruicai laughed.","It was not easy for outsiders to obtain the talismans of the Divine Talisman Sect. Although there were all kinds of talismans on sale, they were not cheap. In particular, the Great Strength Divine Talisman, which could increase one’s strength, was sold at a very high price. Once it was used, the power of the Great Strength Divine Talisman completely erupted.","Liang Ruicai’s mana did not change, but his aura had increased by several levels.","“Mountain Crushing Fist!”","Liang Ruicai punched again. This time, it was completely different from before. This punch shattered the sky as if it would tear the entire sky apart.","“Great Strength Divine Talisman? I want to see how powerful it is!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly.","At this moment, he finally understood why Cui Mingjie and the others were so confident that they could suppress the Yin Yang Energy Sigils he had planted. The thing that suppressed the Yin Yang Energy Sigil he planted should be the sealing talismans refined by the Divine Talisman Sect.","However, they had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s Yin Yang Energy Sigil. The Yin Yang Energy Sigil that Chu Yunfan used was not suppressed by the sealing talisman that they had refined. It broke through the sealing talisman that they had refined and caused Cui Mingjie to die instantly.","Chu Yunfan also threw a punch. The shadow of the eight heavenly dragons met the mountain-like punch.","Boom!","The collision was clearly on a higher level than before. The air shook violently, and the sky shook.","After using the Great Strength Divine Talisman, Liang Ruicai’s strength had clearly increased by a level. In a battle between experts, even if there was only a slight difference, there would still be a huge gap, let alone such a huge increase.","With a punch, both sides were actually evenly matched.","Liang Ruicai’s expression finally changed. This was already his trump card, but he still couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. After using the Great Strength Divine Talisman, his strength increased by several times compared to before. He could even destroy monsters of the same level, but he could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he suddenly realized how powerful Chu Yunfan was. He was simply a monster in human skin."]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 Killing Liang Ruicai","paragraphs":["1607 Killing Liang Ruicai","Liang Ruicai realized that Chu Yunfan had attacked casually before. Clearly, he had not used his full strength. This was what he was most afraid of.","Chu Yunfan was clearly only in the Core Form Stage, but his physical strength was so great. Or rather, Chu Yunfan had always been like this. It was just that before this, he could not even Chu Yunfan’s bottom line.","Only now, after using the Great Strength Divine Talisman, could he finally see the depths of Chu Yunfan’s strength.","“The Great Strength Divine Talisman. Not bad!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. He didn’t care. He didn’t even look and immediately punched out again. In an instant, the sky shook violently.","“D*mn it!”","Liang Ruicai’s eyes flickered with a terrifying light. He crossed the distance and instantly appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. He wanted to seize the opportunity. All of his mana boiled and shot into the sky like a white rainbow as if it wanted to pierce through the entire world. A peak Golden Core could not be underestimated. He was fearless against everyone on the same level.","However, Chu Yunfan did not care to look at it. He only punched out, piercing through everything and shattering everything.","Liang Ruicai’s fists were like two mountains as they fell down, trying to crush Chu Yunfan with his boundless mana. However, in an instant, the white rainbow-like mana was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s attack. It collided with Liang Ruicai’s fists.","Boom!","The world changed color. The strength of both sides surged to a terrifying extent. At this moment, they were not inferior to some peak Golden Cores.","Liang Ruicai was given a steady stream of power through the Great Strength Divine Talisman. That terrifying power was enough to cut through everything. If he hadn’t met Chu Yunfan, who had a terrifying physical cultivation base, he would have been invincible.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The two sides continued to exchange blows in the air without any fancy moves. At their level, they were fighting head-on, relying on their own strength.","Liang Ruicai was feeling a little anxious. He could feel that the divine power in his body was starting to stagnate under Chu Yunfan’s crazy attack, not to mention that the effect of the Great Strength Divine Talisman was gradually declining. It was impossible to keep increasing.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His strength came from himself. He was powerful in all aspects. Such a battle could not even make him gasp for breath.","Chu Yunfan quickly suppressed Liang Ruicai and put him at a disadvantage.","Boom!","There was another clash, but this time, Liang Rui was forced back a few steps. Wounds appeared on his arms, and blood splashed out. It was caused by Chu Yunfan.","Although his strength had increased, the toughness of his physical body had not increased. His weakness was exposed.","How could Chu Yunfan let go of such a good opportunity? He took a step forward, his blood surging like a pillar. His whole body was like a golden god of war, instantly appearing in front of Liang Ruicai.","“I’ll finish you off in one go! Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch. The eight dragons turned into eight figures and landed on Liang Ruicai.","Bang!","With a loud explosion, Liang Ruicai let out a miserable cry. He flew backward, and wounds covered his body. It was simply unbearable to look at. He was no longer as arrogant and domineering as before.","Liang Ruicai finally accepted the fact that he was no match for Chu Yunfan. Thinking of this, he did not dare to stay any longer and immediately fled into the distance. However, just as he was about to escape, a large hand descended from the sky and landed on him.","Bam!","Liang Ruicai exploded in the air and split into pieces. However, his corpse and golden core were absorbed into the Mountain River Diagram by the big hand.","One of the talismans that was flickering with a faint light fell into Chu Yunfan’s hand. It was a talisman with ancient seal characters written on it. Ordinary people might not recognize this ancient seal character, but how could Chu Yunfan not recognize it? With the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, he immediately recognized that this ancient seal character was strength.","The word “strength” seemed to possess divine power, providing the user with an endless stream of power.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were fixed on the Great Strength Divine Talisman. Suddenly, the godhead in his mind emitted bursts of light. A lot of information about the talisman suddenly appeared in front of him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a supercomputer, constantly analyzing all kinds of information about the Great Strength Divine Talisman and deducing many mysteries. Combined with the many records of the talisman chapter in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, Chu Yunfan analyzed the various mysteries of the Great Strength Divine Talisman in just a moment.","When he came back to his senses, he had already understood a lot of the mysteries of the talisman path. Talismans were divided into two types. One was an invisible energy talisman. Such energy talisman depended on the mana of the person who used it. In other words, the stronger the user, the more powerful the talisman would be. On top of that, energy talismans would disappear very quickly after use.","Of course, these talismans were the most common one-time-use talismans in Grand Xia, and they were relatively cheap.","However, the one in Chu Yunfan’s hand was different. It was a paper talisman refined from extremely precious heavenly materials and earthly treasures. The power of a paper talisman far exceeded that of energy talismans. Moreover, a paper talisman was used properly, it could be used several times. One only needed to know how to fill it with energy.","However, the method of injecting energy was a secret of the Divine Talisman Sect. Outsiders did not know about it. Therefore, in Liang Ruicai’s hands, it was a one-time-use talisman, and it was extremely expensive.","But Chu Yunfan had used the godhead to thoroughly analyze the mysteries of this talisman. This Great Strength Divine Talisman could be used repeatedly in his hands.","Chu Yunfan himself had boundless strength. With the addition of this Great Strength Divine Talisman, one could imagine how much Chu Yunfan’s strength would increase. For a short time, Chu Yunfan would even dare to challenge a peak Golden Core.","This was a great harvest. Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction and then returned to the Origin Energy Fusion Array to continue refining the Fused Origin Pill."]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 The Violet Thunder Swords Finally Appears","paragraphs":["1608 The Violet Thunder Swords Finally Appears","Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai also returned to the Origin Energy Fusion Array. They were going into seclusion for a time to consolidate their huge gains.","Chu Yunfan was strong, so strong that it exceeded their imagination.","“He’s so strong. His gaze swept across me earlier, and I couldn’t even move!”","“This is the aura of the number one...”","“That’s right. So what if Grand Xia is powerful? We have Chu Yunfan!”","The experts from all sides were discussing animatedly. They were all hostile toward Chu Yunfan before, but after being abused by the experts from Grand Xia, they could not help but stand on Chu Yunfan’s side.","As time went by, the news of Chu Yunfan killing Liang Ruicai and the other experts spread. For a time, it caused a huge uproar. This was not the first time. This was the second time that Chu Yunfan had killed the experts of Grand Xia on a large scale.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had killed Xiang Feiyun and the others who had caused trouble in the capital of Great Wei. In total, dozens of people had died at his hands, and more than half of them were experts above the Golden Core Stage. Many people couldn’t help but exclaim in shock. They didn’t know when their Violet Thunder Sword Domain had produced such an unprecedented figure. Even the top experts of Grand Xia were no match for Chu Yunfan.","To them, this was simply unimaginable.","Many people placed their hopes on Chu Yunfan. They were no longer able to fight against these people from Grand Xia, but there was a powerful existence among them who could fight against Grand Xia.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s name shook the world, and his reputation was unparalleled. However, an even bigger piece of news spread throughout the world overnight.","The last remnants of the Violet Thunder Swords, which had once ruled over the entire world, had been found. And the people who had found it were none other than the experts from Grand Xia.","This news caused a huge uproar.","Originally, many ordinary people did not know of the existence of the Violet Thunder Swords. But after experiencing such a series of events, especially the experts of the various local powers, they now knew a few things about the Violet Thunder Swords.","A long time ago, this world was ruled by the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. It was precisely because of this that the appearance of the Violet Thunder Swords had shocked the entire world.","Most likely, the people from the larger factions knew a little about the Violet Thunder Swords. Naturally, they understood what the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance was. There were many people who wanted to obtain the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance.","As for the experts from Grand Xia who had broken through the barrier, they were here for the sake of the Violet Thunder Swords’s inheritance.","During this period, the entire world had been turned upside down for the sake of the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance. Everything revolved around it. All these years, the various major powers in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had been searching for the Violet Thunder Swords inheritance one after another. However, they had never been able to find it. In fact, to most people, the inheritance didn’t exist.","The Violet Thunder Swords had been destroyed a long time ago, so how could there still be any inheritance left? If there was, it should have been found long ago.","No one knew where the Violet Thunder Swords’ final headquarters was. After the passage of time, many of the ancient books had long since disappeared amid the chaos of war.","But the Violet Thunder Swords had re-emerged, not in the human world, but in the demon league.","But in the demon league, many demons too had suffered the same attacks. Many top experts of Grand Xia entered the demon league and destroyed many demon tribes. Those once prominent demon kings were crushed to death in their own territory little chicks.","They were flattened, and the demons suffered heavy casualties. Some became Grand Xia’s lackeys and others were killed. In a short time, the demon league lowered their heads to the experts of Grand Xia.","Grand Xia mobilized the entire strength of the demon league to search for the Violet Thunder Swords. After a long time, they finally found the Violet Thunder Swords’ headquarters.","It caused a sensation in the world overnight.","It was only now that everyone realized that no matter how hard they tried, there was no news of the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance. It turned out that the Violet Thunder Swords’ headquarters had always been in the Ultimate West Demon League.","What followed was even more news. The experts of Grand Xia had found the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate and commanded a large number of monsters of the demon league to attack the gate, they were not afraid of being attacked.","Who would have thought that countless sword energy would burst forth from the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate? Countless monsters were instantly killed. Even the experts of Grand Xia suffered heavy casualties.","For a moment, the entire world was in an uproar. Everyone then realized that although the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate had been found, it would not be that easy to break into it.","Currently, the experts of Grand Xia were all stationed outside the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate, trying to figure out a way to break into the place. The monsters of the demon league were constantly being driven to attack the gate. There were countless casualties and blood flowed like rivers. It was as if tribe after tribe was wiped out.","The Violet Thunder Swords was so difficult to deal with that it could be said to shock the world.","At this moment, everyone knew that the experts of Grand Xia were far from just a few. In fact, the true top experts who entered the Violet Thunder Sword Domain this time were not even the famous Xiang Feiyun and Liang Ruicai.","For a moment, this news covered up the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed Liang Ruicai and occupied the Origin Energy Fusion Array."]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 Yang Feifeng of the Holy Puppets","paragraphs":["1609 Yang Feifeng of the Holy Puppets","As soon as this news was released, the experts of the major forces frenziedly rushed to the Ultimate West Demon League. Although their strength was far inferior to those of Grand Xia and they might not even be able to withstand a casual slap from others, this concerned the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords, so they had no choice but to go crazy.","Chu Yunfan was only suspected to have obtained the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords, and it was already so incredible. If they could obtain the inheritance, they might not be extraordinary, but at least they would have enough power to protect themselves before the storm came.","At this time, the demon league had been completely defeated. How could they still have the ability to stop the invasion of the experts of these major forces?","For a moment, all kinds of experts had gathered in the demon league. Martial arts experts who were rarely seen could be seen everywhere.","But soon, another piece of news spread, and this matter was related to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had already caused a huge uproar when he killed Xiang Feiyun and the others. Later on, even Liang Ruicai and the others died at his hands. Even the Origin Energy Fusion Array that Liang Ruicai had prepared for a long time was occupied by Chu Yunfan.","He was boldly standing on the opposite side of these experts of Grand Xia. He was just short of pointing at them and slapping their faces.","It was said that the Origin Energy Fusion Array was related to some of the top experts and helped them break through to the Core Stage. Now that Chu Yunfan had occupied the array, it was obvious that both sides would definitely fall out with each other.","“Who is Chu Yunfan? The number one expert in the world? He’s just a frog in a well. We were attacking the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate, so we didn’t have the time to deal with him. Now that he dares to occupy the Origin Energy Fusion Array, there’s no way for him to escape!”","This announcement was deafening and spread throughout the world overnight. The impact of this matter was too great. It could be said that it represented the conflict between Grand Xia and the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","Chu Yunfan’s strength and reputation were unquestionable. He was the number one expert in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain and had killed dozens of experts from Grand Xia.","The identity of the person who said this was finally revealed. As people spread the news, everyone came to know about this person.","Yang Feifeng, a disciple of the Holy Puppet Sect.","This was also the first time many people had heard of this name. Soon, those within the demon league spread more information. Although this was the first time that Yang Feifeng was known by the major forces of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, he was famous within the demon league.","His puppet army had slaughtered countless demon tribes. His reputation was illustrious and unimaginably powerful. Even from the information unintentionally revealed by the experts of Grand Xia, it people figured out that Yang Feifeng’s strength was far above Liang Ruicai, Xiang Feiyun, and the others who were killed by Chu Yunfan.","However, someone felt that something was wrong. It seemed that someone was adding fuel to the fire behind the scenes, wanting Yang Feifeng and Chu Yunfan to go against each other. They had the intention of borrowing a knife to kill someone, but nobody knew who was borrowing whose knife to kill who.","Many people realized that not all the experts of Grand Xia were in harmony. There were probably many conflicts that outsiders did not know about. However, many people who knew the inside story understood that these experts of Grand Xia who entered the Violet Thunder Sword Domain were from different sects. They might not be on good terms with each other.","For a moment, everyone fell silent. They felt that another terrifying storm was about to arrive. Everyone was waiting to see how Chu Yunfan would react.","However, Chu Yunfan acted as if he hadn’t heard these words. He remained in the Origin Energy Fusion Array and had no intention of responding to these words.","A storm was coming. Everyone realized that it was going to be another violent collision.","Now, Yang Feifeng was unable to spare any time because there was news that the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate was about to be breached. No one would be willing to leave and lose this opportunity. And Chu Yunfan seemed to be constantly absorbing the fused origin energy and was unwilling to leave either.","However, this seemingly peaceful situation would obviously not last.","Once the gate was breached and the inheritance within was taken, the thunderous attack from the experts of Grand Xia would only be a matter of time.","Time passed day by day. Just as everyone was waiting nervously, a figure suddenly tore through the sky from the direction of the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate, heading toward the capital of Great Qi.","Someone recognized that figure. It was Yang Feifeng’s puppet!","Yang Feifeng came from the Holy Puppet Sect of Grand Xia and was skilled in using all sorts of puppet techniques. Puppets were extremely powerful, and they were even comparable to human martial arts experts.","The puppet that had left the Violet Thunder Sword Sect was the one Yang Feifeng had been using most frequently. He relied on this puppet to slaughter hundreds of demon tribes. It was simply invincible. Just by relying on this puppet, Yang Feifeng had already made a name for himself.","According to everyone’s speculation, the strength of this puppet alone was probably not inferior to the peak of the Golden Core Stage. No wonder Yang Feifeng looked down on Chu Yunfan. His puppet had strength that surpassed Liang Ruicai, so he naturally did not take Chu Yunfan seriously.","For a time, all eyes in the world were attracted by this puppet.","In the capital of Great Qi, outside the Origin Energy Fusion Array, countless scouts stared at the formation.","Suddenly, a beam of light flashed from the teleportation circle in the capital of Great Qi and a figure flew out. In just a moment, it reached the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","“Chu Yunfan, come out and accept your death!”","This voice was like a great bell that shook the world.","Instantly, everyone’s eyes focused on this figure. They saw that it was a puppet that looked like it was made of an unknown metal. It was about the same height as an ordinary person and looked like an ordinary puppet. However, its body carried a monstrous might.","“It’s here. It’s the puppet!” someone exclaimed.","The scouts of these large factions had long received the news and asked them to keep an eye on this place. Now, Yang Feifeng’s puppet had finally arrived. Although it was just a puppet, its monstrous might made countless people tremble with fear.","“Yang Feifeng didn’t come in person, but sent a puppet to die.”","A clear voice came from the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","Immediately after, three figures flashed out. They were Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai, and Ye Qiushui."]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 Stomping a Peak Golden Core to Death","paragraphs":["1610 Stomping a Peak Golden Core to Death","“I’ve come to die?”","A sharp light flashed through the puppet’s eyes. Although it looked like it was made of gold and iron, its expression was rich, no different from a human’s.","“A mere native dares to speak such nonsense.”","The puppet’s words were full of contempt. It was not the least bit afraid of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan sneered. Although he had never seen such a puppet before, this did not prevent him from knowing about it. Whether it was in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories or in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, there were records of it.","This puppet was a type of secret technique puppet. It was the same idea as the unmanned mecha the Federation was developing. The Federation had started to develop artificial intelligence many years ago. However, these artificial intelligence could only handle ordinary tasks, and the various things in martial arts were complicated. Even humans themselves might not be able to fully understand them, let alone artificial intelligence. Therefore, although the intelligent mecha project was underway, there were not many results.","This puppet was similar, except that the one controlling the puppet was not a smart chip but a trace of the user’s primordial spirit. Therefore, it was not this puppet that was talking to him now, but Yang Feifeng’s primordial spirit hidden in the puppet.","“Nonsense?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You think you can defeat me with a puppet? I’ll let you know how wrong you are”","“Such arrogance.” The puppet sneered, and its voice burst out with a metallic sound.","The puppet burst out, accompanied by the sound of metal cracking. It turned into a palm and smashed down. When this palm landed, it was as if it had punched a huge hole in the sky, forming a terrifying tide.","This was a martial art.","This puppet could use martial arts. This was something that the AI of the Federation could not do at the moment. It was because of this that the intellegent mechas of the Federation was still not popularized. Once this problem was solved, the industrial production method of the Federation would be enough to drown all the powerful enemies.","Chu Yunfan was fearless. At this moment, he threw out a talisman. The talisman turned into the shadow of a strong man and rushed into Chu Yunfan’s body. He felt an endless amount of power surge out of his body. This power did not come from his own body, but it could be used by him.","This talisman was none other than the Great Strength Divine Talisman.","The Great Strength Divine Talisman that Liang Ruicai had used before was now used by Chu Yunfan, and its power was even greater than before. When he used it, Chu Yunfan realized that the Great Strength Divine Talisman had increased his strength by three times.","Chu Yunfan’s own strength was already terrifying. Even Liang Ruicai, who had used the Great Strength Divine Talisman, was killed when he came into contact with Chu Yunfan, let alone now that his strength had increased by three times.","Chu Yunfan punched out. In an instant, everyone saw the collapse of the air as if a huge hole had been punched in the sky. It was just a simple punch, but when the strength reached a certain level, it truly reached the so-called indestructible state.","Bam!","The fists of both parties collided.","The puppet was sent flying. Without a doubt, he was at a disadvantage in the battle of strength with Chu Yunfan. It was sent flying like a kite with a broken string, leaving a long white line in the sky.","“How is this possible?!”","A look of disbelief flashed across the puppet’s eyes. It was the disbelief of Yang Feifeng’s primordial spirit hidden within. Although this puppet of his was known to be on par with an expert at the peak Golden Core Stage, his true trump card was that the puppet itself was refined from a special metal. Its strength far exceeded that of ordinary human martial art practitioners.","In terms of mana and martial arts comprehension, he definitely could not be compared to ordinary martial arts experts. But now, he was sent flying by Chu Yunfan in the place he was most proud of. Even though he had seen Chu Yunfan use the expensive Great Strength Divine Talisman, it was still too exaggerated. To be able to send him flying with a single punch, just how powerful was Chu Yunfan’s body?","But before he could think about it, a bolt of lightning flashed in front of him. In an instant, Chu Yunfan appeared above him.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan’s foot stomped forward. Under his feet, netherworld water suffused the entire sky. It then turned into a huge foot that stomped down.","‘D*mn it!’ the puppet cursed in its heart, but it was too late. Chu Yunfan stomped down and ruthlessly stepped on its body.","Bam!","The puppet was like a comet hitting the ground. In an instant, it crashed into the ground.","Boom!","The sky and ground shook violently. This collision stirred up a wave of dust that was tens of millions of feet high.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it happened in an instant. Although the spies of the various large factions also had cultivation, they were at most in the Divine Abilities Stage. Their eyes could not keep up with a battle of this level. They only saw that the puppet had fallen to the ground as soon as Chu Yunfan attacked.","“What a terrifying battle!”","The scouts from the various major forces gulped. It was the first time they had discovered that a pure martial arts battle could have such a soul-stirring power. It simply made them aghast.","As for Chu Yunfan, be it in terms of strength or speed, without exception, he was the best choice. He was ten times more terrifying than the rumors.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re courting death!” The puppet tried to stand up, but Chu Yunfan had already arrived above it.","“Not destroyed yet. The material of this puppet is pretty good.”","Chu Yunfan’s praise sounded like mockery to the puppet. But before it could express its anger, Chu Yunfan stomped on it without hesitation.","Bam!","The puppet was stomped into the ground again, and a big hole was stomped out with it as the center. This wasn’t a game. Chu Yunfan had no intention of letting the puppet go. He kept kicking it again and again.","Every time, it caused the sky to tremble. The ordinary people in the imperial capital not far away were panicking, thinking that the earth dragon had made a comeback. After an unknown amount of time, Chu Yunfan finally stopped. The puppet had been crushed."]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 Overwhelming Combat Strength","paragraphs":["1611 Overwhelming Combat Strength","Everyone stared at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape. It was too brutal. That was a puppet that was rumored to be at the peak Golden Core Stage.","It was a rare sight!","What did they see now? Chu Yunfan had trampled the puppet to death.","It was a truly brutal battle. No one had never seen such a shocking battle. Even the other opponents that Chu Yunfan had defeated before had not been like this. He had defeated a Golden Core Stage expert purely with his full strength. This allowed everyone to truly understand what it meant to be invincible.","After crushing the puppet that was comparable to a peak Golden Core, Chu Yunfan transformed into a large hand and grabbed the puppet.","Ye Qiushui and Chu Hongcai went up to Chu Yunfan.","“Brother Fan, you’re amazing. Even a peak Golden Core is no match for you!” Chu Hongcai exclaimed.","Chu Hongcai clearly felt the puppet’s terrifying strength earlier. It could suppress him with its aura alone. Just a glance at him made him feel as if he had fallen into an ice cave. He instantly understood that although he was already a Core, there was still a world of difference between him and the real top experts in the Core Stage.","That was the true invincible expert in the Core Stage.","But even so, against Chu Yunfan, the puppet was still no match for him and was trampled to pieces.","One could imagine how excited Chu Hongcai was at this moment.","“This is nothing. Although this puppet is also said to be comparable to a peak golden core, its considered the bottom of the barrel among peak Golden Cores,” Chu Yunfan said.","In the eyes of ordinary people, this puppet was comparable to the peak of the Golden Core Stage and could be considered powerful. But in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was nothing. After all, a truly top-notch puppet could crush experts of the same level, and not just to this extent.","Chu Yunfan could tell that the material used to make this puppet was not top-notch. The crafting method was very different from the invincible puppet that could sweep across the world in the Alchemy Emperor’s memory. It was rather crude. This puppet could only bully low-level experts. Facing an expert of the same level, this was far from enough.","“If Yang Feifeng has this kind of strength, he will surely die.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly. “I defeated this puppet by relying on the explosive power of the Great Strength Divine Talisman,” he continued.","After this battle, Chu Yunfan had a complete understanding of his strength. With his current strength, he was invincible among late Golden Cores, Even if he encountered a peak Golden Core, he would not have to worry about protecting himself.","Once he used the Great Strength Divine Talisman, his strength would increase by three times, and his strength would also have a qualitative leap. This puppet, who was the lowest of the peak Golden Core Stage, was not his match.","In other words, Chu Yunfan could just reach the peak Golden Core Stage. He could had the ability to compete with the top young experts of Grand Xia.","Ye Qiushui looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. Compared to Chu Hongcai, Ye Qiushui was even more excited. To Chu Hongcai, Chu Yunfan was powerful, but to an ant, a bear and a rabbit were equally powerful. They could be trampled to death. Ye Qiushui knew more.","In her opinion, Chu Yunfan was not very strong. Although he was much stronger than her, in Grand Xia, he was still nothing. As far as she knew, there were many experts who were stronger than Chu Yunfan. Even in her sect, there were many experts who were much stronger than him.","However, Chu Yunfan’s improvement speed was fast, so fast that she found it hard to imagine. It had only been a short time, but Chu Yunfan’s strength had already improved tremendously.","How long had it been?","“Hongcai, find a place to cultivate and consolidate your golden core,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Hongcai had just entered the Core Stage. At this moment, his golden core was only a phantom and was at its weakest. If he was not careful, his golden core might shatter, and he would fall back into the Divine Abilities Stage.","“Okay, Brother Fan.” Chu Hongcai nodded. He knew that he wouldn’t be able to help.","Yang Feifeng was an existence at the peak of the Golden Core Stage. Just the puppet he used earlier had the cultivation of the peak of the Golden Core Stage, so Yang Feifeng’s strength must be above that. That kind of battle was not something Chu Hongcai could interfere with.","Then, Chu Yunfan looked at Ye Qiushui and said, “I plan to head to the Violet Thunder Sword Sect. Do you want to come with me?”","Ye Qiushui sighed. She knew that this was a problem that she would have to face sooner or later. If it had been before, she would definitely have been willing to head to the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate. She might have had the chance to obtain the Violet Thunder Swords’s inheritance.","However, the Violet Thunder Sword Sect had probably become a dragon’s pool and a tiger’s den. She didn’t know how many people viewed her as a traitor. They probably would try to kill her in the future. But she did not mind. They were not on the same side, so how could she be considered a traitor?","After thinking for a while, Ye Qiushui finally shook her head and said, “I’d better not. I’ll meet you at the edge of the barrier, Brother Chu.”","Ye Qiushui knew that with her strength, she was only in the early stages of the Golden Core Stage. On such a battlefield, facing those powerful experts, she was afraid that she would not even have the strength to protect herself.","“All right then.” Chu Yunfan nodded."]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 Wait for Me to Kill You, a Breakthrough Is Near","paragraphs":["1612 Wait for Me to Kill You, a Breakthrough Is Near","After watching the two leave, Chu Yunfan formed a seal with his hand. Suddenly, a huge mountain range formed between heaven and earth and smashed into the Origin Energy Fusion Array.","Accompanied by a huge explosion, the entire ground shook violently, and the entire array completely collapsed. The array was destroyed in front of the spies of the various large factions.","“The Origin Energy Fusion Array collapsed. How terrifying!”","“Chu Yunfan is so scary!”","“This is a good thing for the Violet Thunder Sword Domain!”","As time passed, the concept of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain was gradually accepted by everyone.","This Chu Yunfan was really ruthless. What he couldn’t get, he wouldn’t let anyone else get it. He had no intentions of leaving the Origin Energy Fusion Array for the experts of Grand Xia.","However, they soon discovered that after the array was destroyed, there was no fused origin energy in the array. Everyone was stunned. They looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. One had to know that the array was filled with fused origin energy. Everyone in the world who cared about it knew this. But now, they could not see any energy at all.","What was going on?","They could not believe that Chu Yunfan had absorbed all of it. If Chu Yunfan had absorbed so much fused origin energy in one breath, he would have exploded.","What they didn’t know was that in Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram, there were ten Fused Origin Pills lying there quietly. These pills were made from the fused origin energy in the Origin Energy Fusion Array. In such a short period, Chu Yunfan could not absorb all of it, but he could gather the energy and make them into Fused Origin Pills.","Chu Yunfan casually grabbed one of the pills and swallowed it. A huge amount of fused origin energy surged through Chu Yunfan’s body and spread into his limbs and bones, turning into a powerful force. It began to wrap around the fatigue in Chu Yunfan’s body and helped him to break through to the peak Core Form Stage.","Chu Yunfan did not stop. He headed straight for the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate in the Ultimate West Demon League.","As time passed, the outcome of the battle spread throughout the world. Chu Yunfan had killed Yang Feifeng’s puppet in battle, and the outcome was completely beyond everyone’s expectations. According to everyone’s initial opinion, even if Chu Yunfan was not killed by Yang Feifeng’s puppet, he would still have to escape in a sorry state. The real result was shocking.","“Chu Yunfan won?”","“Chu Yunfan has grown to this extent?”","“How strong. Chu Yunfan si powerful!”","The outcome of this battle had even shocked the experts of Grand Xia.","“Looks like we’ve underestimated this fellow.”","“I didn’t think that the lowly Violet Thunder Sword Domain would produce such a character.”","“Yang Feifeng is simply too shameful. He brags that he’s invincible, but the puppet he refined is so weak. How ridiculous.”","“Chu Yunfan, when I have the time, there will be no place for you in this world!”","For a time, the world was in an uproar.","Chu Yunfan did not conceal his whereabouts. He swaggered straight to the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate. He could not hide it from anyone. Only then did everyone realize that Chu Yunfan wanted to head to the Violet Thunder Swords.","For a moment, everyone was in an uproar.","Chu Yunfan was restless. Facing the extremely powerful experts of Grand Xia, all the major forces in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had no choice but to lower their heads and did not dare to fight against them.","However, Chu Yunfan was completely different. He was using force to fight force. He did not admit defeat. This was the first time since the invasion of the experts of Grand Xia that someone had been so domineering.","Chu Yunfan had killed Xiang Feiyun, Liang Ruicai, and the others. This time, not only did he crush Yang Feifeng’s puppet, but he also personally rushed to the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate to compete with the experts of Grand Xia.","This was something unprecedented, and even the experts of Grand Xia couldn’t help but look at it in a different light. Chu Yunfan actually dared to show his attitude. He was here to kill Yang Feifeng.","“Very well. I’ll wait here for him to come and die!” Yang Feifeng said angrily, angered by Chu Yunfan.","The world was in chaos, and everyone’s eyes were focused on Chu Yunfan.","In the Ultimate West Demon League, a figure was shuttling through the forest at an astonishing speed. His speed was so fast that it exceeded the speed of sound. Wherever he passed, terrifying sonic booms erupted.","A terrifying sound wave formed behind him.","Suddenly, the figure stopped. It was a young man in black clothes with delicate features. The divine power on his body was like a terrifying tide that spread in all directions. He was like the center of a huge storm.","He absorbed the air surrounding the demon league. He was not effected by the coldness. He absorbed all of it into his body and turned it into his own strength.","“Hah!”","Chu Yunfan shouted. Terrifying power was exploding from his entire body. He was breaking through to the peak of the Core Form Stage.","He did not fly to the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate. On the contrary, he ran to it. As he ran, his body boiled with power, and the blood in his body surged like boiling water. The blood in his body had been mobilized to the limit, and a breakthrough was just around the corner.","The aura on his body continued to grow. In just a moment, it alarmed the entire forest. A few auras seemed to have sensed Chu Yunfan’s aura and rushed over."]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 Came for Revenge? Kill Him!","paragraphs":["1613 Came for Revenge? Kill Him!","At this moment, a few figures tore through the sky. They shortly arrived around Chu Yunfan and saw him. The leader was a woman in red. She had a graceful figure and exquisite features. When she saw Chu Yunfan, her face immediately turned ferocious.","“It’s him!”","The woman’s eyes were filled with shocking killing intent. Behind her was a middle-aged man with a square face and a young man in green. When the three of them saw Chu Yunfan, their faces revealed a hint of killing intent.","“It really is him. I didn’t think you’d actually dare come here,” the young man in green said as he stared at Chu Yunfan with a ferocious expression.","“Kill him and avenge Brother Liang!” the woman said angrily.","When the three of them saw Chu Yunfan, they were furious. They all thought of Liang Ruicai, who had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. They had a good relationship with Liang Ruicai. It could be said that he had saved their lives. If it weren’t for him, they would not exist.","“I’ve long heard that you’re coming here, you thief. We’ve been patrolling the area for the past few days and finally managed to catch you.”","The woman in red had a ferocious expression on her face that made people shudder. Her eyes reddened as she recalled the scene from before she entered the Violet Lightning Sword Domain.","“Don’t worry. Once I obtain the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance, my cultivation level will improve. I’ll approach your sect master and propose our marriage.”","No one expected that after this sentence, they would become forever separated by heaven and earth. Thinking of this, the killing intent in the woman’s eyes became even clearer.","“This fellow is too ferocious. Even Big Brother Liang is no match for him. How are we supposed to defeat him?” the middle-aged man wondered. His expression was a little fearful. Chu Yunfan’s current reputation was not fake. He had fought his way up.","Before this, no one knew about him, but after the two battles with Xiang Feiyun and Liang Ruicai, Chu Yunfan’s fierce reputation became known to the world. When he destroyed Yang Feifeng’s puppet, it made countless people tremble in fear. There were some people among them who didn’t put Chu Yunfan in their eyes, but the middle-aged man was not one of them.","“What did you say?” The woman in red looked at the middle-aged man with a murderous look. “When Brother Liang saved our lives, what did you say? You said your life belongs to him. To bring you into the fold, Brother Liang paid a huge price. This is how you repay him!”","The middle-aged man looked at the woman and felt overwhelmed. He understood what Liang Ruicai had meant to her. Liang Ruicai had been the pillar of support in her life. Now that she had lost this pillar, whoever dared to stand in her way of revenge would be her enemy.","“That’s right. We were saved by Brother Liang, and Chu Yunfan seems to be breaking through right now. It’s a good opportunity for us to make a move,” the young man said after some observation.","He was confident that Chu Yunfan was on the verge of a breakthrough. This was undoubtedly a great opportunity.","“That’s right. This is the perfect opportunity. Even the heavens are on our side, don’t you think so?” the woman said loudly, her eyes flashing with intense hatred. “Moreover, this fellow is powerful. If we let him break through again, it would be our doom.”","“I know you’re scared,” the woman said, “But think about it. Marquis Huntian is now looking for Chu Yunfan’s head. Once we obtain it, you can get anything you want. You even have hope of becoming a Transcendent Core.”","The middle-aged man thought of this as well. Thinking of this, he gritted his teeth and said, “You guys are right. This is a good opportunity.”","The middle-aged man glanced at Chu Yunfan. At this moment, he seemed to have lost his mind. His entire body was surrounded by a ball of energy. This was just crazy. To break through in such a defenseless wilderness was madness.","The middle-aged man made his move. He stomped down with a back kick. This kick overturned the entire sky, and in an instant, landed on Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","This kick penetrated the energy tide around Chu Yunfan and landed directly on his body. However, it was silent, and there was not even the slightest fluctuation on the ground. It was as if the power of his kick had been absorbed by a force.","“What? How is this possible?”","The middle-aged man’s expression fell. He thought of something and instantly tried to get out of the way. But at this moment, he suddenly felt a huge force grab his foot. A big hand reached out for the energy storm, grabbed him, and threw him to the ground.","Boom!","The man was grabbed and thrown to the ground. A wave of dust that was hundreds of feet high surged up, like a huge storm on the sea. He felt as if his body had shattered. He did not know how many bones in his body had been broken.","But before he could think further, he saw a big hand materialize in the air and slap down on him.","“D*mn it! Do you have to be so violent?!”","When the young man saw this scene, he roared and jumped out. However, he saw another large hand flying out. It clenched its fist and punched him.","Bam!","The young man was hit by the punch, and he flew backward. His entire body was torn into pieces in mid-air. An intermediate Golden Core had died tragically in an instant. His appearance did not change the fate of the middle-aged man being slapped to death. He could not even delay it for a moment.","In an instant, two of her companions were dead. The woman’s eyes turned red, and she looked at Chu Yunfan with incomparable hatred. She wished she could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces!"]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 Breakthrough, Peak Core Form Stage","paragraphs":["1614 Breakthrough, Peak Core Form Stage","In an instant, Chu Yunfan, who was clearly still in the midst of comprehending and breaking through, casually attacked and killed two Golden Cores.","The woman was now fearful. Her cultivation was good, but at this moment, she seemed a little weak in front of Chu Yunfan. Her two companions had been Golden Cores, but they were killed by Chu Yunfan as if he were chopping melons and vegetables. Even though she really wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, she was a little afraid now.","She was scared of Chu Yunfan.","“I’ll kill you!”","The woman in red was overwhelmed by her anger toward Chu Yunfan. But before she could make a move, a large hand reached out from the storm and slammed down on her. The terrifying power seemed to turn the world upside down.","“D*mn it!”","The woman finally realized that all their assumptions were wrong. They thought that Chu Yunfan was in a state of breakthrough and would not be able to advance or retreat. He should have been at their mercy. At the very least, he would have to retreat from his state of comprehension and breakthrough, interrupting his breakthrough.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan was not what they had imagined? He completely broke their understanding. Even though he was currently breaking through, he was not weak. On the contrary, it was completely different from what they had imagined.","Chu Yunfan had broken through many times during battles, and his rich experience was beyond their imagination. Of course, he would not easily put himself in extreme danger.","The slap headed straight for the woman. She retreated, trying to avoid the hand that was falling on her. However, she discovered that a divine will had locked onto her, and she had no ability to dodge the hand.","Bam!","The palm landed on her and she screamed. Her body was torn into pieces, turning into blood that filled the sky. Chu Yunfan put her into the Mountain River Diagram.","It was an instant kill.","The surroundings did not change. It returned to the usual scene as if the intense battle had never happened. Chu Yunfan was too fast, so fast that he didn’t even give them a chance to react before he killed them.","At this moment, many divine wills in the surroundings swept over as if they had noticed the battle here. The terrifying storm around Chu Yunfan calmed and was absorbed into his body, leaving nothing behind.","Chu Yunfan’s expression returned to normal. He had completed his breakthrough and officially broken through to the peak Core Form Stage. He was now only half a step away from forming a golden core.","The reason why he did not choose to fly all the way to the Violet Thunder Swords was for this breakthrough. He knew very well that many of the people from Grand Xia at the Violet Thunder Swords were peak experts. He had to be absolutely confident before he acted.","Now, as his strength improved, his combat strength had increased several times. Even without the Great Strength Divine Talisman, ordinary peak Golden Cores were no match for him. Once he used the talisman, he was confident that he could sweep them all.","Chu Yunfan too wanted to get a piece of the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance. At the very least, he wouldn’t let Yang Feifeng obtain it.","Using the Great Strength Divine Talisman once, millions of low-grade spirit stones had to be used to recharge it. The consumption was not too great, but after being used for a second time, a crack appeared on it.","Judging by the situation, he couldn’t get many uses out of it, but to Chu Yunfan, this was enough.","Chu Yunfan restrained his aura so that no one knew he had just completed a breakthrough. However, when these people’s divine wills swept over him, their expressions changed drastically.","“It’s him!”","“He actually came, and at this time. He truly does not know the immensity of heaven and earth.”","“I have a feeling that his stage will not only be the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. His future will be even more glorious.”","Everyone discussed animatedly. Soon, they discovered that a huge battle had occurred at the scene. With their strength, they quickly found out what had happened.","The three people who had been patrolling and threatening to kill Chu Yunfan had disappeared. They could not be contacted. There was no doubt that they were the ones who had fought with Chu Yunfan earlier. And from the situation at the scene, it was likely that the three of them had met misfortune.","Thinking back to when they had sensed the fluctuation of divine power, they quickly came to a conclusion that shocked them. Chu Yunfan had killed three Golden Cores in a very short period. They could not even react before perishing.","This made many of Grand Xia’s experts, who did not know how powerful Chu Yunfan was, change their expressions. Chu Yunfan was too fierce. If he was not a fierce dragon, he would not cross the river.","Chu Yunfan did not seem like a good person to them and was definitely not someone to be trifled with. He gave them a fierce show of strength the moment he appeared.","The news of Chu Yunfan’s arrival spread like lightning to the surrounding areas of the Violet Thunder Swords. He said he would come, but many people thought he would not have the courage to come to this place where the experts gathered.","They were completely wrong. Chu Yunfan definitely had the guts to do so.","Countless figures were pacing back and forth outside the mountain gate of the Violet Thunder Swords. Not only were there experts from Grand Xia but there were also many Cores from the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Though they knew that the chances were slim, they still hoped that they would have the chance to obtain the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords and stand out from the rest.","In a forest, Chu Yunfan leaned against a towering tree. In front of him was a man in black who was reporting to him respectfully.","“Imperial Advisor, all the information you want about Yang Feifeng is here.”"]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 Frightened by the Name “Chu Yunfan”","paragraphs":["1615 Frightened by the Name “Chu Yunfan”","Chu Yunfan took a jade slip from the man’s hand. It contained a huge amount of information. It was all the information that the man had collected from various places in the Violet Thunder Swords.","In front of Chu Yunfan, he knew his position. The imperial advisor was a terrifying existence who had supported two emperors. He knew many things that ordinary people did not know, and he felt that this young imperial advisor was unfathomable. Even compared to a genius of Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan was even better.","The man didn’t even dare to breathe loudly as Chu Yunfan quickly flipped through the information regarding Yang Feiyang.","Yang Feifeng was a disciple of a rather powerful sect in Grand Xia, the Holy Puppet Sect. His strength was unfathomable. Usually, this sect rarely fought head-on. They would often send out puppets like the one Chu Yunfan had destroyed. The only time they attacked was when they were seizing the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate, and the strength they displayed was terrifying.","It was far superior to the puppets they used.","“I see.” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","Yang Feifeng’s strength was probably far above his puppet. No wonder he didn’t change his expression even though his puppet was destroyed.","Chu Yunfan looked into the distance. The Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate was the entrance to a huge city. The reason why the demon league had not noticed it was because the entire city was shielded by a hidden barrier. However, Grand Xia’s people were different. They had captured the Violet Thunder Swords’ successor and obtained the exact location of the headquarters from them. That was how they managed to hit their target with one strike.","Above the entire city was a huge barrier. When Chu Yunfan opened his Divine Eye, he found that these were not ordinary barriers, but barriers formed by talismans. Each talisman was like a treasure sword. These swords turned into streaks of light and flowed in the air, forming a barrier. It was this barrier that stopped the experts of Grand Xia and pushed them to command many monsters from the demon league to attack the city.","However, the Violet Thunder Swords truly displayed its strength as a top sect. Though those monsters attacked day and night without fear of death, they were unable to break the barrier. When the barrier was attacked, countless sword lights and talismans awakened and burst out from all directions. Under this torrential rain of swords, no matter how many monsters charged fearlessly, it was useless.","Even the experts of Grand Xia had tried to attack a few times, but without exception, they were all beaten back. Some of them were severely injured and some died on the spot.","According to the information they received, the experts of Grand Xia must have already found a way to enter. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be waiting quietly. The source of the news said that the Violet Thunder Swords had been captured. However, this matter had nothing to do with Chu Yunfan.","The city had been divided into four camps according to their region and respective camps. The East, West, South, and North gates each had their own forces. Among them, Yang Feifeng was the leader of the North gate. The forces there either submitted to him or were masters under him.","Chu Yunfan was at the south gate of the Violet Thunder Swords, facing Yang Feifeng. At the Violet Thunder Swords’s south gate, experts were scattered throughout the mountains and forests, waiting for the barrier to be opened.","All of a sudden, they saw a figure swaggering over and heading straight for the south gate.","“Stop! Who are you?”","A few experts of Grand Xia who were patrolling the area stopped this figure. These people were all top-notch experts. They were in the Golden Core Stage. In the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, they were existences that could destroy a whole kingdom. But here, they were only good enough for patrol duty.","These people had arrogant expressions. When they saw Chu Yunfan’s clothes, they knew that he was not from Grand Xia. They immediately berated him.","“Get lost. This isn’t a place for you natives.”","“That’s right. Do you guys think you have a chance of obtaining the Violet Thunder Sword inheritance? I’m dying of laughter!”","These people laughed without any restraint. But when they saw the indifferent expression of the person before them as if he did not take their words seriously, they asked again, “Who are you?”","These words seemed to have divine power, causing the hair of these few experts of Grand Xia to stand on end. They instinctively jumped more than ten meters away.","They looked at Chu Yunfan in horror as if they had seen a ghost. They were Golden Cores, so they were naturally not cowards. However, this great killing god in front of them was an exception.","Chu Yunfan was the only person in the entire Violet Thunder Sword Domain who could threaten them and treat them like trash. Most importantly, it was rumored that he hated the people of Grand Xia. As long as he met them, not a single one of them would survive.","With their cultivation, they could only be arrogant in front of ordinary natives of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. Meeting Chu Yunfan was like meeting their nemesis and natural enemy.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry when he saw these people jumping away. When did he become so famous? Just hearing his name was enough to scare them. He didn’t know whether to laugh, or cry, or feel proud.","“That’s right. I’m Chu Yunfan!” he nodded.","Who knew that these people would suddenly run even further away and stare at him like he was a great enemy? Their faces were filled with extreme panic. They did not dare to stay and turned around to flee."]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 To Climb the Ladder, You Need Strength","paragraphs":["1616 To Climb the Ladder, You Need Strength","Chu Yunfan was baffled. When did his reputation reach such a level? It was at the level where he could make crying kids shut up.","“Chu Yunfan is here! It’s Chu Yunfan!”","Someone cried out in alarm. Immediately, waves of divine wills revealed a sense of panic. It seemed that everyone panicked when they heard his name.","In the distance, the experts of the Violet Thunder Sword Realm who were following behind were dumbfounded. Were these people completely terrified? They had never seen experts of Grand Xia being so cowardly before. This was completely different from the experts of Grand Xia that they knew. The style was completely different.","No matter which expert of Grand Xia they met, which one of them didn’t have a high and mighty appearance? Some of them didn’t even bother to talk to them. They usually looked at everyone like they were trash. Therefore, in their understanding, these experts of Grand Xia should be more arrogant than the last.","But now, after hearing Chu Yunfan’s name, these people were flustered. They were simply not the same type of creatures as the high and mighty experts of Grand Xia that they knew.","“Are they really the people that we know about?”","These people sucked in a breath of cold air.","“Chu Yunfan really scares them!”","“Hahahaha, these people belittled us as natives and did not put us in their eyes at all. Now, let’s see if they still dare to be so arrogant.”","“That’s right. We should show them that there are experts in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.”","These people were mocking the experts of Grand Xia. These people were too arrogant, treating them like pigs and dogs. They had been intolerable.","Now, Chu Yunfan had helped them vent their anger.","How many masters had Chu Yunfan killed? How could they not be afraid?","They focused on Chu Yunfan. Although he had said he would come, this was the first time he had appeared so openly.","“Chu Yunfan, why are you here?” an expert from Grand Xia asked.","“Did you really not know that I was coming? Don’t you think of all the people in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain as lowly natives?” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Don’t you think we’re too weak? I’ll kill a few of you to show you how weak we are!”","The experts of Grand Xia fell silent. They had not expected Chu Yunfan to issue a challenge.","“Chu Yunfan, haven’t you heard of the saying that one should keep a low profile? Do you really think you’re that mighty? You’re too arrogant,” a black-robed, menacing-looking youth said.","“Why? Are you against me?” Chu Yunfan glanced at the youth.","“Against you? No, I’m not, but you have to understand. Don’t think that you can do whatever you want just because you killed Xiang Feiyun and Liang Ruicai. The two of them are nothing compared to us,” the youth said coldly.","“This is not a place where you can be arrogant,” he continued, “There is order here. If you don’t follow the order, you will die.”","“That’s right. This is not a place where you can be arrogant. Even if you’re a dragon, you have to coil up. Even if you’re a tiger, you have to lie down,” another short youth stood up and looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the two of them. He smiled and said, “What? Are you going to fight me?”","Chu Yunfan looked at the two of them and was not moved by their words. When they saw how arrogant he was, and how he had come up to them and shouted to kill them, they were instantly furious.","“The two of you are too extreme. In this world, the strong are respected. What does Xiang Feiyun and Liang Ruicai have to do with you?”","A man walked over from afar. This man was tall and looked extremely handsome. The tall man came up and stood in front of Chu Yunfan and the two men.","“Huang Feng, is it really appropriate for you to stand up for an outsider?” the menacing youth said coldly, “There’s already a traitor, Ye Qiushui. Are you going to betray us too?”","Chu Yunfan realized that this menacing youth was good at putting labels on people.","“Betray?” the tall man, Huang Feng, sneered. “I think there must be some misunderstanding between you two. Since when was I in the same camp as you?”","Everyone’s expression froze. They had not expected Huang Feng to bring up this issue that everyone knew about but tacitly avoided. He brought it up in front of everyone.","“Thank you for helping me, but it doesn’t matter. Since they want to target me, I don’t mind killing a few more people,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He would never hesitate or hold back against those who targeted him.","“Either you kneel and apologize to me now or you die.” Chu Yunfan’s voice became colder and colder.","The two of them did not expect that Chu Yunfan would not give them any face. They were furious. Chu Yunfan was much stronger than they had imagined.","“I don’t care who the person behind you is, but since you’ve jumped out, be prepared to suffer my anger!”","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they realized that although these two people seemed to be standing up for Grand Xia, there were probably other people behind them.","Many people in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain knew Chu Yunfan’s style. Ever since his debut, he had never compromised. Whoever tried to suppress him would be killed by him.","“This is his style. If Chu Yunfan bows his head to these people, then he won’t be the Chu Yunfan we know.”","“You’re going too far. Do you really think you’re invincible?” the short youth shouted. A light flashed and a huge copper hammer appeared in his hand. He swung it at Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 Killing Golden Cores in Seconds","paragraphs":["1617 Killing Golden Cores in Seconds","The copper hammer in this short youth’s hand was taller than himself. It looked a little ridiculous when he waved it in his hand. However, the copper hammer created a terrifying tornado that smashed down as if it were going to shatter the world.","“Petty tricks!”","This short youth had amazing strength. Ordinary people would have lost their momentum if they saw him, but in front of Chu Yunfan, he was just showing off his skills to an expert.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look and punched out. This punch hit the hammer head-on.","“Chu Yunfan is too arrogant. That copper hammer is at least ten thousand pounds, and he dared to receive it with his bare hand.”","“He’s overconfident.”","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s actions. They had never seen such a fierce fighting style.","Clang!","An incomparably loud bang rang out.","Everyone saw that Chu Yunfan did not break his arm as they had expected. On the contrary, his punch pierced through the copper hammer and shattered it into pieces.","“Is this impossible!”","The short youth hastily retreated. His entire arm had been broken by Chu Yunfan, and blood flowed out. In terms of pure strength, he was completely defeated by Chu Yunfan. He didn’t have the ability to compare with Chu Yunfan. He was completely crushed.","“Hurry up and attack!” the short youth roared.","A look of horror flashed across his eyes. He and the menacing youth had made an agreement to incite all the people of Grand Xia to deal with Chu Yunfan. Who knew that they would be ruined by Huang Feng? No one was fooled, and he placed himself directly in front of Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, the menacing youth finally made his move. He turned into a black line and flew toward Chu Yunfan. When he attacked, there was no movement. It was as if the clouds and the wind were light, but it directly stabbed toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","It was the typical move of an assassin. This menacing youth had learned the assassin’s path. And at this moment, he finally erupted.","This was the real trump card that the two of them had discussed. The short youth would attract Chu Yunfan’s attention and the menacing youth would be the one who would make the final move.","Chu Yunfan seemed to be completely unprepared. He only cared about chasing the short youth. In an instant, the menacing youth was right before Chu Yunfan.","A sword landed directly on Chu Yunfan’s head.","Clang!","“Impossible!”","However, he could not break through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","Just as he was distracted, Chu Yunfan arrived in front of the short youth and punched him. The short youth was dumbfounded. Before he could react, he died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The menacing youth finally reacted. An extremely dangerous feeling rushed to his brain from behind. When he wanted to escape, he found that it was too late. Chu Yunfan was already standing behind him, and a sword light slashed down.","Slice!","The menacing youth did not have any defensive measures and was cut into two halves.","All of this happened in the span of a few breaths. Chu Yunfan was fast. Before anyone could react, he had already killed the two young men who provoked him.","Everyone instantly exploded.","“How powerful. I’ve heard about Chu Yunfan, but nothing compares to seeing it with my own eyes.”","“I didn’t expect such a person to appear in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.”","“I don’t know who instructed these two people to give up their lives. It’s such a pity.”","“Chu Yunfan’s ruthless methods are even more shocking than the rumors. He doesn’t care who the person behind them is.”","Watching Chu Yunfan collect the two corpses, Huang Feng’s face revealed a knowing expression. He sensed Chu Yunfan’s deeper meaning. It was not that a fierce dragon could not cross the river, but there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan wanted to establish his power with absolute strength. Anyone who wanted to attack him had to be prepared to die in his hands.","The two people he had casually killed were undoubtedly Golden Cores, but they were unable to withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. After that battle, Chu Yunfan’s strength was enough to intimidate a considerable number of people.","Many of the experts of Grand Xia were secretly watching this scene, and they were all wiping cold sweat off their faces. Chu Yunfan was more ferocious than the rumors said. Fortunately, they had not jumped out earlier. Otherwise, they would have died without knowing how.","“Would you be interested in chatting with me for a while, Brother Chu?” Huang Feng said asked a pause. He turned a blind eye to the fact that Chu Yunfan had casually killed two experts from Grand Xia.","“It’s better to accept it than to not,” Chu Yunfan nodded.","With Huang Feng leading the way, Chu Yunfan came to a house beside the city where the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate was located. In the past, the Violet Thunder Sword Sect had treated this city as their headquarters. Naturally, this was not the only house. There were countless houses attached to the city. One could imagine how prosperous the Violet Thunder Swords had been back then. And now, one of the houses had become Huang Feng’s residence.","The two of them sat opposite each other in the backyard.","“I’ve long heard of your name, Brother Chu, and I’ve been looking forward to meeting you. Seeing you today, you’re indeed a dragon among men. A true talent,” Huang Feng said.","Chu Yunfan looked at Huang Feng with a faint smile and said, “You’ve been waiting for me. I don’t think all you wanted to do was say a few good words to me, right? Just get straight to the point.”","Huang Feng was not angry that he was exposed. Instead, he said, “Very well, I won’t beat around the bush in front of an honest person. I would like to invite you to join hands with me in dealing with Yang Feifeng.”"]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 The Abstract Stage","paragraphs":["1618 The Abstract Stage","“Deal with Yang Feifeng?” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself. This was not too unexpected.","There was no love without reason in this world, and naturally, there was no hatred without reason. Chu Yunfan wouldn’t believe that Huang Feng had no ulterior motives for suddenly showing goodwill to him.","Chu Yunfan started to size up Huang Feng.","Huang Feng was tall and handsome. There was an extremely powerful but hidden divine power in his body. Although it could hide from others, it could not hide from Chu Yunfan’s eyes. Huang Feng was very strong. He was probably much more terrifying than any of the powerful enemies he had defeated before.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s hesitation, Huang Feng continued, “I believe you should know that although we’re all from Grand Xia, we’re all from different factions. As for me, I happen to have some conflicts with Yang Feifeng, so I need your help.”","Chu Yunfan paused for a moment and did not agree rashly. Instead, he said, “Although Yang Feifeng is strong, it’s not like I don’t have a chance of winning. Besides, I can protect myself. Why must I cooperate with you?”","Huang Feng saw that Chu Yunfan didn’t immediately agree, but he didn’t mind. If it were him, he wouldn’t believe others so easily.","“If you think about it this way, then you’re right. But I’m afraid there will be a problem,” Huang Feng said.","“What problem will there be?” Chu Yunfan said calmly. He had absolute confidence in his strength. Before he broke through, ordinary peak Golden Cores were not his match. Not to mention that he had broken through now. He did not even care about three to five peak Golden Cores. He was determined to obtain the inheritance and did not care about Yang Feifeng.","“What if I say that Yang Feifeng’s strength is already half-step away from the Abstract Stage?” After Huang Feng took a look at Chu Yunfan, he revealed a shocking piece of news.","“Half-step from the Abstract Stage?” Chu Yunfan’s expression fell slightly.","Everyone knew that the Golden Core Stage was the peak of the Core Stage, but it was not the peak of the cultivation path. In fact, there was another realm above the Core Stage, and that was the Abstract Stage.","The Core Stage was about forming a golden core. From then on, one’s life was up to oneself and not the heavens, and one would begin to transcend the mortal world. However, that was just a foundation. For a true expert, the Abstract Stage was the real starting point.","Cores practiced according to the secret teachings left behind by their predecessors. When they reached the Abstract Stage, they would truly begin to comprehend the laws themselves.","The change of martial arts was nothing more than between the virtual and the real. The Core Stage was the transformation from virtual to real, and the golden core transformed from a shadow into a real entity. One’s divine power became stronger and stronger till one reached the status of a god.","The Abstract Stage was the transformation from real to virtual.","Abstracts could comprehend a higher level of power, which was the laws of nature. Comprehension of laws and non-comprehension were simply two different concepts. It was like some people had the authority to use a computer, while others had the authority to modify the computer’s coding.","The abstract in the name “Abstract Stage” represented nature’s laws. It was a power that could not be seen or touched and could only be comprehended by one’s body. Once one stepped into the Abstract Stage, they would reach another level. Although it was just the beginning, it was still a world of difference compared to Cores.","Hearing Huang Feng’s words, Chu Yunfan finally understood why Huang Feng wanted to team up with him to fight against Yang Feifeng.","If Yang Feifeng was only at the peak of the Golden Core Stage, Huang Feng would not be afraid. However, stepping into the half-step Abstract Stage was another matter. Although it was only a half-step, his strength would surely have skyrocketed.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was a little contemplative, but it was only a little contemplative because even if Yang Feifeng had stepped into the half-step Abstract Stage, he was still quite confident. At least, it would not be difficult for him to protect himself. As long as he was given time to completely absorb the remaining energy within the Fused Origin Pills, his strength would advance a step further, and even a half-step Abstract would not be his match.","But this time, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to refuse. He simply looked at Huang Feng.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan did not refuse, Huang Feng immediately said, “You just got here and haven’t figured out the situation yet. Now, we’re roughly divided into many camps according to our proximity. Yang Feifeng is now occupying the North gate, and there are many subordinates following him. The ones who provoked you earlier were his subordinates.”","Chu Yunfan understood. This was no different from his previous guess. In his opinion, there was an 80% chance that it was Yang Feifeng, but he was not so sure. From the previous incident, he had judged that Yang Feifeng was looking for trouble with him because there were other people behind him.","None of these young experts of Grand Xia were simple people. Each of them was a genius. It was impossible to say that they were stupid. They were just arrogant and conceited.","“Other than Yang Feifeng at the north gate, there is also Nangong Zhuo who has occupied the West gate,” Huang Feng said, “Nangong Zhuo is a direct descendant of the Nangong clan of Grand Xia. He is a relatively famous existence among the younger generation.”","Nangong Zhuo of the Nangong clan?","Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything. He just silently memorized the name.","“Other than Nangong Zhuo, there is also the Saber Tyrant, who occupies the east gate. This person is an independent cultivator. No one knows what his background is. They only know that he is an extremely powerful saber user who has challenged many famous disciples of the younger generation,” Huang Feng said, “In fact, because he’s too ruthless and easily takes lives. He provoked some sect elders to personally attack him, but they were all defeated by him.”","“Then the person occupying the south gate must be you,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently as he glanced at Huang Feng.","Huang Feng smiled and nodded. “Thanks to everyone’s appreciation, I am indeed the leader of the South gate. Right now, we are each defending our own side. We’re all waiting for the barrier to break.","“We have already agreed that when that time comes, we’ll charge in through different gates. As for who will obtain the inheritance, it will depend on who has the means.”"]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 Yang Feifeng Comes Knocking","paragraphs":["1619 Yang Feifeng Comes Knocking","“But if that’s the case, why do you want to work with me?” Chu Yunfan glanced at Huang Feng. “Is there no one else who will join hands with you?”","“Of course there is, but the more people there are, the better.” Huang Feng smiled. “In any case, you are prepared to fight Yang Feifeng, Brother Chu, so isn’t it reasonable for us to cooperate?”","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and said, “I’ll accept your request then. However, I don’t know much about the Violet Thunder Swords’ current situation. Would you mind giving me a rundown?”","Huang Feng smiled and nodded. “With your strength, Brother Chu, you’re much stronger than I anticipated. You are on part with a peak Golden Core.”","As Huang Feng spoke, he looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of surprise in his eyes. Although Chu Yunfan had only made a few moves earlier, he could tell that Chu Yunfan had not yet entered the Golden Core Stage. After all, there was a huge difference between the Golden Core Stage and the non-Golden Core Stage.","And Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was already comparable to a peak Golden Core. How shocking was this?","It took Huang Feng some time to get over his shock. At the same time, he was also very interested in Chu Yunfan’s background. He didn’t know what kind of background Chu Yunfan had to be so impressive.","“Ordinary people naturally can’t pose any threat to you, but Nangong Zhuo, Yang Feifeng, and Saber Tyrant have already stepped into the half-step Abstract Stage. It’s best you avoid them for now,” Huang Feng advised.","“If I’m not wrong, you should be at the half-step Abstract Stage too.” Chu Yunfan remembered what Ye Qiushui had said before. There had been many people behind the Origin Energy Fusion Array. Yang Feifeng and the others were counting on the Origin Energy Fusion Array to break through to the Abstract Stage.","“You’re correct.” Huang Feng nodded.","Chu Yunfan thought to himself that this was indeed the case. With his current cultivation, even an ordinary peak Golden Core could not move him, but Huang Feng made him feel a faint fear in his heart. He was definitely not just a peak Golden Core.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment. Other than these people, he didn’t care about the others. They shouldn’t be enough to pose a threat to him, but even if he met these people, he could protect himself.","The only thing that surprised him was that Yang Feifeng had stepped into the half-step Abstract Stage, and his strength had taken another step forward.","This ruined Chu Yunfan’s plans.","However, he was not discouraged. He just needed to take a little more time and make another breakthrough. At that time, even if he faced Yang Feifeng, he would be able to win.","“However, I heard that the Origin Energy Fusion Array is a method you were planning to use to break through the Abstract Stage. Now that I’ve destroyed it, are you not mad?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Huang Feng only smiled. “Brother Chu, you have underestimated us. There are many experts in Grand Xia. The Abstract Stage is nothing. Although our cultivation levels are not high, we are all top disciples of our respective sects. We have all kinds of ways to break through to the Abstract Stage. The array was just one of them.","“Brother Chu, don’t tell me you think that just anyone can enter the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.”","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he suddenly realized that these people, including those he had killed, were probably the best among of the various sects. Although not all of them were very strong, there was no doubt that they were people with great potential. Their future was limitless. Therefore, it was not without reason that these people were more arrogant than the next.","Unfortunately, Xiang Feiyun, Liang Ruicai, and the others had provoked Chu Yunfan and were killed by him.","“Although fused origin energy is precious, it’s not our main goal in coming here. What we really want is the Violet Thunder Sword inheritance. If we can obtain even a portion of it, our future prospects will be limitless,” Huang Feng said without reservation.","Chu Yunfan finally understood. No wonder Huang Feng was still willing to cooperate with him even though Chu Yunfan had destroyed the array. To Huang Feng, there was more than one way to enter the Abstract Stage. The array was just one of the paths.","“Compared to Grand Xia, were the Violet Thunder Swords very powerful?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s not to the point. However, there’s no doubting the strength of the Violet Thunder Swords. It’s enough to be placed on par with the first-rate sects of Grand Xia,” Huang Feng said.","“There are many secrets within the Violet Thunder Swords. Even though it declined countless years ago, its sword path barrier still leaves us helpless.” Huang Feng sighed. “If we want forcefully, I’m afraid we’d suffer heavy casualties.”","Chu Yunfan was about to say that Huang Feng could wait for Marquis Huntian to lead his army into the Violet Thunder Sword Domain before taking action. However, he immediately realized that these people were probably planning to divide the inheritance before Marquis Huntian could act.","After all, according to the rumors, Marquis Huntian’s strength was far above everyone else’s. If he were to make a move, they would never get a share.","“On top of that, we forced those monsters to attack some of the deeper parts. We forced our way in and saw a shocking scene. There’s a shocking energy inside, and dense multicolored light spewed out of it. It was extremely magical,” Huang Feng said.","“It’s a pity that we didn’t manage to get close. According to our speculations, those multicolored lights were most likely used by the Violet Thunder Swords to cleanse the meridians and marrow of their disciples. After so many years, the energy hasn’t dissipated. If we can obtain it, we’ll undoubtedly be able to step into the Abstract Stage.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. So Huang Feng already had a goal. No wonder he didn’t care that the Origin Energy Fusion Array was broken.","Suddenly, just as the two of them were still talking, an incomparably loud roar came from outside the courtyard.","“Chu Yunfan! Come out and meet your demise!”","This shout turned into a sound wave that flattened the entire courtyard, revealing Chu Yunfan and Huang Feng. The two of them raised their heads and saw a young man with disheveled hair. He was tall and his face had a sharp expression. What was most strange was that he was carrying an incomparably huge box on his back. It was even bigger than himself.","“Yang Feifeng!” Huang Feng coldly said.","Chu Yunfan immediately knew who the person was."]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 A Tied Battle","paragraphs":["1620 A Tied Battle","After receiving the news of Chu Yunfan, Yang Feifeng patiently sent people to sow discord between Chu Yunfan and the Grand Xia experts. He wanted to use everyone’s hands to get rid of Chu Yunfan. However, these Grand Xia experts were shrewd people. How could they be fooled so easily? Moreover, it was such a clumsy scheme.","If Chu Yunfan was not strong, they might have attacked. But as soon as he arrived, he put on a fierce stance and killed two intermediate Golden Cores.","Nobody was blind here. They could see that even though Chu Yunfan was not at the peak Golden Core Stage, his combat strength was not inferior to it. What was the difference between him and a peak Golden Core then?","There were so many experts from Grand Xia, but only a small number of them could stand shoulder to shoulder with Chu Yunfan. There were probably only a few who could suppress him.","Under such circumstances, who would casually become Yang Feifeng’s knife?","After realizing this, Yang Feifeng could not sit by any longer and planned to take action personally.","“How dare you, Yang Feifeng. Do you plan to start a war with me?” Huang Feng suddenly said coldly. He flew into the sky and faced Yang Feifeng from afar.","“Huang Feng, this matter has nothing to do with you. If I were you, I’d stay out of this. This matter isn’t something you can interfere with,” Yang Feifeng said, “This b*stard has killed so many people from Grand Xia. Do you know that the news has already spread? Every sect is rubbing their fists. Whoever can kill him will be taught a new martial art and be given treasures. What do you think? There are so many people who want to kill him right now. If you help me kill him, you and I can split these rewards.”","Yang Feifeng was also a little wary of Huang Feng. He wanted to use this method to tempt him.","The sound of gasps could be heard from the surroundings. At some point, many experts had surrounded them. When they heard about these rewards, they all sucked in a breath of cold air, and a hint of greed flashed across their eyes.","A single martial art or a precious treasure was not enough to move them, but Chu Yunfan had killed dozens of people. They could learn new martial arts and gain precious treasures if they killed him, so how could they not be moved?","If Chu Yunfan stood alone, it would be easy to deal with him.","“Hahahaha, Yang Feifeng, you’ve misjudged me. I’m not that kind of person.”","Facing this huge temptation, Huang Feng was completely unmoved. These benefits were not small, but he had a greater ambition. This little bit was not enough to make him switch sides.","“Huang Feng, you have to agree to this. You have to even if you don’t want to,” Yang Feifeng said coldly.","With that, Yang Feifeng made a move. In the sky, countless spirit energy was condensed and transformed into a huge puppet. This was a puppet completely composed of spirit energy.","This was a method of the Holy Puppets. After all, it was impossible to use the puppets they meticulously crafted every single time. That would not be enough.","Although these puppets condensed from spirit energy could not compare to the top-notch puppets that Chu Yunfan had trampled to death previously, they were still as strong as Golden Cores.","“Yang Feifeng!” Huang Feng’s face darkened. Yang Feifeng had no respect for him. But just as he was about to make a move, he saw another figure appear in the sky.","In the sky, a tall and slender man dressed in military attire was pointing a longbow at Huang Feng.","“Brother, I suggest you don’t move. Otherwise, we won’t have a good time.”","Huang Feng’s expression turned even uglier as he spat out this person’s name.","“Nangong Zhuo!”","Huang Feng’s expression became uglier and uglier as he stared at the person who came. It was Nangong Zhuo from the Nangong clan, whom he had mentioned to Chu Yunfan.","He had no doubt that if he dared to make a move, Nangong Zhuo would make a move too. The Nangong clan were famous for their archery skills, and the current head of the family was even known as an archery god.","Huang Feng was afraid of Nangong Zhuo and Yang Feifeng. Now that Yang Feifeng and Nangong Zhuo had joined forces, what he was most worried about had finally happened. As for Saber Tyrant, he had always been a loner, so it was impossible for him to join forces with anyone. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have needed to seek out Chu Yunfan.","“Even Nangong Zhuo has appeared. It seems that Yang Feifeng is adamant about killing Chu Yunfan.”","“Chu Yunfan won’t be able to escape death. Any one of them has the strength to kill him, let alone two of them working together.”","“Even if Nangong Zhuo is held back by Huang Feng, I’m afraid Chu Yunfan won’t be able to hold out for long.”","No one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s chances. Chu Yunfan’s strength was not even at the Golden Core Stage. So what if he had the strength to match a peak Golden Core? How could he be a match for such a half-step Abstract?","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid of the spirit puppet that was flying down. He jumped up and shot out a punch like a rocket.","Boom!","This punch smashed the spirit energy puppet into pieces.","“Yang Feifeng, is this all you have?” Chu Yunfan could tell that Yang Feifeng had come prepared, but he was not flustered.","“How dare you! So you have some tricks up your sleeve!” Yang Feifeng shouted coldly. “No wonder you dare to be so arrogant.”","As he spoke, Yang Feifeng moved. His body emitted a golden light, and he slapped down with his palm.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","In an instant, thousands of palms slammed down, almost causing the entire sky to collapse. However, Chu Yunfan was not willing to be outdone. He attacked with the Eight Astonishing Punches.","In the sky, he fought head-on with Yang Feifeng.","Everyone was dumbfounded. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan would never fight Yang Feifeng head-on. That was simply using his own weakness to attack the enemy’s strength. No normal person would do that.","No matter how strong Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was, his shortcomings in cultivation were obvious. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would do the opposite and fight with Yang Feifeng?","What shocked everyone even more was that although Chu Yunfan was at a disadvantage, he was not in danger of being defeated for a while.","“How is this possible? Why does Chu Yunfan’s strength seem to be stronger than before?”"]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 Yang Feifeng Being Chased","paragraphs":["1621 Yang Feifeng Being Chased","Many people were shocked to find that Chu Yunfan’s strength was much stronger than when he defeated the puppet.","At that time, Chu Yunfan’s strength was only comparable to the peak of the Golden Core Stage. But now, he was probably not weak among peak Golden Cores.","” He seems to have just broken through.”","“That’s right. It shouldn’t have been too long ago.”","Many Grand Xia experts sighed in amazement. Even a peak Golden Core would find it difficult to fight a half-step Abstract until now, let alone Chu Yunfan, who was not even in the Golden Core Stage.","Even Huang Feng was a little stunned by this. He had been thinking of ways to get rid of Nangong Zhuo. He was worried that Chu Yunfan would be killed by Yang Feifeng in the next moment, and then his plan would instantly come to naught. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be at a disadvantage when engaging Huang Feng in battle?","Chu Yunfan’s strength had clearly exceeded his expectations.","“Is this what you rely on? No wonder you dare to be so arrogant!”","Seeing that he could not take down Chu Yunfan as quickly as he expected, Yang Feifeng was a little stunned. His eyes flashed with an even more shocking killing intent.","Chu Yunfan was difficult to deal with. If he went one step further, it would be even more troublesome. When Chu Yunfan entered the Golden Core Stage, wouldn’t he be no match for him?","Compared to him, Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough to the Golden Core Stage was clearly much easier.","A sharp glint flashed across his eyes. However, the current Chu Yunfan was not enough to move him. He struck down with his palm, causing Chu Yunfan to take a few steps back. His entire body was emitting traces of blood energy.","Chu Yunfan’s blood and energy were surging. There was indeed a gap between his cultivation and Yang Feifeng’s.","“You think you can compete with me without even reaching the Golden Core Stage?” Yang Feifeng placed his hands behind his back, looking extremely arrogant and aloof.","As Yang Feifeng spoke, he attacked and casually slapped down. The terrifying power caused a series of air collapses. From afar, a huge air hole was formed in the sky.","At this moment, the shadow of a yellow-scarved strongman flew out of Chu Yunfan’s body and fused into his body. His aura was being protected inch by inch, and his strength had also increased by a level. His strength soared.","“You have some skills, but it’s useless. Before me, you’re far inferior,” Yang Feifeng said with a cold expression. He was completely indifferent. Chu Yunfan only moved him slightly. He was able to sweep away ordinary Golden Cores.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fist landed on the huge palm and exploded in mid-air. The sky shattered, and an energy tide swept out at supersonic speed. Even Nangong Zhuo and Huang Feng, who were confronting each other, were affected. They hastily retreated, not daring to get close.","“A mere ant dares to resist?” Yang Feifeng sneered.","“You’re just relying on your cultivation level to bully me. If we were at the same cultivation level, killing you would be as easy as taking a stroll.”","Chu Yunfan shouted loudly as he threw out eight punches in succession. Each punch was earth-shattering and shocked the entire south gate area.","“So what if I’m bullying you?” Yang Feifeng sneered and then slapped down again. It was cold and merciless. He wanted to rely on his strength to crush Chu Yunfan. He did not feel ashamed in the slightest.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan attacked, bursting out with countless rays of light. A sword appeared in his hand. On this sword, endless sword light splashed out. The sword light swept out a terrifying light and slashed directly at Yang Feifeng.","This sword came in fast. It was so fast that it was terrifying.","Yang Feifeng didn’t even have time to react to this attack. He was not expecting Chu Yunfan to have such a trick up his sleeve.","Slice!","The sword light hit Yang Feifeng, and blood spurted out.","“Agh!” Yang Feifeng screamed in pain. His vision turned black and he almost fainted. Half of his body was slashed open. A huge bloody gash had been inflicted by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","On Yang Feifeng’s body, the puppet fragments shattered inch by inch. He had actually covered himself with a layer of energy, but he looked no different from an ordinary person on the outside. No one knew about this.","However, at this critical moment, it saved his life. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack would have killed him instantly.","This sword was not an ordinary sword light, but a sword light swept out by the Monster Vanquisher. Just this one strike had completely drained Chu Yunfan’s divine power. This was the strongest attack Chu Yunfan had ever launched. His body had been emptied.","“Huff, huff, huff!”","Chu Yunfan was panting heavily as he stared at Yang Feifeng. He felt a little regretful that he failed to kill Yang Feifeng. He had been holding back and did not make a move previously because he wanted to strike Yang Feifeng with a ruthless attack.","Who knew that Yang Feifeng actually had such a trump card?","Everyone was dumbfounded as they watched the change in the situation before them.","“F*ck!” someone finally cursed.","Everyone finally understood that the so-called intense battle before was just a smokescreen that Chu Yunfan had released. The real killing move was this sword.","This sword was truly shocking, and even the half-step Abstract Stage Yang Feifeng fell for his trick.","“What the...”","Huang Feng was completely dumbfounded. Even Nangong Zhuo was dumbfounded. This sword had completely frightened them. If it was them, they would not have fared any better than Yang Feifeng if they were caught off guard.","Chu Yunfan forced himself to get up. The sword had drained his divine power, but he still had strength. Although he was exhausted right now, he was much better than Yang Feifeng.","“Go to hell!”","Chu Yunfan chased after Yang Feifeng, holding the Monster Vanquisher in his hand as he flew up into the air.","As for Yang Feifeng, he was covered in blood. He had been almost cut into two by Chu Yunfan’s attack. He dared not stay any longer and fled into the distance.","Everyone was dumbfounded as they watched Chu Yunfan chase after Yang Feifeng."]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622 The Mountain Gate Opens","paragraphs":["1622 The Mountain Gate Opens","Everything had changed too quickly. Originally, Yang Feifeng was attacking Chu Yunfan, but now, Chu Yunfan had severely injured him and was even chasing after him.","Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan had ambushed Yang Feifeng. Otherwise, how could Yang Feifeng have been injured?","Many people noticed the Monster Vanquisher in Chu Yunfan’s hand. They did not know what grade the sword was. With just one slash, it severely injure Yang Feifeng. What a joke. If a peak Golden Core could use all of their divine power to heavily injure a half-step Abstract in one strike, the world would be in chaos. Even if it was a sneak attack, this should have been impossible.","The real reason for this was probably that treasure sword.","The eyes of many people lit up, and a hint of greed flashed through their eyes. This treasured sword was likely of a high grade, and a treasure sword that could injure a half-step Abstract was rare.","But when they thought about how cruel Chu Yunfan was, many of them dismissed the idea in their hearts. What a joke. Even Yang Feifeng was no match for him, let alone them. Some people were tempted when they saw Chu Yunfan’s great energy consumption, but when they saw him raising the Monster Vanquisher and chasing after Yang Feifeng crazily, they gulped. They didn’t want to get into trouble.","Although Chu Yunfan’s strength had fallen greatly, he had not fallen to the point where they could attack him at will.","Yang Feifeng endured the intense pain in his body. There was something mixed in the sword light that the Monster Vanquisher slashed out, making it impossible for him to recover. The sword light seemed to be corrosive, corroding his divine power so that he could not heal himself.","Thinking of this, how could he dare to stay any longer? He hurriedly shouted, “Nangong Zhuo, help me!”","Nangong Zhuo’s first reaction was to shoot an arrow at Chu Yunfan. However, Huang Feng locked onto Nangong Zhuo with his divine will. The meaning was clear. If Nangong Zhuo made a move, he would also make a move. Nangong Zhuo might then be able to save Yang Feifeng, but he would be severely injured by Huang Feng.","Nangong Zhuo was a little dumbfounded. He never expected that things would turn out like this. Yang Feifeng should have been the one to take the lead while he was acted as an assistant. Who knew that Yang Feifeng would be seriously injured by Chu Yunfan and try to flee?","He was then left alone here and was restrained by Huang Feng.","He felt that this was f*cked up. This was completely different from the outcome he had expected.","“Yang Feifeng, you won’t escape!” Chu Yunfan shouted loudly as he stepped on lightning and deshed forward.","His Thunderclap Physique was on full display. He had recovered a portion of his thunder divine power as he chased after Yang Feifeng.","Just as everyone was watching the battle between Chu Yunfan and Yang Feifeng, the sword barrier shrouding the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate suddenly collapsed and disappeared without a trace. Spirit energy instantly formed a surging torrent that spread out in all directions.","The Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain was a blessed land to begin with. It was unknown how much spirit energy was contained within. It had been enveloped in a barrier for many years and had never been absorbed by anyone. Apart from a portion that was absorbed by the enchantment as energy to maintain itself, most of it was trapped inside.","With the collapse of the barrier, the energy spread in all directions, forming a torrential flood that sent everyone flying. Even though everyone present was a Golden Core, they were blown away by this surging torrent. Even Chu Yunfan was no exception. He did not have much divine power left in his body, and as a result, was blown away by the spirit energy.","The others are about the same.","“Yang Feifeng is about to escape!”","Chu Yunfan saw that Yang Feifeng did not resist the energy and fled using its force. His only thought now was to escape from Chu Yunfan.","“Where do you think you’re going?!”","Chu Yunfan roared loudly and chased after him. His determination scared Yang Feifeng to death. Now that the sword barrier was broken and everyone was rushing into the Violet Thunder Swords, Chu Yunfan was still determined to kill him.","Yang Feifeng didn’t want to die.","Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. He was a little interested in the Violet Thunder Sword inheritance, but not that much. He had the top inheritance in his mind, which was the most powerful cultivation technique from the era of emperors. The Violet Thunder Swords inheritance could not compare, so of course, Chu Yunfan had to kill Yang Feifeng first.","This was more important.","“Where are you going?”","Chu Yunfan opened his mouth, and the surrounding spirit energy surged into his mouth like spiritual dragons. He used the Celestial Devouring Art to convert the energy into divine power. Immediately, his divine power recovered and his speed increased.","Yang Feifeng, who had been staring at Chu Yunfan with his divine will, was shocked when he saw this scene. There was actually such a method. If it were him, he would probably explode if he absorbed so much spirit energy at once. It was impossible for him to absorb the energy so casually and roughly. Although spirit energy was beneficial to the body, if absorbed in excess, they could die.","At the thought of this, a fierce look flashed through his Yang Feifeng’s eyes.","“Chu Yunfan, you forced me to do this!”","As Yang Feifeng spoke, he bit the tip of his tongue and spat out a mouthful of blood essence. After spitting out this mouthful of blood, his face turned pale, but his speed doubled. With the help of the power of the spirit energy blast, he instantly disappeared from the area without a trace.","“F*ck!”","Chu Yunfan was upset. He had severely injure Yang Feifeng, but bhe failed to kill him and allowed him to escape. The only thing that made him gratified was that Yang Feifeng had probably burned his vitality. Even he had escaped, he had injured himself even further.","“Forget it. I shall go take a look at the Violet Thunder Swords’ headquarters first.”","Chu Yunfan turned in the direction of the Violet Thunder Swords. He charged into the city where the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate was located."]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 The Dangerous Mountain Gate","paragraphs":["1623 The Dangerous Mountain Gate","Chu Yunfan rushed straight into the mountain gate and bumped into a few Golden Cores from Grand Xia who had just arrived from other places.","No one had expected the barrier to collapse so suddenly. Everyone was caught off guard by this incident. However, when they saw Chu Yunfan, they immediately felt a chill. They no longer dared to underestimate him. From the battle earlier, they now understood terrifying Chu Yunfan was. Even without the Monster Vanquisher, he was not inferior to ordinary peak Golden Cores and had the upper hand. He was powerful and not easy to deal with.","Although they didn’t know how the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had produced such a terrifying existence, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was a terrifying opponent.","“Brother Chu, there will surely be many fortuitous encounters past the Violet Thunder Sword mountain gate. There will be enough fortuitous encounters for us to improve together. Don’t worry, we’re different from Yang Feifeng.”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s unfriendly expression, one of the Grand Xia experts was so frightened that they quickly spoke up and expressed their goodwill to Chu Yunfan. This person too was a peak Golden Core. Among these Grand Xia experts, although this person was not as good as Huang Feng and the others, they were still one of the best.","Originally, the Grand Xia experts looked down on the natives of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. But now, he had no choice but to lower his head. He did not want to provoke Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan quickly recovered to his peak. This amazing recovery ability was terrifying. He had fought Yang Feifeng whose strength was unfathomable and was just one step from entering the Abstract Stage. Who would have thought that Yang Feifeing would run away like a stray dog after being met with just one fo Chu Yunfan’s slashes? If Chu Yunfan hadn’t been hindered by the torrent of spirit energy, Yang Feifeng would not have been able to escape.","Anyone could tell that Chu Yunfan was a ruthless person.","There was no life-and-death grudge, so of course, these Grand Xia experts did not find problems with Chu Yunfan. If they were late in arriving at the headquarters, the fortuitous encounter would be snatched away.","“Good!” Chu Yunfan nodded. Although he was decisive in killing, he was not the first person to raise his sword. Since these people were not planning on offending him, he would not trouble them.","When these people saw that Chu Yunfan had no intention of attacking them, they heaved a sigh of relief. Then, they turned into streaks of light and headed deep into the Violet Thunder Swords.","Chu Yunfan went looking for Huang Feng. Huang Feng had mentioned earlier that the Violet Thunder Swords used a mysterious light to cleanse their elite disciples. If Chu Yunfan wanted to take another step forward, other than the Fused Origin Pills, this light sounded like a good choice.","According to the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, that mysterious multicolored light was likely a kind of extremely precious energy of nature. It was difficult to see under ordinary circumstances, but it could stabilize one’s foundation, cleanse one’s meridians, and open the valve for cultivation.","During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there had been such light. All the factions used it, but it was difficult for ordinary people to even glimpse it. This light wasn’t produced on the ground. It was a mysterious light that only appeared in a void. It was produced by a mysterious energy of the universe. In the past, an emperor-level expert had to go deep into an endless void to find this light for their disciples to cleanse their meridians and marrow.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed was extremely fast. Although his foundation was solid, if he could be baptized by this mysterious light, his foundation would be even more solid.","He didn’t hesitate and headed into the depths of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","In just a few moments, Chu Yunfan had already reached the depths of the city. However, he saw that the ground was littered with corpses. He saw the scene of an extremely tragic battle. There were corpses everywhere, but these corpses had dried up many years ago. They were all dried corpses, and their bodies had either been torn apart or pierced by weapons.","It was a horrific scene.","These corpses were all wearing the uniform of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect. There was no doubt that they were disciples of the Violet Thunder Swords from countless years ago.","Chu Yunfan recalled the information he had received regarding the Violet Thunder Swords. Back then, the sect had been attacked by someone and wiped out, and many of the sect’s books and inheritances were stolen.","It looked like the rumors were true.","Chu Yunfan scanned the blood with his divine will. He could feel that the blood contained a terrifying power. Although there was only a little left, it was not difficult for Chu Yunfan to imagine how powerful the owner of the blood had been.","The Violet Thunder Swords had indeed encountered a great enemy, and a great battle had erupted here. Even now, one could still see the great battle erupting in the city. The entire sect had been a battlefield. There were signs of damage everywhere, but the houses here had been strengthened by countless barriers and arrays, so they were not completely destroyed. However, it was not difficult to imagine how terrifying the battle back then was.","At this moment, a few streaks of light flew over from afar. Chu Yunfan took a closer look. Weren’t those the Grand Xia experts who had entered first?","Before he could react, streaks of sword light swept over from the sky, nailing the Grand Xia experts to the ground. They were smashed into pieces and their bodies exploded.","“What the?!”","The air in Chu Yunfan’s lungs froze. There was likely an extremely terrifying existence in the depths of the Violet Thunder Swords. The sect probably had a backup plan. Otherwise, how could they have buried all their powerful enemies?","Chu Yunfan recalled the rumors about the Violet Thunder Swords. Although it was said that many of the inheritances had been snatched by other large sects, in reality, countless experts from those sects had fallen here too."]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 The Sword Ghost and the Altar","paragraphs":["1624 The Sword Ghost and the Altar","The battle here had been a world-shaking battle, and it was a battle where both sides had suffered. After the various major powers broke into the Violet Thunder Swords’ headquarters, the Violet Thunder Swords’ final trump card wiped out a large portion of the major powers’ experts.","This was the reason why although these sects had managed to snatch away a considerable portion of the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritances, their martial arts was on a decline. The peak experts from back then had been left behind here.","It was unknown whether the blood that had not dried up belonged to a Violet Thunder Swords expert, or an expert from the various sects that had invaded.","Pondering over this, it suddenly occurred to Chu Yunfan that the Violet Thunder Swords’ backup plan might still be here.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan saw a huge shadow standing in the distance. A creature emitting dense ghost energy appeared before everyone. It was a malicious ghost—a sword ghost that was very different from regular malicious ghosts.","To be precise, it was a ghost servant.","This servant was born from a method of nurturing ghosts. Although Chu Yunfan had never seen one before, he had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so he was knowledgeable. There were few methods in this world he did not know about.","He could tell at a glance that this was a ghost servant raised by a martial arts expert. Only cultivators who cultivated the ghost path could raise such a ghost servant for their own use. And this ghost servant was very different. It was a fierce sword ghost.","This malicious ghost had been an extremely powerful swordsman when it was alive.","However, the Violet Thunder Swords wasn’t a ghost sect, so there shouldn’t have been anyone who cultivated the ghost path or raised ghost servants here. The cultivation of the sword path was an extremely pure cultivation. One’s life was completely entrusted to the sword path. One sword light could chill the entire world.","There was no need to borrow external items. On the contrary, borrowing the power of external items would make one’s power impure. Therefore, it was highly possible that this sword ghost was produced from the soul of a swordsman of the Violet Thunder Swords.","This sword ghost had retained a portion of its memories and martial arts cultivation. This was clearly a rather powerful method.","However, the sword ghost transformed from this method was similar to all ghost servants. They had to endure extreme pain and torture at all times. The ghost energy would constantly erode one’s rationality. This was an extremely cruel method.","Sects that cultivated the ghost path were unpopular because these methods were too cruel. It was impossible for a person who was not particularly determined to transform into a sword ghost. Moreover, it had been so many years, yet this ghost’s mental state had not collapsed. This in itself was terrifying.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan felt his hair stand on end.","The sword ghost let out a long, mournful cry, and swept out a multitude of sword lights, each thousands of feet long. From afar, it was extremely terrifying. Chu Yunfan could see that several Grand Xia experts flying through the sky could not escape in time were slashed and died on the spot.","“Run!”","All the Grand Xia experts came to their senses. They had stepped into the ghost’s boundary and awakened it. This ghost’s cultivation was unfathomable. A Golden Core could not withstand a single blow from it.","Chu Yunfan saw Huang Feng rushing over from afar.","“Brother Chu, let’s stay far away. That Sword Ghost’s range of activity is limited. As long as we don’t get too close, we shouldn’t be in too much danger,” Huang Feng said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. The sword ghost seemed to be guarding something, so it was moving around in a certain area and had no intention of leaving. As long as they were careful enough to avoid being discovered by it and being struck by its sword lights, they should be fine.","“Let’s head to the spot with the mysterious light,” Huang Feng said.","Chu Yunfan nodded and followed Huang Feng.","Huang Feng didn’t dare to fly through the sky. That sword ghost was too big. Its gaze swept across the area, and it attacked whoever it saw. Although it couldn’t leave a certain range, that didn’t mean that the sword lights it swept out couldn’t.","These sword lights were like missiles sweeping through the air. Those who were swept by them, regardless of their cultivation, would die. Loud explosions could be heard everywhere. Even Chu Yunfan felt frightened when he saw them.","Huang Feng led Chu Yunfan to an altar located in a huge square. In the square were countless mummified corpses. These corpses were once the disciples of the Violet Thunder Swords.","These Violet Thunder Swords disciples’ souls were not destroyed though their bodies had perished. They continued to roam around the altar and attacked anyone who came close. Above the altar, a rainbow-colored energy was emitting an alluring light.","At this moment, many experts were already around the altar and were fighting the Violet Thunder Swords mummy disciples. Although the cultivation of these mummies was not high, they were experts above the Golden Core Stage and still posed a huge threat to these Grand Xia experts.","Chu Yunfan could see from afar that Nangong Zhuo was wielding a longbow and shooting out dozens of arrows at the same time, blowing up the Violet Thunder Swords mummies as he approached the altar.","On the other side, a young man in a tight shirt held a saber in his hand. He swept out saber lights, carving out a path and rushing toward the altar.","“Brother Chu, let’s work together. We’ll split the energy at the altar equally between us,” Huang Feng said.","“Okay.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","They didn’t dare to show their heads or fly up. They would surely die if the sword ghost’s sword lights came down on them. Therefore, the only choice was to charge forward.","The two of them joined forces, and Chu Yunfan finally saw Huang Feng’s attack. His leg techniques were extremely shocking. In the blink of an eye, he multiplied into many countless figures in the sky. His speed was so fast that it was shocking. Wherever he passed, the Violet Thunder Swords mummies were kicked to pieces.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. He made the Mountain Wrap Seal and formed a huge mountain. He crushed dozens of Violet Thunder Swords mummies in one go.","Just like that, the two of them joined hands and caught up with Nangong Zhuo and Saber Tyrant. The four of them rushed toward the altar as fast as they could."]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 Easy Targets? Slap Them to Death!","paragraphs":["1625 Easy Targets? Slap Them to Death!","Everyone saw the four rushing toward the altar. Immediately, they formed groups of three to five and began to cooperate. Their strength could not compare to the four, so they could only use this method to rush toward the altar.","Everyone knew that the opportunity to break through was right in front of them. And it became their goal.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Everyone attacked frantically, but they were a step too slow. They could only watch helplessly as Chu Yunfan and the other three reached the altar.","Nangong Zhuo and Saber Tyrant had noticed Chu Yunfan and Huang Feng joining forces to attack. Huang Feng was extremely fast and was skilled in movement techniques. When he moved, his figure was everywhere. It was as if he could occupy the entire world.","This was something that they all knew about. After all, they were each other’s biggest competitors. It was impossible for them to not know about his skills.","What really shocked them was that Chu Yunfan was keeping up. Chu Yunfan turned into a bolt of lightning and flashed past. If Huang Feng was the wind—formless and unpredictable—then Chu Yunfan was a thunderclap that shook the world.","The speed of both parties was extremely fast. In a moment, they had already caught up to Nangong Zhuo and Saber Tyrant. The four of them reached the side of the altar at the same time.","Four huge hands rose into the air and grabbed at the rainbow light atop the mysterious altar. Several large hands made of energy collided in the air as everyone attacked.","Behind him, many Grand Xia experts had also acted. There was a group around the altar. All kinds of martial arts attacks followed, like a tidal wave that swept everything. The area around the altar became a huge battlefield. Everyone was frantically tearing at the mysterious light.","“Get lost!”","Chu Yunfan and Nangong Zhuo almost collided with each other. Nangong Zhuo pushed his palm toward Chu Yunfan, wanting to send him flying. However, Chu Yunfan was not a person who would back down. He was not afraid when facing Yang Feifeng, let alone Nangong Zhuo.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan blocked Nangong Zhuo’s attack with a punch. Chu Yunfan was at a slight disadvantage but not completely. It was a difficult situation. Nangong Zhuo glared at Chu Yunfan but didn’t do anything more to him. If he battled Chu Yunfan now, he would only be taken advantage of.","At this moment, the four of them began to exclude the others. Although the four of them were not as good as one person, it was still better than letting the others get a piece of the pie. The strength of the four was naturally unquestionable. When they cooperated, even a peak Golden Core could not interfere.","Furthermore, they were being held back by the Violet Thunder Sword mummies.","Chu Yunfan grabbed at least one-third of the rainbow light shining on the altar. Nangong Zhuo and the Saber Tyrant were dissatisfied, but they had no choice. Chu Yunfan was too fast. They could only join forces with Huang Feng to split one-third of the light. The remaining light was split among the other peak Golden Cores who had rushed over.","Chu Yunfan and the others digested the results of the battle. They understood that it was impossible to not give a portion to these peak Golden Cores. There were more Golden Cores coming from behind. If they did not appease these people, they would be in big trouble.","Chu Yunfan had gained the most. He seized one-third of the rainbow light and turned it into a flash of lightning, instantly arriving at the edge of the square. He could feel the rainbow light seeping into his body. It was an irreversible process. When he got hold of the rainbow light, it had already begun.","He was not the only one. Huang Feng, Nangong Zhuo, Saber Tyrant, and the other peak Golden Cores who had been allocated a portion of the rainbow light all fled to the side of the square. They sat down cross-legged and attacked the cultivation barrier. They were about to break through in such a chaotic battlefield.","They had no other choice. Breaking through on the battlefield was dangerous, but there was no way to store the rainbow light. Their only choice was to break through as quickly as they could.","After leaving the altar, the light would quickly dissipate if it was not absorbed. The Violet Thunder Swords had probably constructed this altar specifically to store the rainbow light.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged and began to absorb the rainbow light. He could feel a mysterious power washing through his meridians, marrow, and every cell in his body.","Chu Yunfan’s physical strength was already very shocking, and under the washing of this mysterious power, he felt his body undergo a transformation. His entire body was undergoing a violent transformation.","Time ticked by.","As the battle continued, the Violet Thunder Swords mummies in the plaza slowly decreased and the Grand Xia experts gained the upper hand. Looking at the top experts who were already sitting cross-legged on the side and breaking through, they were upset. They had clearly charged in together, but they had failed to get a share of the pie.","It was just too upsetting.","Soon, everyone focused on Chu Yunfan. Not only did he have the most rainbow light, but more importantly, he was the only native of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain here. They wouldn’t have to worry about revenge from the sect behind him.","A few people started attacking. Chu Yunfan was breaking through now, and it seemed that he was at his weakest. However, just as they approached, a hairy hand suddenly appeared in the sky around Chu Yunfan and slapped the Grand Xia experts.","Bam!","In just one blow, the few Golden Cores were shattered by the palm. Their bodies collapsed and blood splattered. Then, they were grabbed by this hairy hand and brought into the void.","Everyone was scared half to death!"]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 Entering the Golden Core Stage","paragraphs":["1626 Entering the Golden Core Stage","Only then did they realize that what they had thought before was wrong. Although Chu Yunfan was alone and was breaking through on such a dangerous battlefield, he was not completely unprepared.","These people were planning to target Chu Yunfan, but that was the wrong idea.","Thinking of this, many people gave up. Each of these people had the ability to suppress them. They couldn’t afford to offend them. Even Chu Yunfan, who seemed to have no roots, was not someone they could afford to provoke.","Those peak Golden Cores were not to be trifled with.","Each of these people had set up a defensive barrier. If their defensive barrier was broken, they would not be able to bear the consequences once they were angry. Thinking of this, many people pounded their chests and stamped their feet. They were just a little bit away, but a little bit was like a natural moat that separated them.","“I don’t believe that this is the only fortuitous encounter in the Violet Thunder Swords. Since we can’t get the one here, let’s go somewhere else!” someone shouted.","Then, everyone reacted. Since the rainbow light was gone, how could they be willing to stay? They hurriedly flew into the distance.","They didn’t dare to fly up, afraid that the gigantic sword ghost would see them. However, sword light continued to sweep through the air, because behind them, many experts from the Violet Thunder Sword Domain also rushed into the city. Countless monsters were also driven into the city, and the city was in a fierce battle.","When the sword ghost saw this scene, it could not contain its anger. It kept attacking. Every sword light that swept down would bring about a terrifying tide, killing countless monsters and humans.","Even though the sword ghost kept blasting out sword lights, there were simply too many monsters, and they were under the command of the monster king. They were fearless, and they were getting closer and closer.","At this moment, a sword light suddenly descended from the sky and landed directly on the square.","Boom!","After a loud explosion, the entire square was reduced to dust.","The altar that was originally used to hold the rainbow light was shattered by the attack. It also woke up everyone at the edge of the square.","Nangong Zhuo opened his eyes. He felt the divine power in his body growing rapidly like a huge vortex. He felt that his entire person was different.","The Abstract Stage! He had stepped into the Abstract Stage!","Stepping into this step was an eventuality. He was originally already at the half-step Abstract Stage, which was to say that he was only half a step away from the Abstract Stage. After the baptism of the rainbow light, he finally took that step.","It was a matter of pushing the boat with the current and stepping into the Abstract Stage.","He could feel that even though he had just stepped into the Abstract Stage, he was at least several times stronger than before. A smile spread across his face. The Abstract Stage and the Non-Abstract Stage were two completely different things. Only by truly crossing over could one understand the difference between them!","Powerful!","This was the only thought he had!","He then saw Chu Yunfan sitting cross-legged on the other side of the square that had turned into dust. Chu Yunfan was emitting a faint light, gentle and calm. It was as if everything on the battlefield had nothing to do with him. It was a state of mind that was at the peak of perfection.","Nangong Zhuo’s first reaction was to raise the bow in his hand and point it at Chu Yunfan.","“If I were you, I wouldn’t do it.” Chu Yunfan opened his eyes as if he had felt Nangong Zhuo’s arrow. There was a faint smile on his face.","Facing Nangong Zhuo’s arrow, he didn’t panic. He had a kind of confidence that made Nangong Zhuo tremble in fear.","Nangong Zhuo instantly felt the hair on his body stand on end. It was as if every pore on his body was shrinking. He felt as if he was being targeted by an ancient ferocious beast. It was as if he wasn’t aiming at Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan was aiming at him!","Immediately, Nangong Zhuo felt extremely aggrieved. When he was at the half-step Core Stage, he could not take down Chu Yunfan. His strength now had increased several times and he had entered the Abstract Stage. His combat strength was not the same as before, but he was still frightened by Chu Yunfan.","At the thought of this, he gritted his teeth and released the bowstring in his hand. An arrow soared through the sky and shot toward Chu Yunfan with the momentum of a tsunami. This arrow was fast, causing the surrounding air to change. It turned into a frenzy and formed an incomparably huge storm.","Boom!","A loud explosion sounded like a large missile bombing the scene. The loud explosion woke everyone up.","Nangong Zhuo’s arrow shot out. This arrow was so terrifying that even Huang Feng and Saber Tyrant were shocked and hurriedly retreated to the side.","Everyone expected Chu Yunfan to be killed. After the huge explosion, they did not see Chu Yunfan being shot into powder, nor was he seriously injured. In the endless smoke and dust, they opened their divine eyes and saw Chu Yunfan raise his arm and open his palm to catch the arrow.","When the arrow touched Chu Yunfan’s palm, it cracked inch by inch.","Everyone was dumbfounded. They did not expect to see this scene. They knew very well how terrifying Nangong Zhuo’s arrow was. That was the combat strength of someone who had stepped into the Abstract Stage—the terrifying power of the initial insight into nature’s laws.","Even if Huang Feng or Saber Tyrant wanted to fight, they had to go all out. Otherwise, they might be severely injured by the arrow.","But who knew that Chu Yunfan only stretched out his arm and casually caught the arrow?","“Impossible!” Nangong Zhuo said incredulously.","He had held nothing back. He had used his full strength, but in the end, his arrow was caught by Chu Yunfan.","Just how terrifying was Chu Yunfan?","Nangong Zhuo’s pupils constricted. He finally realized that the peaceful and perfect aura on Chu Yunfan’s body was the aura of the Golden Core Stage."]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 Half Dead in One Strike","paragraphs":["1627 Half Dead in One Strike","Yes, the aura on Chu Yunfan’s body was none other than the aura of a Golden Core!","The Golden Core Stage represented the perfection of the Core Stage. Only when one reached the Golden Core Stage could one truly complete the cultivation of their golden core.","It was the perfection of this cultivation level!","After several years of bitter cultivation, Chu Yunfan had finally stepped into the Golden Core Stage. He was originally at the peak of the Void Core Stage and was only one step away from the Core Stage.","After washing his body and almost completing a huge transformation, Chu Yunfan, like Nangong Zhuo, also completed a breakthrough and broke through to the Golden Core Stage in one go. His combat strength then increased several times.","At this time, everyone woke up from their seclusion. Chu Yunfan and Nangong Zhuo were not the only ones who had broken through. The cultivation of the others had also made a huge leap. Huang Feng and Saber Tyrant who were half-step Abstracts, had broken through to the Abstract Stage, which was similar to Nangong Zhuo’s cultivation.","As for the other martial arts experts who were originally at the peak of the Golden Core Stage, they had also advanced a step further and reached the half-step Abstract Stage. They were only a little bit away from the Abstract Stage. They were almost on par with Huang Feng, Saber Tyrant, and Nangong Zhuo.","Moreover, this breakthrough did not have any side effects at all. On the contrary, it even raised their life level.","They wanted to encounter such a good thing every day, but they understood that it was impossible. This rainbow light energy was rare. Even the sects that owned it strictly controled its use. It was simply not something they could come into contact with.","Only the top geniuses had the chance to be baptized by this rainbow light.","Those geniuses were about the same age as them, but their cultivation levels were like the difference between heaven and earth. It was not just the difference in talent, but more of the difference in resources.","But even so, they were very happy. Their harvest from this trip was quite fruitful.","However, after their joy, they immediately focused their gazes on the two people in battle. Nangong Zhuo’s arrow had woken them up, and Chu Yunfan had casually grabbed Nangong Zhuo’s arrow, which made them even more stunned. They were dumbfounded.","They looked at Chu Yunfan as if he were a monster. He was like a monster in human skin!","“I told you, if I were you, I wouldn’t shoot this arrow,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. His eyes were calm and composed as if he didn’t take Nangong Zhuo seriously.","Nangong Zhuo looked at Chu Yunfan. The good mood that he had just had was completely ruined.","“So what if I did? You’re just a Golden Core. Do you really expect me to lower my head?” Nangong Zhuo gritted his teeth and stared at Chu Yunfan. However, he understood in his heart that this person in front of him was not an ordinary Golden Core. This was just his wishful thinking.","Chu Yunfan was too strong and terrifying!","With his current Abstract Stage cultivation, ordinary golden cores, even eight to ten of them, would not be enough to kill Nangong Zhuo. Even three to five half-step Abstracts would not be able to stop him. He had the strength to crush everyone.","But even so, when facing Chu Yunfan, he didn’t have the confidence to win.","It was because he had sensed Chu Yunfan’s threat he had decided to strike first and gain the upper hand. That was why he had shot that arrow. Who knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was beyond his expectations?","Chu Yunfan had grabbed the arrow with his bare hands.","Was he a monster?","Nangong Zhuo felt bitter, but his pride did not allow him to lower his head.","“So what if he’s in the Golden Core Stage?” Chu Yunfan shook his head and sneered. “I had no enmity with you. It’s fine that you helped Yang Feifeng, but now that he was chased by me, you actually dare to jump out? If I don’t teach you a lesson, you won’t know the immensity of heaven and earth.”","“Teach me a lesson? You?” Nangong Zhuo was instantly angered by Chu Yunfan’s words. “The person who will teach me a lesson is yet to be born,” he said as he pulled on the bow in his hand.","“I’ll show you witness the Nangong clan’s archery skills, you lowly native!”","Nangong Zhuo’s eyes suddenly turned sharp. His eyes locked on Chu Yunfan, and the divine power in his body burned at an amazing speed.","“Be careful, Brother Chu. That’s the Nangong clan’s Meteor Arrow technique, and it’s extremely terrifying.” Huang Feng warned Chu Yunfan.","If he had only treated Chu Yunfan as a partner that he could use for a while, then his attitude was completely different now. Chu Yunfan’s potential was immeasurable and definitely not ordinary.","“It’s fine. It’s just some bullsh*t archery skills,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","The arrow in Nangong Zhuo’s hand shot out. In an instant, the wind and clouds changed color. The arrow in his hand turned into a huge shooting star that dragged a long tail behind it as it rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","This was the power of a comet crashing into the earth.","There were rumors that the dinosaurs of ancient times went extinct because of an asteroid hitting the Earth. Of course, Nangong Zhuo’s arrow was not that powerful, but it was absolutely shocking when it was released by an Abstract.","“You dare to show off your insignificant skills in front of me?” Chu Yunfan sneered and then slapped out. He didn’t use any shocking technique, nor was it some divine power or martial arts. It was just a simple slap that slapped down on the shocking arrow.","Boom!","There was a huge explosion, like the sound of two huge stars colliding. Then, everyone saw Nangong Zhuo’s Meteor Arrow was smashed into powder by Chu Yunfan’s strike.","The energy spread in all directions like a tidal wave. However, Chu Yunfan’s slap didn’t lose its momentum and kept going. Nangong Zhuo knew that things were not good. He was good at long-range attacks—close-combat was his weakness. This was the weakness of the experts of the Nangong clan. It was just that the degree was different.","Now, he couldn’t escape. Chu Yunfan’s strike had locked onto him.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s strike seemed slow, but it was actually fast. In an instant, it had already hit Nangong Zhuo.","Nangong Zhuo screamed as he was sent flying. He coughed up a mouthful of blood and his bones were broken."]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 The Difference Between Being Flipped by One Hand or Two Hands","paragraphs":["1628 The Difference Between Being Flipped by One Hand or Two Hands","Chu Yunfan’s strike was so sudden that it looked like he had attacked in an instant. What was even more unexpected was that Nangong Zhuo, who had been showing off his might, was so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","Nangong Zhuo was completely defeated by Chu Yunfan in an instant. He couldn’t even withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan.","This move shocked everyone. Before this, even the most imaginative person could not imagine that the final scene would be like this. In everyone’s opinion, even if Nangong Zhuo could not take down Chu Yunfan, he could still protect himself as he was an Abstract.","Although everyone was not far from the Abstract Stage, it was precisely because of this that they knew that stepping into the Abstract Stage and not stepping into the Abstract Stage were completely different.","They were simply not on the same level.","But Nangong Zhuo, who had entered the Abstract Stage, was defeated by Chu Yunfan, who had just entered the Golden Core Stage. And he was defeated in a single move!","Huang Feng and Saber Tyrant felt their hair stand on end. They had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously before. Chu Yunfan could challenge a half-step Abstract previously, but that was only at the half-step Abstract. After they had entered the Abstract Stage, the gap between them should have widened.","However, the truth was that although they had been pulled apart, it was Chu Yunfan who had pulled them ahead of them. They had made great progress and their combat strength had increased several times, but Chu Yunfan’s improvement was greater than theirs.","At this moment, they remembered that Chu Yunfan had taken the most rainbow light, more than one-third of it. None of them had as much as him. It was several times more than theirs. And after absorbing so much of the light, Chu Yunfan’s combat power had undergone a tremendous change.","They were right. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was soaring, especially his cultivation level. He had not just entered the Golden Core Stage but had broken through to the peak of the fledgling Golden Core Stage. He was just a little bit away from entering the intermediate Golden Core Stage.","Moreover, his combat strength was much stronger than Nangong Zhuo and the others. Only the three of them working together could make him slightly afraid, but that was all. If it was just one of them, Chu Yunfan wasn’t even interested in taking a second look.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely calm because only he knew how strong he was. He still had nine Fused Origin Pills in hand. With the pills, he could take a step forward and enter the intermediate Golden Core Stage.","Moreover, this would not take much time. He could do it right here.","This time, the harvest of these Grand Xia experts who had come to the Violet Thunder Swords had mostly fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands. It could be said that they had helped him.","“This is impossible!”","Nangong Zhuo stared at Chu Yunfan and spat out a mouthful of blood. His body was blasted into one of the housings. After much struggle, he finally got up, but he felt that all the bones in his body had been broken. Just moving was extremely painful.","In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was a monster who defeated him with one strike. Both of them had broken through, and he had entered the Abstract Stage. However, he could not shake off Chu Yunfan. Instead, he was far behind him.","Thinking of this, Nangong Zhuo was unwilling. If he had known, he would have cooperated with Yang Feifeng to attack Chu Yunfan. Now, he felt regret.","But it was too late now. Chu Yunfan was no longer someone he could deal with.","Nangong Zhuo began to regret it. He shouldn’t have made a move earlier. When he had just broken through, he was in high spirits. Though Chu Yunfan had warned him, he didn’t take Chu Yunfan’s words to heart. He thought that Chu Yunfan was bluffing to scare him.","“I didn’t want to kill you, but since you attacked me, don’t blame me for this,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, his eyes flashing with sharp killing intent.","Although Nangong Zhuo was no match for him, his talent could not be underestimated. Since Nangong Zhuo had offended him, he would completely eliminate him.","“Brother Chu, please hold back on account of me,” Huang Feng suddenly said.","Chu Yunfan looked at Huang Feng with some doubt. He didn’t know why Huang Feng was sticking out his neck. It didn’t seem like there was any relationship between the two of them. After all, Nangong Zhuo had stopped Huang Feng from saving him.","“I owe an elder of the Nangong clan a favor, so please grant me this favor, Brother Chu. Let Nangong Zhuo go this one time, and I believe the Nangong clan will remember this mercy,” Huang Feng said with a bitter smile on his face.","He had no relationship with Nangong Zhuo, and he even wished for Nangong Zhuo to die. However, he owed a favor to an elder of the Nangong clan. This favor was so great that he had to step up and save Nangong Zhuo even though he knew that he might offend Chu Yunfan in the process.","He knew that Nangong Zhuo was a junior whom the clan elder thought highly of. But he naturally did not dare to speak to Chu Yunfan from above, because even Nangong Zhuo was not Chu Yunfan’s opponent. Although Nangong Zhuo was not good at close combat, even if he himself made a move, the result would not be any better. What was the difference between being flipped by one hand or two hands?","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and looked at Nangong Zhuo.","Nangong Zhuo knew that whether he could hold on to his life depended on what he did now. He quickly said, “Brother Chu, I was bewitched by Yang Feifeng earlier. I’ll never go against you again. I swear to the Heavens that I will never take revenge because of this matter in the future.”","Chu Yunfan gazed at Nangong Zhuo. His oath to the heavens was useful. Chu Yunfan knew that it didn’t matter if an ordinary person swore casually. Even if they swore to the heavens, it wouldn’t have much effect. In short, if an ordinary person swore to the heavens, the heavens wouldn’t care about them.","But cultivators who had cultivated to the Abstract Stage began to come into contact with the laws of the unseen world. Once an Abstract swore to the heavens, it would have some effect. If they broke the oath, all kinds of things would come knocking on their door.","Chu Yunfan knew about this matter from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, so he did not doubt it. He nodded and said “All right then. I will respect Huang Feng’s wishes and let you off this time. But if you try to make a move against me in secret, don’t blame me for being merciless.”"]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 Marquis Huntian, Li Qianyuan","paragraphs":["1629 Marquis Huntian, Li Qianyuan","Of course, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t suddenly show mercy. He let Nangong Zhuo go because he had his own opinions. Even if Nangong Zhuo’s strength improved in the future, he was confident that Nangong Zhuo’s improvement speed wouldn’t be faster than his.","Of course, if Nangong Zhuo changed his mind, he wouldn’t mind killing him.","As Chu Yunfan stared at Nangong Zhuo, the latter seemed to be frightened by him. There was no resentment in his eyes. When he heard Chu Yunfan was willing to let him go, he heaved a sigh of relief and quickly said, “Thank you, Brother Chu.”","Although he resented Chu Yunfan for knocking him to the ground and almost killing him, he knew that he would not be able to kill Chu Yunfan. With his pride, he wouldn’t dare to ask the elders of the Nangong clan to help him. Most importantly, he was a member of an aristocratic family. He had grown up in all kinds of schemes and plots. He knew who he could offend and who he couldn’t.","Only when he calmed down and did not look at Chu Yunfan from above did he realize how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. As long as he did not die prematurely, his future was limitless.","In the end, Nangong Zhuo decided to give up on finding trouble with Chu Yunfan and instead switched tactics to befriend him. This was especially so for a local of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","Chu Yunfan was so outstanding, and he would definitely enter Grand Xia in the future. Moreover, he did not have a foundation, so he was just the right person to rope in.","All of Nangong Zhuo’s anger was vented on Yang Feifeng, who had dragged him into the water. If it weren’t for Yang Feifeng, he wouldn’t have ended up like this. However, he didn’t know that it was because he had given up on finding trouble with Chu Yunfan that he had escaped. If he had any thoughts, he wouldn’t have been able to escape Chu Yunfan’s perception. At that time, he would have died.","“This is great. Everyone gets a happy ending.” Huang Feng smiled. “We don’t have any reason to fight to the death in the first place. It’s just for the Violet Thunder Swords’ inheritance and some fortuitous encounters. Wouldn’t we gain more by joining forces than by killing each other?”","Nangong Zhuo thought for a moment and nodded. Previously, the four of them had worked together tacitly to block the peak Golden Cores who had rushed over from behind, successfully allowing them to snatch the bulk of this fortuitous encounter. If they fought to the death, it was inevitable that others would benefit from it. At the end of the day, it was all for the sake of benefits. There were only eternal benefits, not eternal enemies.","All of a sudden, the gigantic sword ghost let out a long howl toward the sky and began to move. It stepped out of the range everyone thought it was confined to. Some Grand Xia experts, Thunder Sword Domain locals, and many monsters were affected. They were struck by sword lights and turned into a shower of blood.","Chu Yunfan, Saber Tyrant, Nangong Zhuo, and Huang Feng looked at each other, and their expressions turned ugly. If the sword ghost was stuck to a small area, they could carefully search for more treasures. But now that it had stepped out of that area, they were in grave danger.","“Let’s go!”","Saber Tyrant was the first to react. He turned into a streak of light and quickly swept across the ground at supersonic speed. Chu Yunfan and the others looked at each other, and their first reaction was to escape. Their strength was simply not enough to withstand a single strike from the sword ghost.","In just a few moments, they had left the city where the Violet Thunder Swords was located. Behind them, the sword ghost was getting closer and closer. Just as it was about to leave the city and catch up to the crowd, a blazing flame descended from the sky and landed on the sword ghost.","“Rrrraaaagggh!”","The sword ghost was smashed open, and it cried out in pain. It was a creature of extreme Yin, and this ball of fire was a flame of extreme Yang. This was like the sword ghost meeting its nemesis, and it burned a huge hole in the ground.","If it had been an ordinary person, they would have been burnt to death on the spot, or at the very least, severely injured. However, the sword ghost had only let out a long howl before it recovered. Its blood-red eyes, which were as big as lanterns, stared at the sky.","Everyone spotted a huge war chariot in the sky.","This chariot was a bronze chariot. There were even spots of rust on the body of the chariot. It was unknown how many years it had been destroyed. There were even some dark red blood stains in some of the dents. Many many years had passed since, but the blood had not dried up.","There were also some marks left by swords and spears on the carriage, which looked quite old and worn. However, it was this extremely ancient and worn-out chariot that was bursting forth with an unprecedented and terrifying might that firmly suppressed the sword ghost who was chasing everyone.","It was a fire dragon, making the entire bronze chariot look like the sun in the sky.","Chu Yunfan sucked in a breath of cold air. He could see the origin of this divine dragon. It was a divine dragon condensed from fire nature laws.","This bronze chariot had a powerful background!","Then, Chu Yunfan looked into the chariot. It was driven by a young man in fiery red armor. He looked to be about 25 or 26 years old. He had a handsome face and held the reins in one hand and a halberd in the other.","He looked like the god of war.","The young man was the only one who had managed to suppress the entire city. Even the unscrupulous sword ghost stared at the figure with a grave expression.","“It’s Marquis Huntian, Li Qianyuan! Why is he here?” Huang Feng exposed the young man’s identity."]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 The Number One of the World’s Younger Generation","paragraphs":["1630 The Number One of the World’s Younger Generation","It was Marquis Huntian—Li Qianyuan.","Everyone’s expression turned solemn. No matter who they were, when they saw Li Qianyuan, their expressions fell.","They all knew that those with too high cultivation levels could not cross the Violet Thunder Sword Domain barrier. Now that Li Qianyuan had appeared, there was only one possibility–-the barrier had been breached.","Grand Xia’s army would surely come and wipe out all other powers. No one else would be able to obtain even a shred of the Violet Thunder Sword inheritances. There was no doubt that from the moment Li Qianyuan appeared, their moment of glory had come to an end.","Li Qianyuan alone was an existence that they could not match, not to mention the endless army behind him","“What a shame,” Nangong Zhuo said through gritted his teeth. The injuries on his body made him feel like his whole body was being torn apart every time he moved.","He was not walking away empty-handed. His cultivation had advanced to the Abstract Stage, so of course, he had gained a lot. Under normal circumstances, if he didn’t have any fortuitous encounters, he would need at least one or two more years of cultivation to reach the Abstract Stage.","But compared to the initial estimation, there was still a gap. They had no way to fight against Li Qianyuan.","Huang Feng and Saber Tyrant’s expressions were equally grave as they understood that with Li Qianyuan’s appearance, they would not be able to gain anything more from the Violet Thunder Swords.","But among these people, the one with the most complicated expression was Chu Yunfan. Li Qianyuan was powerful. Just the aura he emitted was enough to suppress the entire city. That was an existence that was even more powerful than an Abstract.","And such a person was trying to find a way to kill him!","Chu Yunfan could feel many gazes sweeping over him. Li Qianyuan had threatened to kill Chu Yunfan. Many people knew about this, but Chu Yunfan had been too arrogant before, so they didn’t dare to reveal such thoughts. But now that Li Qianyuan was here, their minds started to wonder.","“Let’s go!” Huang Feng hurriedly said.","Chu Yunfan immediately sped off. Everyone watched as he fled. They watched from afar and did not dare to get close.","Li Qianyuan looked coldly at the sword ghost before him. His expression was cold and aloof, like a god of war.","“Who are you?” The sword ghost’s throat vibrated as it spoke in human language.","The ghost had managed to retain the intelligence it had when it was alive, but its voice was hoarse, especially since it had not spoken for countless years. It sounded like a piece of cloth being torn apart.","“I am Marquis Huntian of the Grand Xia Empire, Li Qianyuan,” Li Qianyuan said coldly.","“Grand Xia?” When the sword ghost heard these words, its eyes flashed with a fierce light. “Damn you!”","Li Qianyuan sneered. “I can’t believe you became a sword ghost voluntarily. If you join me, I’ll help you condense a ghost body and stabilize the ghost energy within you so that it doesn’t erode your mind.”","“You want me to surrender? Go to hell!” the sword ghost roared.","The ghost was somewhat confused. At this moment, there was only incomparable hatred in its mind. It could only remember that Grand Xia was its mortal enemy. Though it was only clear-headed for a short while, it could not forget such a deep hatred.","In a flash, the ghost swept out its sword. Sword light rose into the air like a mountain and slashed down at Li Qianyuan.","“Stubborn fool.” Li Qianyuan sneered.","He had not placed much hope in this offer in the first place. This ghost had willingly become this creature to protect the Violet Thunder Swords for generations. One could imagine the determination of such a person.","Ghosts did not have corporeal form. They were formed through pure will. If the person turned ghost was weak-willed, the ghost would have vanished long ago or been completely eroded by the ghost energy and become a mad ghost. And ghosts with strong obsessions were even more troublesome. They did not have any rationality and only had the thought of completing their obsessions.","However, Li Qianyuan was not afraid. He swung his halberd fiercely, and the sword light that was as huge as a mountain collapsed as if it was torn apart.","“He’s so strong! There’s such a big gap between us and Li Qianyuan!”","Once he was far away from the battlefield, Huang Feng stopped. He looked at the two people fighting in the distance, and his eyes flashed with a hint of unwillingness. He knew that there was a huge gap between him and Li Qianyuan, but he did not expect the gap to be so big.","Although Huang Feng had stepped into the Abstract Stage, the gap between them had not narrowed. Instead, it felt like it had widened. The more ignorant he was, the more he was fearless. Now, the more he knew, the more he could feel how terrifying Li Qianyuan was.","“Is this the number one of the world’s younger generation?” Nangong Zhuo clenched his teeth and was somewhat unwilling. He was a top disciple who was favored by his clan, but compared to Li Qianyuan, he was a far cry.","“The road of cultivation has just begun. We’re a few years younger than him and are about to enter a period of rapid progress. We still have a chance to reach his height in the future,” Saber Tyrant said coldly. His eyes flickered with raging flames. He was not willing to be outdone, and the thought of replacing Li Qianyuan one day rose in his heart.","Suddenly Li Qianyuan burst out with terrifying strength. He pushed the bronze chariot forward and slashed out with the halberd. He defeated the ghost single-handedly.","The ghost was powerful, even more powerful than Li Qianyuan. But it was a ghost and had the Yin constitution. After countless years, its body was unstable and it could barely think coherent thoughts. It acted mostly on instinct. Under such circumstances, how could it be Li Qianyuan’s opponent?","It was easily beaten back and forth.","The battle went from the outside of the Violet Thunder Sword city into the city. The terrifying battle destroyed the houses within. Countless houses were reduced to ruins and even turned to dust.","Even the Grand Xia experts were dumbfounded, let alone the Violet Thunder Sword Domain locals. When they saw this scene, they were completely dumbfounded as if they were watching a battle between a god and a devil.","The locals knew how powerful Grand Xia was because of the Grand Xia experts. However, the battle between Li Qianyuan and the sword ghost made them understand how ridiculous their previous thoughts were."]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 Stomping Yang Feifeng to Death","paragraphs":["1631 Stomping Yang Feifeng to Death","The strength of those Grand Xia experts was just the tip of the iceberg. In the confrontation between Li Qianyuan and the sword ghost, even if they were Golden Cores who were previously invincible, they would be killed in the aftermath of the battle. Such a battle was like a battle between gods and devils. It was not something they could imagine.","Chu Yunfan left the city where the Violet Thunder Swords was located. From afar, he could see the terrifying aftermath of the battle between the sword ghost and Li Qianyuan.","Chu Yunfan sighed. Li Qianyuan was indeed strong, so strong that with his current strength, he was afraid that he could not protect himself. He could not withstand a few hits, and he would certainly die.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid. On the contrary, he felt his blood boil. The powerful Grand Xia was the place he yearned for. There were many stronger opponents there. Moreover, just because he was inferior to Li Qianyuan now did not mean that he would be inferior to Li Qianyuan forever.","So what if Li Qianyuan was the number one in the world? Chu Yunfan had killed so many so-called number ones, so there was nothing to be afraid of. But of course, Chu Yunfan was not about to rush up and die to Lu Qianyuan right now.","‘Since Li Qianyuan has come in person, there must be something in the city that he’s interested in,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","Although he couldn’t beat Li Qianyuan head-on, with the Mountain River Diagram, he might be able to benefit from Li Qianyuan. After all, everyone knew that Li Qianyuan was hostile to him. Li Qianyuan wanted to kill him to eliminate the hidden danger, and he would naturally find ways to weaken Li Qianyuan’s strength.","Before Chu Yunfan could think further, he saw a huge hand in the distance reaching out for him. He instinctively stepped back and crossed hundreds of meters in one step, barely managing to avoid the hand.","“Chu Yunfan, I’ve gone through a lot of trouble to find you.”","A familiar voice came from afar, and a figure appeared in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan took a closer look, and surprise flashed through his eyes as the person in front of him was none other than Yang Feifeng, who had been seriously injured by him previously and fled.","Yang Feifeng’s current strength had changed drastically. After the battle with Nangong Zhuo, Chu Yunfan naturally knew that this change in aura was the aura that only appeared when one stepped into the Abstract Stage and began to comprehend the natural laws. In other words, after Yang Feifeng escaped, not only did he not die, but his strength had improved greatly.","“You’re still alive?”","Chu Yunfan was a little stunned. He knew very well how terrifying his sword strike was. It was already good enough if Yang Feifeng didn’t die. Even if he had some healing pills, it would take a few months for him to get better.","However, not only had Yang Feifeng recovered from his injuries, but his strength had also improved.","“That’s right. You didn’t expect this, did you?” Yang Feifeng’s face revealed a ferocious expression. “I thought that I was going to, but this is the will of heaven. I met Marquis Huntian, and he saved me. Not only did he heal me, but he also helped me improve my strength.”","Yang Feifeng felt very lucky. He didn’t expect to meet Li Qianyuan while he was escaping. Li Qianyuan saved him and gave him a pill to increase his strength. There was a grateful expression on Yang Feifang’s face while thinking about it. He had only wanted to attack Chu Yunfan for his own benefit, but after this incident, he was now absolutely loyal to the Marquis.","Li Qianyuan’s power was not something he could match. Even if he trained his utmost best, he could never compare to Lu Qianyuan. The only way was to follow in the footsteps of this strong person so that he could reach a high level in the future.","“A mere pill is nothing to me. I’m sure you’ve heard of me having a great encounter when I was young, so these pills are nothing to me. As long as you do your best, I can give you plenty of these, and I guarantee you’ll become the master of your sect in the future.”","Yang Feifeng’s mind flashed with Li Qianyuan’s words. He finally understood that some people were born to be the protagonist. If this pill was leaked to the world, many people would fight over it. But for Li Qianyuan, it was something that could be given to others.","This made Yang Feifeng even more determined to follow Li Qianyuan.","“So this is Li Qianyuan’s doing.” Chu Yunfan nodded, his face revealing a look of understanding.","He knew that Li Qianyuan had a great fortuitous encounter when he was young, so he probably didn’t lack pills. He knew that there were countless pills that could help people in the half-step Abstract Stage reach the Abstract Stage.","“You became his dog. No wonder you’ve improved.”","“What did you say?” Yang Feifeng narrowed his eyes, sharp killing intent flashing through them. “Chu Yunfan, you’re at death’s door, yet you still want to struggle? You don’t understand how powerful an Abstract is. Earlier, you used a cunning method to heavily injure me. Now, that move of yours is useless against me. To me, you’re just an ant.","“The Marquis has wanted your head for a long time. Now is the perfect time for me to take it and claim a reward from him.”","Yang Feifeng now looked at Li Qianyuan with complete servitude.","Chu Yunfan shook his head. “Although you were domineering, you were a human. What’s the difference between you and a dog now? A martial artist standing between heaven and earth, without even the heart to strive for self-improvement, what achievements could you possibly have in the future?”","“Wagging your tongue to buy time is useless. You won’t get away.”","Yang Feifeng looked at Chu Yunfan with a cold smile. He looked like he knew Chu Yunfan’s place. He assumed that Chu Yunfan had said so much just to buy time.","“Buy time? Who told you I was doing that?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “But you’re right. Since I’m going to kill you, I shouldn’t waste my breath.","“Fourth Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward, and in the blink of an eye, the entire world changed color. It looked like he had turned into a god of heaven and earth. With a stomp, netherworld water appeared under his feet, and it all swept toward Yang Feifeng.","Bang!","Yang Feifeng could not resist. He was stomped on. His head was squashed into his body, and he died instantly."]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 Stealthily Shadowing","paragraphs":["1632 Stealthily Shadowing","With his head squashed into his body, Yang Feifeng was stomped to death. He didn’t even know how he had died. His strength had improved greatly, but he couldn’t withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan sneered. It was ridiculous that Yang Feifeng thought he had a chance to avenge himself. But no one would’ve expected Chu Yunfan’s strength to improve so quickly.","Earlier, he had relied on surprise to heavily injure Yang Feifeng. And Yang Feifeng, thinking that Chu Yunfan had run out of tricks, instantly attacked again. Thus, Yang Feifeng was heavily injured by Chu Yunfan as he was not prepared.","Though Chu Yunfan’s strength had improved greatly, he should not be a match for Yang Feifeng, who had also improved greatly. But Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person. Yang Feifeng was too naive.","After killing Yang Feifeng in one strike, Chu Yunfan felt much more at ease. He could let Nangong Zhuo live, but Yang Feifeng was out of the question.","He raised his head and looked at the Violet Thunder Swords’ mountain gate. At this moment, Li Qianyuan had gained the upper hand. He had sent the sword ghost flying into the city, and there were terrible aftershocks everywhere. Everyone was shocked and did not dare to get close. They watched from afar as if waiting for a miracle to happen. They were thinking they might get a chance to obtain something.","Chu Yunfan did the same. In the blink of an eye, he shot toward the gates. Right now, everyone was so focused on the shocking battle that no one noticed Chu Yunfan. As he approached the gate, he felt wave after wave of battle raging in all directions, and it overthrew him.","Chu Yunfan rolled and disappeared from where he stood. He entered the Mountain River Diagram. The diagram turned into a tiny particle that was invisible to the naked eye and rushed into the city. Even the aftermath of this shocking battle could affect this particle.","This was the latest function of the Mountain River Diagram that Chu Yunfan had developed after his strength had improved greatly. It was not a new function. The diagram already had this ability. It was just that Chu Yunfan was not strong enough to use it back then.","As time passed, his strength increased, and more of the diagram’s functions became available to him. At first, it was just an empty space. Now, not only was the space constantly expanding, but there were also areas such as the herb mountain.","After all, this was an artifact left behind by the Alchemy Emperor. Moving the diagram was just one of its abilities. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t dare to sneak up on Li Qianyuan.","Everyone’s attention was drawn to this intense battle. No one noticed that a particle was sweeping in at an astonishing speed. Of course, it stayed on the edge of the battlefield.","Li Qianyuan was holding a halberd in his hand. He waved it, sending out terrifying divine lights, hitting the sword ghost again and again. the sword ghost screamed. The divine lights from Li Qianyuan’s halberd were like flames, burning through the entire sky. For the ghost, this man was his nemesis.","The ghost’s cultivation was related to the sword, so it was good at attacking but not good at defending. Almost all of its attacks fell on Li Qianyuan’s chariot, which blocked all the blocks. The ghost could not hurt Li Qianyuan.","In terms of cultivation level, the sword ghost was not inferior, but Li Qianyuan had a magic weapon, which occupied a huge advantage. Li Qianyuan beat the sword ghost back. Everyone could see that the sword ghost’s body was slowly becoming blurry, and the sword lights it released were also weakening.","After a period of fighting, the sword ghost was hit by Li Qianyuan’s halberd, and it crashed into the ground, destroying a large number of buildings. Li Qianyuan shouted and threw out his halberd. It was like a long dragon whizzing out, instantly nailing the sword ghost to the ground. The sword ghost screamed as he was burned into nothingness by the flames that erupted from the halberd.","“Stubborn.”","Li Qianyuan jumped out of the chariot and pulled the halberd out of the ground. The sword ghost had been burned away by the flames. With a wave of his hand, the bronze chariot in the sky was put into his space and disappeared.","Clad in battle armor, Li Qianyuan looked like a god of war. He slowly walked toward the center of the city and soon disappeared from everyone’s sight.","“Li Qianyuan is so terrifying!”","“His title as the number one among the youths is impressive.”","“Li Qianyuan’s cultivation method was a bane for the sword ghost, but his strength is beyond doubt.”","However, none of them noticed that there was a particle attached to Li Qianyuan’s body.","Walking in the city, Li Qianyuan did not flinch. His expression was extremely cold. Suddenly, he turned around and swept out his divine will like an arrow like he noticed something was wrong. But he couldn’t find anyone following him. He felt a little strange. He felt like someone was spying on him, but he could not sense where the person was.","However, Li Qianyuan was unperturbed. It was likely a remnant technique of the Violet Thunder Swords. He wasn’t afraid of a living expert from the Violet Thunder Swords, so why would he be afraid of methods left behind by a dead one?","Within the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan breathed a sigh of relief. Li Qianyuan’s senses were very sensitive, even terrifying. If it weren’t for the concealment of the Mountain River Diagram, it would have been difficult to hide from Li Qianyuan."]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 Priceless Treasures","paragraphs":["1633 Priceless Treasures","Despite how magical it was, the Mountain River Diagram was not completely foolproof.","Although Li Qianyuan was strong, there was still a gap between him and the emperors of the ancient era. If he was an expert of that level, he would probably have spotted Chu Yunfan at a glance.","It wasn’t an exaggeration to say that an emperor-level expert’s eyes were like torches and could see through every detail. Experts at that level could see Heaven and Hell. Their gazes could see through earthly barriers.","They had reached terrifying heights of power. They were not inferior to the gods in ancient myths. A person of that level was only one step away from becoming a true god.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know if there were any experts of that level in Grand Xia. He couldn’t learn much from Ye Qiushui as her status was too low. What she knew wasn’t enough to satisfy Chu Yunfan’s desire.","As Chu Yunfan was lost in his thoughts, Li Qianyuan entered the depths of the Violet Thunder Swords. This was a place that even the Grand Xia experts had not been able to reach. All of them had been chased away by the sword ghost.","But now that the sword ghost had been destroyed by Li Qianyuan, no one would stop him. The remaining barriers and arrays could not stop Li Qianyuan. His steps seemed slow but were actually fast. In just a moment, he had already arrived at the center of an incomparably huge hall.","Li Qianyuan’s eyes lit up. This hall was his real goal.","‘It’s right ahead!’","Li Qianyuan had a fortuitous encounter when he was a child. The pills and magic tools that ordinary people could only dream of were all within his reach. The items he wanted from the Violet Thunder Swords were different from ordinary treasures. It was worth it for him to leave the main force behind and come here personally.","From within the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan followed Li Qianyuan’s gaze and saw that there were several things in the hall. There was a barrier covering everything. On the leftmost table, there was a cauldron. This ancient bronze cauldron was engraved with ancient and complicated patterns.","Ordinary people would not understand what this ancient bronze cauldron was used for, but Chu Yunfan recognized it at a glance. This cauldron was a rare medicinal cauldron and could be used as an alchemical furnace. There were also many other wonderful uses for this item.","For ordinary people, although it was useful, it was just so-so. In Chu Yunfan’s hands, the effect would be completely different.","He recognized this medicinal cauldron as a magic tool from when the Alchemy Emperor was alive. The medicinal cauldron that the Alchemy Emperor had been using before achieving great strides in his cultivation was called the Mountain River Cauldron.","Later on, after the Alchemy Emperor attained the dao, he gradually used less of the cauldron. With his cultivation, ordinary medicinal pills could be easily and quickly made.","Chu Yunfan was different. He did not have the shocking cultivation of the Alchemy Emperor. He had spent a lot of time turning the fused origin energy into Fused Origin Pills. If he had the help of Mountain River Cauldron back then, he would have been able to turn all the fused origin energy into Fused Origin Pills in less than an hour.","Moreover, from the Alchemy Sovereign’s memories, Chu Yunfan knew that besides making pills, the Mountain River Cauldron could also increase the quality of medicinal herbs. Some medicinal herbs that might not meet the requirements could be boosted through the Mountain River Cauldron.","For example, some formulas called for a thousand-year-old ginseng, but if they were refined with Mountain River Cauldron, even an eight-hundred-year-old ginseng could be used. At the same time, this cauldron was a defensive treasure refined by the Alchemy Emperor. Using the Mountain River Cauldron to protect oneself could greatly increase one’s defensive power.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze moved away from the Mountain River Cauldron. Beside the cauldron was a talisman that looked like a small sword. There was a faint sword intent rising from this talisman as if it could explode at any moment. Just one glance was enough to make Chu Yunfan tremble with fear.","‘A Sword Light Talisman!’","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized it. He had the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, so he was quite knowledgeable. The talisman was something that ordinary people could not recognize, but it was not difficult for him.","This Sword Light Talisman sealed a strand of sword light within it. Once it was released, it would release the full power of the sword light. This was a method that the large sects in the Ancient Zenith Civilization used to protect their disciples. The sword light sealed in was usually very powerful. A disciple might only appear to be at the Void Core Stage, but once they used this talisman, they could even kill an Abstract.","This talisman was very precious as it was difficult to store such powerful sword light. It had to be made out of various precious materials. Therefore, the value of this Sword Light Talisman was immeasurable. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t know how powerful the sword light sealed in it was, since it was placed here by the Violet Thunder Swords, it was probably very strong. Even if it couldn’t compare to Mountain River Cauldron, it probably wasn’t far off.","Beside the Sword Light Talisman, Chu Yunfan saw a golden book. It seemed to be made entirely of gold. There were a few words written on it.","Violet Thunder Sword Scripture.","Chu Yunfan’s pupils contracted slightly. It was a sword scripture!","Ordinary cultivation techniques would at most be called techniques. However, if it was called scripture, it meant that the technique was incredible. It was not a title that ordinary cultivation techniques could receive. It had to be of extremely high quality and all-encompassing to be called a scripture.","In other words, this Violet Thunder Sword Scripture was likely the foundation of all the techniques in the Violet Thunder Sword Sect. It was very likely that the techniques recorded in it were the most authentic and superior sword techniques in the sect.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. He didn’t care much about ordinary sword techniques, but the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture was different. The techniques of the Violet Thunder Swords should possess thunder divine power. They would be compatible with Chu Yunfan’s Thunderclap Physique. For him, the most suitable sword technique for him to cultivate was definitely the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. He was determined to get these three items. Each of them was worth a lot, especially the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture and the Mountain River Cauldron.","He now understood why Li Qianyuan had come personally."]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 Getting the Treasures and Angering Li Qianyuan","paragraphs":["1634 Getting the Treasures and Angering Li Qianyuan","Needless to say, Chu Yunfan was probably the only person in the world who truly understood the true use of the Mountain River Cauldron, which was the most precious item here. The second most precious was the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture. If it were to spread, it would cause countless people to fight for it, and it would cause a bloody storm. The last item, the Sword Light Talisman, was extremely valuable as well.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath. He only had one chance. Snatching something from Li Qianyuan’s hands was undoubtedly like pulling teeth from a tiger’s mouth. If he was not careful, he wouldn’t be able to pull it off.","As Li Qianyuan looked at the three items in front of him, his eyes lit up. He was looking for these exact items. He had personally asked the successor of the Violet Thunder Swords about this. When the Violet Thunder Swords had been destroyed, the sect master left behind these three items to give the successor of the sect a chance to revive the sect.","The Violet Thunder Sword Scripture recorded the Violet Thunder Swords’ supreme sword techniques. Most of the techniques of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect were derived from this scripture. With the scripture in hand, it wouldn’t be a problem for a person to establish a new Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","As for the Sword Light Talisman, it was for the successor to use in self-defense. There were countless experts in the world. If they offended some old monster, the successor would have the means to defend themselves.","As for the cauldron, even the successor could not explain its origins. They only knew that it came from a peerless expert from a distant era, and later ended up in the hands of the Violet Thunder Swords. He wasn’t even sure what its specific function was.","However, Li Qianyuan was thinking about something else. Items that could make the sect master of the Violet Thunder Swords keep it as a future item to revitalize the sect were naturally not ordinary items. In the future, there would be a chance to understand the cauldron further.","“This sect master had a good plan. If he leaves behind too many things, others will covet them. If he leaves behind too few, it will not be enough to revitalize the sect.” Li Qianyuan sneered.","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he finally understood why these three items were suddenly placed here. The Violet Thunder Swords’ sect master had left them behind to revive the sect. Everything made sense now.","The sect master of the Violet Thunder Swords had good foresight. If the Violet Thunder Swords had been destroyed and all the secret manuals and treasures within the sect had been plundered, there would probably not have been any successor who survived. The experts who coveted the treasures of the sect would definitely not let go of this opportunity. The three items that were left behind were not too eye-catching, but they were necessary for the revival of the sect.","Li Qianyuan probably never dreamed that while he was planning to take these items, there was another person who was coveting them as well.","“Let’s go to the side hall and see if there are any other treasures.”","Li Qianyuan went to the side hall. For him, these things were already in his pocket, so there was no need to rush. It was impossible for someone else to step in here without his knowing. His divine will enveloped this area. The moment someone came in, he would instantly sense it.","Furthermore, this world had been in decline for far too long, and there was no one who could fight against him. The sword ghost was nothing more than an old thing from the previous era that had been left behind countless years ago.","In the side hall, there were some natural treasures. They were considered precious in the eyes of the outside world, but compared to the first three items, they were far inferior.","After Li Qianyuan left, a figure appeared in the empty hall. It was none other than Chu Yunfan. When he appeared, the first thing he did was to grab the Sword Light Talisman. The enchantment that was originally attached to the talisman was shattered, and it fell into his hands.","Chu Yunfan immediately grabbed in the direction of the Mountain River Cauldron. As soon as he touched it, a familiar fluctuation came from the cauldron, forming a connection with Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram.","The divine will that the Violet Thunder Swords’ past sect master had cast over the cauldron collapsed. It was instantly swallowed by an even more powerful divine will. This divine will was left behind by the Alchemy Emperor. It had been lying in wait for all these years, and the moment Chu Yunfan touched the cauldron, it resonated with the Mountain River Diagram and he instantly gained control of it.","With the Alchemy Emperor’s strength, when the successive sect masters of the Violet Thunder Swords had been trying their best to control the cauldron, they had only skimmed the surface of its uses. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and was considered the heir of the Alchemy Emperor.","He took control of the Mountain River Cauldron at the first moment.","What happened in the main hall instantly alarmed Li Qianyuan.","“Who is it?!” he roared.","His voice was filled with great anger, and his anger burned everything.","An incomparably terrifying hand shot out of the side hall and grabbed at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately sensed an intense danger. The cauldron flew up and hovered above him.","Clang!","When this large hand slapped the cauldron, the sound of metal clashing erupted.","Chu Yunfan took a few steps back and felt his blood boil. He almost spat out blood from the shock. Li Qianyuan’s strength was truly terrifying, far above his current strength. If the cauldron had not blocked most of the attack, he would have been killed by Li Qianyuan in one strike.","Even though the cauldron had blocked most of the power, a small portion still shook his body. Although he was shocked, Chu Yunfan’s attack was not slow. He took a step forward and was right before the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture. He smashed the barrier around the scripture and threw it into the Mountain River Diagram.","“How dare you!”","Li Qianyuan was furious. In a flash, he appeared in the main hall. He finally saw who had stolen his things.","Wasn’t this the Chu Yunfan that he had been looking for and hoping to kill?"]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 A Shocking Attack","paragraphs":["1635 A Shocking Attack","When he saw that the person who came was none other than Chu Yunfan, Li Qianyuan was so angry that his whole body trembled. He emitted a terrible killing intent, freezing the air in the main hall.","Li Qianyuan was far more terrifying than an Abstract.","“I’ve been looking for you. I haven’t managed to kill you, and you dare to appear in front of me?”","Li Qianyuan was furious and burst out. His terrifying killing intent materialized. Then, he grabbed out at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan dove into the Mountain River Diagram.","“Trying to escape? Wishful thinking!”","Li Qianyuan saw that Chu Yunfan’s figure was about to disappear into space. How could he not understand how Chu Yunfan had deceived his perception earlier?","His gut feeling had not been wrong. There was indeed someone following him, but Chu Yunfan was hiding in a spatial artifact. His eyes flashed. Such tools were rare even in Grand Xia.","Ordinary spatial artifacts could only store inanimate objects. If one wanted to hide people in it, the quality of the artifact had to be very high. Even he didn’t have such a thing, but Chu Yunfan did.","Li Qianyuan reacted quickly. He threw out a talisman, and in an instant, the entire space was frozen. Chu Yunfan, who was about to enter the Mountain River Diagram, was frozen. He could not enter.","“Do you really think that I can’t do anything to you?” Li Qianyuan sneered and chased after Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan quickly flew out of the main hall. But although he was fast, the gap between his strength and Li Qianyuan’s was too big. Li Qianyuan caught up with him in an instant.","Li Qianyuan slapped down.","Clang!","This strike hit the cauldron above Chu Yunfan’s head. He was hit by a huge force and was instantly sent flying.","Chu Yunfan almost spat out a mouthful of blood and his expression fell. Li Qianyuan was too strong. If he didn’t have the Mountain River Cauldron, he would have been defeated long ago and died at Li Qianyuan’s hands.","“An ant dares to plot against me? Hand over the items and I’ll grant you a quick death.”","Li Qianyuan revealed a sneer. He was not anxious in the slightest and even had the intention of playing a cat-and-mouse game. In his eyes, even if Chu Yunfan had the protection of the cauldron, it was not a problem for him to kill Chu Yunfan.","It all just depended on when he was going to kill him.","“So this medicinal cauldron can be used in this way. Without knowledge on how to make pills, it can still be used as a defensive treasure.”","Li Qianyuan clicked his tongue in wonder. In his opinion, the cauldron was already in his pocket. The successor of the Violet Thunder Swords hadn’t mentioned it, but Chu Yunfan had uncovered a new function.","Faced with Li Qianyuan’s constant pressure, Chu Yunfan kept backing away. Lii Qianyuan kept hitting Chu Yunfan with his palm. He didn’t even use any unique skills. He just relied on his absolute tyrannical strength to beat Chu Yunfan back.","However, he did not panic. His expression was solemn as he kept retreating. Shortly, both parties had flown out of the city. As for the Grand Xia experts and the Violet Thunder Sword locals who hadn’t left yet, their eyes went wide when they saw this.","“How... How is this possible? Isn’t that Chu Yunfan?”","“Yes, that is Chu Yunfan. Why is he being chased by Li Qianyuan?”","“Chu Yunfan didn’t leave and actually snuck into the city?”","“How audacious!”","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s boldness. These people were all dragons and phoenixes among men, so it was not difficult to guess the whole story. It was likely that Chu Yunfan had sneaked in at some point and wanted to snatch benefits from under Li Qianyuan’s nose. Unfortunately, he was discovered and was now being chased.","In their opinion, Chu Yunfan had failed. They could not imagine that Chu Yunfan would succeed. What they didn’t know was that it was because Chu Yunfan had succeeded that Li Qianyuan was chasing after him.","Suddenly, as everyone was discussing, a shocking sword light shot out in the air. It swept across the ground and bombarded Li Qianyuan.","Slash!","This attack came too suddenly. No one expected Chu Yunfan to be capable of unleashing such a terrifying attack. Many people trembled when they saw this scene. They could not imagine how terrifying this sword was. If it landed on them, even if it was just the aftershock, it was enough to crush a Golden Core into pieces.","“Wh-What sword light is that?!”","Many people gasped.","In the distance, Huang Feng was shocked by this scene. This was completely different from the sword light Chu Yunfan had released with the Monster Vanquisher. Not only was its power dozens of times stronger, but most importantly, this sword light had the sound of thunder and was surrounded by endless thunder energy.","It was clearly the result of a different cultivation technique.","He had no idea how Chu Yunfan had done this.","Huang Feng knew that Chu Yunfan was not strong enough to do this, but it also showed that Chu Yunfan had hidden such a shocking trump card.","Nangong Zhuo’s face turned pale with fright. This sword attack had truly frightened him. At this moment, he finally understood why Chu Yunfan had looked down on him before. He really did have such a terrifying technique."]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 Severely Injuring Li Qianyuan and Escaping","paragraphs":["1636 Severely Injuring Li Qianyuan and Escaping","They all thought that Chu Yunfan had hidden this technique. They never thought that this was a fortuitous encounter that Chu Yunfan had just gained in the city. In their opinion, it was impossible to snatch anything from Li Qianyuan.","Everyone’s eyes widened as they watched the storm caused by the sword light finally dissipate. They could finally see something. They saw that Li Qianyuan had been hit by the strike, and his body had almost been cut in half.","Such terrifying power made everyone shudder.","“Th-This can’t... This is the first time Li Qianyuan has been so severely injured!”","Someone recalled a terrifying legend about Li Qianyuan.","“Yes, this is very likely. Li Qianyuan had a fortuitous encounter when he was young. He had shown amazing strength since a young age. When he was ten years old, ordinary adult disciples were already no match for him.”","“That’s right. Even in the battles of the south and north, there’s no one who could match him. Ordinary enemies can’t stand up to him for even a moment.”","“I didn’t expect him to be so severely injured in such a backward world.”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan might have just created history. It was the first time someone had severely injured Li Qianyuan. Though he had done it with the help of an external force, it was still unprecedented.","“You’re courting death... I’m going to kill you!”","Li Qianyuan’s eyes blazed, flashing with fierce killing intent. His invincible legend had been broken by Chu Yunfan. A person who was an ant in his eyes had broken his legend. What made him even more furious was that Chu Yunfan had used the sword light from the Sword Light Talisman.","With just one attack, he was heavily injured and his strength plummeted.","“Hahaha! Li Qianyuan, you still want to act all high and mighty?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He was panting heavily. The activation of that sword attack was not without cost. All the divine power in his body had been drained. He had so much divine power, but it was still drained in an instant. One could imagine how difficult it was to activate the talisman.","He had borrowed the power of the talisman. It was impossible for him to slash out such an attack with his own strength. It was no wonder that the sect master of the Violet Thunder Swords had left it behind for the successor to use for self-defense.","If Li Qianyuan hadn’t been wearing an extremely high-grade inner armor, which blocked most of the attack, he would have been doomed. His cultivation was very high, but he was still far from the Violet Thunder Swords sect master’s. This attack was equivalent to the sect master’s full strength.","There was no doubt about its power. But at the same time, the sword light that this talisman had accumulated was exhausted. It was not a permanent talisman and could only be used three times.","And Chu Yunfan had already used it once. He could only use it again after it was fully charged. There were only three times, so Chu Yunfan couldn’t use it recklessly. He could only use it when he was in imminent danger.","“Go to hell!” Li Qianyuan’s eyes flashed, and his expression was extremely ugly. In an instant, he pounced at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, fled into the distance frantically. Just as Li Qianyuan was about to pursue, a giant beast appeared in front of him.","“It’s a hou! Oh my god, there was a hou here!”","Someone cried out in surprise. They recognized the origin of this fierce beast in a single glance. Wasn’t it the hou that was rumored to be ranked at the top among the many fierce beasts in ancient times?","This creature had long ceased to exist. It disappeared a long, long time ago because of the great changes in the world. No one expected to see a living one here.","‘How many trump cards does Chu Yunfan have?!’ many people wondered in disbelief.","When Chu Yunfan was being chased, he threw out many tricks. With the Mountain River Cauldron, he managed to block Li Qianyuan’s attack. In addition, he had that shocking sword and a hou.","In a short time, Chu Yunfan had displayed many trump cards, each of which was enough to make them drool.","“A hou? You think a beast can help you?”","Li Qianyuan was furious. If it was an adult hou, he might have turned around and run. But this one was just a juvenile. What was there to be afraid of?","Even though he was severely injured now, he was not someone that anyone could casually insult. The anger in his heart surged.","Li Qianyuan suppressed his injuries, then raised his halberd and chopped down at the hou.","The hou’s body was extremely tough and was said to be invulnerable. But before the halberd, it was like a piece of paper. In an instant, a huge gash was drawn out, and fresh blood spurted out.","Chu Yunfan fled frantically. The hou was responsible for blocking Li Qianyuan.","Li Qianyuan was furious. He got into the bronze chariot and chased after them. The armor on his body had collapsed. He looked a little embarrassed, but his power was still unimaginable to ordinary people.","Each strike landed on the hou’s body. Although the cauldron neutralized most of the attacks, the remaining power still left the hou covered in wounds. If it was an ordinary monster, it would have died long ago.","Chu Yunfan was extremely distressed. He had great plans for the hou, but he couldn’t afford to care right now. Since he wanted to snatch food from the tiger’s mouth, this was the price he had to pay.","Bam!","Another halberd strike landed, sending the cauldron flying. The remainder of the strike landed on the hou.","Finally, the hou couldn’t hold out any longer. After a loud roar, it shattered into pieces. Chu Yunfan caught the pieces and dove into the Mountain River Diagram.","At that moment, the energy of the talisman that Li Qianyuan threw out to freeze the space had been used up. Before Li Qianyuan could throw out a new talisman, Chu Yunfan had entered the diagram.","In an instant, he disappeared.","“D*mn it!”","Li Qianyuan’s handsome face was twisted and his expression was ashen."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 Hou Form, Great Increase in Combat Strength","paragraphs":["1637 Hou Form, Great Increase in Combat Strength","The news that Li Qianyuan failed to capture Chu Yunfan and let him escape spread throughout the world overnight. All the Grand Xia experts were dumbfounded as if they had seen a ghost. They never imagined that Li Qianyuan would fail.","But they had seen all of this with their own eyes!","Li Qianyuan, who was furious, sealed the space within a thousand miles with an array formation and searched wantonly, but he could not find Chu Yunfan.","However, this news was quickly replaced by other news. The barrier of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain was broken, and Grand Xia’s cavalry came. In just a short month, they occupied the entire Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","After the destruction the Grand Xia experts had caused, the various major powers of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain understood that Grand Xia was not something they could resist.","Grand Xia didn’t want to destroy the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, but to rule it. After the army entered, a large number of officials followed. Grand Xia was very experienced in this matter. In a short time, they had already incorporated the Violet Thunder Sword Domain into their rule. After a long period of turmoil, the Violet Thunder Sword Domain finally returned to a calm state.","At this moment, in the Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the air. His injuries had almost recovered. Of course, he knew that Li Qianyuan had sealed the space outside and was trying to find him. But CHu Yunfan was not in a hurry to go out. He was healing.","After the battle with Li Qianyuan, Chu Yunfan was severely injured by Li Qianyuan. But after such a long period of rest, he had naturally recovered. He had gained a lot from this risky gamble, but unfortunately, the hou clone had also been completely destroyed.","“I guess I’ll just use what’s left to practice that divine ability.”","Chu Yunfan recalled there being a divine ability in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. This divine ability was called the Form Reshaping. This ability could change one’s original appearance. If one cultivated it to the peak, one could transform into a body that was thousands of feet or tens of thousands of feet tall, like a pillar that supported the sky.","In the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, there were many people who knew of this Form Reshaping. But for many cultivators, it was still just a legend. Only a small group of people standing at the top of the pyramid had the ability to cultivate this ability.","Under such circumstances, some people used another trick to get along.","Chu Yunfan could fuse the blood of a ferocious beast into his body to cultivate the form of the ferocious beast. Although it was not as terrifying as orthodox forms, it could increase his strength greatly.","The bloodline of ordinary monsters was too thin, so it was useless. Only the bloodline of famous ancient ferocious beasts could result in a ferocious beast form.","Without a doubt, the hou was one of the most ferocious beasts in the world. Now, Chu Yunfan was going to cultivate the hou’s form. At that time, his strength would be greatly enhanced and he would be able to take another step forward.","The Violet Thunder Swords would be under the rule of Grand Xia in the future. Who knew how many experts there would be? Chu Yunfan had to prepare a few more trump cards.","Chu Yunfan was already very strong. Ordinary fledging Abstracts were no match for him. If he could use this foundation and take on the hou’s form, his strength would increase by a notch.","However, there was a time limit to this increase. With his current strength, he could only support the hou form for three minutes at most.","Of course, these three minutes were enough for Chu Yunfan to do a lot of things. In addition, he still had the Sword Light Talisman, the Great Strength Divine Talisman, and so on. Even if he met Li Qianyuan again, he would dare to give it a try.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan immediately began to cultivate.","In front of him, the hou’s body slowly floated up. As if it was crushed by a huge force, it turned into a bloody mist that filled the sky. Then, the bloody mist merged into Chu Yunfan’s body. It had fused into his every pore and cell.","Chu Yunfan began to change. His body began to grow dense hair. It was not the hair of an ordinary person, but the hair of a beast. He circulated the Celestial Devouring Art, continuously refining the hou’s blood. The blood that filled the sky was refined and fused into his body.","After a long time, he let out a long roar toward the sky and his entire body suddenly changed. He was covered in hair, his eyes were red, and his teeth grew into fangs. In an instant, a boundless ferocious might enveloped the entire Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan had transformed into a peerless ferocious beast.","The terrifying beast stood in the sky and emitted a ferocious aura from ancient times.","This was a real hou!","After a while, the long hairs faded away, and Chu Yunfan transformed back into his original appearance. Chu Yunfan felt his entire body drenched in cold sweat. When he had transformed into the hou, he almost couldn’t control his rationality and was immersed in the boundless killing intent.","This ancient ferocious beast had a brutal aura in its bloodline. If one’s willpower was not strong enough, it was possible that this aura would possess the person. At that time, one would really become a hou. Fortunately, the godhead had released a clear stream of energy at the critical moment, rescuing Chu Yunfan from this predicament.","‘That was amazing. It was a short transformation period, but my consciousness was taken away by the hou. If I had stayed in that form, the consequences would have been unimaginable. I can only stay in that form for three minutes at most.’","Chu Yunfan thought that this was the bad side of a ferocious beast’s bloodline. Every pore on his body revealed a fierce aura.","‘But after transforming, my strength will be comparable to the Abstract Observance Stage,’ Chu Yunfan mused.","Above the Core Stage was the Abstract Stage, and the Abstract Stage was just a general term. It was further divided into the Abstract Stage, the Abstract Observance Stage, and the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","Chu Yunfan was only at the Golden Core Stage, but after transforming, he dared to fight even an Observer. The power of this hou form was naturally unquestionable.","“But this is not enough. To deal with Li Qianyuan, I need more trump cards.”"]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 A Year Later","paragraphs":["1638 A Year Later","Against ordinary people, Chu Yunfan’s strength was unquestionable. Even if it was Huang Feng and the others, Chu Yunfan could easily defeat them. But facing Li Qianyuan, he was still not strong enough.","He needed to continue strengthening himself!","Chu Yunfan looked outside. There were still a large number of soldiers from Grand Xia patrolling the area. Within a thousand miles, not a single trace could escape their eyes.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry. He could take this opportunity to cultivate properly. He still had nine Fused Origin Pills, which was enough for him to continue cultivating.","Thinking of this, he was not in a hurry to leave. He started circulating the Emperor Method and swallowed a Fused Origin Pill.","Boom!","As soon as he swallowed the pill, it was as if a bomb had exploded in his body. Countless energy waves swept out. He immediately controlled this energy with his mind and began to charge towards the barrier of the intermediate Golden Core Stage.","Wave after wave, Chu Yunfan attacked crazily.","Time flew by like a white horse. Cultivation knew no time.","During Chu Yunfan’s cultivation time, a year passed. As Grand Xia strengthened its management of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain, peace was restored. Compared to the original situation where the three great countries were fighting for supremacy and the demons were eyeing them covetously, this was undoubtedly a peaceful situation for the world. The commoners got used to the fact that the ruler had changed and they were now part of Grand Xia. For ordinary people, there was no difference","After the barrier between the two worlds broke, the dense spirit energy from Grand Xia surged in. In just a year, everyone in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain felt the benefits of double the spirit energy.","Ordinary people gained strong bodies and were immune to all diseases. Cultivators discovered that it was easier to break through levels that were originally difficult to break through. One after another, they broke through.","Practically everyone in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain had benefited from this. Very quickly, the Grand Xia experts returned to their homeland. A year later, the Violet Thunder Sword Domain officially became history, becoming the Violet Thunder Prefecture of Grand Xia, becoming one of the several hundred prefectures of Grand Xia.","For some people, Chu Yunfan, who had not appeared for more than a year, was the man of the hour. To catch him, the enraged Li Qianyuan arranged countless troops to patrol day and night. But Chu Yunfan had completely disappeared. There was no news of him at all. It was as if he had disappeared into thin air.","Under such circumstances, even Li Qianyuan, who was leading the army, had to give up on the search for Chu Yunfan, at least on the surface. Grand Xia’s Imperial Capital had issued an imperial edict. Li Qianyuan was to return to the war department and receive a reward after he had conquered the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","However, there were rumors that Li Qianyuan was injured by Chu Yunfan a year ago. His injuries had not completely recovered, so he had to return to the Imperial City to find a way to treat himself.","No matter what, everyone knew that the old era had passed and a new era was coming. Within the Violet Thunder Prefecture, various legends regarding Grand Xia began to circulate.","Perhaps it was because Grand Xia had absolute strength, they didn’t suppress the original powers. This made the various powers heave a sigh of relief and feel a little grateful. However, they also understood that Grand Xia did not care about doing so because the dragons in the sky did not care about the opinions of the ants on the ground. Although it was a little sad, it was actually a good thing for them.","There were also some smart people who understood that Grand Xia didn’t just plunder and leave. They wanted to rule for a long time.","According to countless rumors, the Violet Thunder Prefecture had been one with the Central Plains since ancient times. Later on, the Violet Thunder Swords used supreme formations and barriers to separate that area from the rest of the world. Now, they had returned.","Grand Xia Empire, Cloud Prefecture, Yi Castle.","Although it was called a castle, in reality, it was like a small city with a permanent population of more than 100,000, and in the castle, 80% of its residents were descendants of the Yi clan.","But on this day, the Yi clan patriarch, who was in seclusion, rushed out after receiving a piece of news. Everyone was stunned. They didn’t know what kind of news could make a tough-willed man like him so anxious.","In the guest hall, a resolute old man held a jade slip in his hand. His hand was trembling slightly.","“I didn’t expect to receive news from Tianxing after so many years!”","The old man wiped away the tears at the corner of his eyes and looked at the young man in the guest seat. It was a handsome young man dressed in black.","“Thank you, Young Master, for bringing me Tianxing’s message. I’m extremely grateful,” the old man said emotionally.","He had been fighting for Grand Xia for many years, and no difficulty had ever troubled him. However, the news brought by this handsome man today made him unable to hold back his tears.","How many years had it been? How many years had it been since his youngest son had disappeared? He had used many connections, but he could not find any news of his youngest son.","He never expected to receive a message from his youngest son today.","“You’re welcome. The pre—Ahem, Senior Tianxing took great care of me, so this is what I should do.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the old man and sighed. When he left the Kunlun Realm, the Federation president had asked him to deliver a letter to his father if he could reach his birthplace one day.","The president’s real name was Yi Tianxing. He was the youngest son of Lord Yi, the lord of Yi Clan Castle. When he was young, Yi Tianxing accidentally fell into a spatial crack and landed in the Kunlun Realm. By chance, he became the president of the Federation.","Of course, Chu Yunfan couldn’t tell anyone about the Federation right now. It was a top-secret, and he couldn’t reveal it casually. Otherwise, with its strength, Grand Xia would be a disaster for the Federation. They would not fare any better than the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","“No matter what, you brought me news of Tianxing. I can finally rest assured and die in peace,” Lord Yi said.","He really wanted to ask about his son, but his son had already written in his letter that it was not convenient for him to return for the time being, so he could only give up for the time being.","“I don’t know how to repay your kindness. If you need anything, as long as it’s within my means, I will do my best to help.”"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639 The Flying Celestial Sect","paragraphs":["1639 The Flying Celestial Sect","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment, then said, “I would like the Yi clan to issue me an identity certificate.”","Lord Yi frowned. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to make such a request. But before he could say anything, a voice suddenly came from outside the living room.","“You want my clan to issue you an identity certificate? Are you planning to participate in the Flying Celestials exam?”","It was a female voice. Her voice was pleasant to the ear, but there was a hint of unwillingness in her voice.","A figure arrived in the hall. It was a woman dressed in white. Her face was exquisite and graceful, and her skin was as fair as snow. She was like a high and mighty goddess.","The moment he saw the woman in white, Chu Yunfan’s hair stood on end. This was the keen intuition he had after fusing with the hou. This woman gave off a dangerous and powerful aura.","She was another terrifying existence that had surpassed the Abstract Stage. It was the same feeling as when he met Li Qianyuan.","“You’re here, Yunyao.” When Lord Yi saw the woman, he smiled. “Young Master Chu, let me introduce you. This is my granddaughter, Yi Yunyao.”","“Greetings, miss,” Chu Yunfan said, “What makes you think I want to participate?”","Yi Yunyao pouted and said, “It’s not a hard guess. Flying Celestial holds a recruitment event every five years. Countless young geniuses wish to join Flying Celestial, but they are one of the ten great sects of Grand Xia. Selected disciples have to go through a strict screening process. If someone like you with an unknown background is selected, you’ll be tested for at least twenty years.”","Yi Yunyao had hit the nail on the head. Chu Yunfan’s goal was the Flying Celestials. He had secretly infiltrated Grand Xia’s Cloud Prefecture for a long time, and his goal was the Flying Celestials.","Grand Xia had ten great sects, and the Flying Celestial Sect was one of them. They were extremely powerful and had countless experts. Their power was deeply rooted in Grand Xia.","There was no room for reconciliation between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan. Chu Yunfan had to kill Li Quanyuan. And for now, he needed a strong backer—one that could compete with the forces behind Li Qianyuan.","It was because of this that Chu Yunfan chose the Flying Celestials. This sect had an extremely huge influence throughout Grand Xia. Even in the Imperial Capital, they had a huge say.","Although Chu Yunfan was confident that he would be able to kill Li Qianyuan sooner or later, it would take time. That was why he wanted Lord Yi to issue him an identity certificate. With it, Chu Yunfan could be exempted from being investigated for 20 years.","“That’s right. That’s indeed my goal. Think you can help me?” Chu Yunfan said.","“Sure, we can supply you with a cert. In the future, you’ll be under my name,” Yi Yunyao said lightly, “You brought news of Uncle Tianxing to our clan. This small favor isn’t worth mentioning.”","“Thank you,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll come back tomorrow for the cert.” He immediately took his leave.","After watching Chu Yunfan leave, Lord Yi said, “We know nothing of this person’s background. If you send him to the exam in your name, won’t it be a burden to you?”","Yi Yunyao shook her head. “It’ll be fine. I’ve just been promoted to true disciple, and countless people want to curry favor with me. This is nothing. He helped bring back news of Uncle Tianxing to our clan. This is nothing.”","“You’re been promoted?”","Lord Yi stared at Yi Yunyao with his mouth agape. His eyes were filled with disbelief and shock. At the same time, a hint of excitement appeared on his face.","Yi Yunyao was now a true disciple of the Flying Celestials. Every disciple of the sect held great records in Grand Xia, and they were equivalent to courtiers. Now that she was a true disciple, the benefits the Yi Castle would gain would be endless.","A true disciple was enough to lead an entire sect.","“That’s right. I just got promoted. Grandfather, the imperial court will soon reward me. Please receive it on my behalf,” said Yi Yunyao.","“No problem. Hahahaha, our clan is truly blessed!” Lord Yi laughed.","Every true disciple of the ten great sects was a talent that the imperial court valued. This was a great benefit to Yi Castle. The imperial court had always been lenient in rewarding clans that nurtured such talents.","“This is nothing. There are many true disciples in the Flying Celestials. I have to do better. Now that Li Qianyuan has been conferred the title of marquis, he’s one step ahead of me. I have to speed up my training. I will earn a marquis position for our clan,” Yi Yunyao proclaimed.","When she mentioned Li Qianyuan, her eyes flashed with an unwillingness to admit defeat.","“What great ambition!” Lord Yi was almost beside himself with tears.","Although Yi Castle was considered a tyrant within a radius of a thousand miles, in reality, in all of Grand Xia, a faction like theirs was not even considered a country bumpkin. If Yi Yunyao could become a marquis, their clan would rise with the tide and successfully advance into the circle of nobility.","“If your late father knew about this, he would be very comforted,” Lord Yi said with a solemn expression as he wiped away his tears.","“But keep an eye on this Chu Yunfan. He’s no ordinary person. We have to find Tianxing through him,” Lord Yi said, “When he said that he was here to bring a letter, I didn’t believe it. But although handwriting can deceive people, divine will can’t. Tianxing probably has something he can’t tell us. That’s why he asked this person to bring a letter home. If we keep an eye on him, we’ll be able to find Tianxing.”","Yi Yunyao nodded. “That’s my thoughts too. Otherwise, I wouldn’t personally take action for a mere recruitment exam.”","Her pretty face tensed up slightly as she recalled them first meeting Chu Yunfan. He gave her a feeling that she couldn’t see through him. At least, she couldn’t see through him at a glance. This was a very rare situation.","At this moment, she had a strange feeling in her heart. ‘Interesting!’"]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 Peak of Golden Core Stage","paragraphs":["1640 Peak of Golden Core Stage","After leaving the Yi Castle, Chu Yunfan went to a place devoid of people. His figure flashed and he entered the Mountain River Diagram. In there, he was absolutely safe and did not need to worry about being discovered.","The appearance of Yi Yunyao made him click his tongue in wonder. The foundation of Grand Xia was truly terrifying. For example, Xiang Feiyun, Liang Ruicai, and others were considered top-notch geniuses in the Federation.","What was a genius? They were heaven-sent geniuses. However, they could be seen everywhere here, especially Li Qianyuan who was a terrifying expert Chu Yunfan had never met before. Though she was not as great as Li Qianyuan, she was still very terrifying.","Furthermore, Chu Yunfan clearly felt some kind of energy being suppressed deep within Yi Yunyao’s body. She was clearly more than meets the eye. She too had fortuitous encounters and was not someone ordinary.","When he arrived at Grand Xia, Chu Yunfan realized that some of the common knowledge he had in the Federation was completely overturned here. After a time, he discovered that the spirit energy in Grand Xia was extremely dense. It was almost several times more than that in the Violet Thunder Prefecture.","The more spirit energy there was, the more spiritual life would be born, as was the case since ancient times. This was showcased in Grand Xia. Even babies were born Innates and would not degenerate into the Acquired Stage with the passage of time.","Due to the abundance and purity of spirit energy, coupled with the fact that they were taught breathing techniques since they were young, the starting point of these residents of Grand Xia was the Innate Stage. This would be simply unimaginable in the Federation.","The army of Grand Xia was powerful enough to crush everything. The ordinary soldiers were Cores, and Golden Cores were everywhere in the army. A genius born from such an environment, if placed in the Federation, would be a saint that appeared once every few hundred years.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t feel the slightest fear. On the contrary, he felt that it was interesting. It was very interesting. This was the world he yearned for.","What he needed to do first was to integrate into Grand Xia. Any faction here was calculated in units of more than ten thousand years. Even if they opened their doors to recruit disciples, the selection criteria were very strict. Strength was only one of the criteria. They had to have a clean family background with a traceable family line. This was something Chu Yunfan could not do, so he asked for help from Lord Yi.","Once he joined the Flying Celestials, it would be the time for him to truly appear again.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged and continued to cultivate. In the past year, his cultivation had undergone a world-shaking change compared to a year ago. His cultivation jumped from the fledgling Golden Core Stage to the peak of the late Golden Core Stage. He was only half a step away from reaching the peak Golden Core Stage.","He took out his last Fused Origin Pill. In more than a year, he had swallowed one Fused Origin Pill after another. This was the last one. These pills would be the reason he could rush to the peak of the Golden Core Stage. At that time, his combat strength would soar to the peak of the Abstract Stage. The Flying Celestials’ test would be a piece of cake for him.","Chu Yunfan swallowed the last Fused Origin Pill. The powerful medicinal power of the pill surged through his body. Fortunately, he had experienced this situation many times in the past year and was already used to it. He quickly controlled the medicinal power and began to refine it into his own divine power.","After a long time, his eyes flew open and his divine power burst out. The golden core in his body finally completed the final refinement and quietly floated in his meridian.","Chu Yunfan had finally reached the peak Golden Core Stage!","If the golden core in Chu Yunfan’s body could be seen, it would be found that his golden core was at least several times more powerful than an ordinary person’s. It seemed to have a terrifying energy brewing within it. It was extremely terrifying. It was only now that Chu Yunfan had truly completed his transformation.","After forming a golden core, one’s life would be in one’s won hands!","Chu Yunfan finally broke through. Compared to a year ago, he was at least ten times stronger. If the current him were to encounter Huang Feng and the others again, he could defeat them all with a single slap. Although Huang Feng and the others would also improve, it was impossible for them to compare to Chu Yunfan, who had achieved a three-tier jump after consuming the Fused Origin Pills.","“It’s not enough. Facing Li Qianyuan, this bit of strength isn’t enough.”","Chu Yunfan was not entirely happy with his breakthrough. He had fought Li Qianyuan before, so he knew how terrifying Li Qianyuan was. He couldn’t even defeat Yi Yunyao.","Suddenly, seven sword lights slowly appeared behind Chu Yunfan. These seven sword lights were surrounded by purple lightning. They looked like sword-shaped lightning.","“The Seven Violet Thunder Swords...”","This was the name of the sword technique Chu Yunfan had cultivated. It was a peerless technique recorded in the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture.","These seven sword lights formed around his body. When he attacked, a lightning bolt would flash and he could kill in one strike. This technique was impressive.","Chu Yunfan was a little weak when he used it before. Now that he had made a further breakthrough, the power of the Seven Violet Thunder Swords was beyond doubt.","If he were to add in the support of the Great Strength Divine Talisman and execute the seven swords in one go, even an Observer above the Abstract Stage might not necessarily be without the strength to fight.","Ten days later, Chu Yunfan arrived at the Flying Celestials’ main gate after receiving the identification certificate from Yi Yunyao. This was a mountain range that stretched for tens of thousands of miles. It stretched from east to west like a dragon lying on the ground.","This was the mountain gate of one of the ten great sects of Grand Xia, the Flying Celestials.","Wherever Chu Yunfan looked, the tens of thousands of miles of mountain range were hidden in layers of barriers and arrays. It was impossible to pass through. Only through the main gate in front of him could one enter and exit.","The main gate was even more majestic. It stood in midair, and the words “Flying Celestial Sect” were written on the board. The strokes were like dragons and snakes, vigorous and powerful.","On this day, the Flying Celestials’ mountain gate emitted a faint light. It was as if Chu Yunfan had arrived at the legendary Pearly Gates, and beneath the main gate was a path paved with white jades, extending from the ground to the sky."]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 Entrance Test","paragraphs":["1641 Entrance Test","Looking at this mythical scene, Chu Yunfan felt emotional.","Countless voices entered Chu Yunfan’s ears.","“There are so many people. Only a sect like the Flying Celestials could attract so much attention.”","“Heavens, just how many people have come? From what I’ve seen and the people I know, there are already quite a number of geniuses from all over the world gathered here. There are even some who are famous in their provinces.”","“That’s right. Moreover, they’re all powerful experts. Even in the Flying Celestials, Golden Cores are only fringe disciples. Even they might not pass. This time, Flying Celestials is only recruiting 5,000 fringe disciples.”","“Not even one-tenth of the applicants from every season can get in. Tsk, tsk!”","“Becoming a fringe disciple is nothing. The truly powerful ones are those who manage to become inner disciples as soon as they start.”","“That’s right. I’ve heard about that. These people are different from others. These people came here to become seed disciples. Otherwise, they would have become disciples of the Flying Celestials long ago.”","“Of course. Even among the inner disciples, there are different grades. The truly powerful ones are seed disciples. A seed disciple is a seed that has the hope of becoming a true disciple, out that comes out of every ten people. It’s amazing!”","Chu Yunfan heard everything. He swept his gaze across the crowd and saw powerful auras lurking about. Moreover, many of them were either rich or noble. They seemed to have extraordinary backgrounds.","This was as expected. Cultivation consumed a lot of resources, and Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to this level was almost unique. Normally speaking, if there was no powerful force behind a person, it was impossible to cultivate to this level.","Of course, the most powerful backer would be the Central Royal Court or the ten great sects. Besides that, joining the great sects was the fastest way to enter the Central Royal Court. Every year, a large number of disciples from the great sects would join the Central Royal Court and work for Grand Xia. Li Qianyuan was one of the best among them.","If one could only be a fringe disciple while being in the Golden Core Stage, then Chu Yunfan speculated that an inner disciple would have to be at least in the Abstract Stage, and that might not even be enough. To become a seed disciple, one would have to be one of the best in the Abstract Stage.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept across the crowd. He was shocked to find Huang Feng among them. He was also one of the people who had come to apply for the Flying Celestials. This made him somewhat stunned. He did not know what kind of power Huang Feng was supported by to choose to participate in the Flying Celestials’ test.","Compared to a year ago, Huang Feng was now even more powerful, and his strength had undergone a tremendous change. A year ago, he was only at the fledgling Abstract Stage. Now, he was at least at the intermediate Abstract Stage. This improvement was extremely shocking. He was at least several times stronger than before, but against Chu Yunfan’s improvement, it was not worth mentioning.","Suddenly, many figures flew down from the floating gate. Each figure was stepping on a beam of light. These people were all above the Abstract Stage. As soon as they came out, they stunned the thousands of experts who had come to take the test. After all, the best among them were only at the Abstract Stage, while the figures on the light were all in the Abstract Stage and above. Only a portion of the Abstracts present didn’t care. Some of them even dared to look directly at these experts with a hint of contempt in their eyes.","These Flying Celestials disciples were all dressed in white robes. Their sleeves fluttered in the wind, making them look like celestials from the heavens. At this moment, one of the disciples stepped forward. His gaze was piercingly cold as he swept his gaze over the sea of people. And when he did, not to mention the Golden Cores, even the Abstracts did not dare to look him in the eye.","A peak Abstract.","This man was definitely the most terrifying peak Abstract that Chu Yunfan had ever seen. The divine power in his body surged, almost on par with Chu Yunfan’s.","Of course, this was only what Chu Yunfan thought. If it was an ordinary person, they would have been scared to death. That was a peak Abstract, and Chu Yunfan was only in the Golden Core Stage. It was already a miracle that he could compare to a peak Abstract at all.","‘Wow, the Flying Celestials are indeed impressive. Just the strength of the leader of the inner disciples is already so impressive. I wonder how glorious the seed and true disciples are.’ Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder, but he wasn’t afraid.","Someone revealed the identity of this disciple.","“I heard some things about him. Fang Yu a peerless genius. His ancestors were disciples of the Flying Celestials. He was born a disciple of the sect, so he’s different from outsiders like us. It’s said that he entered the Abstract Stage three years ago. In just three years, he reached the peak of the Abstract Stage. His future is limitless. It’s also said that he’s being nurtured to be a seed disciple. He might even become a true disciple in the future.”","“This is all old news. Fang Yu already stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage a long time ago. He then encountered an old demon at the Abstract Interpretation Stage and was severely injured after covering the rear alone. He narrowly escaped death and his cultivation has yet to recover.”","The surrounding people gasped. Fang Yu had already reached the peak of the Abstract Stage before he was injured. How powerful would he be when he recovered?","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but admire Fang Yu. Even if it was him, if he were to encounter an Interpreter, he would only be able to barely protect himself and escape. Fang Yu’s strength was indeed extraordinary.","“The test is about to begin. Golden Cores, please stand on the left to participate in the fringe disciple test. We are only accepting 5,000 Golden Cores. Abstracts, stand on the right. There is no limit to the number of Abstracts as long as they meet the requirements,” Fang Yu said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. It seemed that the Flying Celestials had certain restrictions on the recruitment of Golden Cores. They probably only recruited the strongest and most talented among them."]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 One Move Is Enough","paragraphs":["1642 One Move Is Enough","But for Abstracts, there were no restrictions. After all, reaching the Abstract Stage was already a testament to one’s talent. Not every Golden Core could enter the Abstract Stage.","Although Chu Yunfan had slaughtered Grand Xia experts who had wreaked havoc in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain like pigs and dogs, they were in fact the cream of the crop among the various small and medium-sized sects and families. They definitely had the talent to enter the Abstract Stage.","Everyone followed Fang Yu’s instructions and split into two groups. Then, balls of light appeared in front of them. They knew that they had to enter if they wanted to take the test. This was especially true for the Golden Cores who saw each other as opponents. There were a total of more than 100,000 of them, but only a few thousand of them could join the Flying Celestials.","By the time they held another recruitment, most of them would have passed the age limit. Such people generally wouldn’t have too high of an achievement, and the Flying Celestials wouldn’t even spare them a glance. Although they were absolute geniuses in the eyes of ordinary people, what the Flying Celestials wanted was the geniuses among geniuses. Ordinary geniuses were not even worth paying attention to.","Everyone jumped in. However, when it was Chu Yunfan’s turn, he did not dive in. After everyone had entered the ball of light, Chu Yunfan was the only one left.","“Why aren’t you going in to take the test?” Fang Yu asked.","“I would like to apply for the inner disciple test,” Chu Yunfan said plainly.","“You?” One of the disciples laughed. “You’re only at the peak of the Golden Core Stage, yet you dare to apply for the inner disciple test? Do you think that the peak Golden Core Stage is only a little bit away from the Abstract Stage?”","“Does the Flying Celestials have a special rule that Golden Cores aren’t allowed to participate in the inner disciple test?” Chu Yunfan asked.","The disciple was immediately stumped by the question. He flew into a rage out of humiliation and berated, “Sharp-tongued brat. The sect did not specify that Golden Cores could only participate in fringe disciples test, but you don’t understand the difference between Golden Core Stage and Abstract Stage. An idiot like you who looks at the sky from the bottom of a well isn’t qualified to participate in any part of the test!”","The disciple released his aura, throwing straight at Chu Yunfan like a storm.","Chu Yunfan was like a small boat under the pressure of this aura. He could capsize at any time, but he didn’t move. He was like a reef, allowing the rain and wind to blow past him as he remained steadfast.","Fang Yu was moved by this sight and a strange look flashed through his eyes. Then, he picked up a bamboo scroll and injected his divine power into it. A light screen appeared in front of him, showing Chu Yunfan’s identity information.","“Chu Yunfan is from the Violet Thunder Prefecture. He’s recommended by Senior Yi Yunyao.” Fang Yu read this aloud and was instantly stunned.","Not only Fang Yu, but even the other disciples looked at Chu Yunfan in astonishment. They recalled that the Violet Thunder Prefecture was a province that had been conquered by Grand Xia just last year. It was said that there was a serious gap in martial arts in that place. It had been many years since there had been a master. Even a Golden Core was already considered a peerless master there, and a Core Former was already seen as a kingdom guardian.","In their eyes, this was a joke. It was simply laughable. However, it was precisely because they knew this that they were a little stunned. How could a peak Golden Core appear in that backward area? Of course, to them, it was not even worth mentioning, but in the Violet Thunder Prefecture, Chu Yunfan was considered a rare talent.","“Hahaha! So you’re a bumpkin from the Violet Thunder Prefecture.” The disciple who had mocked Chu Yunfan earlier was even more sarcastic now. “You must’ve stayed in that backward place for too long. You think our sect is on the same level as your hometown.”","Fang Yu glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “Since Senior Yi recommended you, I will make an exception and give you a chance. Luo Buping will test you. Three moves. If you can last three moves, I will let you participate in the inner disciple test.”","“Three moves? Hahahaha! I’ll take him down in one!” Luo Buping laughed sinisterly.","A cold light flashed in through the man’s eyes. He had already made up his mind to make Chu Yunfan suffer. Although he could not kill Chu Yunfan because of Senior Yi, he could still cripple Chu Yunfan’s martial arts.","“You’re right, I only need one move,” Chu Yunfan also said indifferently, completely disregarding Luo Buping.","Luo Buping charged forward, sweeping out with his sword. He seemed to have transformed into an immortal from beyond the heavens.","“Transcendent Flying Celestial.”","With this move, the entire air collapsed on a large scale. The sky shook violently with the momentum of a landslide and tsunami.","“Luo Buping is being reckless. He’s using the Transcendent Flying Celestial to deal with a Golden Core.”","“That’s right. Even I’m not familiar with this move. If he doesn’t control himself, he’ll kill Chu Yunfan.”","“He is a talent recommended by Senior Yi.”","When the disciples saw this scene, they said that it was bad, but their faces were filled with ridicule. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was as ridiculous as a monkey who didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth.","Just as the sword was about to pierce his throat, Chu Yunfan shouted, “Sword, come to me!”","The surrounding spirit energy formed a sharp sword in his hand. Chu Yunfan jumped up and faced the incoming sword light.","“You want to fight me with a mere sword light? Let’s see how you die!” Luo Buping sneered when he saw Chu Yunfan rushing forward with a sharp sword condensed from spirit energy.","Bam!","The sword lights collided in the air, forming a terrifying collision. The disciples, who had been mocking Chu Yunfan, were shocked upon watching the shocking scene. Chu Yunfan cut Luo Buping’s sword light with one strike, and then the sword light landed on Luo Buping’s body with an unstoppable force.","Bam!","Luo Buping screamed and he was blasted away. A huge hole appeared in his chest and blood splattered everywhere."]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 Inner Disciple Test","paragraphs":["1643 Inner Disciple Test","A deathly silence fell over the scene. No one had expected the battle to end like this.","Chu Yunfan had dealt Luo Buping a heavy blow with lightning speed!","“He... He actually did it!”","The Flying Celestial disciples, who were experienced and knowledgeable, were shocked. One could imagine how much shock Chu Yunfan had given them. Thinking back, both sides said that they would finish each other in one move, but now it seemed that Luo Buping’s words had become a complete joke.","Chu Yunfan had done as he had said and sent Luo Buping flying with one move.","Luo Buping was severely injured by one move, and he kept howling in pain. If they had not seen it with their own eyes, how could they believe that a Golden Core could easily injure a Void Core?","At this time, everyone put away their contempt for Chu Yunfan. After all, they could see that he was very strong. Without three-thirds of his strength, he wouldn’t have dared to do this. Chu Yunfan dared to say that before not because he didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth, but because he was strong.","“I’m going to kill you!”","Luo Buping grabbed a handful of healing pills from the void and stuffed them onto his wound. His entire body twitched in pain. However, the effects of these pills were very good. In a short time, he had recovered.","Luo Buping roared angrily. His eyes were red. He wanted to cut Chu Yunfan into pieces. Chu Yunfan had embarrassed him in front of everyone. If he didn’t kill him, it would be difficult to dispel the hatred in his heart.","“Stop! Aren’t you embarrassed enough?!” Fang Yu shouted, “Chu Yunfan has already shown mercy, yet you don’t know how to appreciate it. Get lost, and don’t come out again today.”","As Fang Yu spoke, he rolled up his sleeves. Luo Buping turned into a golden light and was instantly swept away, disappearing into the depths of the Flying Celestials.","Chu Yunfan’s expression, which had not changed at all, finally showed a hint of being impressed. Fang Yu clearly occupied the dominant position among these people. He attacked as he pleased, and there was no room for disobedience.","“Since you have proven your strength, you are qualified to participate in the inner disciple test. I will allow you to participate. However, the test isn’t as simple as the fringe disciple test,” Fang Yu said directly.","“Thank you for your help, Senior Fang. I’m ready,” Chu Yunfan said.","“In that case, step inside.” Fang Yu tapped on the light screen in front of him, and a door of light appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan jumped into the door of light.","“Senior Fang, are we really going to let him take the test?” one of the disciples asked warily.","“And why shouldn’t I let him participate? Do you think I’m the one making the decision for today’s test? Many elders and even the Grand Elder are watching from above. No matter what cultivation level he is at, a Golden Core with the combat strength of an Abstract will probably alarm even the elders. If you touch him, you’d be stirring up a hornet’s nest,” Fang Yu said indifferently.","He knew these elders and the grand elder well. These people were all staring at these rookies, wanting to find a few good seedlings. How could a genius who could severely injure an Abstract at the Golden Core Stage not be noticed? Earlier, he clearly felt several divine wills sweeping over. That was a clear warning.","“Moreover, this person was recommended by Senior Yi. If you don’t let him take the test and Senior Yi asks for punishment, who among you can bear the consequences?” Fang Yu’s gaze swept across everyone, and everyone immediately revealed embarrassed expressions.","They knew that they were only inner disciples and were not on the same level as true disciples like Yi Yunyao. With her recommendation, they did not dare to do anything.","‘I think I’ve heard of him from somewhere...’ Fang Yu thought.","After Chu Yunfan entered the light door, he realized that he had entered a completely different world. This was a small dimensional plane, and there were already hundreds of people floating in the void. These people did not even look at him as they were all staring at a middle-aged man in a moon-white robe.","However, the middle-aged man glanced at Chu Yunfan, who had entered late, and a hint of surprise flashed across his eyes.","“Everyone, all of you are the young geniuses of Grand Xia. It is your pride to choose the Flying Celestials. But in the future, the Flying Celestials will be proud of you,” the middle-aged man said.","“I believe everyone understands the current situation. Right now, the outer realms are in chaos. The outer realm evil spirits want to attack the Central Plains. This is truly a time of crisis, and right now, the country needs pillars,” the middle-aged man continued, “Your families and sects sent you to the Flying Celestials because we are powerful. No matter how chaotic the outside world is, we will not move. Now, the Imperial Court has begun to select talents on a large scale. You have heard of Li Qianyuan, correct? He is the first marquis of the younger generation, but he will definitely not be the last. As long as you are loyal enough and have enough ability, the Flying Celestials can provide you with such a stage. It won’t be impossible for any of you to become a marquis in the future.”","The middle-aged man’s words didn’t make anyone’s expression change much. They understood what was going on.","“Next, let’s talk about the rules of the test. According to the rules of the Flying Celestials, all of you are people with clean backgrounds and outstanding strength and talent. You are already considered Flying Celestial disciples. However, I believe that all of you don’t just want to enter the Flying Celestials.”","The middle-aged man glanced at everyone and continued, “I believe that everyone understands the rules. All of you are now considered inner disciples, but only ten of you will become seed disciples. As for the benefits of becoming a seed disciple of the Flying Celestials, I’m sure I don’t have to list them out. All of you should know what you’re all here for.","“As such, I shall stop rambling. Let’s begin. The fight will be in pairs. In the end, the top ten will become seed disciples.”"]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 Instant Kill","paragraphs":["1644 Instant Kill","As soon as the middle-aged man finished speaking, another door appeared in front of everyone. Without hesitation, everyone rushed in. Chu Yunfan was no exception as he too entered the light door.","He appeared in a ring. This ring was in a separate dimension and had a barrier around it. The technology to create such a small dimension was a high-tech technology that even the Federation had yet to reach.","Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder.","Suddenly, a figure appeared in front of him. It was a young man dressed in black. His expression was solemn, but then he saw Chu Yunfan. He laughed as he said, “God truly blesses me. I’ve met a Golden Core. Looks like I’ve won the first round!”","The divine power in the youth boiled. He was an intermediate Abstract. Among the geniuses who came to participate in the assessment, he was pretty good.","The youth made his move. Divine power surged through his body. He stretched out his arm and a long saber appeared in his hand. His aura was like a god’s. In an instant, he pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, outside of the dimension, Fang Yu and a group of inner disciples from the Flying Celestials were watching this battle. They naturally had the means to see the battle inside. Other than the seeded contestants who had long been selected by the sect, the most eye-catching one was probably the Golden Core who had shocked them earlier.","“So it’s Xiao Bofu. His strength is impressive. It’s said that he once received the inheritance of an ancient saber master. His cultivation is good,” someone commented. He recognized the black-robed youth and naturally thought that Chu Yunfan was in big trouble.","Everyone’s expression remained unchanged. There were many people among them who had fortuitous encounters. This was not a big deal. What they really wanted to know was whether Chu Yunfan could handle it. Even Fang Yu was watching intently. Clearly, she was also quite interested in this matter.","In the ring, Xiao Bofu’s blade slashed down. The saber light condensed into one, and countless divine power turned into a terrifying killing move that slashed down at Chu Yunfan. The saber light from this slash lit up the entire ring.","“Petty tricks!” Chu Yunfan sneered and stretched out his hand. A sword condensed from purple lightning appeared behind him.","It was the Seven Violet Thunder Swords. At this moment, only one sword was formed. Then, the sword on Chu Yunfan’s back swept out fiercely. Compared to the shocking aura of the saber light, this sword looked ordinary, but it instantly tore the saber light apart.","Bam!","After the sword light tore through the saber light, it instantly landed on Xiao Bofu’s body.","Spurt!","Xiao Bofu spat out a mouthful of blood, and his entire body trembled. A huge hole had been blasted through his chest, and blood flew everywhere.","He was instantly defeated!","“Petty tricks. With your strength, you dare to look down on me?” Chu Yunfan sneered and opened his palm. The sword turned into a small sword about the length of a finger and spun above his palm. Then, he clenched his fist and the sword dissipated.","Chu Yunfan had defeated Xiao Bofu in one blow, but to him, this was an everyday mundane task.","“Chu Yunfan is unfathomable. Is he really in the Golden Core Stage?”","“There’s no mistake. He’s definitely only at the Golden Core Stage. My perception can’t be wrong, but how did he do it?”","“Even Xiao Bofu, who has already stepped into the intermediate Abstract Stage, couldn’t block his attack?”","“Chu Yunfan is terrifying. He’s peerless and magnificent. It’s no wonder Senior Yi personally recommended him.”","The two contestants were quickly teleported out of the ring.","Chu Yunfan stood in the air. At this time, some people who had already finished their battle also appeared. When they saw that Chu Yunfan had won against Xiao Bofu, they were all stunned. Soon, the well-informed ones among them received the news from the inner disciples. Chu Yunfan had defeated Xiao Bofu in one strike.","Immediately, many disciples took note of Chu Yunfan. He was definitely a huge threat. However, most people did not take it to heart. They took advantage of this opportunity to recover.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care. In just moments, he had recovered from the consumption of the attack. The power of the Seven Violet Thunder Swords was indeed impressive. He had other trump cards. His methods were varied, increasing his combat strength.","Soon, all the battles had been decided. The battles between these geniuses were ruthless and decisive. Very few of them were dragged out, and the outcome was often decided in a short time. In a battle between experts, the difference was only a split second.","Soon, it was the second round.","After Chu Yunfan entered the door of light, his opponent soon came in. It was a man about thirty years old. His figure was tall and straight, and he had a high and mighty aura. It was clear that he was also a person who had been in power all year round.","“That person is the current head of the Yun clan in Lavish Prefecture, Yun Hui, right? He’s the youngest person to become head of the Yun clan throughout history.”","Someone recognized the young man. After Chu Yunfan had killed Xiao Bofu in seconds, more and more people were attracted to him.","Yun Hui glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “I just took some time to look you up. I didn’t expect you to come from that backward Violet Thunder Prefecture. Tsk, tsk. Although the Imperial Court has not imposed any restrictions on natives from backward prefectures and treats you all equally, with your strength, it’s already incredible that you can make it this far.","“I will give you a chance to end this battle with dignity. Surrender now. Otherwise, when I attack, the casualties will be unpredictable. I want to become a seed disciple.”","Yun Hui spoke arrogantly as he looked at Chu Yunfan with a somewhat regretful expression. He was quite surprised, but that was all. Chu Yunfan was destined to be a stepping stone for him to become a seed disciple.","“You sure are full of confidence.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly."]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 Defeating Yun Hui","paragraphs":["1645 Defeating Yun Hui","“Hahahaha, this isn’t just confidence. The Violet Thunder Precture is a backwater. Even a Core can be called an expert in your land. Isn’t that ridiculous?” Yun Hui burst into laughter, not having a care in the world for Chu Yunfan. “But from the looks of it, you don’t seem to be prepared to surrender?”","“That’s right. Why should I? You should be the one to surrender,” Chu Yunfan said straightforwardly.","“You really don’t want to take the path to heaven, but instead barged into hell. Do you really think that Grand Xia is your Violet Thunder Prefecture? You’re just a frog at the bottom of a well!”","Yun Hui’s expression immediately turned cold, but there was a hint of mockery in his eyes. It was obvious that he treated Chu Yunfan as a plaything.","“I’m afraid Chu Yunfan is in big trouble now that he has met Yun Hui.”","“That’s right. Yun Hui is the current head of the Yun clan in Lavish Prefecture. For him to be able to become the head of the Yun clan at his age, of course, he relied on his strength. Tsk, tsk. Don’t look at how Chu Yunfan defeated Xiao Bofu previously. Even Xiao Bofu would probably be defeated in one move if he met Yun Hui.”","“Although Yun Hui is not one of the few seed disciples that have been chosen, his ranking is still very high. He is definitely qualified to compete for the position of seed disciple.”","At this moment, the outside was in an uproar because of the two of them.","“I didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be from the Violet Thunder Prefecture. It seems that a true dragon really came from shallow waters.”","“However, it was not easy for him to reach this step.”","No one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s chances. In their opinion, Yun Hui’s advancement was already set in stone. Even the Flying Celestial disciples who had already become inner disciples had their own plans. Although they were all high and mighty now, once this batch of disciples entered the Flying Celestials, they would be on the same level. At that time, they would be competitors. Many people were already considering how to fight against Yun Hui.","Fang Yu was probably the only one who could ignore them. His cultivation far surpassed everyone else’s. To him, these people were not enough to pose a threat to him. He chose to look at Chu Yunfan because he found him interesting.","In the ring, Yun Hui’s patience seemed to have been worn out by Chu Yunfan. He immediately shouted, “This is where you end today!”","As Yun Hui spoke, his gaze swept across the sky. He was looking at the Flying Celestial disciples. In the future, they would all be fellow disciples. They would be fellow disciples and competitors. He wanted to show these people his strength. In the Flying Celestials, those who did not have strength would not have any status. He was going to show his strength now.","At this moment, Yun Hui took a step forward and punched out. “Divine Chaos Clouds!”","As he punched out, the clouds in the world condensed into a sea of clouds. At the center of this sea of clouds was Yun Hui, the true ruler. The white clouds formed by these clouds seemed to be nothing, but everyone knew that the truly terrifying thing was hidden within them. Every white cloud was a terrifying fist force that could shatter everything.","This was the ultimate technique of the Lavish Prefecture’s Yun clan.","In an instant, the entire arena space seemed to be under his control. The clouds enveloped Chu Yunfan. In an instant, a series of violent explosions sounded. Yun Hui had instantly released countless fist forces.","Yun Hui was at least twice as strong as Xiao Bofu. He was an existence that had truly stepped into the peak of the late Abstract Stage and was only a step away from the peak of the Abstract Stage. No wonder he dared to declare that he wanted to compete for the position of seed disciple. With his current cultivation base, it was not like he could not do it.","“Chu Yunfan is finished. He won’t be able to resist those clouds. The best way is to dodge.”","Just when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was finished, they saw a sword light with purple lightning shooting out from the sky, instantly tearing apart the white clouds. In an instant, it had already torn everything apart and slashed in Yun Hui’s direction.","“This is impossible!”","Yun Hui had never expected that Chu Yunfan would be able to counterattack despite being surrounded by his countless clouds. This sword light instantly made the hair on his back stand on end as if he had encountered a great danger. He immediately raised his hands to protect himself, but the sword light smashed down at the next moment.","Bam!","Yun Hui immediately screamed and flew backwards. His arms were already a bloody mess, and he was severely injured by the sword. Soon, everyone discovered that Yun Hui’s hands weren’t the only ones that had become a bloody mess. His chest had also been slashed open by the sword light.","Yun Hui screamed in pain and quickly grabbed a healing pill from the void. He wanted to heal himself, but Chu Yunfan would never give him the chance. Chu Yunfan instantly came up behind him and kicked him.","This kick was like lightning and directly hit Yun Hui’s back. Yun Hui screamed and flew out of the ring. He couldn’t move. All the bones in his body were seriously injured by Chu Yunfan.","“So strong!”","Upon seeing this scene, not only the genius disciples who came to participate in the test, but even the Flying Celestial disciples were dumbfounded. From the beginning to the end, Chu Yunfan only used two moves. One severely injured Yun Hui and the other completely made Yun Hui lose his ability to fight.","“With such strength, it’s not impossible for him to compete for the seed disciple position,” someone said in shock.","“That’s right. Even among seed disciples, there aren’t many who can do this.”","“What kind of physique does he have? He’s a monster!”","Everyone was shocked. The Flying Celestial disciples finally took Chu Yunfan seriously and listed him as the biggest threat. He was no longer a dispensable small figure.","“How did he train? In a place like the Violet Thunder Prefecture, it’s almost impossible for him to cultivate to such a powerful level.”","“Could it be that he’s gifted? But he has not made many moves. It’s impossible to determine if he has any special physique that makes him so powerful.”","“But in terms of special physique, isn’t there one among the disciples who applied for the test this time aorund? If Chu Yunfan doesn’t lose, those two might meet.”"]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 Chu Yunfan Is an Easy Target?","paragraphs":["6 Chu Yunfan Is an Easy Target?","Chu Yunfan had easily defeated another opponent. If he was a seed disciple they had already chosen, it would not have been a big deal. To be able to become a seed disciple of the Flying Celestials, one naturally had the strength to crush their peers. However, Chu Yunfan was not their predetermined candidate, not to mention that he was only in the Golden Core Stage.","This had never happened before. A mere Golden Core was enough to defeat an expert at the late Abstract Stage. This was a complete reversal of worldviews, especially for those who had been taught since they were young that the gap between the Core Stage and the Abstract Stage could not be crossed.","“He’s only a Golden Core, yet he’s already so powerful. If he steps into the Abstract Stage, how powerful will he be?”","“It’s not that easy to enter the Abstract Stage. Why do the Flying Celestials recruit inner disciples according to their cultivation base? It’s because many Golden Cores will never enter the Abstract Stage.”","“That’s right. Who knows how many geniuses have made great progress in the Golden Core Stage but can’t cross the threshold of the Abstract Stage?”","The crowd discussed animatedly, but there were still many people who disdained Chu Yunfan and were unwilling to admit his strength.","“I heard that the Violet Thunder Prefecture was previously ruled by the Violet Thunder Swords. They were a large sect back then, so it’s normal for them to have a bit of inheritance. For him to be able to cultivate to such a shocking level in the Violet Thunder Prefecture, I reckon that it has a lot to do with the inheritance of the sect.”","As everyone was discussing animatedly, Chu Yunfan and Yun Hui were teleported out of the ring. Chu Yunfan’s expression was indifferent as if defeating Yun Hui was a very ordinary thing. After defeating Yun Hui, Chu Yunfan was arranged to fight a few more rounds. His battles undoubtedly attracted many people.","Chu Yunfan didn’t disappoint them. He defeated all the opponents from the intermediate to the late Abstract Stage with a single strike. Everyone felt that the Seven Violet Thunder Swords that Chu Yunfan had displayed were impressive, but they did not understand his strength or what other techniques he had.","None of his opponents could make him take them seriously, which disappointed many people.","Soon, it was the final round. Those who passed this final round would undoubtedly become a seed disciple of the Flying Celestials. At this moment, everyone’s expression became solemn, even those who had been eliminated. There were only 20 people left on the field.","Among these twenty people, each of them carried the aura of a peerless overlord. They were extremely powerful, and among their peers, it was difficult to find a match. Apart from Chu Yunfan, everyone else was at the peak Abstract Stage.","After a few rounds, those who were not strong enough had long been eliminated. It was impossible for them to reach this step.","Among these peak Abstracts, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was the most special one. This was because not only was he not at the peak Abstract Stage, he was not even in the peak Golden Core Stage. This attracted the attention of many people. Many people chose to watch his battle.","When these twenty people lined up in a row, everyone felt their divine wills sweeping out. These twenty people were sizing each other up. No one knew who their next opponent would be. Anyone could be their next opponent.","Chu Yunfan’s divine will also swept around. Among these people, one person quickly appeared in his perception. This person was dressed in a long green robe. He had a handsome face and sharp eyebrows. He looked heroic.","Just by standing there quietly, Chu Yunfan felt that he was unfathomable. It was as if he was not a person standing there, but a storm. Yes, this person felt like a storm to Chu Yunfan. This was the only person who attracted his attention.","While Chu Yunfan was sizing up the others, the others were also sizing up Chu Yunfan. Everyone was very surprised that a Golden Core could make it to the finals. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan’s luck was too good. He must not have encountered any strong opponents before that allowed him to make it to this point.","‘If only I had met him.’","Many people had this thought. They didn’t think that Chu Yunfan was that difficult to deal with. In their opinion, those who were defeated by him must have been weak, and they were different. Everyone here was a strong opponent. Among them, Chu Yunfan seemed to be the weakest and the easiest to bully.","“Next, the final round of the competition will begin. The one who wins will become a seed disciple among the inner disciples of the Flying Celestials,” the adjudicator announced.","As he spoke, he looked at two people. One was the green-robed youth whom even Chu Yunfan could not help but pay attention to. The other was naturally Chu Yunfan, who had fought his way here as a Golden Core.","He wasn’t surprised by the green-robed young man. With his strength, he was already on the list of people the Flying Celestials paid close attention to. Even when he was young, the Flying Celestials had secretly helped him several times.","This was the common practice of the various large sects. Although there was a standard for recruiting disciples, there were many disciples with potential they would start paying attention not long after they were born. It was very normal for many factions to snatch a disciple.","This green-robed youth was one of the best. Before the adjudicator came to preside over the test, he had already received special instructions from several elders to pay attention to this person.","What really surprised the man was Chu Yunfan. In his opinion, it was already good for Chu Yunfan to be able to participate in the inner disciple selection. He was already a big dark horse, but now it seemed that he was more than just a big dark horse.","“Let’s begin.”","The middle-aged man didn’t say anything else and opened a portal in front of everyone. Finally, the final selection for seed disciples began.","Chu Yunfan was fearless and stepped into the ring. A muscular young man appeared too. When he saw Chu Yunfan, his face revealed a hint of joy. He had been paying attention to Chu Yunfan before, hoping that he would be able to draw Chu Yunfan. He did not expect that the heavens would follow his wishes and that he would really be matched up with Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 Becoming a Seed Disciple","paragraphs":["7 Becoming a Seed Disciple","“I’m so lucky,” the muscular youth said with a teasing smile. “The seed disciple position is mine!”","“Early?” The muscular young man sneered. “This time, I am determined to become a seed disciple. I don’t even care about people of the same level, let alone you.”","The outside world was in chaos. Due to the existence of a Golden Core like Chu Yunfan, more than half of the gazes were attracted to this battle. Everyone was waiting to see how far Chu Yunfan could go.","This was especially true for the Flying Celestials disciples. They had seen many geniuses. It was not uncommon for a fledgling or intermediate Abstract to become a seed disciple. It could even be said that it was common. But no matter what, they were all in the Abstract Stage.","Chu Yunfan was different. He was only in the Golden Core Stage. If he could become a seed disciple, he would be creating an unprecedented miracle. It was a miracle that they would never see a second time.","“Chu Yunfan is in big trouble. He’ll probably get stuck in the top ten.”","“That’s right, Xue Liwei isn’t an ordinary person. I’ve heard of him. The Xue clan isn’t close to our sect, but Xue Liwei is different. He was saved by a sect elder when he was young, so he’s determined to join the Flying Celestials.”","“That’s right. He was almost selected as a disciple by that elder. He was qualified to join the Flying Celestials, but he waited for this opportunity to amaze the world. After all, ordinary disciples and seed disciples are two different things.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. They were no strangers among these people, or rather, the only person they were unfamiliar with was Chu Yunfan. As for the others, they had grown up in Grand Xia since young. This was especially so for these geniuses, and they were all familiar with each other. This was especially so since they were competitors this time around. They had already sent people to gather information on each of them.","There was only one person that they felt unfamiliar with, and that was Chu Yunfan from the Violet Thunder Prefecture. That was a blind spot in their intelligence. None of them took Chu Yunfan from the Violet Thunder Prefecture seriously and thought that he was just so-so. Who would have thought that he would become the biggest dark horse in this test?","Some people had thought that Chu Yunfan was lucky, but at this point, no one would think that he was lucky anymore. No one could reach this stage just by luck. Chu Yunfan had come this far. It was clear who was higher and who was lower.","However, no one was optimistic about whether Chu Yunfan could make it to the final step. After all, Xue Liwei was probably the strongest opponent he had ever faced. To be able to reach this step, none of them were weak. Every one of them was very powerful. And Xue Liwei was to become the disciple of an established elder.","There were some people who suspected that Xue Liwei was purposely paired up with Chu Yunfan. Could there be some inside story? After all, Chu Yunfan seemed to be the weakest among these people and the easiest to bully.","“It’s not early. You aren’t going to make it!” Xue Liwei burst into laughter. “You’re lucky to be able to reach this point, but your luck ends here. I’ll finish you off in one move. There’s no need to waste time.”","Xue Liwei sneered and attacked. His figure flashed and he arrived in front of Chu Yunfan in the blink of an eye. He casually slashed out with his sword. This sword light was extremely condensed. Although it was only about 100 feet long, it was extremely terrifying. Even a mountain peak would be cut off by this strike.","This was the manifestation of condensing divine power to a terrifying level. It was not something that ordinary people could do.","“Finish me off in one move? You’re too confident.” Chu Yunfan sneered. He formed a dragon claw with his hand and grabbed at the sword light.","Bam!","The sword light was crushed by Chu Yunfan, and the light scattered in all directions. Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s claw grabbed Xue Liwei.","Xue Liwei did not expect his attack to be so easily broken. Divine power instantly surged from his entire body as if it had transformed into a suit of armor that protected him. However, it was crushed by Chu Yunfan in an instant, and Xue Liwei was hit.","Bam!","Spurt!","“Aaaaaggggh!”","Xue Liwei let out an angry roar. He struggled to get up, but Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and appeared above him.","Chu Yunfan stomped on Xue Liwei. Netherworld water appeared in the sky and landed on Xue Liwei’s body with a thunderous momentum.","Boom!","Xue Liwei was stomped into the floor of the ring, and the ground around him shattered.","Xue Liwei was defeated!","Everyone was stunned and dead silent.","“That was so fast... Xue Liwei was defeated so quickly!”","“Xue Liwei is defeated. This is simply unbelievable!”","“It’s unbelievable. I saw Xue Liwei defeat his enemies with one move. None of them could last three moves against him, but now he was defeated by Chu Yunfan!”","“There’s really a strong opponent among the strong. They are so strong. Each one is more ferocious and terrifying than the other.”","The geniuses who came to take the test were all shocked. If it were them, they would not be Xue Liwei’s match. However, Xue Liwei, who was incomparably powerful in their hearts, was not a match for Chu Yunfan. He was defeated in an instant.","Everyone could see that Xue Liwei was no match for Chu Yunfan. He couldn’t even force Chu Yunfan to reveal his true strength.","“Just how strong is Chu Yunfan? He’s simply terrifying!”","“That’s right. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it either.”","“I’m afraid that elder’s scheme has failed.”","Everyone’s eyes shone as if they wanted to see through Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 Entering the Flying Celestial Sect","paragraphs":["8 Entering the Flying Celestial Sect","Everyone wanted to see through Chu Yunfan. No one knew what his true strength was, but they all knew that this was not the extent of it.","“Could it be that his battle prowess is comparable to the Abstract Observance Stage?”","Someone made a guess. Even the craziest person, who had the most confidence in Chu Yunfan, still found this guess unacceptable and unbelievable.","“He shouldn’t have reached that level yet,” Fang Yu said.","Everyone nodded in succession, and there were even some who heaved a sigh of relief. They naturally believed Fang Yu’s judgment. After all, among them, only Fang Yu was at the Abstract Observance Stage.","“Even so, he’s probably the only Golden Core to become an inner disciple.”","Many people sighed. Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t reach the height they guessed, this was already a record.","Chu Yunfan walked out of the ring after the battle. He felt that the people around him looked at him differently. They no longer looked at him with disdain like before. They only thought that he was a lucky dark horse.","“Congratulations, Brother Chu.”","Huang Feng walked out of the crowd and congratulated him. A look of disbelief flashed across his eyes, and his expression was quite complicated. Although Chu Yunfan’s powerful combat strength had left a deep impression on him more than a year ago, he was still very shocked.","However, it was definitely not as deep an impression as this time.","Although Huang Feng also thought of himself as a genius, he had never thought of competing for the position of seed disciple. In a behemoth like the Flying Celestials, geniuses were not worth much. Anyone who was casually caught would be a genius in the eyes of others. It was already difficult to become an inner disciple, let alone a seed disciple.","Huang Feng was now even more certain that he had made the right choice to rope Chu Yunfan in. Yang Feifeng wanted to find trouble with Chu Yunfan, but he was killed by Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, he secretly applauded Chu Yunfan’s godlike actions. He had killed many Grand Xia experts back in the Violet Thunder Prefecture. These people were not without roots. They all had sects and families behind them. How could these sects and families let this matter go so easily?","Things were different now. Chu Yunfan was an inner disciple of the Flying Celestials. Even if they had the courage, they wouldn’t dare to take revenge. At most, they would do something secretly.","“Congratulations to you too. We will be in the same sect in the future,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile. He didn’t reject Huang Feng.","After a while, the remaining battles were all over. The seed disciples from this test were selected. Among them, there was indeed the green-robed youth whom Chu Yunfan paid special attention to.","The youth seemed to have sensed Chu Yunfan’s gaze and turned to look at him.","“Everyone, the inner disciple test has come to an end. I will now announce the names of the seed disciples: Hua Xianyuan, Fang Zhiyuan, Liu Deqing, Li Yue, Nan Yidu, Cheng Feishi, Zhang Yu, Feng Baoyu, Lin Su, and Chu Yunfan.”","The adjudicator appeared and read out the name list. No one was surprised by the names, but the last name did. A mere Golden Core had achieved an unprecedented and shocking achievement. Even the adjudicator couldn’t help but take a few more glances at Chu Yunfan.","“As for the rest of you, you will automatically become inner disciples of the sect. There will be fringe disciples who will bring you to your assigned residences. In addition, there will be sect benefits. In the future, I hope that all of you will serve the Flying Celestials and Grand Xia well.”","Soon, many Golden Cores in moon-white robes surged into this space. These were all fringe disciples of the Flying Celestials. At this moment, they all approached these new inner disciples.","Before Chu Yunfan was a tall, graceful, and delicate woman in a moon-white robe. She bowed to Chu Yunfan and said, “Senior Chu, I’m a fringe disciple who’s here to guide you into the sect. My name is Lin Yuexin.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. Although he entered the sect later than her, he was now an inner disciple, so he naturally deserved the title of senior.","“Please, lead the way.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Follow me, Senior Chu.” Lin Yuexin nodded. She stepped out of the test space and headed toward the inner part of the Flying Celestials. Rays of light flashed around her, and so did most of the others.","Just as Lin Yuexin was about to stop and wait for Chu Yunfan, she realized that he had already come up silently behind her.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept across the Flying Celestials. At this time, the fringe disciple test had also been completed. However, their treatment was not as good. Unlike the inner disciples, who had individual guides, they were all guided as a group to the depths of the Flying Celestials.","Lin Yuexin glanced at Chu Yunfan, and a hint of disbelief flashed in her eyes. When Chu Yunfan became a seed disciple while in the Golden Core Stage, the geniuses who came to take the test and the inner disciples of the Flying Celestials were surprised. Even the fringe disciples who were waiting outside were in an uproar.","The fringe disciples of the Flying Celestials were also in the Golden Core Stage. Chu Yunfan was a seed disciple, but they were just ordinary fringe disciples. This made many of them sigh. They were all humans, but why was the difference so huge?","“What are you looking at? Is there a flower on my face?” Chu Yunfan noticed Lin Yuexin’s gaze and revealed a faint smile.","“No, no!” Lin Yuexin said as she quickly looked away.","In the Flying Celestials, the hierarchy was strict. The difference between fringe disciples and seed disciples was too big. Even if Chu Yunfan killed her, it would at most mean a little trouble for him."]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 Many Benefits","paragraphs":["9 Many Benefits","“Senior Chu, I’ll give you a rundown of the sect. The Flying Celestials is divided into four regions, east, south, west, and north. The North District is where the sect master, grand elders, and elders live, cultivate, and enter seclusion. Some of the most famous sights in our Flying Celestials, including the sacred caves and blessed lands, are all in the north region,” Lin Yuexin explained.","Chu Yunfan nodded. The North District was the core of the Flying Celestials and the source of supreme power. The East District should be the residence of the current high and mighty true disciples. In addition to them, there should be their servants, inner disciples, and fringe disciples whom they treated as their confidants.","From these words, it was not difficult for Chu Yunfan to guess that these true disciples ran their own territories. There were servants, inner disciples, and fringe disciples. They were all like independent small kingdoms.","The Flying Celestials didn’t care about this. It was clear that they did this intentionally. After all, the people who would hold the power of the Flying Celestials in the future were none other than these true disciples.","There was only one sect master, a few vice sect masters, elders, grand elders, and other high-ranking people within the sect. These people were all selected from these true disciples. It was clear that letting them manage these things now was for the sake of taking charge of the sect in the future.","Chu Yunfan had once reached the peak of the world, so he was familiar with these methods. Not to mention that he had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. In the memories, even in the era of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, this method was common.","Chu Yunfan believed that Yi Yunyao had her own territory in the East District. After all, a true disciple and an inner disciple like him were two completely different existences. True disciples were considered the ruling class of the Flying Celestials and even all of Grand Xia, while inner disciples were just ordinary members.","“The Western District is where we’ll be staying. The outer regions of the district are occupied by the fringe disciples while the inner disciples live in the West District itself. Other than that, there’s also the South District.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. Everything was clear now. The core area, residential area, commercial area, and so on were clearly planned out. Although the Flying Celestials was a small place, they had all the necessary organs. It was just like a small country.","Under Lin Yuexin’s lead, Chu Yunfan soon arrived at a mountain peak in the West District. On a stone tablet at the foot of the mountain, the words “Moonview Peak” were written.","“Senior Chu, all the new seniors are settled in Moonview Peak. You’ll be living here too,” Lin Yuexin said.","Chu Yunfan looked around. Although it was a mountain peak, it was located within a large mountain range. All kinds of courtyards were scattered all over the mountain range like stars. It was definitely more than enough to accommodate hundreds of inner disciples.","Chu Yunfan and Lin Yuexin landed in front of a house. It was an elegant and quiet courtyard with three entryways. Although it wasn’t very large, it was still an independent space with pavilions, rockery, and flowing water.","Lin Yuexin revealed a hint of envy. If she really wanted it, she could have a courtyard with 30 entryways outside. But this was the Flying Celestials, a place where every inch of land was worth an inch of gold.","After Chu Yunfan entered the house, he felt that the spirit energy was much denser here. The spirit energy in Grand Xia was already very dense, almost double that of the Violet Thunder Prefecture. However, the spirit energy in this courtyard was at least 50% denser than the outside. He could feel that there was a spirit-gathering formation in the surroundings that was constantly operating.","If such a place was built in the Federation, it would be priceless. Countless people would pay a sky-high price to buy it. After all, cultivating in such a place was simply twice the result with half the effort.","Lin Yuexin took out a set of robes from the void and said, “This is the robes of our sect. It’s called the Flying Celestial Robe. It’s refined from various extremely precious materials. After wearing it, you’ll be immune to ordinary poisons and it serves as a great defensive item. Even if a Golden Core attacks with all their strength, the robe will be difficult to destroy. In addition, after wearing the Flying Celestial Robe, the divine power in your body will circulate at any time and place. It can increase the efficiency of cultivation by at least 10%.”","Chu Yunfan was a little speechless. He didn’t really care about the defense of this thing. With his current physical defense, not to mention a Golden Core, even an Abstract wouldn’t be able to hurt him. However, it would be amazing if he could increase his training efficiency by more than 10%. Don’t underestimate this small number. Accumulated over the years, it would be very impressive.","As Lin Yuexin spoke, she was also a little envious. Although she was also wearing a Flying Celestial Robe, in terms of grade, it was far inferior and could not be compared.","“In addition, there’s also this pill called the Flying Celestial Pill. This pill is a specialty of the Flying Celestials. Outsiders can’t buy it even if they want to,” Lin Yuexin said, “The pill recipe is top secret and is usually only given to true disciples. Inner disciples will only receive a pill when they become seed disciples or when they make great contributions.”","Lin Yuexin took out a medicine bottle and handed it to Chu Yunfan. Her eyes flashed with envy, but she didn’t dare to keep these things. She was just a fringe disciple. She didn’t have the guts to do so.","“Other than these, there are also these books. Some of them record some of the martial arts of the sect. However, all of you have your own fortuitous encounters, so you don’t have to learn them. There’s also some basic knowledge of Grand Xia, astronomy, geography, and human relations.”","“That’s about it. If you don’t have any other instructions, I’ll be leaving now,” Lin Yuexin said.","“Okay, you can go.” Chu Yunfan waved."]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 Break Through to the Abstract Stage!","paragraphs":["0 Break Through to the Abstract Stage!","Chu Yunfan put on the Flying Celestial Robe and immediately felt the divine power in his body circulating much more smoothly. Just this function alone made the robe very impressive.","From this, it could be seen that the Flying Celestials’s foundation was indeed powerful.","Chu Yunfan flipped through the books. He merely glanced at the secret manuals and was not interested in learning them. Although these cultivation methods were rare in the eyes of the outside world, compared to Chu Yunfan’s methods, it was like heaven and earth.","Fortunately, the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials had already considered that many of the Flying Celestial disciples were bringing skills from their masters, especially the geniuses. Each of them had their own fortuitous encounters and were not simple. Forcing them to cultivate these crude cultivation techniques of the Flying Celestials was not worth it. Therefore, they did not enforce it.","Chu Yunfan casually flipped through the books. In these books, there were little people sitting cross-legged or standing up while practicing martial arts. Although there were no written records, a large amount of information surged into his mind with just a glance. These secret manuals were all magic treasures and were extraordinary.","There was no need to record anything in words. It was directly transmitted to the person’s brain through the mind. Even Chu Yunfan could not help but click his tongue in wonder.","These martial arts were too easy for Chu Yunfan. He only glanced at them and everything entered his mind. In minutes, he had already learned them all. The godhead inside him was constantly emitting light. In an instant, he had already learned all these martial arts. As long as he was willing, he could cultivate them to the realm of perfection anytime and anywhere.","Soon, Chu Yunfan put down these secret manuals and flipped through the book that recorded astronomy, geography, human feelings, legends, myths, and other things pertaining to Grand Xia. The title of the book, which only had two words, was “The World.”","Although Chu Yunfan had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, the memories were from a very, very long time ago. Chu Yunfan thus didn’t know much about the current situation. This book solved his pressing problem.","The Flying Celestials’ heritage was reflected in all aspects, especially in this book. This book was as thick as an ordinary book, but the contents recorded were as vast as the stars. They were sealed within with a special technique. Even with Chu Yunfan’s photographic memory and his ability to understand everything he saw, it took him a full day and night to finish reading the entire book, gaining a general understanding of the situation in Grand Xia.","After putting down the book, Chu Yunfan immediately decided to go into seclusion. He had a Flying Celestial Pill with him, which was enough for him to enter the Abstract Stage. Though he had set up a formation for cultivation, he still entered the Mountain and River Diagram. Only here did he feel truly safe.","Sitting cross-legged in the air, Chu Yunfan swallowed the Flying Celestial Pill. He felt a powerful force rushing out, constantly washing his limbs and bones. An even stronger force rushed directly into his brain. This was the biggest difference between the Abstract Stage and the Golden Core Stage.","Cores cultivated golden cores while Abstract cultivated natural laws. Cultivators below the Abstract Stage tempered their bodies to accommodate more mana. It was different when one reached the Abstract Stage. One had already faintly touched upon the comprehension of the natural laws. In this process, one’s brain was constantly developed, producing incredible abilities. Only then could one perceive these laws that were originally impossible for humans to perceive.","There was a hidden latch within the brain, the aperture opening. This was the last key that held the door to the natural laws for humans. Therefore, people would often call flipping this latch “enlightenment.”","In Chu Yunfan’s body, the aperture opening was much stronger than in ordinary people. The stronger the person, the more difficult it was to break through. He could easily defeat a Peak Abstract while in the Golden Core Stage. How could he be ordinary?","He was walking on a path that no one had ever walked before.","Chu Yunfan’s divine power was breaking through the aperture opening layer by layer. However, he was extremely careful. He was many times more careful than when he broke through to the Golden Core Stage. This was because most of his Golden Core Stage was cultivating his limbs and bones. Even if he was crippled, he could recover with time.","However, the brain was different. Even at Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level, this was still a forbidden world. He had never cultivated the brain before. Whether it was Grand Xia, which had an incomparably strong cultivation path, or the Federation, which had advanced technology, their research in the field of the brain was very shallow.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t need to fumble around on his own. He could rely on the experience of his predecessors to cultivate. There were records within the Emperor Method. As his cultivation continued to increase, the memories kept coming out for him to use. He only needed to cultivate step by step.","During this process, Chu Yunfan was covered in sweat. The intense pain made his entire body twitch. For ordinary Golden Cores, this round was simply a narrow escape. This was why the Flying Celestials differentiated its inner and fringe disciples by the Abstract Stage. It was because the Golden Core Stages who showed great talent might never reach the Abstract Stage.","This was an extremely tragic ratio.","After an unknown period of time, Chu Yunfan’s entire body seemed to have been soaked in cold water. Sweat kept dripping down like rain. However, his expression did not change.","This was a very strange state.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. Two golden lights shot out from his eyes and rushed into the sky. After suppressing his aura for a long time, it suddenly exploded.","Chu Yunfan had finally stepped into the Abstract Stage!"]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 When a Conflict Begins, They Killed as They Pleased!","paragraphs":["1 When a Conflict Begins, They Killed as They Pleased!","The moment he entered the fledgling Abstract Stage, Chu Yunfan’s entire person was completely different. He could feel that the surrounding environment had undergone earth-shattering changes.","At this moment, he truly understood a principle. What did it mean to look at a mountain that was not a mountain, and look at water that was not water!","And he was currently at such a level.","Chu Yunfan could feel how wonderful the world had become. It was as if he had changed his outlook on the world. He could see things that he couldn’t see or sense before. It was all mysterious beyond words and wonderful beyond words. From seeing the surface of things to seeing the essence.","He could feel that his strength had undergone an earth-shattering change. The power he could control was even stronger, and his strength had increased several times from his original foundation, and his battle prowess charged into the Abstract Observance Stage.","Chu Yunfan finally came out of seclusion. He realized it had taken him more than half a month to complete the breakthrough. Of course, to be able to achieve such an effect in only half a month was shocking. The Flying Celestial Pill was indeed amazing. Unfortunately, with his current status, he could only get one.","After the breakthrough, Chu Yunfan immediately came out of seclusion and checked that the arrays he had set up for security around the courtyard had not been broken. Only then did he feel relieved.","Dressed in a moon-white robe, Chu Yunfan headed out. He wanted to visit Yi Yunyao. He was able to enter the Flying Celestials because of her recommendation, after all. Otherwise, a person with an unknown background like him would not be able to become a seed disciple. He would definitely be excluded from the selection. That was why Chu Yunfan wanted to personally thank her.","Chu Yunfan quickly passed through the West District and arrived at the East District. Different from the houses in the West District, there were mountain peaks in the East District. The base of these mountains was wrapped in endless spirit energy. It looked like an immortal fog was lingering around them as if they were the living quarters of gods.","Compared to the spirit-gathering formation in Chu Yunfan’s courtyard, these mountains used the entire mountain peak as an array to gather spirit energy. The effect was at least a dozen times better. It was not on the same level at all.","Suddenly, a shout came from afar. In the distance, a group of people sitting atop of warhorses flew over. Each of these horses they rode was extraordinary. They were more than three meters tall and looked like dragons and tigers. They were extraordinary, like dragon horses.","The horse’s four hooves rose into the air and stepped on air as if they were stepping on solid ground. Their speed was extremely fast, as fast as lightning.","If it was before this, Chu Yunfan might not have known, but after reading The World book, he knew about these horses. These horses were called drakehorses. It was said that it was the offspring of a flood dragon and a horse. After countless years of domestication, these drakehorses now littered in the thousands. Even the standard warhorses in the Grand Xia Army were these drakehorses.","On top of this group of drakehorses was a group of youths. They were also dressed in moon-white robes and were Flying Celestial disciples.","“Move aside!”","These people charged forward without slowing down as if they wanted to kill Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately flashed past them, his figure not the slightest bit flustered. However, after these knights passed by, they turned around.","“Where did you come from? How dare you charge around in the East District. Do you want to die?” the leader of the group said arrogantly.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. These people were lawless. They were clearly the ones who were charging around, but now they were blaming Chu Yunfan.","“I’m Chu Yunfan. I just joined the Flying Celestials a few days ago. I’m here today to pay a visit to Senior Sister Yi Yunyao,” Chu Yunfan said patiently.","“Yi Yunyao?”","Hearing this name, these people did not have the intention of letting this matter go. On the contrary, a hint of sternness flashed across their faces.","“So you’re Senior Yi’s man. No wonder you don’t know the rules. Since she didn’t teach you the rules of the sect, let us teach you!” the leader said as he sneered.","“Teach me the rules? Trash like you?”","How could Chu Yunfan not understand that these people did not have good intentions? They probably had a grudge against Yi Yunyao. He scoffed at them.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, anger flashed across their faces. The leader shouted, “Kill him. If anything happens, Senior Wang will take care of it.”","These people immediately shouted and charged their horses toward Chu Yunfan.","As they charged, the drakehorses under their command took on the illusion of flood dragons. With more than ten people charging, they carried the terrifying aura of an army.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed sharply. These people were more domineering than the last. They were used to treating human lives like grass. They killed people without hesitation. Although he himself was decisive and merciless, he had never looked down on human lives like this.","“You’re courting death!”","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t want to be too high-profile for the time being, he wasn’t going to swallow his anger and back down.","Behind him, a streak of sword light flew out. The sword was wrapped in violet lightning and instantly shot out.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The sword light swept through the sky. In an instant, these people screamed in pain. Their bodies and horses were pierced by Chu Yunfan’s sword light and fell from the sky. Their eyes were wide open. They couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan, this new disciple, was so unyielding.","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to kill these people, an angry voice suddenly sounded.","“How dare you!”","It was an incomparably loud roar. An overwhelming might swept over. This terrifying power was like a storm, making Chu Yunfan feel as if the world was rejecting him from all directions. He was about to be crushed by this terrifying power.","Then, a figure landed before Chu Yunfan. It was a man in a moon-white robe. However, the edges of his robe were painted with golden edges. It looked extremely ancient and mysterious.","The man was in his thirties. His face was cold, and his thin lips and sharp eyes looked extremely terrifying."]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 Wang Yifan Backs Down","paragraphs":["2 Wang Yifan Backs Down","The man’s eyes were locked on Chu Yunfan. To ordinary people, this man was like a beast that chose to devour people. Even Chu Yunfan’s divine power began to circulate, and all the hair on his body stood up.","This was an existence that surpassed the Abstract Stage, a true disciple!","This person was undoubtedly a true disciple of the Flying Celestials. Chu Yunfan had wanted to keep a low profile and not provoke a true disciple, but the other party chose to bully him. He had no choice.","Chu Yunfan did not cause trouble, but he was never afraid of trouble, even if the other party was a true disciple. He had a lot of trump cards. If he really exploded, he might have a chance to teach the other party a lesson.","The man saw that Chu Yunfan had a calm expression. Chu Yunfan didn’t look like an ordinary person who was scared out of his wits.","“You dare to kill people in the Flying Celestials? You’re courting death. Do you really think you can do whatever you want as an Abstract inner disciple?” The man looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","Chu Yunfan could sense that this person had come with ill intentions. He gathered all his mana and was ready to attack at any time. Although the man in front of him was very powerful, it was impossible for to Chu Yunfan simply surrender.","“How dare you condense your divine power in front of me!”","The man snorted coldly and attacked. He casually slashed down with a sword light.","Chu Yunfan’s hair stood on end, and he felt as if he was in extreme danger. He quickly formed an energy shield in front of him to protect himself. But in an instant, the energy shield was cut through and the sword light landed on him.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan was sent flying, and a huge wound appeared on his arm, causing blood to spurt out.","“Hmm?”","The man frowned when he realized that he had failed to kill Chu Yunfan in one hit. Although he had only casually attacked, an ordinary Abstract should not have been able to block his attack and would have been killed. However, only Chu Yunfan’s arm was injured.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. He was about to activate the bloodline of the hou in his body and transform into a hou. Then, he would use the Monster Vanquisher to fight this man.","He had a chance of winning!","“Wang Yifan, you dare to touch my people? Don’t force me to make a move!”","A crisp and cold voice suddenly came from afar. Immediately after, Yi Yunyao came on a beam of light. She stood before Chu Yunfan and blocked the man, Wang Yifan.","Chu Yunfan now knew who this man was. When he was reading “The World,” he had seen records of the Flying Celestial true disciples. As there were not many, all of them could be recorded in the book. It was just that the records were not very detailed. After all, this was a big taboo, but he knew some basic information.","Wang Yifan was one of the Flying Celestial’s true disciples. His strength was unfathomable, and he possessed extremely powerful cultivation from a young age. However, he was temperamental and extremely murderous.","“So this is your man Junior Yi. This person killed one of my disciples. He violated the sect rules and should be sentenced to death.”","When Wang Yifan saw Yi Yunyao appear, he immediately restrained his expression and glared at her. He did not even look at Chu Yunfan. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was just an inner disciple who was a little more than he had imagined. He was nothing. Who he truly was afraid of was Yi Yunyao.","“Wang Yifan, you don’t have to tell me. I know the rules of the sect better than you do, and I also know that every single one of your disciples is as arrogant and despotic as you,” Yi Yunyao said with a cold smile. “If we really think about it, attacking a fellow disciple is a capital offense. Chu Yunfan was just defending himself. What’s wrong with that?”","“Does this mean you plan to disrespect me, Junior Yi? For a lowly inner disciple?” Wang Yifan’s voice became colder and colder as he stared at Yi Yunyao.","Yi Yunyao said indifferently, “I’ll settle this feud. If you’re not satisfied, we can have a fight now and end this matter.”","Wang Yifan stared at Yi Yunyao coldly, then squeezed out an ugly smile and said, “Since you’ve spoken, I’ll let you go this time. If he encounters any disaster in the future, I won’t be held responsible.”","Wang Yifan’s words were full of threats. He did not care about the disciples that Chu Yunfan had killed. What he really hated was that Yi Yunyao did not take him seriously. The threat in his words was clear as day. Could Yi Yunyao watch Chu Yunfan for the rest of her life?","If Wang Yifan wanted to get back at a small inner disciple, he just needed to say the word.","“You don’t have to worry about that. Such a day will never come,” Chu Yunfan said, “Senior Wang, you should be careful. Take care that a disaster doesn’t befall you.”","“I’ve never met an inner disciple as arrogant as you,” Wang Yifan said fiercely. Of course, he knew what Chu Yunfan meant, and his eyes flashed with a fierce light. “Your subordinates are talented, Junior Yi. I want to see who will be in trouble when the time comes.”","After Wang Yifan finished speaking, he left.","“I’m sorry I’ve brought you trouble, Senior Yi,” Chu Yunfan said as he cupped his hands.","Yi Yunyao answered, “No need for sorry. Those disciples didn’t attack you because of you, but because of me. I have a grudge with Wang Yifan, and they wanted to help him vent his anger. Who would’ve thought that they’d kick a hornet’s nest?","“Inner disciples are nothing compared to true disciples. With your status, it’s impossible for you to casually kill them. Now that this matter involves two true disciples, the two of us can bring a conclusion to this matter.”"]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 Merit Hall","paragraphs":["3 Merit Hall","“Without me, I’m afraid you wouldn’t have gotten past this matter so easily,” Yi Yunyao said. She then glanced at Chu Yunfan and asked, “Do you feel that the world is unfair?”","The wound on Chu Yunfan’s arm was slowly healing. This attracted Yi Yunyao’s attention. With Wang Yifan’s strength, it should be impossible for Chu Yunfan to heal so quickly. Wang Yifan had passed the Abstract Stage. Chu Yunfan was struck by the sword, but he was not killed. This made Yi Yunyao very curious.","Chu Yunfan must have a secret, something big!","“I’m not a child. Fairness isn’t important to me,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll get back at him sooner or later.”","Although Wang Yifan was very powerful, Chu Yunfan wasn’t discouraged. He had two great inheritances from the Alchemy Emperor, which could be said to be unprecedented. All he needed now was time.","When Yi Yunyao heard his words, she wasn’t annoyed. On the contrary, she revealed a smile and said, “That’s right. With such an idea, you surely have a bright future. But this isn’t enough. Far from enough, in fact.”","She continued,” You come from the Violet Thunder Prefecture and perhaps don’t know enough about Grand Xia and the Flying Celestials. This is a system where the strong prey on the weak. Wang Yifan doesn’t dare to touch you not only because of me, but also because you’re a seed disciple.”","“He knows that I’m a seed disciple?” Chu Yunfan asked in surprise.","“Did you think what happened was an accident? I’m afraid that the entire sect knows that I’m the one who recommended you as you’re the first person I’ve ever recommended,” Yi Yunyao said, “I’ve been fighting with Wang Yifan for so many years. If I don’t understand him by now, that would be a joke.","“He wants to kill you to show off,” Yi Yunyao continued.” If you were just an ordinary inner disciple, then killing you would be no different from killing the disciples under his name.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn. Although Grand Xia was extremely prosperous, the number of killings was extremely rare.","“What he thinks is that I can’t protect you forever. He will find a chance to kill you.” Yi Yunyao sighed. “But he’s right. I can’t protect you forever. You will have to fend for yourself and prove your talent. The better you perform, the more attention you’ll get from the higher-ups, and the more he won’t dare to attack you.”","“I understand,” Chu Yunfan said.","Although it was said that the bird that stood out would be shot, at the same time, the bird that stood out would also receive the most attention from others. Although the true disciples were extremely powerful, they were not at the point where they could casually kill the future star of a sect. That would be too lawless.","“And although the Flying Celestials is extremely large, our resources are limited. These resources won’t fall into your hands for nothing. If you don’t fight for them, you won’t get them,” Yi Yunyao said.","“I understand. Thank you for your guidance, Senior Yi.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","Of course, he understood these principles. After all, he had experienced this kind of thing countless times in the past.","“All right, enough chatter. I’m going back into seclusion. You should head back too, and be careful. Don’t let give Wang Yifan any opportunities,” Yi Yunyao said.","With that said, she stepped on a beam of light and disappeared.","Chu Yunfan stood there for a while, then stepped on the light and left too. Today’s events made him understand that the Flying Celestials was not a peaceful place. On the contrary, competition between people was everywhere. He had to become a true disciple as soon as possible. However, the basic condition to become a true disciple was to reach beyond the Abstract Stage.","After bidding farewell to Yi Yunyao, Chu Yunfan returned to his residence and entered seclusion. During this time, he clearly sensed several divine wills spying on him from outside, but they were unable to enter his residence.","The Merit Hall was a special department within the Flying Celestials. It specialized in issuing missions to the members. Some of these missions were issued by the sect, some were issued by the disciples of the sect, and some were issued by other small sects and families. Among them, the mission with the highest return rate and the most interesting was from the Imperial Court. Grand Xia’s Imperial Court had always been generous, and the rewards after completing the missions issued by them were quite considerable.","The highest-ranking true disciples would often take on all kinds of missions to temper themselves. Moreover, many fortuitous encounters were obtained from missions, not to mention the generous rewards after completing them. Therefore, the Merit Hall was a very powerful faction within the sect. Many people had to act according to their wishes.","However, the Merit Hall usually took a neutral stance and did not get involved in the various disputes within the sect. Otherwise, no one would feel at ease letting the Merit Hall control such a huge benefit.","The Merit Hall was always crowded and noisy. Countless outer and inner disciples were rushing in and out, either to hand in missions or to accept missions. The staff members of the Merit Hall were very busy.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation required countless resources. It was far from enough to just wait for the sect to distribute some cultivation resources according to the prescribed order. Only by completing missions could he obtain the resources to increase his cultivation in a short time.","Although Chu Yunfan was wary of Wang Yifan, he did not take it to heart. He had many tricks up his sleeve and had the Sword Light Talisman of the Violet Thunder Swords. It was not impossible for him to kill Wang Yifan. Who he was truly afraid of was Li Qianyuan. Compared to Li Qianyuan, Wang Yifan was not worth mentioning.","“Long time no see, Brother Chu.”","Chu Yunfan had just arrived at the Merit Hall when he was stopped by a familiar face. He looked around and spotted Huang Feng walking over to him."]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 Lone Star","paragraphs":["4 Lone Star","“Hey, Brother Huang.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at Huang Feng and found that his cultivation had improved again. Huang Feng had reached the late Abstract Stage. He had probably just finished digesting the benefits offered by the Flying Celestials after entering the sect.","Dressed in a moon-white robe, Huang Feng looked elegant and graceful. He sized up Chu Yunfan and felt that Chu Yunfan was completely unfathomable. Chu Yunfan felt like an endless sea.","“Brother Chu, your cultivation has become stronger. Congratulations,” Huang Feng said.","“You’re too polite, Brother Huang.” Chu Yunfan waved at him.","“Brother Chu, are you also here to take on a mission?” Huang Feng asked.","“That’s right. I’m here to see if there’s a suitable mission for me,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What a coincidence. Some of us are about to take on a mission. Would you like to join with us?” Huang Feng said.","“Oh? What kind of mission it is?” Chu Yunfan asked as his eyebrows went up.","“It’s a mission issued by the Imperial Court. A true disciple of the Astral Demonites, Lone Star, is being very bold. To cultivate his demonic arts, he sneaked into Grand Xia and started a massacre, killing and injuring thousands of citizens. The infuriated Imperial Court issued this mission,” Huang Feng explained.","“And it’s not just to the Flying Celestials. The other sects and aristocratic families have also received this mission. I reckon a large number of experts are currently on their way to hunt the Lone Star down.","“The Imperial Court is offering a reward of an Evolution Pill. Whoever can capture him or kill him will be able to obtain this pill!”","Chu Yunfan frowned. Of course, he knew about the Astral Demonites. The Flying Celestials had written about this sect in the “The World.” In truth, the world was far from just Grand Xia, which was the Central Plains. Beyond the Central Plains, there was a vast territory. There were countless berserkers, sea tribes, demons, and other foreign races living out there. They were eyeing the Central Plains like tigers eyeing their prey and were Grand Xia’s greatest enemies. Among them, there were countless sects that were denounced by Grand Xia as evil, demonic, and heretical sects.","The Astral Demonites was known as the leader of the five great demonic sects. Its strength was stronger than the Flying Celestials, and the status of its true disciples was comparable to the Flying Celestials’ true disciples, experts above the Abstract Stage. Just Wang Yifan alone was enough to force Chu Yunfan to use all his trump cards. This Lone Star was probably even more difficult to deal with.","Chu Yunfan was not planning on taking on too much risk. Being brave didn’t mean that he was brainless. But when he heard about the Evolution Pill, he couldn’t remain calm.","With the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, how could he not know about the Evolution Pill? This was an extremely precious pill. Its greatest effect was to help a person undergo a complete transformation and greatly increase their strength. If a peak Interpreter consumed it, it would increase the chances of them successfully breaking through by at least 50%.","Even for existences above the Abstract Stage, the Evolution Pill could help them break through. It was an extremely precious material. Chu Yunfan knew the recipe, but it would take forever to collect all the herbs.","Chu Yunfan’s biggest shortcoming was his lack of foundation. Ordinary accumulation methods were not suitable for him. Only by making a fortune overnight could he make up for his lack of foundation to the greatest extent.","His cultivation was too strong, so it was more difficult for him to transcendent the Abstract Stage than ordinary people. Even he was not completely confident he could do it, but if he had the help of the Evolution Pill, everything would be different.","“If he’s a true disciple of the Astral Demonites, wouldn’t we be courting death?” Chu Yunfan questioned.","With the help of the Sword Light Talisman, the Mountain River Cauldron, and the hou transformation, Chu Yunfan could protect himself. But if Huang Feng went, he would surely die.","“Lone Star was met with misfortune. He crossed paths with Meng Tianren of the Virtuous Academy. It’s really unlucky. Virtuous Academy is the nemesis of these devils and heretics. Moreover, Meng Tianren is known as the strongest true disciple of Virtuous Academy. It’s said that Lone Star was severely injured by Meng Tianren and that his cultivation broke. It’s because of this that we have the chance to attack. Otherwise, how could we beat Lone Star?” Huang Feng said, “This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Are you interested, Brother Chu?”","Chu Yunfan was stunned. He didn’t expect someone else to make the first move. It was an expert from Virtuous Academy. There were records of Virtuous Academy in “The World.” It was a powerful sect ranked second among the ten great sects of Grand Xia. Its strength was much stronger than the Flying Celestials.","Due to their close relationship with Grand Xia’s Imperial Court, Virtuous Academy’s disciples monopolized the vast majority of the civil servants in the empire. As a result, this sect’s network throughout the empire was vast. Even the dukes and ministers of Grand Xia, as well as the majority of the local officials, came from the Virtuous Academy. One could imagine how terrifying this sect was.","The local officials of Grand Xia were not completely powerless. They were all top-notch martial arts experts. The stronger Grand Xia was, the more effective their cultivation would be. And the virtues they cultivated were the nemesis of evil.","Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be confident if he had to face Lone Star head-on, but if it was a Lone Star whose cultivation had been broken, that would be easy.","“Who else is on your team, Brother Huang?” Chu Yunfan was considering whether he should go with Huang Feng.","“I won’t be the one heading this mission. We’ll be going with my cousin, Huang Ling’er, and a few other seniors. If you’re interested, we can go together,” Huang Feng said.","“All right, I’ll have to trouble you to introduce me then,” Chu Yunfan said.","He didn’t know much about Grand Xia. If he didn’t have a familiar person to lead him, it would be too late by the time he arrived. Right now, there were probably people all over the world who wanted to kill Lone Star. Who knew how many people would rush over? Once they were done, there would be nothing left.","“That’s great. With you joining us, we’ll be like a tiger with wings. Follow me, Brother Chu,” Huang Feng said."]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 Everyone Has Their Own Plan","paragraphs":["5 Everyone Has Their Own Plan","Under Huang Feng’s guidance, Chu Yunfan arrived at a corner of the Merit Hall. There were four people waiting there. One was a tall and slender woman with fair skin and a delicate face. She was dressed in tight clothes and looked valiant. There was also a tall and strong man, a middle-aged man of medium height, and a man in a luxurious robe with an arrogant expression.","“Huang Feng, this person is the strong reinforcement you were looking for?” the arrogant man questioned. He glanced at Chu Yunfan and saw that Chu Yunfan had clearly just entered the Abstract Stage. His expression became a little disdainful.","“Senior Fan, he is one of the top ten inner disciples of our batch,” Huang Feng hurriedly said.","“One of the top ten? Each batch is worse than the last. A person who just stepped into the Abstract Stage managed to enter the top ten?” the arrogant man said with a faint smile.","However, the expressions of the others changed slightly. They knew very well how difficult it was for a fledgling Abstract to be one of the top ten of the Flying Celestials’ inner disciple test. After all, they all went through it, so they understood how difficult it was.","The arrogant man also understood this, but he didn’t care. So what if Chu Yunfan was a genius? In front of him, Chu Yunfan was nothing.","Huang Feng was just about to explain that Chu Yunfan had not been in the fledgling Abstract Stage when he became a seed disciple, but in the Golden Core Stage. But when he saw Chu Yunfan’s gaze, he immediately shut his mouth and said nothing.","“Since my cousin introduced him, this man must have real talent,” the woman said.","“Brother Chu, this is my cousin, Huang Ling’er, and this is Fan Shixin,” Huang Feng introduced the woman and the arrogant man. “These two are Iron Heart Tie Shixiong and Senior Zhang Yi.” He introduced the tall man and the medium-sized man.","“Greetings, Seniors.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","“Huang Feng may have introduced you, but he himself is already a burden. Let me test your capabilities.”","Iron Heart sneered and suddenly attacked. In an instant, his fist arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. His fist was powerful, but it didn’t cause a sonic boom. It was extremely fast. Like a bolt of lightning, he arrived before Chu Yunfan.","This Iron Heart’s cultivation had clearly long surpassed the Abstract Stage and had already stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan raised his hand to block the punch. His body shook slightly, and he blocked it.","Instantly, everyone had a whole new level of respect for Chu Yunfan. Iron Heart’s cultivation was already at the Abstract Observance Stage, and when this punch was thrown toward Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan was able to receive it and was not sent flying. It was not without reason that Chu Yunfan had entered the top ten and become a seed disciple.","“Not bad. You’re pretty strong. You can stay.” Iron Heart nodded, indicating that he recognized Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over the group. He discovered that among these people, the one with the highest cultivation was Fan Shixin. His cultivation had reached the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage. Next was Huang Feng’s cousin, Huang Ling’er, who was also at the late Abstract Observance Stage. The remaining Iron Heart and Zhang Yi were also at the Abstract Observance Stage.","Huang Feng himself was at the late Abstract Stage. Although he was considered great among the new inner disciples, there was still a huge gap between him and these veteran disciples.","“Not bad. I’ll let you join us.” Fan Shixin nodded.","“But let me make it clear to you that Lone Star’s life is mine. None of you are allowed to fight me for him. I’m taking the Evolution Pill. As for you, I won’t mistreat any of you. I will reward you all. If you dare to defy me, I will kill you with my own hands.” Fan Shixin sneered.","Chu Yunfan frowned and realized that this was different from what Huang Feng had said. Then, he heard Huang Feng’s telepathy. After listening to Huang Feng’s explanation, Chu Yunfan finally understood that Fan Shixin had a great background. His father was an elder of the Flying Celestials, so he had been pampered since he was young. He respected very few people.","This group of people had been hired to help Fan Shixin complete this mission. Although they would not be able to obtain the Evolution Pill, they would still be able to obtain many benefits from Elder Fang.","Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows. “Brother Huang, this isn’t right. This is different from what you told me.”","“Brother Chu, this is the best result we can hope for. There are many people watching Lone Star. Aside from us, there are many people from other sects chasing after him. With our cultivation, we have no chance of winning.” Huang Feng smiled bitterly and begged for mercy. He was relieved that Chu Yunfan did not turn hostile on the spot.","Of course, Chu Yunfan did not turn hostile. However, he made up his mind. When the time came, he would not give up Lone Star. This concerned whether he could transcend the Abstract Stage or not, and this was a mission issued by the Imperial Court. If one wanted to be conferred the title of Marquis or Minister, they would have to rely on the accumulation of such contributions.","Although Fan Shixin had agreed to his participation, Chu Yunfan could clearly feel the hostility in his eyes. Chu Yunfan didn’t know what he was plotting. Although it was only for a moment, Chu Yunfan still caught it.","“Since none of you have anything to say, let’s set off. It’s better to be early than late,” Fan Shixin said.","The group Merit Hall. Upon exiting, Fan Shixin waved toward the sky and a flying warship appeared. This ship shone with golden light and was engraved with countless runes. It looked very powerful and was clearly a high-grade magic treasure.","“Let’s go. This is my airship. It’s much faster than flying on your own,” Fan Shixin said as he jumped in.","Chu Yunfan and the others did not hesitate and immediately followed.","With a wave of Fan Shixin’s hand, the airship turned into a beam of light and flew into the distance. In the blink of an eye, it had disappeared."]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 Sierra Holy Demon","paragraphs":["6 Sierra Holy Demon","Not long after Chu Yunfan and the others left, Wang Yifan was sitting on a throne in a hall in the East District’s Startling Cloud Peak. A stream of light flew past and landed in his hand. It was a jade slip used for communication.","“Chu Yunfan, I don’t believe that Yi Yunyao can protect you forever!” He sneered. “This time, I will kill you.”","Not long after, a few Flying Celestial disciples in moon-white robes strode in.","Wang Yifan commanded, “Collect Chu Yunfan’s head. I want everyone to know the consequences of offending me. If you do well, I will reward you handsomely.”","He had no intentions of attacking personally. Chu Yunfan was an ant that did not qualify for him to attack personally. If not for Yi Yunyao, Chu Yunfan would not even be enough to make him look sideways.","The Flying Celestial disciples revealed happy smiles. They knew that Wang Yifan had always been generous. Even if it wasn’t something very important to him, it was precious to them. As for Chu Yunfan, they had already heard some things. Although he had caused Wang Yifan to back down, Chu Yunfan was only a disciple who had just entered the sect. Without Yi Yunyao’s protection, Chu Yunfan was nothing.","“We will bring back his head, Senior Wang.”","Everyone promised.","***","An endless strong wind blew and a streak of light flashed in the sky. Upon closer inspection, there was an extremely gorgeous airship.","On the airship, Fan Shixin and the others stood on the bow. Chu Yunfan stood behind them with his eyes closed. He was making full use of his time to cultivate. He had broken through to the Abstract Stage, but such strength was not considered outstanding in the Flying Celestials. The battle between Wang Yifan and Yi Yunyao had shown him the cruel nature of the Flying Celestials. It was a society where the strong preyed on the weak. The beauty on the surface could not hide the cruel competition within.","And a core disciple like Wang Yifan was shouting to kill him. If he didn’t have Yi Yunyao’s support, even if Wang Yifan killed him, who would stand up for him?","Strength. Only with sufficient strength could one stand firm in this world.","Moreover, Tang Siyu was still waiting for him to find her.","Soon, a dark cloud appeared before everyone’s eyes. The strange thing was that this dark cloud sealed the distant world. It was not just hanging on the horizon.","“That’s demonic energy.” Fan Shixin narrowed his eyes.","“That’s right. He really fled to this place.” Huang Ling’er nodded. “There aren’t many places in Grand Xia that have demonic energy. Lone Star was severely injured by Meng Tianren and urgently needed to replenish his demonic energy. Someone saw him hiding in this Sierra Holy Demon.”","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. Although he had never been here before, he was not unfamiliar with this place. He had read about the Sierra Holy Demon in “The World.” This was an area that was shrouded in endless demonic energy all year round. No one knew how it was formed. In legends passed down by the elders, a great demon was once buried here. It was said that it had a certain relationship with the Holy Demon Cult.","For some unknown reason, the demonic energy here lingered all year round. Grand Xia had attacked this place several times to dispel the demonic energy. After all, although demonic energy was a great tonic for martial artists who cultivated the demonic path, it was harmful to other martial artists and creatures. However, they never succeeded. Grand Xia kept this a secret and did not seem willing to mention it. There was not much record in the official information.","Everyone knew that Sierra Holy Demon was extremely dangerous. It was said that someone had seen the figure of a terrifying creature flying into the depths of Sierra Holy Demon but nobody had been able to verify this.","Grand Xia had set up a barrier here. Because of this, the demonic energy did not spread out and there was no way to remove it. Grand Xia could only choose to ignore it.","“Don’t worry. It’s just rumors. If there really was a monster, the Imperial Court would’ve sent experts to deal with it. Moreover, we’re not going deep inside. Lone Star is heavily injured. He shouldn’t be able to run far.” Fan Shixin looked confident.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t worried. For others, demonic energy was harmful, but to him, it didn’t matter. He knew the Celestial Devouring Art and could refine demonic energy for his own use. He was not afraid of the corrosion of the demonic energy.","The airship quickly sped through the sky and plunged into the demonic energy dark clouds. Chu Yunfan noticed that a golden barrier had risen around the airship. As soon as they entered the range of Sierra Holy Demon, countless demonic energy surged over crazily as if they had intelligence. It looked like they wanted to erode these golden barriers.","“Hold on!” Fan Shixin shouted and turned the airship without warning. It was clear that he was a little distressed about letting the airship fight against the demonic energy.","The arrays and barriers carved on the airship were extremely rare. Without their protection, everyone would succumb to the endless demonic energy covering the sky and earth. Everyone raised their protective energy shields and protected themselves. In the pitch-black darkness, the energy shields made them look like small suns.","Chu Yunfan was the last to act. He pretended to put up an energy shield, but he was secretly using the Celestial Devouring Art to absorb the demonic energy. In this pitch-black environment, no one noticed his strange behavior."]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 Breaking Off From the Team","paragraphs":["7 Breaking Off From the Team","‘What dense demonic energy.’","Everyone’s eyes were like torches. Although it was pitch-black, the light emitted by their energy shields allowed them to see some of their surroundings.","They had landed in a mountain range. This place, under the influence of the demonic energy, was like a demon domain. It was completely different from the environment in other parts of Grand Xia.","Suddenly, a black shadow flashed past. Before anyone spotted it, the shadow pounced toward the group. A sharp claw swept over and attacked everyone.","“You’re courting death!” Fan Shixin shouted.","The divine power in his body surged. In an instant, actually turned into a light that filled the sky. Only then did everyone finally see what it was. It was a dried corpse.","The most terrifying thing was that this corpse was wearing the moon-white robe of the Flying Celestials. This corpse had been a disciple of the Flying Celestials when it was alive.","Its sharp claws landed on Fan Shixin and tore through his energy shield. Fortunately, everyone reacted at this moment and hurriedly attacked the corpse.","Bam!","The dried corpse exploded.","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief.","“This was a Flying Celestial disciple. Looks like this person came here in pursuit of Lone Star and was killed. Through the effects of demonic energy, he turned into an undead,” Huang Ling’er said.","“That’s right, that’s very possible. It’s also possible that they weren’t here to hunt down Lone Star. Countless people have died here over the years,” Zhang Yi said.","Everyone thought of a terrifying possibility. They thought that Sierra Holy Demon was unsuitable for living creatures and so assumed there were no other dangers here aside from Lone Star. They realized now that they had probably underestimated this mountain range. Just the corpses that had turned into undead were extremely terrifying.","“Perfect!” Fan Shixin grinned and pointed at Chu Yunfan. “You, go ahead and scout the area.”","“Why?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“We’re stronger than you. If you refuse to go, you can die here right now.” Fan Shixin sneered.","Chu Yunfan realized that Fan Shixin had changed his mind and brought along someone he thought was a burden because he had planned to let Chu Yunfan be cannon fodder.","Iron Heart and Zhang Yi had surrounded Chu Yunfan. They looked like they would kill him if he didn’t cooperate.","“You guys are too much. I invited Brother Chu to come with us. How am I supposed to live with myself after this?” Huang Feng said.","“Shut up. You have no right to speak here. If it wasn’t for Huang Ling’er, I wouldn’t have brought you along either. You better listen to me or I will kill you too.” Fan Shixin sneered. His expression was incomparably cold.","“Fine, I’ll do it,” Chu Yunfan said lightly. No one noticed that his eyes flashed with a sharp killing intent.","His father was an elder, the ruling class of the Flying Celestials. He had seen this beating a stick and giving a carrot method many times and was very familiar with them.","Chu Yunfan wordlessly walked ahead of the group. Huang Feng wanted to say something but Huang Ling’er stopped him. The team continued forward in this awkward atmosphere. Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and disappeared into the demonic energy.","“D*mn it! He’s trying to run!”","Fan Shixin immediately attacked. He had been guarding against Chu Yunfan’s possible escape, so he showed no mercy and swept out a sword light. However, there was only a sound of metal colliding. Chu Yunfan did not budge even a little before he disappeared into the demonic energy. They could only vaguely see a bronze cauldron floating above his head.","“D*mn it! He escaped!” Fan Shixin gritted his teeth.","Chu Yunfan dared to run away from him and succeeded. To Fan Shixin, this was a great humiliation.","“It’s fine. The Sierra Holy Demon is filled with dangers. If he had obediently scouted for us, he might still have a chance of survival. The only thing that awaits him now is death.” Iron Heart sneered. “With so many of us together, we can barely protect ourselves. How long can a new Abstract like him last in this place? I’m afraid he’ll soon become one of the corpses on the ground.”","“That’s right. If he were smart, he would have known to cooperate with us obediently. He thinks he has escaped, but he just ran toward his death.” Zhang Yi nodded.","Fan Shixin’s face revealed a bit of pride. “Forget him. We need to find Lone Star as soon as possible. As for Chu Yunfan, he’s dead. What kind of seed genius is he? Only those who can survive can be called geniuses. Those who die halfway are all fools.”","Among the crowd, only Huang Feng looked depressed. He felt that he had been used. But among these people, he did not even have the right to speak. He knew that what Fan Shixin and the other two said was right. In this environment, where demonic energy lingered everywhere and dried corpses were everywhere, Chu Yunfan was basically dead if on his own.","He felt a little regretful that Chu Yunfan had to die here before he could display his talent. However, this was a common occurrence for Grand Xia. Every day, countless geniuses were born and countless geniuses died.","“Let’s hurry up and find Lone Star. I want his head and the Evolution Pill,” Fan Shixin said."]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 Slaughter in the Darkness, Annihilating a Whole Team","paragraphs":["8 Slaughter in the Darkness, Annihilating a Whole Team","Everyone continued to move forward. None of them noticed that in the darkness, a pair of eyes were staring at them. This person was none other than Chu Yunfan. He sneered as he watched the group leave, then came out of the Mountain River Diagram. Fan Shixin’s sword had hit the Cauldron of Mountain River Cauldron, but it didn’t land on him.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","These people thought he was dead for sure. They didn’t know that to him, this environment was no different from the Central Plains, which was filled with spirit energy. He could use all kinds of energy with the Celestial Devouring Art and refine it for his use. Whether it was demonic energy or spirit energy, they were all the same.","He was like a fish in water in any environment.","But before Chu Yunfan could follow after Fan Shixin’s group, another group suddenly shuttled through the dense demonic energy. He took a closer look. It was another group of disciples wearing moon-white robes.","With a flash, Chu Yunfan disappeared from where he was and entered the Mountain River Diagram. He could see that it was a group from the Flying Celestials. The leader of the group was a square-faced man.","He walked over, then wondered aloud in puzzlement, “Are you sure about this? This is where Chu Yunfan disappeared?”","“Yes. The tracking talisman that Senior Wang gave us should be able to track Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts,” another disciple answered.","‘Ah, they’re here for me.’","Chu Yunfan didn’t have to think much to guess who this Senior Wang they were talking about was. Other than Wang Yifan, there was no one else. Yi Yunyao had said before that she couldn’t protect him forever. The moment Chu Yunfan left the Flying Celestials, he would undoubtedly become Wang Yifan’s target. Unless he never left the sect, Wang Yifan would think of ways to eliminate him. He had to increase his strength as soon as possible to deal with Wang Yifan.","From what Wang Yifan’s lackey’s were saying, Wang Yifan must have left something on him. Otherwise, how could these people use the tracking talisman and track him all the way here?","Chu Yunfan spread out his divine will and checked on every cell in his body. A moment later, he found a wisp of Wang Yifan’s divine will attached to his clothes. The wisp of divine will was so small that if Chu Yunfan had not been looking with a fine-toothed comb, he would have missed it.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. None of these core disciples were simple. Even someone like Wang Yifan, who seemed to be shouting and killing at every turn, was meticulous when doing things.","He didn’t even notice when Wang Yifan had planted this divine will. It was small, so small that it could not even form a consciousness. But if it was just for tracking, it was more than enough.","However, these people found that they could not sense that divine will wisp. Chu Yunfan, who had entered the Mountain River Diagram, was no longer in this dimension, so they naturally could not sense the divine will wisp.","“He shouldn’t have gone far. We have to take his head and get the reward from Senior Wang,’ someone said.","“If we have time, we might even be able to track down Lone Star. It seems like everyone is looking for him right now,” another disciple said.","Thinking of the Evolution Pill, everyone’s expression changed. To them, the Evolution Pill was like a legendary divine pill. Without this pill, it was impossible for them to become true disciples in their lifetime. But with the help of the Evolution Pill, they could become true disciples.","True disciples and inner disciples were completely different. One was the ruling class, and the other was the ruled class. The inner disciples were only the reserve force of the Flying Celestials, while the true disciples were the backbone of the sect. They were like the elders of the younger generations and had great power.","Suddenly, just as they were imagining the future, a sword light appeared in the sky.","Slice!","One of the disciples was caught off guard and was slashed in half by the sword.","“What the?!” The square-faced leader jumped in shock.","Everyone instantly tensed up and their divine wills swept out. Although they were quickly corroded by the demonic energy, they could not sense anyone. It was not accurate to say that they were unprepared. Their divine wills had been constantly scanning the surrounding situation. There was no danger in their perception, but the danger was right in front of them.","It was right beside them and caught them off guard.","Just as they were on high alert, they saw another sword light slash down from the sky. It was lightning fast and cut another disciple in half. Everyone was shocked. They circulated their divine power and put up their energy shields.","In the endless darkness, a powerful enemy was spying on them. If they were in the outside world, where there was plenty of sunlight, they would not have been ambushed so easily. But it was different here. Not only was the demonic energy blocking their vision, but it also blocked their divine wills, turning them blind.","“Come out if you have the guts! What kind of person sneaks around?!” one of the disciples shouted. But just as he finished his sentence, a sword light appeared out of thin air and pierced his throat.","“There!” the leader shouted and punched out a huge hurricane in the direction of the sword light. However, there was no one there.","Everyone was terrified. If they could see the enemy, no matter how powerful they were, they would not be so afraid. But this enemy was invisible and untouchable. As they thought of the many legends about the Sierra Holy Demon, they felt their hair stand on end.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","Sword light continuously flashed across the sky, and these people were slaughtered in a matter of seconds. Even the square-faced leader was no exception. He didn’t even have the chance to display his Void Observance Stage cultivation before dying to the sword light."]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 Astral Demon","paragraphs":["9 Astral Demon","The massacre in the darkness went of for a while. Those who came to kill Chu Yunfan all died at his hands. Until their deaths, they didn’t know that the person who killed them was their target, Chu Yunfan.","They all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. To them, this was a dangerous place, but to Chu Yunfan was like a fish in a water here.","After killing all of them, Chu Yunfan reappeared in the air. His face was expressionless as he placed the corpses of these people into the Mountain River Diagram. If these corpses weren’t dealt with, given the density of the demonic energy here, it wouldn’t take long for them to turn into undead. To be used to water Chu Yunfan’s Brahma Tree was considered a good last use.","“Wang Yifan, huh? One day, I will cut off your head.” Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold.","To others, Wang Yifan was a high and mighty true disciple, an existence that ordinary people could not even imagine. But to Chu Yunfan, he was just a small stumbling block on his endless martial path. If he couldn’t even deal with Wang Yifan, how could he reach enlightenment?","Chu Yunfan glanced around. Although that incident had only been a short moment, he had lost track of Huang Feng and the others. This forced him to give up on tracking Fan Shixin for the time being.","Fan Shixin had tricked him into coming here to be cannon fodder. If he was slightly weaker, he would have really become cannon fodder.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t in a hurry. Like a fish in water, he absorbed the demonic energy and turning it into his own power. At the same time, he charged toward the intermediate Abstract Stage. Although he had just stepped into the Abstract Stage, his foundation was extremely firm. It was firmer than anyone elses’. He did not have to worry about his foundation being unstable, so he could continue to break through.","Along the way, he scouted the area and occasionally encountered some undead. These were the experts who had died here. They were not very powerful and were no match for Chu Yunfan. He easily killed them one after another.","The closer he got to the center of the Sierra Holy Demon, the more Chu Yunfan felt an extreme danger. He could hear fainte roars coming from the center of the Sierra Holy Demon. It seemed to be the roar of some terrifying beast.","Sometimes, Chu Yunfan could even feel the ground trembling. It was caused by large creatures passing by. Thinking of this, he sucked in a breath of cold air. The records of the Sierra Holy Demon in “The World” were vague, and much of it was only brief mentions. This itself was strange. Although “The World” only gave a rough introduction to this place, the situation was still very strange. And these experts who died here inexplicably, could they really not have resisted the corrosion of the demonic energy and died?","It was probably not that simple.","‘Is there really a legendary demonic creature in the center of the mountain range?’ Chu Yunfan thought of the many legends about the Sierra Holy Demon. Someone had once seen an extremely terrifying figure here. Although it was only a glimpse, it had completely frightened them.","Chu Yunfan decided to be more careful. But even so, these undead couldn’t do anything to him. Soon, he realized something strange. These undead seemed to be moving in the same direction as if summoned by something.","‘If these undead were not born only because of the demonic energy, but also because they have a certain level of intelligence or if someone is controlling them from behind, then everything makes sense.’ Chu Yunfan felt that this would explain everything. All the unreasonable things he had seen before could be explained. ‘But if that’s the case, why are all these undead scattered all over the Sierra Holy Demon heading toward one place?’","He could clearly sense demonic shadows flying in a certain direction. ‘Unless there’s something ahead that requires them to rush over to fight or protect. If someone is controlling these undead from behind, then they might be going to that person.’","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up as if he had suddenly thought of something. He felt like he had come to understand something. Like his feet had a mind of its own, they sprinted in the direction of the undead and followed them closely.","Soon, a huge basin appeared ahead. To be precise, it was not a basin, but a pool. It was filled with a black liquid—condensed demonic energy. The demonic energy in the Sierra Holy Demon was already very dense, but the demonic energy in this pool was clearly more than ten times denser. It had even turned into a viscous liquid.","The liquid demonic energy filled the pool and surged like boiling water.","There was a gigantic demon sitting in the center of the pool. It had a green face and sharp fangs. It also had wings and was covered in pitch-black scales. Its eyes were red, and it looked to be more than 30 meters tall. It was extremely huge.","“It’s an astral demon!”","These beings once invaded the human world, but they were defeated and forced to withdraw from the human world. It was rare to see such demons in this world in this day and age."]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 The Heart of the Sky Demon","paragraphs":["0 The Heart of the Sky Demon","Back during the Ancient Zenith Civilization, humanity had developed into an extremely prosperous period. They had invaded other dimensions, and one of them was called the Demon Realm. This realm was different from other realms. It had no spirit energy and was instead filled with demonic energy.","And this realm was occupied by demons of every kind. The most famous of them all were the sky demons. They were the representative of all demonkind.","When the Demon Realm was discovered, a long war between humans and demons began. Both sides became entangled, and the existence of demons became present through the entire history of mankind ever since.","The roots of the demonic path that was now popular came from the demons. There were differences between the humans and demons. Some people could not resist the enticement of the demons and willingly degenerated into pawns, becoming something known as human-demons.","These human-demons served as the vanguard of the demons’ attack on humans. They were called mad dogs. When the demons retreated to the Demon Realm, the human-demons took the opportunity to become independent and established their own race to cause trouble.","On another hand, some mighty figures among the humans willingly walked the demonic path when the human world was in its most dangerous time to find out the secrets of the demons. They gave up the cultivation of spirit energy and specialized in cultivating demonic energy. They opened up a completely different path from the cultivation of spirit energy. This then gave birth to many sects.","These were two completely different demonic paths, and they were the two main streams at present.","It had been many years since a real demon was seen. During the ancient war, the connection between the Demon Realm and the human world had been exiled into the endless void. In addition to the continuous encirclement and suppression of Grand Xia over the years, it was rare to see pure demons in this world.","Chu Yunfan could see that this demon was emaciated. All the muscles and skin on the demon’s body was flabby. Even the luster of his scales had disappeared.","This was clearly an old sky demon. Although the lifespan of a sky demon was far longer than that of ordinary human martial art practitioners, they would eventually die of old age.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood that these wandering undead were being controlled by this old sky demon. These undead had received a distress signal sent by the sky demon and rushed here to frantically to protect it.","Around the demonic energy pool were thousands of figures. Each of these figures was an expert at the Abstract Stage or above. There were a few Abstracts, but most of them were in the Void Observance Stage. Some were even in the Void Interpretation Stage.","And these experts were crazily attacking the sky demon, but they were held back by countless undead.","Everyone wanted to take down the sky demon. Aside from the demons and humans being mortal enemies, the sky demon had something humans coveted—the heart of a sky demon.","The demon’s heart was the source of all the demonic power in the sky demon’s body. It was an extremely precious material. But a sky demon was at least an existence that surpassed the Abstract Stage. They were top-tier demons. If this sky demon was at its peak, these people would not dare to be so impudent. But since this sky demon was old, it was a different matter.","Many people were ecstatic because they never expected to come across such a fortuitous encounter when they had come here to kill Lone Star. A sky demon heart was an extremely pure energy core. For humans, even if they could only convert and use a small portion of the energy, it would allow their cultivation to advance one step further. Chu Yunfan was naturally very clear about this, even more so than most people.","He looked around and soon found Fan Shixin and the others. As expected, they had also found the sky demon. They were killing the undead that were crazily attacking them.","They were surrounded by danger, but to obtain the sky demon heart, everyone was not afraid of danger and attacked with all their might. These were all experts at the Void Observance Stage, or even the Void Interpretation Stage. Even in the Flying Celestials, they were considered seed disciples, and were completely different from ordinary inner disciples. They were the future true disciples, and their status could not be mentioned in the same breath as inner disciples. In the absence of true disciples, they could be considered important figures in a region. However, they could be seen almost everywhere here.","It was unknown how many Interpreters there were. At least a hundred of them were at Interpreters, and the rest were at the Observers. Ordinary Voids like Huang Feng were extremely rare.","‘There are so many people fighting for the sky demon heart.’ Chu Yunfan’s expression turned cold. He wanted to fight for the sky demon heart too, but there were too many competitors. If he had the heart, he was confident that he could make a Sky Demon Pill specially made by an Alchemy Emperor. It would not be difficult for his cultivation to advance further.","Right now, Chu Yunfan did not have the luxury of time. If he could speed up his cultivation, he would not hesitate.","“If I use the proper method, I won’t have to share the sky demon heart.”","Chu Yunfan had many trump cards. He had the hou transformation, the Sword Light Talisman, the Mountain River Cauldron, and so on. He had both offense and defense. However, there was a time limit and his items were limited. When dealing with a single person, he was naturally invincible. But against so many experts, it was unlikely that he would succeed.","‘In that case, I’ll use my wits,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","With a flash, he rushed straight into the sky demon pool. No one noticed this change. On the one hand, Chu Yunfan had hidden himself too well, and on the other hand, no one should be hiding here because the demonic energy here was so dense that it was terrifying.","The protective energy shield of an ordinary Abstract would be completely eroded in an instant. Then, they would either be invaded by the demonic energy and turn into a human-demon or die. But for Chu Yunfan, this was like a fish in water.","He continued to circulate the Celestial Devouring Art and continuously absorbed the liquid demonic energy. His cultivation advanced by leaps and bounds, at least ten times faster than when he absorbed ordinary demonic energy.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan was getting closer and closer to the sky demon."]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 Lone Star Appears, Everyone Is in Danger","paragraphs":["1661 Lone Star Appears, Everyone Is in Danger","Just as Chu Yunfan was hiding at the bottom of the sky demon Pool and absorbing demonic energy to cultivate, experts appeared in the sky. The thousands of experts from all over Grand Xia had broken through the obstruction of the undead, flying in the direction of the sky demon.","This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, especially so when many people had encountered bottlenecks in their cultivation. Without a doubt, this was their chance to break through that bottleneck.","Rumble!","These experts attacked one after another. Terrifying attacks shook the sky and earth, and all of them landed on the sky demon. The sky demon’s eyes blazed as her stared at these humans. With a wave of his hand, he crushed all of these attacks.","If the sky demon was at his peak, he would not care about these ant-like humans. However, the heavens were unforgiving. Even with the lifespan of a sky demon, it was time for him to die.","The sky demon pool was supposed to be its burial ground. Who knew that when he was about to die, a group of humans who coveted its heart would come?","This made the sky demon extremely furious.","“D*mned humans! Even if I’m not at the peak, I’m not someone you ants can contend against1”","The sky demon opened his bloody mouth and countless flames shot out, burning the entire world. Some of the experts who were flying at the front were burned and instantly turned into ashes.","“Be careful, everyone. This sky demon is clearly trying to regain his last breath. We can’t let him succeed.”","An expert of Grand Xia shouted. A mirror appeared in his hand. Raging flames surged out of the mirror and landed on the sky demon. However, it was unable to penetrate the sky demon’s defenses.","The others knew they were facing a great enemy. They took out all kinds of magic treasures and divine powers, which broadened Chu Yunfan’s horizons. However, these attacks were clearly unable to do anything to this sky demon. With a wave of his hand, the sky demon crushed these attacks in the air with a claw.","Rumble!","Everyone’s attacks were in full swing. Facing this sky demon, everyone went crazy and attacked the sky demon, to which the latter was frantically counterattacking. Every second, someone was knocked out of the sky and fell beside the sky demon pool like a stone.","But the sky demon was old. More and more wounds appeared on his body, and blood kept flowing out. It was clear that he could not hold out for long.","He was already on the verge of death. Erupting with such combat strength was a desperate move. The sky demon was exhausting his life. After this battle, whether he was willing or not, he would perish.","The sky demon’s attacks became more and more frenzied. More and more people died at his hands, but many more felt excited because they knew that the sky demon would soon die, and the sky demon heart they longed for would soon be in their hands.","In just a short time, more than half of the experts had suffered heavy casualties. Moreover, the Interpreters, who had rushed ahead and at the same time the strongest, had been completely wiped out. They had been the sky demon’s main targets. Every second, someone would die at the hands of the sky demon.","And just as those Observers were planning to fight to the death, this incomparably enormous sky demon collapsed, and its enormous body started withering. This was the symptom of its powers being completely drained. The sky demon had burned his life force, and the backlash had taken away his life force in an instant.","The sky demon’s body landed in the sky demon pool.","“The sky demon’s heart is mine!”","An Observer that was closest rushed to the side of the sky demon’s corpse and grabbed at the sky demon’s heart. His face was filled with uncontrollable joy. No one had expected the sky demon to fall so easily. There was no sign at all, and the sky demon was almost impossible to stop.","Suddenly, a stream of light came from afar and transformed into a streak of starlight that blasted at this Observer. The body of this Observer cracked open in an instant.","“I’m sorry, but the heart is mine.”","Following a cold voice, a handsome man dressed in black with a hint of yin energy dashed in front of everyone.","“Lone Star! You actually dare to appear?!”","Someone in the crowd immediately recognized the man. He was the person they were pursuing, Lone Star.","At the thought of this, everyone’s spirits were lifted, and the divine power in their bodies followed suit, ready to attack at any time. The person right in front of them was Lone Star.","Although Lone Star had only become famous within Grand Xia recently, his name had already spread throughout the entire empire. He was a true disciple of Astral Demonites. His cultivation was unfathomable, and he was good at dodging. Even if everyone wanted to kill him, they could not defeat him, and those who could defeat him could not find him.","For a time, there were even people who were unaware of the situation calling him the number one expert among the younger generation of Astral Demonites. When Meng Tianren attacked, he had injured Lone Star, causing him to flee in a sorry state.","However, everyone knew very well that it was not because Lone Star was weak. It was that Meng Tianren was strong. He was the number one genius of the Virtuous Academy. In the history of the Virtuous Academy, there was no one who had such a talent in martial arts. He was known as the existence most likely to reach enlightenment in the future.","This was made everyone curious. How did Lone Star escape from Meng Tianren?","According to the rumors, Lone Star should have been a lamp that had run out of oil. However, that was not the case. On the contrary, he seemed to be in high spirits. Although everyone had come to encircle and annihilate him, none of them had the intention to fight him to the death.","However, they were soon shocked to discover that all the Interpreters had died at the hands of that sky demon. The rest of them might not be a match for Lone Star.","Everyone was in danger!"]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 Lone Star Is Furious at the Opportunist","paragraphs":["1662 Lone Star Is Furious at the Opportunist","A cold smile appeared on Lone Star’s face. The injuries on his body were not as serious as expected. In other words, he had recovered a lot in such a short time.","Everyone had seen Lone Star being severely injured by Meng Tianren with their own eyes. He was in a very sorry state, and he was only left with one breath to escape. Otherwise, these people wouldn’t have the guts to find trouble with him.","Who would have thought that he had reserved more strength than they had originally expected. They were no forced into a corner.","“You lot want to kill me? I’ll kill all of you!” Lone Star laughed, his eyes flashing with a blood-red light. In his eyes, everyone here would become his food and speed up his recovery.","Meng Tianren’s attack had been too shocking, and even now, he could still feel the faint pain from his wounds. The majority of the mana in his body was used to suppress his injuries and prevent them from worsening. Otherwise, how could these mere Interpreters and Observers be his match? There would have been no need for him to set up a trap to lure them over.","Yes, this was his trap from the very beginning. He had infiltrated Grand Xia for a very long time and had long discovered this dying sky demon. Now, he could use these people to let him benefit from the fight.","“There are so many of us here. Why should we be afraid of him? Kill him and we’ll get the Evolution Pill!” someone shouted.","But the moment his voice fell, he was strangled by the neck. His neck had been grabbed by a powerful palm. Everyone’s vision blurred. Lone Star, who had been in front of them, had disappeared.","Lone Star was standing before the person who had spoken and was lifting him up high. The man struggled, but the divine power in his body could not be condensed.","“An Evolution Pill? Tsk tsk, even I’m a little tempted. I want to chop off my head to exchange for the Evolution Pill.” Lone Star clicked his tongue in wonder.","Evolution Pills were extremely attractive to Abstracts, and it was also very useful to him.","Bang!","While Lone Star was speaking, he grabbed the person’s head with his palm. The person’s entire head was crushed, and red and white liquid sprayed out.","Everyone froze. Only now did they remember that even though Lone Star’s cultivation was not as good as before, he was still a true disciple of Astral Demonites.","True disciples who grew up in an environment where everyone was hostile and killed each other were even more terrifying than the true disciples of the ten great sects in terms of ruthlessness and difficulty.","Lone Star licked his lips and swallowed the brain matter that had splattered onto his face. At the same time, waves of demonic energy radiated from his body. In a moment, this person was sucked dry.","Everyone could clearly sense that the aura on Lone Star’s body had become a little stronger. It was clear that he relied on absorbing the essence of this Observer to heal his injuries.","Everyone wanted to run, but Lone Star’s divine will had locked onto all of them. Although his cultivation level had temporarily fallen, the methods he used in the past were not something that these people present could compare to.","“Let’s take him down!”","Everyone knew that if they didn’t give it their best shot, they would be defeated by Lone Star one by one. There were more undead coming from afar, and they had completely surrounded the outside. It was impossible for them to escape quickly.","All kinds of terrifying attacks landed on Lone Star, but he reacted quickly. In the blink of an eye, he had started killing. When these Observers who were usually considered to be illustrious faced him, they were unable to retaliate. More than half of them were massacred in an instant.","These people had nowhere to retreat to, and they all erupted with their powerful strength. However, against Lone Star, they were unable to withstand a single blow. At this moment, Lone Star displayed his overwhelming strength, which was truly terrifying to the extreme.","“You can’t kill me! My father is an elder!”","Fan Shixin watched in horror as Lone Star killed the others and charged straight at him. But as soon as he finished speaking, he realized that a demonic claw had pierced through his body and crushed his heart.","Fan Shixin’s body turned into dust and scattered as his blood was sucked dry.","The remaining Tie Xinnan and Zhang Yi wanted to escape, but they were too late and were killed as well.","“Come at me!” Huang Feng glared at Lone Star.","Lone Star was simply terrifying. Huang Feng felt a strong sense of oppression, and it was difficult for him to even move.","‘Is this what a true top-notch expert looks like?’ Huang Feng wondered.","This was the first time he had felt so close to death. Under the pressure of Lone Star’s aura, it was difficult for him to even move. It was different from the time when he met Li Qianyuan.","Li Qianyuan was ten times more terrifying than Lone Star. However, Li Qianyuan’s target was not him. He was just swept away, and the distance was so far that it did not suffocate him.","Huang Feng now realized how terrifying one above the Abstract Stage was. He instantly thought of Chu Yunfan. The opponent that Chu Yunfan faced was Li Qianyuan. He didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it. Not only did he not die, but he was also able to severely injure Li Qianyuan.","It was funny that he had thought Li Qianyuan was just all-show. Thinking back, he had been too naive.","Suddenly, a figure flew out from the bottom of the sky demon pool, and a shocking sword light slashed down from the sky. Lone Star did not even look at it as he raised his hand and crushed the sword light. He turned his gaze over and saw a young man in a moon-white robe coming to the side of the sky demon’s corpse and putting it away.","“You’re courting death!”","Lone Star’s eyes burst out with a sharp light. He thought that he was the fisherman who benefited from the fight between the snipe and clam. Who knew that there was actually a hunter hiding behind the fisherman?","This person had taken away the fruits of his painstaking planning!","Immediately, Lone Star couldn’t be bothered to deal with Huang Feng anymore. He chased after the young man in the moon-white robe.","The young man in the moon-white robe turned around and fled into the distance. He soared like a dragon and descended like a phoenix, disappearing into the layers of demonic fog.","Lone Star followed closely behind and chased after him."]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 Surrender? Fat Chance","paragraphs":["1663 Surrender? Fat Chance","“W-We’re saved!”","Huang Feng heaved a sigh of relief. At this moment, he realized that his back was completely drenched in sweat. He felt as if he had just walked through the gates of hell. There was not a single bit of pride in his heart.","Originally, Huang Feng was somewhat proud of himself. After all, the Flying Celestials was one of the top ten sects in the world. Even if he was just an inner disciple, it was already more awe-inspiring than some of the sect leaders of small sects. If he could become a true disciple, he would be able to stand on equal footing with the sect leaders of some medium-sized sects.","However, he now truly understood how big the gap between him and these top-notch experts was. They were simply not on the same level. He only had the possibility of becoming a true disciple, while these people were already high and mighty true disciples. It seemed like they were only one step away, but in reality, the difference was like heaven and earth.","Huang Ling’er was panting heavily, her chest rising and falling. Her delicate face was flushed red. Escaping from the hands of the grim reaper had affected her greatly.","Death had never gotten so close to her before.","“Was that Chu Yunfan?” Huang Ling’er said in shock.","“I think so,” Huang Feng said after some thought. He smiled bitterly, especially thinking that Fan Shixin and the others had wanted to use Chu Yunfan as cannon fodder. In the end, he and Huang Ling’er were saved because of Chu Yunfan.","This was what people called fate.","Huang Feng and Huang Ling’er looked at each other. They understood why Chu Yunfan had only come out at this time and hadn’t attacked before. He had probably wanted to kill Fan Shixin a long time ago, so he had only attacked after watching Lone Star kill Fan Shixin.","However, they had nothing to say. After all, Chu Yunfan could have watched them get killed by Lone Star, but he didn’t do so. He had even done his best for them.","“We’re saved. How is Lone Star so terrifying?”","The remaining survivors heaved a sigh of relief. Originally, there were thousands of people here. However, after the old sky demon and Lone Star’s terrifying slaughter, there were less than two hundred people left.","They were in a state of shock. Everyone had come with the intention of taking Lone Star’s head in exchange for an Evolution Pill. Who knew that they would be killed by Lone Star like cutting grass?","At this moment, they finally understood how ridiculous their previous thoughts were. They wanted to scheme against others, but in the end, Lone Star had schemed against them.","“Let’s go. Who knows when that person will be killed!” someone shouted.","Everyone immediately scattered like birds and beasts. Although they were no match for Lone Star, the undead surrounding them could not stop them from escaping.","In the end, only Huang Feng and Huang Ling’er were left.","“I wish Chu Yunfan won’t have to die.” Huang Ling’er sighed.","“I don’t think he will,” Huang Feng said.","“You think he’ll survive?” Huang Ling’er looked at Huang Feng doubtfully. She didn’t know why he would suddenly say such a thing.","“He won’t just not die. Chu Yunfan is the most mysterious person I’ve ever met. He comes from the Violet Thunder Prefecture, but he has a shocking inheritance. He’s not an ordinary person. On top of that, I have a feeling that when he attacked, he was just trying to lure Lone Star away to save us. He has many other means.”","As Huang Feng spoke, he laughed. He felt that this idea sounded ridiculous. How could Chu Yunfan be a match for Lone Star? It was already difficult for him to escape from Lone Star, not to mention killing Lone Star. That was simply impossible.","However, Huang Feng felt that it was very possible. He had only known Chu Yunfan for a short time, but Chu Yunfan gave him an unfathomable feeling. Many times, he thought that Chu Yunfan was dead for sure, but Chu Yunfan had pulled off one astonishing counterattacks after another, completely exceeding everyone’s expectations.","Huang Ling’er did not know where Huang Feng’s confidence came from, but she nodded and said, “Perhaps, but whatever the case, we shouldn’t linger here.”","She too had noticed that Chu Yunfan had been a little strange, but at this time, the undead flew over and surrounded the two of them.","“Yeah, let’s leave,” Huang Feng responded and quickly fled with Huang Ling’er.","***","Chu Yunfan flew at high speed, and behind him, Lone Star was following closely. From time to time, terrifying attacks were blasted out from Lone Star’s hands. His eyes were bloodshot, and he was extremely angry. He thought he had been smart, but Chu Yunfan had managed to cut him off. This was a great humiliation—a slap in the face.","“You can’t run away. Even if you run to the ends of the earth, I will catch you and tear you into pieces!” Lone Star roared as the divine power in his body burned like a demonic flame.","However, Chu Yunfan stopped and turned to look at Lone Star.","Lone Star, who was about to pounce on him, stopped and looked at Chu Yunfan suspiciously. Chu Yunfan’s actions seemed extremely strange to him. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan shouldn’t be at the end of his rope, but now Chu Yunfan suddenly stopped in his tracks.","He instinctively had a feeling that this was a trap.","“Since I can’t run I won’t run then.” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The surrounding demonic energy did not pose any threat to Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, he was like a fish in water in a paradise.","Chu Yunfan felt extremely moved. The Alchemy Emperor, who had created such a shocking martial art like the Celestial Devouring Art, was simply a genius of his generation. Whether it was spirit energy, demonic energy, or any kind of energy, Chu Yunfan had yet to find any he could not use.","“You’re pretty smart. If you surrender obediently, I’ll leave your corpse intact,” Lone Star said with a cold smile.","“Surrender? Fat chance.” Chu Yunfan waved. “It wasn’t easy to lure you to this deserted place. It’s the perfect place for me to bury your corpse.”"]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 The First Battle of the Hou Transformation","paragraphs":["1664 The First Battle of the Hou Transformation","“Bury my corpse?” Lone Star said coldly.","A hint of suspicion flashed through Lone Star’s eyes. He managed to become a true disciple in the Astral Demonites, which was filled with intense competition and slaughter, not only because of his strength, but also because of his wisdom. He was as cunning as a fox. When he was being chased by Meng Tianren, he was able to set up this trap, causing everyone to attack him and drag the old sky demon to death. Such a person would naturally not take risks so easily.","Chu Yunfan seemed a little strange to him. He suspected that Chu Yunfan had set a trap for him. However, after scanning the area with his divine will, he did not find any traps. He snorted, “Do you really think you can scare me?”","Lone Star had already scanned the surroundings with his divine will and saw many things. There were no traps here, nor was there any trace of a barrier or array formation. In other words, Chu Yunfan was bluffing. He had seen this kind of situation many times, but he was not an ordinary person who would be scared away.","“Scare you? There’s no need for me to do that.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He had lured Lone Star here because he didn’t want others to see him. He could not reveal his trump card to the public just yet. He had chosen to save Huang Feng and Huang Ling’er as Huang Feng had stood up for him when Fan Shixin was trying to use him. Chu Yunfan was well-aware of this.","“How ridiculous. Still trying to scare me?”","Lone Star roared. In an instant, a terrifying aura was released. This aura formed a terrifying pressure that crushed Chu Yunfan’s body. If it was an ordinary Abstract, they would probably be severely injured at this moment.","Having reached this point in his cultivation, Lone Star was no longer that of an ordinary person. His mental powers could materialize to the point where it was enough to kill all his enemies.","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. Although Lone Star was powerful, he had lost his original strength after being severely injured by Meng Tianren. At most, he was only at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","Though Lone Star was far more powerful than an ordinary peak Interpreter, he still hadn’t surpassed the Abstract Stage. He was not as oppressive as Wang Yifan, let alone Li Qianyuan who had seemed like the last boss of the world.","Li Qianyuan had managed to sense the existence of Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram, which forced him to use the sword light in the Sword Light Talisman to severely injure Li Qianyuan before managing to escape.","Compared to Li Qianyuan, even at his peak, Lone Star would not be able to withstand a few moves from Li Qianyuan.","“Oh, well done. You do have some skills. You managed to withstand my aura, but that’s as far as you go.” Lone Star sneered. “How could a mere inner disciple like you understand how terrifying true disciples are? How dare trash like you come after me? What a joke!”","Lone Star’s expression was incomparably arrogant. In the entirety of Grand Xia, the true disciples of the ten great sects and the inner disciples were from two different worlds. One was of the noble class while the other were commoners.","“It just so happens that I was injured by Meng Tianren and require a lot of energy and blood to heal. Your flesh and blood, your divine power, your fortuitous encounters, and your magical items will serve me well. Once I devour you, more than half of my injuries will recover.”","As Lone Star spoke, a hint of greed flashed through his eyes. He had a secret technique that allowed him to faintly sense that Chu Yunfan’s blood essence had reached a shocking level. It was staggering. Compared to the blood essence of several dozen Observers, Chu Yunfan’s vigorous and surging vitality was exactly what he urgently needed at present.","“Such shameless boasting.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Hahahahaha, shameless boasting?” Lone Star sneered and immediately took the lead to attack.","A monstrous demonic claw condensed from endless demonic energy grabbed at Chu Yunfan. This huge hand was like a cloud that covered the sky, sealing the entire space. It could instantly kill an Interpreter.","Lone Star was being cautious. He had never used such a powerful divine power when dealing with an Interpreter before. However, he felt a sense of unease, so he attacked with all his strength.","Chu Yunfan also made his move. In an instant, a violent ancient and fierce aura erupted from his body. Countless long hairs grew out of his every pore, and his canine teeth suddenly turned into fangs.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan transformed into a huge beast. This beast was golden in color and looked like a small mountain.","The ferocious beast swiped at the demonic claw in the air.","Boom!","The demonic claw was crushed into pieces by the beast claw.","“What is this?” Lone Star’s expression fell. He could sense an extremely terrifying and ferocious aura from this ferocious beast. This ferocious aura was many times more terrifying than the demonic aura released by his body. It was the difference in the level of life.","“It’s a hou!” Lone Star immediately recognized the ferocious beast. It was clearly a hou from ancient legends.","A greedy look flashed through his eyes. He was sure that Chu Yunfan was a human and not a hou. In other words, the technique to transform into a hou was definitely a divine ability or a secret technique. After using this technique, Chu Yunfan had gone from being vulnerable to being so powerful that even he was a little shocked.","It was a shocking increase in strength!","‘I have to get this secret technique!’ Lone Star could imagine his strength undergoing a tremendous change if he could pry out this technique. At that time, the true disciples of the Astral Demonites would have a huge increase in strength.","In Lone Star’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s hou was a moving treasure vault.","“Roar!”","The hou that Chu Yunfan had transformed into let out a long howl toward the sky. Waves of ferocious aura were released. His entire body was like a ball of golden flames, incomparably dazzling within the dark Sierra Holy Demon."]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 Beating up Lone Star","paragraphs":["1665 Beating up Lone Star","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s body was surging with the light of fire-attribute divine power. The hou was of the fire element. Even the legendary drought demon that could cause a thousand miles of barren land was also a type of hou.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s strength soar, not only did the terrifying aura not make Lone Star afraid, but it also made him feel extremely excited. The stronger Chu Yunfan became after transforming into the hou, the more benefits it would bring him.","“Hahaha, what a great divine power. I’ve only read of divine power that can transform one into a ferocious beast in ancient legends. It’s called the variable of the heavenly wind and the earth. I didn’t expect to see it with my own eyes here one day.” Lone Star laughed loudly. Countless demonic energy condensed around him, making him look even more ferocious, as if he was about to turn into a demonic creature.","“Cut the crap!” the hou said. Its eyes were red. The hou’s ferocious aura had invaded Chu Yunfan’s brain, trying to control his body.","Chu Yunfan knew that he didn’t have much time, and he quickly made his move.","Swoosh!","A pair of thunder wings grew out of the hou that Chu Yunfan had transformed into. This wasn’t the hou’s divine ability, but rather, it was transformed from the Thunderclap Physique.","In an instant, the hou arrived before Lone Star.","“That’s fast!”","Lone Star felt his vision blur. Chu Yunfan’s huge body arrived right in front of him. The hou’s huge claws were like a ball of fire and lightning, tearing everything apart in an instant and clawing at Lone Star.","There was no need for any martial arts or divine powers. Just this casual strike had great power.","Lone Star snorted coldly. Although he had not realized that Chu Yunfan would be so fast, he was not completely unaware. An energy shield condensed from countless demonic energy instantly appeared in front of him.","Bam!","After a loud explosion, the demonic energy shield was torn apart.","“Astral Demon Devours the World!” Lone Star punched out and collided with the huge claw.","Boom!","The ground and mountains shook. Although Lone Star’s cultivation had fallen from its peak, it was still at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage. After Chu Yunfan transformed into the hou, his strength had increased crazily. In addition, he had the hou’s abnormal bloodline. He could fight evenly with Lone Star.","“Hahaha, good beast! Now watch me kill you!” Lone Star laughed.","He punched out again. Countless demonic energy condensed and formed an incomparably huge demon. The demon opened its jaws and wanted to devour everything. This was one of the ultimate techniques of the Astral Demonites. It was a revolutionary martial art created by the founder of the cult after observing the ecology of Sky Demons. In the Astral Demonites, only experts at the level of true disciples and above were qualified to cultivate this move.","Lone Star meant to kill Chu Yunfan in one go.","Chu Yunfan had no idea what was going on, and he clawed at the sky.","The two sides collided again. Just as Lone Star thought that he could shake Chu Yunfan away, he saw that a talisman had appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body. The talisman shattered and a yellow-scarved strongman evolved from it.","Lone Star, who was originally on par with Chu Yunfan, was sent flying.","‘Impossible!’ As he was sent flying, his eyes went wide. He couldn’t believe that he was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s claw. ‘That’s the Great Strength Divine Talisman!’","Lone Star immediately recognized the talisman Chu Yunfan was using. It was the expensive Great Strength Divine Talisman.","Even in Grand Xia, the Great Strength Divine Talisman was a precious talisman. It was priceless, not to mention for people like Lone Star. It was much harder for them to obtain these talismans than for the experts of Grand Xia. However, this did not prevent him from knowing about the Great Strength Divine Talisman.","“I don’t believe that your Great Strength Divine Talisman can last much longer!”","Lone Star stabilized himself, his eyes flashing with a fierce light. He had studied the Great Strength Divine Talisman before, so he naturally knew the weakness of this item. The sudden increase in strength would consume a lot of stamina, and it could not last long. At most, it could only be used for a short time.","“It’ll last long enough for me to kill you!”","Chu Yunfan flew toward Lone Star. Then, he opened his jaws and spat out a terrifying flame. This wasn’t an ordinary flame. It was a type of drought flame unique to the hou. The flame poured out of the soil and instantly raised the temperature of the surrounding area. Countless demonic energy was swept by the flame and turned into a cloud of green smoke, disappearing without a trace.","Lone Star hastily retreated, but the ball of flame seemed to have eyes and locked onto him. He set up barriers and arrays in front of him in an attempt to resist the flames. However, how could these flames be so easily blocked? The barrier and array formation he had set up were directly burned through and the flames landed on his body.","Immediately, a loud shattering sound came from Lone Star’s body. It was the sound of his inner armor shattering.","The power of the hou’s drought fire was astonishing. If he was at his peak, Lone Star only needed to be a little more careful, but for the current him, this fire was fatal.","At this moment, he truly understood what it meant to be kicked when one was down. He had never taken a fancy to Chu Yunfan, but now Chu Yunfan had forced him to this extent.","Before Lone Star could catch his breath, Chu Yunfan swept his tail at him. The tail swept was swift, bringing with it a terrifying tide. It was like a long dragon that swept toward Lone Star."]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 Endless Trump Cards, Lone Star’s Despair","paragraphs":["1666 Endless Trump Cards, Lone Star’s Despair","Chu Yunfan’s tail swept over like a long dragon. It was everywhere. These ancient ferocious beasts did not need to rely on martial arts or divine powers. They relied on their body’s instinctive movements to produce great power. Even the martial arts developed by humans were developed by imitating these ancient ferocious beasts.","At this moment, Lone Star finally realized how powerful Chu Yunfan was. He felt terrified. He retreated, not daring to get close. However, this huge tail smashed down on him, making it impossible for him to dodge.","Bam!","His hands met the tail, and his entire body was smashed into the ground like a meteor.","Boom!","Lone Star smashed into the ground, creating a huge pit. With him as the center, the cracks spread out in all directions. The cracks were like a spider web, densely packed. Countless specks of dust stirred up a wave of dust that was hundreds of feet high.","One could imagine how powerful this attack was!","Spurt!","Lone Star spat out a mouthful of blood. His hands were almost paralyzed from the impact, and all the bones in his body were about to shatter. He couldn’t barely suppress his wounds. This attack was far beyond his expectations. He had been too arrogant. He had treated the hou, an ancient ferocious beast, as if it was an ordinary monster. Only now did he realize that his previous judgment was wrong.","Each of these ancient ferocious beasts was an existence that could not be calculated with reason, let alone the hou, which was a terrifying existence that was ranked at the top among the many ancient ferocious beasts.","However, this attack did not scare him. On the contrary, it lured out the ferocious aura in his bones.","“I’ll play with you. Let’s see how long you can last!” Lone Star roared. His eyes were bloodshot, and the divine power in his body was boiling.","He was betting that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be able to hold out for much longer, and that he would be able to hold out until Chu Yunfan completely collapsed instead of himself completely collapsing.","His heart was filled with rage. If he had not been injured by Meng Tianren, Chu Yunfan would not have been his match.","Lone Star went berserk. He glared at Chu Yunfan. “I’m going to kill you. If you don’t kill me today, I’m going make you suffer and die!”","Chu Yunfan, who was in the sky, was panting heavily. The series of attacks were too strenuous for him. His cultivation level was too low. Every minute and second of his transformation was crazily consuming his physical strength and divine power. He could feel every cell in his body collapsing.","Then, he launched an attack and rushed toward Lone Star like lightning. Immediately after, another huge steel tail swept over.","However, Lone Star was not about to admit defeat. Thick demonic energy boiled all over his body and formed another body around him.","“The Sky Demon Body?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed red. He instantly recognized this divine ability. This was a rather famous divine power of Astral Demonites, the Sky Demon Body.","The Sky Demon Body could temporarily increase a person’s strength. It was like protecting a person in armor, and their defense would greatly increase. However, just like many of the Astral Demonites’ cultivation techniques, they all had very serious side effects. This technique would devour one’s life force and energy to produce this Sky Demon Body. Unless it was a dire situation, ordinary people were unwilling to use this technique.","With his current injuries, it was very likely that Lone Star would be directly injured. Chu Yunfan had pushed him to his very limits.","“That’s right. Let’s see how you die!” Lone Star roared madly.","At this moment, he no longer had the slightest bit of rationality. There was only one thing on his mind, and that was to tear Chu Yunfan apart.","“You want me to die? You’ll die first!”","Chu Yunfan also let out a long roar toward the sky, and his tail swept toward Lone Star.","Bam!","This time, Lone Star wasn’t sent flying. He only stopped after being pushed back a couple steps. At the same time, he threw out the Astral Demon Devours the World punch that he had prepared beforehand.","He wanted to see Chu Yunfan die with a single punch!","But what happened next made him crestfallen. He saw that his attack had landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but it was unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, a bronze cauldron had appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head.","It was the Mountain River Cauldron!","The cauldron emitted a faint light, blocking Lone Star’s attack.","Clang!","Lone Star’s attack only made a sound like metal clashing and then turned into nothingness. It failed to hurt Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","“How could this be?!”","When Lone Star saw this scene, his eyes widened. The attack that he had carefully planned could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. The Mountain River Cauldron had deflected his attack.","He finally understood where Chu Yunfan’s confidence came from. The hou that he thought was Chu Yunfan’s final trump card was just one of them. His true trump card was this cauldron. It deflected all of his attacks while Chu Yunfan’s attacks kept landing on him.","If this continued, his defeat would only be a matter of time.","Chu Yunfan sneered. The Mountain River Cauldron was a magic tool that the Alchemy Emperor had carried with him before he reached enlightenment. Its main function was to make pills, and it wasn’t very strong in attack and defense. However, this was only in comparison to the other emperors. For ordinary people, the terror of the Mountain River Cauldron was enough to make them sink into complete despair. Even Li Qianyuan couldn’t break the Mountain River Cauldron and kill Chu Yunfan, let alone Lone Star.","While Lone Star was in shock, Chu Yunfan pounced on him again. His huge body that was like a small mountain crashed into Lone Star.","Spurt!","Lone Star let out a blood-curdling scream as he spat out a mouthful of blood. He was sent flying and crashed into the ground. His face was flushed red, and there was the taste of vomit in his throat. His entire body was about to fall apart.","He tried to use his divine power to suppress the injuries he had suffered from Meng Tianren, but how could Chu Yunfan let go of this golden opportunity to take his life while he was still weak?","In an instant, Chu Yunfan launched another attack!"]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 Breakthrough to the Intermediate Abstract Stage!","paragraphs":["1667 Breakthrough to the Intermediate Abstract Stage!","Although Chu Yunfan’s body was huge, his entire body was wrapped in a layer of violet lightning. He was extremely fast. In an instant, he had already rushed over and smashed into Lone Star.","“Your bullying has gone too far!” Lone Star roared.","He saw that Chu Yunfan was relying on the protection of the Mountain River Cauldron and did not care. Chu Yunfan rushed over and bullied him because he could not hit the other party at all.","Lone Star was so angry that he cried out. In his eyes, this was simply going too far. If he wasn’t seriously injured, how could a mere Chu Yunfan be able to move him?","Thinking of this, he felt even more aggrieved. He realized that things were not as simple as he thought. This was a trap from the beginning. Chu Yunfan had lured him here because he thought he would win.","However, the current situation did not allow him to think too much. Chu Yunfan had pounced over with a biting cold killing intent. The entire world seemed to be moved by it. The ferocious might of the ancient ferocious beast was fully displayed at this moment.","Lone Star steadied himself and threw a backhanded punch. It tore through everything in the air. The Astral Demon Devours the World punch devoured everything and swallowed the ferocious beast that Chu Yunfan had transformed into.","But in the next moment, the huge demon formed by the punch was torn apart by the hou formed by Chu Yunfan. His fighting style looked simple and crude. The simplest way to destroy everything in front of him.","Bam!","Lone Star was directly hit was sent flying. He spat out a mouthful of blood and collapsed. He felt that the injuries in his body could no longer be suppressed. They were spreading at an astonishing speed.","“Ahhhh!” Lone Star stared at Chu Yunfan, who was flying toward him again, and his anger blazed. “I, the great Lone Star, am supposed to die in the hands of a nameless nobody like you? I won’t accept it!”","When Lone Star felt that the injuries in his body could no longer be controlled, he immediately mobilized all the divine power in his body. An uncontrollable madness flashed through his eyes, and he erupted. He no longer cared about the injuries in his body. Instead of being beaten to death by Chu Yunfan, he might as well take Chu Yunfan down with him.","This attack was more than ten times stronger than the previous one. This was Lone Star’s true strength, a true disciple of Astral Demonites. He had used most of his strength to suppress the injuries in his body. That was why he couldn’t attack so freely.","Boom!","This attack was directed at Chu Yunfan. The Mountain River Cauldron above his head suddenly burst out with a powerful light. Countless runes flew out and formed a huge barrier, enveloping Chu Yunfan within.","Clang!","This attack was turned invisible by the Mountain River Cauldron. Chu Yunfan took a few steps back and resolved all the attacks.","Opposite him, Lone Star could not suppress the injuries in his body, and his body instantly exploded into pieces. Massive demonic energy spread in all directions with him as the center.","Lone Star, a formidable man of his generation, was dead.","The Mountain River Cauldron returned to Chu Yunfan’s body. At the same time, Chu Yunfan released the hou form and returned to his normal form.","“Huff, huff, huff!” He panted heavily.","The Chu Yunfan’s divine power had been drained and he was exhausted. Transforming into the hou was a final trump card for him. He could not use it often. But he had successfully gotten rid of Lone Star, which meant that he had obtained the Evolution Pill. He now had confidence in transcending the Abstract Stage.","Chu Yunfan collected Lone Star’s corpse, crushed it, and poured it into the Brahma Tree. At this moment, the Brahma Tree in the Mountain River Diagram was emitting waves of fragrance. After being watered with the blood essence of two experts who had transcended the Abstract Stage, the tree finally matured again and produced two Brahma Fruits.","Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. The blood essence of an existence above the Abstract Stage was so huge that it produced two Brahma Fruits. He was not in a hurry to return to report. Instead, he went into the Mountain River Diagram and plucked a Brahma Fruit. He sat cross-legged in the air and swallowed it.","Suddenly, an unprecedented huge energy flood surged into his limbs and bones. Needless to say, the effects of the Brahma Fruit were at least a hundred times stronger than when Chu Yunfan had consumed the first Brahma Fruit.","Chu Yunfan was growing, and so was the Brahma Tree.","He quickly controlled the divine power in his body. He circulated the Celestial Devouring Art to continuously transform this energy into the divine power he needed while crazily attacking a higher realm. He was already at the fledgling Abstract Stage. After passing this stage, he would need to accumulate more energy. It was a process that required time and effort. However, with a heavenly treasure like the Brahma Fruit, this process could be greatly shortened.","This was what was happening to Chu Yunfan. The divine power in his body was growing every moment, like a great river. It was endless and dense to a shocking level.","Not long after, Chu Yunfan had already reached the peak of the fledgling Abstract Stage and began to break through to the intermediate Abstract Stage.","With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan was no stranger to the Abstract Stage. He was confident in his cultivation and comprehension. It was as if an old monster had been resurrected.","Chu Yunfan continued to purify his mana until he could no longer purify it, then he began to break through.","Boom!","His divine power broke through immediately, but it only took a moment. Instead of saying that it was a difficult breakthrough, it was more like he had accumulated enough. Everything was so logical that the breakthrough was just a matter of pushing the boat with the current.","Once he broke through to the intermediate Abstract Stage, Chu Yunfan’s overflowing divine power calmed down, and his control of divine power reached a new peak. His body was like a small pool that had been dug out at least twice as big in an instant. His capacity for divine power had more than doubled, and it had even increased several times.","If outsiders saw this, they would be shocked. No one could be like Chu Yunfan. Every time he improved, he would jump to a whole new level. He was simply a monster.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan stabilized the divine power in his body and controlled his new strength perfectly. He had broken through to the intermediate Abstract Stage!"]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 No One in the Flying Celestials Can Match Us?","paragraphs":["1668 No One in the Flying Celestials Can Match Us?","After breaking through to the intermediate Abstract Stage, Chu Yunfan felt that his strength had reached another level. He was at least twice as strong as before. His combat strength had also undergone a tremendous change.","‘I happen to have another Brahma Fruit with me. It seems that breaking through is only a matter of time.’","Once he had a little more time to consolidate his cultivation, he could make another breakthrough and reach the late Abstract Stage. At that time, he would be considered an outstanding person among the many inner disciples.","It hadn’t been long since he had joined the Flying Celestials, but Chu Yunfan didn’t have the slightest bit of pride or complacency. He knew very well that his real opponent was Li Qianyuan. Compared with Li Qianyuan, he was already far behind, so he had to do everything he could to make himself stronger as soon as possible.","“I’m coming, Siyu!” Chu Yunfan said as he clenched his fists.","After breaking through, Chu Yunfan did not stop and headed straight for the Flying Celestials. At this moment, the outside world was in chaos.","To encircle and annihilate Lone Star, who had already suffered heavy injuries, the experts of each clan moved out one after another. There were over a thousand experts, and all of them were Observers or even Interpreters. Although such experts were not the pillars of the sect, they were still the backbone of the reserve force.","However, they were all slaughtered by Lone Star. One could imagine how much of a commotion this caused. For the ten great sects, Lone Star’s actions were undoubtedly a slap to their faces.","For a time, as the remaining members fled, the matter of Lone Star caused a huge uproar. It was rumored that this matter had even alarmed some of the true disciples of the ten great sects. After all, the Evolution Pill was extremely precious and rare to these true disciples.","Previously, the various sects had the intention to give the inner disciples and seed disciples a chance to temper themselves, so the true disciples did not move. Now, the facts had proven that Lone Star’s strength had surpassed the limits that inner disciples and seed disciples could deal with.","These people could not help but attack!","One by one, the famous true disciples of Grand Xia descended the mountain and charged toward Sierra Holy Demon. For a time, powerful figures could be seen shuttling through the mountain range. No one knew that Chu Yunfan had already killed Lone Star. Even the disciples who had escaped from the various sects and saw Chu Yunfan lure Lone Star away thought that Chu Yunfan was sacrificing himself to carve out an opportunity for them to escape. No one thought that Chu Yunfan had the ability to defeat or even kill Lone Star.","At the foot of the mountain where the Merit Hall was located in the Flying Celestials, there was a sea of people and all kinds of clamor. Chu Yunfan descended and looked around. He saw that the hundreds of people nearby were all familiar faces. They had all entered the Flying Celestials together with him. There were inner disciples and fringe disciples from the same batch. Chu Yunfan even saw Huang Feng standing in the crowd.","At the edge of the crowd, two figures were sitting cross-legged, healing their wounds. Chu Yunfan looked and saw that they were the seeded contestants who had been with him during the test—Fang Zhiyuan and Liu Deqing.","Both of them had many wounds on their bodies. Although the wounds were not very serious, they looked rather miserable. Chu Yunfan was a little puzzled. Fang Zhiyuan and Liu Deqing were quite strong, so why were they injured at the same time?","As Chu Yunfan looked over, he saw that in the center were two experts who were almost identical to each other practicing their sword techniques. The two of them were tall and handsome, and they looked exactly the same. They were dressed in light yellow robes and were practicing with swords in their hands. As they moved, they were as fast as lightning.","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized the pale yellow robe. It was the standard robe of the Divine Star Sect, one of the ten great sects. He easily recognized it at a glance.","The identical twins attacked quickly and decisively. They kept exchanging blows, and the tip of the needle met the tip of the wheat. No one could even see clearly how they attacked. They could only see the sparks of the two swords colliding in the air. Even among Observers, the speed at which these two people attacked was incomparable.","Chu Yunfan glanced at them for a while and sneered. These two people were not using any divine power. They relied on their physical strength and understanding of sword techniques. They were masters of the sword. Their casual attacks seemed to have no sword light, but in fact, they could be said to be unconstrained and unrestrained.","These two were definitely not ordinary people.","“I didn’t expect the Flying Celestials to be so weak. Their seed disciples are only at this level. It’s not as interesting as the two of us sparring between ourselves.”","At this moment, one of the men spoke. He was able to speak leisurely as he attacked. One could imagine that he was still able to handle this level of speed with ease.","“That’s right. How much longer is the leader and the others going to chat? I’m bored to death!” the other person whined, “Didn’t these people say that there was another powerful person in their batch? That person isn’t here.”","The words of these two unscrupulous people instantly angered everyone. However, they did not dare to step forward. They could only watch as the two of them slapped the Flying Celestials in the face.","“Gao Feiyun, Gao Feigeng, don’t be too arrogant. When Hua Xianyuan gets here, you’ll know how powerful he is!” one of the Flying Celestials disciples said.","“And we’re waiting. The Flying Celestials is one of the top ten sects, but it’s been getting worse and worse over the years.” the elder brother, Gao Feiyun, said. When he saw the indignant looks on everyone’s faces, he sneered. “What? Are you trying to bully me with numbers? It doesn’t matter. You guys might as well attack together. I don’t care.”","This made everyone even more speechless. There were many experts in the Flying Celestials. Of course, it was impossible that they could not find anyone who could deal with these twins. It was just that it was not convenient for them to make a move.","The Flying Celestials couldn’t afford to lose so much face after inviting their seniors to take revenge on their peers. Even if they lost for a moment, it would only be for a moment. However, if those seniors made a move, the problem would rise to another level."]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 That’s It? You’re Still Lacking!","paragraphs":["1669 That’s It? You’re Still Lacking!","At this moment, everyone could only place their hopes on Hua Xianyuan. Unlike a dark horse like Chu Yunfan, Hua Xianyuan had been famous since he was a child. It was said that he was different from the rest since he was a child. He had a special physique and was old friends with an elder of the Flying Celestials.","Therefore, Hua Xianyuan was determined to join the Flying Celestials a long time ago. Not only did the Flying Celestials pay attention to such a person, but they had also heard of him even before he joined the sect.","In terms of strength, Hua Xianyuan was the top of the top ten seed disciples. He was a powerful figure who was certain to become a true disciple in the future.","“Don’t go too far. Do you really think you’re invincible?” Someone glared at Gao Feiyun and Gao Fengfei.","“Not invincible, but against you people, yeah, we are,” Gao Feiyun said with a cold smile.","Everyone was furious, but they restrained themselves and did not rush forward. The Flying Celestials could not afford to lose face like this, and neither could they.","“What are you guys arguing about?” A figure slowly walked out of the crowd.","“Chu Yunfan?”","Everyone looked toward Chu Yunfan. They recognized this black horse. Chu Yunfan was probably the biggest dark horse of the Flying Celestials in the past few hundred years. He was the only one who had become a seed disciple with a Golden Core cultivation.","“Chu Yunfan is okay!” Huang Feng’s eyes flashed with surprise and joy. Chu Yunfan seemed to be fine, which made him very surprised, but at the same time, he felt a little guilty.","It was because of him that Chu Yunfan was treated as cannon fodder by Fan Shixin. In the end, it was Chu Yunfan who came forward to lure Lone Star away and save him. He had guessed that Chu Yunfan had ways to protect himself, otherwise, he wouldn’t have rushed out like this. However, when he saw Chu Yunfan appear unscathed, he was still surprised and happy.","“Why is he here?”","“Does he also want to give it a try? But even Fang Zhiyuan and Liu Deqing had failed. What can he do?”","“If he goes up, he’ll only add another failure. Gao Feiyun and Gao Feifeng are too strong. Probably only Hua Xianyuan can deal with them.”","“They’ve both just entered the sect, but why is the difference so huge?”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but no one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan. Although he was one of the ten seed disciples, he was universally recognized as the weakest. After all, he was only in the Golden Core Stage. Even becoming a seed disciple was already shocking enough. How could they have more expectations?","“Interesting.”","Gao Feiyun and Gao Fengfei looked at each other. The two of them, who had only been attacking each other with sword moves, instantly erupted. The divine power in their bodies surged and boiled, and their sword lights began to sweep across, turning into a storm around them. The sword light storm enveloped just the two of them and did not scatter. One could imagine how much control they had over their divine power. It was simply shocking.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan strode forward as if he didn’t see anything.","“Watch out!” Huang Feng shouted, but Chu Yunfan turned a deaf ear and walked straight into the storm.","And something strange happened.","The terrifying sword light storm that could tear mountains could not harm Chu Yunfan. All the sword light seemed to fly past him. Some people even saw some of the sword lights pierce through Chu Yunfan, but it was as if the sword lights were passing through a shadow. They could not pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","Everyone’s eyes widened in disbelief and exclaimed, “What movement technique is he using?”","They all figured that Chu Yunfan was using some kind of movement technique, but they didn’t know what technique could cause such a shocking scene. This was completely different from any movement techniques they knew. Even the most advanced movement techniques in the Flying Celestials could not turn one’s body into an illusion like Chu Yunfan.","“No, it’s not just his movement technique. His movement technique is indeed magical, but the key is that he’s extremely fast,” a figure hidden in the void spoke.","The person was hiding in the void, and the inner disciples did not notice his existence.","This person was watching the scene. However, even if he wanted to make a move, he could not make a move to teach Gao Feiyun and Gao Fengfei a lesson. It was precisely because these two brothers knew this that they were so unscrupulous.","They knew that no matter how unhappy the seniors of the Flying Celestials were, they would not make a move. The Flying Celestials could not afford to be humiliated. Moreover, the Divine Stars was one of the top ten sects. The Flying Celestials naturally did not dare to act rashly.","However, when this person saw Chu Yunfan’s performance, they exclaimed in admiration. This movement technique was absolutely shocking. But the person knew immediately that it wasn’t just Chu Yunfan’s movement technique that was magical. To be able to do this, he had to be as fast as lightning. It was just that ordinary people couldn’t see it.","“Impossible!”","Gao Feiyun and Gao Fengfei widened their eyes in disbelief. The two of them had not held back. Entering the range of their sword techniques was equivalent to being attacked by the two of them together. They were confident that even the Hua Xianyuan of the Flying Celestials would not be able to escape unscathed from their combined attack. But now, their understanding had been overturned. Chu Yunfan had completely ignored their sword lights and passed through the middle.","This was completely beyond their imagination!","In just a few moments, Chu Yunfan had already walked out of the sword light storm and headed straight for the Merit Hall. Suddenly, Chu Yunfan stopped and turned to look at the two of them.","“That’s it? You’re still lacking.”","Everyone at the scene was in an uproar. Chu Yunfan’s casual words were like a slap to their faces, causing them to swell.","“What did you say?!” Gao Feiyun and Gao Fengfei shouted angrily in unison."]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 Instantly Defeating Gao Feiyun","paragraphs":["1670 Instantly Defeating Gao Feiyun","Everyone was excited.","“I said, you’re still lacking,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“Don’t get cocky!”","Gao Feiyun couldn’t hold it in atfer seeing he was being looked down on. He swung out the sword in his hand and a brilliant sword light slashed toward Chu Yunfan.","“You’re despicable!” the Flying Celestials disciples who were burning with rage shouted out.","Gao Feiyun’s attack enveloped Chu Yunfan, looking like it would tear him to pieces. However, with a wave of his hand, Chu Yunfan collected all the sword lights in his palm. He instantly absorbed all the sword lights and they disappeared without a trace. They were instantly shattered into pieces.","“Is that all you’ve got?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “Divine Stars is nothing.”","When everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s shocking technique crush all the sword lights, they immediately cheered.","“That’s right! Divine Stars is nothing!”","“A sneak attack from behind is nothing more than a despicable move.”","“Hahaha, they underestimated us.”","Everyone was talking excitedly.","Gao Feiyun reacted. He had been too proud earlier and was slapped in the face by Chu Yunfan in the end. He had failed to control himself. He no realized where the problem lay.","“What’s your name? Do you dare tell me your name?” Gao Feifeng asked.","Chu Yunfan simply ignored them and walked straight toward Merit Hall. As he walked, he shook his head as if he was facing two ignorant brats.","To the Gao twins, this was blatant mockery.","“You’re a disciple of the Flying Celestials, right? Don’t tell me you don’t have the courage to fight us. Are all the disciples of the Flying Celestials such cowards?” Gao Feiyun said loudly.","Chu Yunfan stopped in his tracks, then turned to Gao Feiyun and said, “Although your goading methods are inferior, I’ll allow you this chance.”","Everyone was amused by Chu Yunfan’s words. No matter whether they liked Chu Yunfan or not, on this issue, all of them had the same position.","Gao Feiyun’s face was ashen. From the beginning, this condescending fellow had not taken him or his brother seriously.","“Our names are—” Gao Feifeng was about to introduce his two brothers when Chu Yunfan waved lazily, “Whatever. I’m not interested in the names of the defeated.”","The Gao twins became even more furious. They hadn’t even fought yet, and Chu Yunfan was already saying that they would be defeated. It was simply preposterous!","“Arrogant brat who doesn’t know his place, I’ll teach you a lesson!” Gao Feiyun took a step forward, and a purple sword appeared in his hand. The sword emitted a faint sword pressure that bore great power.","“Go ahead and attack together. I’m sorry, I’m in a hurry and don’t have time to linger here,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly as he waved.","“Pfffft!”","The crowd laughed. They truly had to re-evaluate this dark horse. Not only was his strength unexpected, but his mouth could really anger people to death. This was especially true for Gao twins. They thought highly of themselves and had no respect for the Flying Celestials. In the end, Chu Yunfan said he had more important matters to attend to than deal with them.","“When we break your bones, I hope you can still say such words.”","Gao Feifeng’s face was ashen, and his eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan. He had a black sword in his hand that was similar to Gao Feiyun’s. The sword was engraved with extremely ancient and complicated runes, which seemed to be a kind of array pattern. It emitted a faint light.","“Hurry up. It’s getting late,” Chu Yunfan said as he stretched lazily.","Gao Feiyun made his move. It was different from before. In the blink of an eye, a sword light flashed and tore the sky apart, and Gao Feiyun was already standing right before Chu Yunfan. The sword light rushed straight toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan then raised his hand and blocked the sword light with his hand.","Bam!","Everyone saw that when the sword light landed on Chu Yunfan’s hand, it wasn’t his palm that shattered. On the contrary, a crack appeared on the sword light. Then, a loud explosion sounded. Everyone saw that the sword light was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s palm. Within seconds, they had turned into flowing lights that filled the sky.","Chu Yunfan then opened his hand, caught these flowing lights, and threw them out.","“Here, take them back.”","These streams of light were sword light fragments. They all headed toward Gao Feiyun who was about to rush over. He was planning to kill Chu Yunfan with another sword attack injuring Chu Yunfa severely. Then, he would say that his sword was indiscriminate in its attacks. All of it would have been normal, but who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would crush his sword light and throw it all back?","But it was too late for Gao Feiyun to dodge. The sword light fragments blocked off all escape.","Bam! Bam! Bam!","Loud booms rang out as the sword light fragments struck Gao Feiyun. The inner armor he was wearing shattered, and the sword light exploded on his body.","“Arrrgh!”","He spat out a mouthful of blood and his entire body was instantly covered. The sword light fragments that smashed into him created several big holes. He flew away and crashed into the ground, forming a large hole in the ground.","Gao Feiyun was instantly defeated!","Before anyone knew it, Gao Feiyun had already been defeated by his own sword light. He couldn’t even resist a single attack from Chu Yunfan.","For a moment, the entire place was deathly silent."]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 What Are You Trying to Act Cool?","paragraphs":["1671 What Are You Trying to Act Cool?","Everyone’s mouth was wide open as they stared at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape. This scene was simply too fantastical for them.","Gao Feiyun was an intermediate Observer. In terms of strength, he could crush everyone. And adding Gao Feifeng to the mix, whose strength was unfathomable, even if they all attacked together, they would fare no better against these twins. It would probably be very difficult to do anything to these two. They would be able to retreat unscathed.","In terms of martial arts, a higher realm might result in a difference of more than double in combat strength, not to mention that the difference in strength between most of them and the Gao twins was far more than just one level. Everyone was of the opinion that only Hua Xianyuan could compete with them.","But before Chu Yunfan, Gao Feiyun was so weak that he could not even withstand a single blow. One one counterattack, he was instantly defeated.","One could imagine how shocking this scene was.","“H-How is Chu Yunfan so strong?”","Many people’s mouths hung agape. In their opinion, it was already shocking for him to become a seed disciple with his Golden Core Stage cultivation. But now, he had defeated Gao Feiyun in an instant.","“He’s so strong! Gao Feiyun’s attack is unable to cause the slightest threat to him!”","“What kind of martial art does he practice? It’s clearly not the style from the Flying Celestials.”","Many people began to speculate. Chu Yunfan clearly wasn’t using a Flying Celestials’ martial arts. The sect did not prohibit its disciples from cultivating other martial arts. After all, everyone had their own fortuitous encounters and fate. Not everyone was suitable to cultivate the sect’s style of martial arts. Only by accepting hundreds of rivers could they become one of the top ten sects and establish a foundation that would not be shaken for ten thousand generations.","Everyone was highly interested in Chu Yunfan’s background. After all, he was simply too mysterious. His head was shrouded in an incomparably mysterious halo, and his strength had increased so quickly that everyone was shocked.","“Feiyun!” Gao Feifeng roared. His eyes were bloodshot as he stared at Chu Yunfan and shouted, “You’re courting death!”","Gao Feifeng attacked. His cultivation was even higher than Gao Feiyun, who was defeated by Chu Yunfan in a second. This was the most shocking thing. Gao Feifeng had just stepped into the intermediate Abstract Observance Stage, but Gao Feiyun had stepped into this level for some time already. In terms of strength, he was a level stronger than Gao Feifeng.","The black longsword in his hand slashed out black winds. These black winds were mixed with the whistling sounds of countless demons. This was a demonic attack, and this was the true power of this demonic sword.","When Gao Feifeng had defeated the Flying Celestials’ disciples earlier, he did not use this sword’s feature. It was clear through this that he looked down on the Flying Celestials. He had barely done anything and these Flying Celestials were already defeated. But now, he could feel how difficult it was to deal with Chu Yunfan. Under such circumstances, he had used all his strength in the first move.","The black winds distorted the sky as if they wanted to turn the entire world into a demon domain. Demonic winds whistled through the air. Even if it was an intermediate Observer, they wouldn’t dare to truly confront these demonic winds head-on either. After all, there were countless demons howling in the demonic wind. If an ordinary person was not careful, they might be affected by the sounds.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t an ordinary person. He didn’t even look at the attack. As the demonic wind blew toward him, he raised his leg and swept it out. This kick was like a lightning bolt in the dark night, tearing apart the night sky and crushing the demonic winds.","“Fourth Netherworld Stomps!” Chu Yunfan immediately used the Nine Netherworld Stomp.","Gao Feifeng suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan had appeared above him and stomped down.","The power of netherworld water spread out from under Chu Yunfan’s feet, and wherever it passed, it was like water flooding a golden mountain. His cultivation was completely different from when he first started cultivating. In an instant, he sent out netherworld water and crushed the demonic wind.","“What kind of martial art is this? How is it so strong? I’m going to give it everything I have!”","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s foot collided with the demonic wind. The wind and countless demons were instantly crushed. The stomp did not slow down and landed right on top of Gao Feifeng.","Bam!","Gao Feifeng let out a blood-curdling scream as he was sent flying. He spat out a mouthful of blood essence as he crashed heavily into the ground. He felt all the bones in his body being crushed by Chu Yunfan in an instant. This was because he was an intermediate Observer. His fleshy body was incomparably powerful. If it was an ordinary person, they would probably have died long ago.","He finally understood how his brother was so vulnerable against Chu Yunfan. It wasn’t that his brother was too weak. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan was too strong.","“How is there such a person within the Flying Celestials?”","Gao Feifeng wanted to move, but his whole body was in extreme pain. He stared at Chu Yunfan. He had not cared about anyone except Hua Xianyuan. Who knew that this dark horse would injure him so severely?","Then, Chu Yunfan shook his head and said regretfully, “I wasn’t expecting you to be so weak. Why were you pretending to be all cool earlier?”","“Ack!” Gao Feifeng spat out another mouthful of blood before his eyes rolled back and he fainted."]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 If You Dare to Talk Nonsense Again, I’ll Cripple You","paragraphs":["1672 If You Dare to Talk Nonsense Again, I’ll Cripple You","Chu Yunfan made Gao Feifeng so angry that he fainted.","When the Flying Celestials disciples saw this scene, they felt incomparably happy. Previously, they had been angered to death by these two brothers. Now, they had finally vented their anger.","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan with gentler gazes. They were no longer as hostile as before. Chu Yunfan had become a seed disciple as a Golden Core. To Chu Yunfan, it was naturally an unprecedented glory, but to them, it was a humiliation. They had been outdone by a golden core. Other than showing off their incompetence and stupidity, there was nothing else.","However, seeing that Chu Yunfan had helped them vent their anger, they naturally looked at him with much gentler gazes. At least, most people would not see him asa freak.","Chu Yunfan did not care about the twins who had fallen to the ground. He went straight into the Merit Hall as if he had just completed something trivial. This made many people sigh. The twins had forced everyone into a corner with no way to deal with them. But for Chu Yunfan, it was just a piece of cake. But after thinking about it carefully, the battle was probably not as difficult for Chu Yunfan.","The twins, who everyone felt were extremely troublesome, were completely powerless against Chu Yunfan.","All of a sudden, a streak of light flashed over from afar. Everyone looked up and saw that it was none other than Hua Xianyuan. He descended like a god with an extremely powerful aura. The fighting spirit he initially carried with him was immediately restrained when he saw the twins lying on the ground.","Someone came forward and told him what had just happened, and Hua Xianyuan retracted his divine power and looked like an ordinary person. He narrowed his eyes in suspicion. He knew Chu Yunfan, but that was only because Chu Yunfan was the first person to become a seed disciple while in the Golden Core Stage. This was something that even he could not do. That was why he paid attention to Chu Yunfan, but that was all.","Hua Xianyuan’s real targets had never been these disciples who had entered with him. Even though theere were ten seed disciples, everyone knew that Hua Xianyuan was not on the same level as the rest. His speed of improvement was the fastest. His targets were those who had been in the sect for a long time. He didn’t care about the others. But now, he realized that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","Regardless of whether it was Gao Feiyun or Gao Feifeng, he only needed a glance to know that although the two of them were strong, they were not his match. Even if the two of them attacked together, he wouldn’t care. However, Chu Yunfan had defeated them so easily. This proved that Chu Yunfan was not ordinary.","He must have many trump cards that no one knew about.","At the thought of this, Hua Xianyuan’s expression changed slightly, and there was a hint of excitement on his face. It had been too long since he felt this way. No one in his generation could be compared to him. In fact, there was no one who could compare to him.","Sometimes, being invincible was a form of loneliness. Even many so-called geniuses who were much older than him were not his match and were defeated by him. He was destined to become a true disciple. His true goal was to become the sect master of the Flying Celestials—the number one person in the sect.","Compared to him, those of the same generation were mediocre. It was not easy for him to find someone interesting, and his face revealed an uncontrollable excitement.","“Chu Yunfan... Interesting...”","A smile appeared on Hua Xianyuan’s face. He then walked over to the twins and handed them some pills to help them recover. With the pills given by Hua Xianyuan, their injuries quickly improved. Both of them were stunned. After all, they had come to provoke Hua Xianyuan, but he was willing to treat them. Moreover, these healing pills were clearly not ordinary items. The pills helped them recover to their peak in such a short period.","Why was Hua Xianyuan spending so much money on them?","The twins were a little puzzled.","“Why are you helping us?” Gao Feiyun and Gao Feifeng asked.","“No reason. I heard that you said that the Flying Celestials is nothing. I originally wanted to beat you up and teach you a lesson, but someone beat me to it. I can’t bully two cripples. Now that you’ve recovered, I’ll beat you up again. Now, no one will say that I’m bullying cripples,” Hua Xianyuan said calmly. A smile appeared on his face, but it was a cold smile.","“This is going too far!”","The twins were instantly enraged. It was fine if Chu Yunfan didn’t think much of them, but this Hua Xianyuan saw them as ants and treated them like cripples?","At the thought of this, the twins couldn’t hold it in and exploded. The anger from being casually defeated by Chu Yunfan earlier erupted. They unleashed all of their powers, and their bodies transformed. They turned into two sword lights and slashed down at Hua Xianyuan.","Hua Xianyuan simple sneered and raised his hand. Everyone was shocked to find that the sword lights formed by Gao Feiyun and Gao Feifeng were crushed when they touched Hua Xianyuan. They could not fight back at all.","Rays of green light shot out from Hua Xianyuan’s body. These rays were extremely dazzling and covered everything. In an instant, a slap was sent out.","Bam!","Bam!","Two incomparably loud sounds rang out, and twins were instantly sent flying. They spat out a mouthful of blood and collapsed. Their bodies were covered in blood. Compared to when they were defeated by Chu Yunfan earlier, their current situation was not much better. It was even more miserable, in fact.","Hua Xianyuan coldly walked toward the twins and said, “Today, I’m only giving you two a small punishment. If you dare to spout nonsense again, I’ll cripple you!”"]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 Who Is Stronger?","paragraphs":["1673 Who Is Stronger?","The crowd fell silent. It was as if everyone was meeting Hua Xianyuan for the first time. The rumors they had heard about him were just rumors. But now, they had finally seen the real Hua Xianyuan.","They didn’t know how to react as they looked at Hua Xianyuan. They even sympathized with the twins. Halfway through their act, the twins were beaten up by Chu Yunfan who was passing by. Then, they were saved by Hua Xianyuan. They thought that Hua Xianyuan was helping them, but who knew that he was only helping them to beat them up again.","After helping them, he beat them up until they were paralyzed!","“I’m not angry anymore. In fact, I want to laugh.”","“I even want to laugh!”","“These brothers probably didn’t consult their horoscopes before going out today.”","“But Hua Xianyuan is simply too strong. He’s even more terrifying than the rumors say. He’s like a monster. The twins are so helpless again him. Who knew that when they went up against Hua Xianyuan, they’d be so powerless?”","“Hua Xianyuan isn’t the only one who’s really powerful. Chu Yunfan isn’t inferior either.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. At this moment, their anger had dissipated. They even felt some sympathy for the Gao twins who had been beaten up twice. The discussions gradually turned to Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan. Whether it was Chu Yunfan passing by and beating up the Gao twins, or Hua Xianyuan saving the Gao twins and then beating them up again, these two incidents were surely in the top ten major incidents of the year.","Among them, the ones who had serious expressions were the other ten seed disciples. Previously, Liu Deqing and Fang Zhiyuan had been defeated by the Gao twins, and it was a humiliating defeat. But when the Gao twins faced Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan, they were powerless to fight back. This highlighted that even among the seed disciples, there was a clear difference in strength.","It was not like what many people had guessed. As seed disciples, their strength should be about the same, but in reality, the difference between the two sides was like the difference between heaven and earth.","It was fine for Hua Xianyuan. Everyone knew about him. Although they were surprised, they could still accept it. It was said that he was the reincarnation of a mighty figure. He had gained a fortuitous encounter when he was young and no one in his generation could match him. If they were called geniuses, then Hua Xianyuan was the greatest genius among them, the monster among monsters.","In the future, he had a chance of becoming the next sect leader of the Flying Celestials. At the very least, he would become one of the upper echelons of the sect and even within the entire Grand Xia Empire.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. In their eyes, he had such amazing strength but no one knew where it came from. No one knew what his background was.","What kind of background did Chu Yunfan have? What kind of inheritance did he receive? How could he be so shocking?","“Between the two of them, who’s stronger?” someone wondered.","If it was before today, they would have said without hesitation that Hua Xianyuan was stronger, but after seeing Chu Yunfan’s shocking power, they no longer dared to say that.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was deeply rooted in their minds. He had defeated the Gao twins with a flip of his hand. His power was not much weaker than Hua Xianyuan’s. This was the most terrifying part.","“It’s hard to say. The Gao twins have no way to bring out the true strength of these two people. They can’t even force them to show their true strength.”","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan are the two strongest seed disciples of this season.”","Many people sighed. It didn’t matter to ordinary people if they had shocking talent among their peers, because no matter what, it wouldn’t be their turn. For self-proclaimed geniuses like them, it was simply the biggest and cruelest thing. Their brilliance would be overshadowed by these two people.","Hua Xianyuan glanced at the Gao twins before leaving on a streak of light. The crowd dispersed as well. Their anger had already been vented. The two people from Divine Stars had suffered two consecutive defeats.","There was nothing more to see here.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know that Hua Xianyuan had come after him and helped the Gao twins, just to beat them up again. He went straight into the Merit Hall and went up to a disciple who was recording down missions.","“Hello, are you here to accept a mission or to report a completed mission?”","The disciple glanced at Chu Yunfan and smiled. He recognized that Chu Yunfan’s clothes were that of an inner disciple’s. This disciple was only a fringe disciple who worked part-time in the Merit Hall. The sect’s resources were never given fringe disciples. Therefore, if they wanted to obtain enough cultivation resources, they had to continuously make various contributions to the sect.","“I’m here to report a completed mission,” Chu Yunfan replied. He glanced through the Merit Hall. At this moment, the hall was bustling. There were countless people who were accepting missions and or handing them in. There were countless experts among them. The vast foundation of the Flying Celestials could be seen at a glance.","“And what mission is this?” the disciple asked.","“I’m here to hand in Lone Star’s mission. I brought his head,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What?” the disciple cried out.","There were at least thousands of missions piled up in the Merit Hall at all times. Of course, he didn’t know all of them, but the Lone Star mission was different. Lone Star had caused hundreds of thousands of casualties in Grand Xia, causing the Imperial Court to be furious. The Imperial Court had called for the various major powers to eliminate Lone Star and even offered an Evolution Pill as a reward. This kind of attention and generous rewards was not ordinary.","Moreover, Lone Star had previously displayed his might, attracting the inner disciples of the various large sects into the Sierra Holy Demon. He had wiped out almost all of these people, causing a huge commotion. Even if the disciples of the various sects who entered the Sierra Holy Demon were not wiped out, the outcome was almost there. Not even 10% of them had managed to escape.","This was the biggest news in recent times."]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 Becoming Famous Overnight, His Name Spreads Across the World","paragraphs":["1674 Becoming Famous Overnight, His Name Spreads Across the World","This matter caused an uproar. Even the higher-ups of the ten great sects were alarmed. True disciples and elders took on this mission one after another and went to Sierra Holy Demon to kill Lone Star and set the record straight.","However, the person in front of him looked like an ordinary inner disciple. How could Chu Yunfan had completed such a mission?","“I said that I killed Lone Star and brought his head to complete the mission. Is there a problem?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“No, no! Congratulations, senior!” the disciple quickly said.","He didn’t care how Chu Yunfan completed it, but he knew that the person who could complete this task was not an ordinary person. After all, even so many powerful inner disciples and true disciples had been defeated. It was already very shocking that Chu Yunfan could complete the mission.","“We’ll need to verify Lone Star’s head,” the disciple said.","Chu Yunfan took out a head from the void. The disciple checked it and found it was indeed Lone Star. The Merit Hall naturally had a set of methods to check the completion of missions. It was impossible to deceive the hall. Moreover, even if someone could do it, they would not dare to do so. Not even the sect leader would be able to protect someone who dared to do this. This was because this was a rule that everyone had set. This rule could not be broken, and no one dared to break this rule.","Moreover, the Merit Hall was one of the major forces of the Flying Celestials. Its power was so huge that it was not something ordinary people could imagine. There were many experts under it. Even true disciples did not dare to lie.","The disciple looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. Although he knew that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t lie to him, he was still extremely shocked when he saw Chu Yunfan take out Lone Star’s head.","“Verification is done. This is indeed Lone Star’s head.” The disciple nodded.","He had seen Lone Star’s drawing before and had also used a special detection method to detect that this head belonged to an existence that had surpassed the Abstract Stage. Coupled with the authority of the Merit Hall, he confirmed that this was indeed Lone Star’s head. However, he was still very shocked. Chu Yunfan actually did it. It was such a shocking thing.","“Well then, can you give me the Evolution Pill reward offered by the Imperial Court?” Chu Yunfan asked.","The disciple shook his head and said with a bitter smile, “Senior, normally, you would be rewarded on the spot. However, this mission is different. The Imperial Court issued this mission to all the major factions at the same time, not just the Flying Celestials. Therefore, the Evolution Pill wasn’t sent here. It’s still in the hands of the Imperial Court.","“We need to hand over Lone Star’s head first. After his identify is verified, the Evolution Pill will be sent out. Senior, you can rest assured that the Imperial Court will do as they say,” the fringe disciple continued, “Senior, please leave your name and address. When the Imperial Court sends the Evolution Pill, we’ll send it to your residence immediately.”","The disciple gulped. This was none other than the legendary Evolution Pill. If he could obtain an Evolution Pill, his cultivation would surely skyrocket. Who knew how much it would skyrocket? It would allow him to be reborn and his aptitude to rise to a higher level. At that time, not to mention being an inner disciple, even becoming an elite disciple was highly likely.","However, the disciple immediately swept this thought out of his mind because he knew that this was destined to have nothing to do with him. He did not dare to have the slightest thought of embezzling the Evolution Pill. That kind of consequence was not something a fringe disciple like him could bear.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “All right, here’s my name and address. When the Evolution Pill arrives, please send it to me as soon as possible.”","“Okay, thank you for understanding, senior,” the disciple said.","He had been working part-time here to earn points for many years. He had seen too many eccentric seniors. Not everyone was reasonable, but those seniors had much higher cultivation and background than him. Many times, they did not take him seriously. But this Chu Yunfan was easy to talk to.","After leaving his name and address, Chu Yunfan didn’t stay any longer. He turned around and left the hall. The Evolution Pill would not arrive anytime soon, but he could not stop his cultivation.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left, the news that the Lone Star mission had been completed spread throughout the Merit Hall and immediately caused an uproar. Recently, this mission had been the focus of everyone’s discussion. Lone Star’s strength made everyone tremble with fear, especially those who didn’t dare to accept the mission. These people felt cold sweat flowing down their backs. If they had been impulsive back then, none of them would have been able to escape. All of them would have died at Lone Star’s hands.","Many people couldn’t help but be stunned. What truly shocked everyone was that the person who completed this mission was not a true disciple or an elder of a large sect, but an unknown inner disciple. For a time, the entire sect was shocked by the news.","This name was originally so unfamiliar. Although Chu Yunfan was a famous person among the new disciples, he was not considered a big shot within the entire sect.","But now, his name had spread throughout the world overnight, and everyone was familiar with this name. It was because he had killed Lone Star. Chu Yunfan’s existence was beyond everyone’s expectations, and his reputation soared."]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 Clouds Move In From All Sides","paragraphs":["1675 Clouds Move In From All Sides","Chu Yunfan became instantly famous.","For Chu Yunfan, becoming one seed disciples with a Golden Core cultivation base only made him slightly famous within the Flying Celestials. Most of the other Flying Celestials disciples did not care about this. The Flying Celestials would recruit a large number of disciples every once in a while, and only someone like Hua Xianyuan, who had been famous throughout the world since he was a child, would be the focus of attention of many sect higher-ups.","Every few years, ten new seed disciples would join the sect. In addition to the direct disciples that the Flying Celestials nurtured, there would be some seed disciples every year.","For most people, they simply did not have the mood to remember all these seed disciples. But now, many people remembered this seed disciple who had just entered the sect, Chu Yunfan, and the source of all this was Lone Star.","To be able to kill Lone Star who was a true disciple was absolutely shocking. Even those who had the imagination before would not have thought that Lone Star would die like this. After all, it was rumored that Lone Star had used the old sky demon to trick everyone, severely injuring them and almost wiping everyone out. In everyone’s eyes, this was an extremely dangerous existence that non-true disciples could not deal with.","Lone Star’s head had been sent to the Imperial Court for inspection. If the Imperial Court acknowledged it, the Evolution Pill would be handed down. Chu Yunfan had become famous in one battle.","However, a rumor soon spread that Chu Yunfan had just gotten lucky. Lone Star may have looked strong at that time, but he was already at the end of his rope. After all, he had just been severely injured by Meng Tianren. Lone Star was an arrow at the end of its flight. This was very normal.","Chu Yunfan had only picked up a bargain.","When this statement was spread, everyone immediately felt that things were not as strange as it seemed. This explanation seemed to be much more reliable than Chu Yunfan killing Lone Star single-handedly. After all, no matter how one looked at it, Chu Yunfan didn’t have the strength to kill Lone Star. However, if he had just been lucky, then it was understandable.","Under this rumor, the attention on Chu Yunfan weakened. In many people’s eyes, he was just a lucky person. And Chu Yunfan never came came forth to quell these rumors as if he tacitly agreed to them.","The only ones who had objections were Huang Feng and Huang Ling’er.","“Do you believe that he was just lucky?” Huang Ling’er asked Huang Feng.","“I don’t believe in luck.” Huang Feng shook his head. He did not believe it and even found it ridiculous. Only those who weren’t present at the time would feel that Lone Star was an arrow at the end of its flight.","What kind of joke was this? Back then, Lone Star had treated them as trash and easily killed them. If Chu Yunfan had not appeared and lured Lone Star away, they would have all died.","Moreover, Huang Feng knew that Lone Star had used magic to devour the blood of the people he had killed. His strength did not retreat, but instead advanced. Lone Star had not been an arrow at the end of its flight.","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan is simply unfathomable. I don’t know how many mysterious trump cards he has. It’s best to be on good terms with such a person,” Huang Ling’er said, “The fact that he saved you means that he values you. As long as such a figure doesn’t fall, he’ll definitely become a great person in the future.”","Huang Feng nodded. He naturally understood this. This was the gut instincts of the descendants of aristocratic families.","“But it seems that Wang Yifan of Startling Cloud Peak is thinking of ways to take down Chu Yunfan,” Huang Feng said.","“It’s fine. I’ve investigated this matter. It’s not like he doesn’t have someone backing him up. At the very least, Senior Yi Yunyao is his backer, but it doesn’t seem like they’re that close. However, this is a good opportunity for us. Doesn’t that person from our clan stand among the true disciples?” Huang Ling’er said.","The Huang clan was a great clan in Grand Xia, and many generations of them. Naturally, the two of them were not the only disciples in the Flying Celestials.","“You’re right,” Huang Feng said, “No matter what, Chu Yunfan saved me. I want to return the favor.”","Huang Ling’er nodded in agreement. This was the foundation of the descendants of aristocratic families. They would repay kindness and revenge. If they took the kindness of others for granted, they would soon have no place to stand.","At the same time, in the main hall of the East District, in the Astonishing Cloud Peak.","Wang Yifan was sitting on a huge stone throne, his face ashen. He suddenly crushed the armrest of his chair.","“Trash! They’re all trash! A group of people couldn’t even kill a single person, and they all died in Sierra Holy Demon? That Lone Star is trash too. He was killed by an outer disciple!” Wang Yifan, unable to contain his anger, kept roaring.","His shouts could be easily heard from outside the hall. His chest heaved up and down, and the anger in his heart was about to make his heart explode. He thought that he had sent out enough experts to take down Chu Yunfan, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would escape. Not only did they not manage to kill him, but they were annihilated in Sierra Holy Demon. Nobody knew what happened to them.","The target he wanted to kill, Chu Yunfan, had not only escaped, but had also taken advantage of the situation and killed Lone Star.","In Wnag Sifan’s eyes, Lone Star was also a good-for-nothing. Even if he was like a lamp that had run out of oil, he still died at the hands of a mere inner disciple. True disciples like them were used to being high and mighty. How could ordinary disciples be compared to them?","Only true disciples could kill true disciples!","Now, this legend had been broken by Lone Star!","“You’re very lucky, Chu Yunfan, but don’t think you’ll be lucky every time. Just wait and see,” Wang Yifan said coldly as a sharp light flashed through his eyes and his body emitted killing intent that enveloped the hall.","The temperature dropped by several degrees."]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 The Bet With Hua Xianyuan","paragraphs":["1676 The Bet With Hua Xianyuan","After becoming famous overnight, there were many pairs of eyes watching Chu Yunfan’s residence. Clearly, the attention of the sect’s higher-ups and various major factions had begun.","However, to Chu Yunfan, these were all things that didn’t matter. He didn’t care for them. He very well that no matter how much these people paid attention to him, in the end, it still depended on his strength. If he wasn’t strong enough, it would be difficult to make these people look at him.","Three days after Chu Yunfan handed in Lone Star’s mission, a person’s arrival attracted everyone’s attention, especially the spies who were wandering outside Chu Yunfan’s residence. They all looked at the newcomer strangely.","“Why is Hua Xianyuan here? Is he planning to fight Chu Yunfan?”","“It’s possible. When the Gao twins wreaking havoc, only the two of them could defeat the twins. This means that Chu Yunfan’s strength cannot be underestimated. If there is anyone in the same generation who can compete with Hua Xianyuan, it is probably Chu Yunfan.”","“I think so too. It’s very likely that Hua Xianyuan is interested in hunting.”","Many people speculated. But before they could make any more guesses, Chu Yunfan’s voice came from the courtyard.","“Come in.”","Hua Xianyuan smiled when he heard this, and then strode into the courtyard. The barrier around the residence was then activated, blocking everyone’s vision. No one knew why Hua Xianyuan had come. Some people hoped that he would explode and fight with Chu Yunfan. It would be best if he could bring Chu Yunfan down.","“Sorry I did not welcome you properly.” Chu Yunfan walked out of the backyard. In front of him, a youth stood with his hands behind his back. It was none other than Hua Xianyuan.","Hua Xianyuan, on the other hand, looked indifferent. He was clearly not interested in these formalities. He sized up Chu Yunfan from head to toe, and his eyes lit up. In an instant, he attacked.","Boom!","It was as if the world was instantly torn apart. Hua Xianyuan’s hand tore through everything in the air and slapped toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s reaction was even faster. He blocked the hand with a punch.","Bam!","Terrifying aftershocks spread out in all directions, causing the barrier in the entire courtyard to shake violently. The spies of the various large factions who had been waiting outside for this news were dumbfounded. This was a plan to make a move at the slightest disagreement. Some of them had a hint of surprise and joy in their eyes.","“I have no ill intentions.” Hua Xianyuan stopped and looked at Chu Yunfan quietly.","“I know. Otherwise, you would already be dea,” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at Hua Xianyuan.","Chu Yunfan had felt a strong fighting spirit from Hua Xianyuan’s attack, but it was indeed as Hua Xianyuan said, he had no malicious intent, nor did he have any killing intent. That was why Chu Yunfan was willing to stop. Otherwise, today would be a situation where one would not rest until the other was dead. Even if the other party was a seed dsiciple, it would be meaningless to Chu Yunfan. Anyone who touched his bottom line would die.","Hua Xianyuan looked at Chu Yunfan’s words cheekily and said, “Among our peers, you’re the first person who managed to block this move of mine.”","“Then I can only say that you’re inexperienced,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Chu Yunfan had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor in his mind and had seen countless outstanding people. Every single one of them was a heaven-defying monster. Hua Xianyuan might seem extraordinary to others, a rare genius that could only be seen once in hundreds of years, but to Chu Yunfan, he was not amazing.","“Whatever you say.” Hua Xianyuan shook his head, a hint of arrogance on his face. He naturally did not take Chu Yunfan’s words to heart. How could there be so many geniuses at his level? Otherwise, all of Grand Xia would enter a golden age. He was confident in himself.","However, he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan was talking about the Ancient Zenith Civilization. At that time, mankind had developed to an extremely prosperous level. Geniuses were like fish crossing the river, and there were countless geniuses among geniuses. That was an era where emperors stood side by side. Many people were not inferior to the emperors of the same era when they were young. They could be said to be stunning.","“If you have something to say, just say it. I believe you’re not here to chat with me out of boredom,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Of course, I have a reason for coming here. Are you interested in making a bet with me? Let’s see who will become the champion of the inner disciple competition,” Hua Xianyuan said calmly.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Hua Xianyuan. He hadn’t not expected Hua Xianyuan to mention this. Every year, the Flying Celestials would hold a competition for the inner disciples. Such competitions for disciples of all levels never ceased. This was like raising venomous insects, creating an intense competitive atmosphere. The winner would take everything, and the rewards of the annual competition were enough to the inner disciples drool. However, the difficulty was unimaginable.","In the Flying Celestials, those below the Abstract Stage were fringe disciples, and those at the Abstract Stage and Abstract Observance Stage were inner disciples. Those above the Abstract Observance Stage were the legendary elite disciples. Interpretors did not participate in these competitions, but it did not mean that the competition among the inner disciples was small.","The Flying Celestials would select countless geniuses from throughout Grand Xia every few years. In addition to the geniuses nurtured by the sect itself, it could be said that geniuses came from were everywhere. Under such circumstances, one could imagine the competition here.","If one could win the competition, there would be many benefits. There was no doubt that it would allow one to be reborn. In the past, there had been many geniuses who suppressed their cultivation and did not advance to the Abstract Interpretation Stage just to do so during the competion and become the champion.","Generally, new disciples would not choose to participate in this kind competition because it was basically to give the older disciples a chance of winning. The talents of these old disciples were not inferior to them. The resources they enjoyed in the sect were not something that the new disciples could compare to.","The Gao twins, who had beaten all the new disciples to the point where they could not fight back, would have been beaten into a pulp within minutes if they had challenged the old disciples of the Flying Celestials. There were plenty of people who could defeat them.","Generally, only the best among the new disciples dared to participate in such a competition, but they did not dare to say that they could win the championship. That was simply impossible. The new disciples would find it hard to win.","And Hua Xianyuan wanted to bet with Chu Yunfan on who would win as if he would surely be the champion. Once this news spread, everyone would be dumbfounded."]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 Astonishing the World","paragraphs":["1677 Astonishing the World","Hua Xianyuan said with a look of eagerness on his face. It had been a long time since he had met someone of the same generation who could compete with him. In the past, his competitors were martial arts experts who were ten, twenty, or even thirty years older than him. Even so, they would often be beaten up by him into a sorry state. It was difficult for him to meet a match, let alone those of the same generation. It was an extravagant hope to block even a single move from him.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. Although Hua Xianyuan hadn’t used 100% of his strength, he had at least used 70%, and Chu Yunfan had easily withstood his attack. One could imagine that Chu Yunfan had a trump card that he had yet to use. This mysterious fellow disciple was powerful enough to make him look askance.","“If the seniors who are interested in winning the championship hear about this, I’m afraid they’ll treat you as a thorn in their side.” Chu Yunfan smiled as he looked at Hua Xianyuan.","“So what? Among the people in this batch, the only one I’m interested in is you. The rest are all mediocre and are not worth worrying about,” Hua Xianyuan said, “As for the seniors, they’re even less impressive. They’re just wasting their time. They rely on their seniority and are nothing special.”","Hua Xianyuan clearly didn’t care about the senior disciples. Whether they were old or new disciples, it made no difference to him. His goal was clear, and that was to become the leader of the Flying Celestials—to become a powerful figure that could cause all of Grand Xia to tremble with a stomp of his foot.","These people were not even stumbling blocks on the road. As long as he had time to cultivate, he could surpass and crush them all. Only Chu Yunfan gave him an unfathomable feeling.","“Who says that new disciples can’t win? I don’t believe that. There’s still half a year before the inner disciple competition. That’s more than enough,” Hua Xianyuan said confidently.","To ordinary people, half a year was just a snap of the fingers, but to Hua Xianyuan, it was enough to change a lot.","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly, but then he relaxed and said, “I find what you said interesting. There indeed is nothing wrong with a new disciple winning the championship.”","“All right then, this bet is settled. Train well. Don’t disappoint me because I will definitely be the one who will have the last laugh. Don’t disappoint me!”","Hua Xianyuan stood with his hands behind his back, his words revealing an unprecedented confidence. Whether it was a new disciple or an senior disciple, there was no difference in his opinion. In this world, absolute strength spoke, not qualifications.","“And don’t lose before you meet me. Otherwise, it’ll be sucha a shame,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“See you soon.” Hua Xianyuan turned around and left.","Hua Xianyuan’s proposal made Chu Yunfan feel a little excited. He knew that if he wanted to rise up in a short time and even be comparable to Li Qianyuan, he could not do without the cultivation of the Flying Celestials. Only by showing enough value would he be able to receive special treatment from the sect.","“The inner disciple competition in half a year? It would have be done even if you didn’t make a sound. But since you’ve come forward, it will be shocking.” Chu Yunfan clenched his fists.","After making up his mind, Chu Yunfan activated all the barriers and arrays around his residence. Then, he entered the Mountain River Diagram and began to cultivate in seclusion.","The bet between Hua Xianyuan and Chu Yunfan spread. Although Chu Yunfan did not speak out, Hua Xianyuan was not afraid to talk about it. He did not fear the senior disciples, He treated them as if they did not exist.","The moment this bet was announced, everyone was shocked. It was not strange for new disciples to participate in the inner disciple competition. Over the years, many outstanding new disciples had participated in the competition, and their rankings were pretty good. However, it was unprecedented for someone to shout that they wanted to win when they were still a rookie.","Many people even thought that they had misheard. After confirming the authenticity of this matter repeatedly, they were instantly in an uproar. How audacious! Although Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan were considered outstanding existences among the new disciples, they were only so compared to their peers. They were crazy to compete with the senior disciples who had entered the sect for who knew how many years.","“Arrogant, too arrogant. Do they think that the competition is just between the new disciples?”","“They don’t know their place. The rookies of this batch are no good. There are actually two such arrogant people.”","Many people shook their heads in disdain. In their eyes, Hua Xianyuan had a chance to become a true disciple in the future, or even reach a higher position. However, if it was now, they were still stronger.","“Hahaha, interesting. This year’s rookies are really interesting. I can’t wait to teach these two ignorant brats a lesson.”","There were also some people who rubbed their fists and wanted to teach these two ignorant people a lesson.","“They’re so arrogant. They think they can be just because they are respected among their peers. Many of us were respected among our peers too.”","“Forget about Hua Xianyuan. I’ve heard about him. It’s said that he has a mysterious bloodline in his body. His strength is unfathomable, and there’s no bottleneck in his cultivation. But who is Chu Yunfan?”","Many people only knew some information about Chu Yunfan, which was that he had become a seed disciple while in the Golden Core Stage. Although it was considered shocking, it was meaningless in the eyes of a true expert. Any genius who died prematurely had no meaning. Only the last laugh would live on.","“Chu Yunfan comes from the Violet Thunder Prefecture. He might have the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect. Although the Violet Thunder Swords has declined, it was a behemoth that was at least one of the ten great sects. Even if he only has some knowledge, it’s still extremely impressive.”","Slowly, a rumor spread among the crowd, and even among the small circles of many experts, the heat even surpassed the news of Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan claiming to win the championship.","For a moment, those people looked at Chu Yunfan with greed in their eyes as if he wasn’t a person, but a moving treasure vault."]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 Breakthrough, Late Abstract Stage","paragraphs":["1678 Breakthrough, Late Abstract Stage","For cultivators, any fortuitous encounter could not be missed. If they only relied on bitter cultivation, it would be a painstaking effort. The lifespan of humans was limited. Even within Grand Xia, where everyone practiced martial arts, the average lifespan was only 200 years.","It seemed like a long life, but in reality, it was simply too short. Everyone was fighting to reach the next level before their lifespan ran out. Even the peerless geniuses in the eyes of ordinary people were no exception. Although there were people who matured late, the number of such people was very small. In this process, in addition to the resources distributed by the sect, various fortuitous encounters were the key to the rise of each genius.","Which of the major characters of Grand Xia hadn’t had dozens of fortuitous encounters? It was already unbelievable that they knew about some of them.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan, who didn’t seem to have any foundation and came from the newly captured Violet Thunder Prefecture, became a very good target for plunder in the eyes of many people. As a result, more and more people started scheming against him.","This was especially so when the Violet Thunder Swords of the past was not inferior to the Flying Celestials. Although the sect had been breached and their wealth plundered, even if only a small portion of their wealth was left behind, it would still be an astronomical figure to an individual.","What no one expected was that although this was just a guess, it was the truth. The backup plan that the Violet Thunder Swords had left behind for its successor to revive the sect had indeed fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands. However, his confidence was not limited to this.","As word of this spread, more and more veteran inner disciples take notice of Chu Yunfan.","“He’s just lucky enough to obtain a broken inheritance, yet he dares to be so arrogant.”","“When he joins the competition, he’ll learn how weak he is.”","Although Hua Xianyuan was the one who was boasting, to everyone, Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan were no different. They were both equally arrogant.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about these rumors. He went into seclusion and had his own plans. The rumors outside were not enough to shake him. Since he had decided to participate in the inner competition, he had to put on a show.","He had just broken through to the intermediate Abstract Stage, but his foundation was solid. It was extremely firm. The effects of the Brahma Fruit were completely revealed at this time.","The effects of the fruit watered by Lone Star and the sky demon’s blood surpassed any of the previous ones. When the other fruit fully matured, Chu Yunfan immediately began to break through without hesitation.","Sitting cross-legged in the sky in the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan silently looked down at this small world that belonged to him. In the distance, the herb mountain faintly emitted waves of light.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath and quickly swallowed the Brahma Fruit. It turned into a surging energy torrent that flooded every cell in his body. He could feel that every cell in his body was cheering at this baptism of high-level energy.","At the same time, he also began to circulate the Emperor Method and broke through to the late Abstract Stage. In his mind, the godhead was emitting a faint light. The heaven and earth had transformed into another appearance in his eyes. The memories of the Alchemy Emperor were analyzed like strings of memories. He began to absorb all this knowledge.","Although Chu Yunfan had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor when he cultivated, he knew the results but not the process. He knew the result but did not know the reasoning. Chu Yunfan could become the next Alchemy Emperor, but that was not his goal.","Now with the help of the godhead, he crumbled these comprehensions into his own knowledge. At the same time, his understanding of the Abstract Stage improved by leaps and bounds. He could vaguely sense that the laws of nature right beside him.","The coldness of the ice, the heat of the flames, these were things that were common in the surroundings. At this moment, they all seemed so vivid to him. He had entered a brand new state of enlightenment. If this news were to spread out, who knew how many people would be shocked. Although the Abstract Stage was a level where one began to comprehend the natural laws, it was just the beginning.","At most, Chu Yunfan should only be able to sense them vaguely. It should have been impossible for him to sense them clearly. Only Chu Yunfan, who possessed the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, could stand from a vantage point and look down on the Abstract Stage.","Boom!","After an unknown period of time, Chu Yunfan, who was in the state of enlightenment, withdrew from this state. He did not know when he had broken through from the intermediate Abstract Stage to the late Abstract Stage.","His battle prowess had went from the intermediate Abstract Observance Stage to the peak. Such strength was considered a powerhouse even among the many veteran inner disciples.","Chu Yunfan had only entered the sect a few months ago, but his efficiency was shocking. What did it mean by advancing by leaps and bounds? This was advancing by leaps and bounds!","Moreover, Chu Yunfan’s foundation was solid. Everything was so logical. The divine power in his body was at least several times more powerful. Even if he encountered a peak Observer, he wouldn’t be afraid in the slightest and would be confident about protecting himself.","However, Chu Yunfan had seen too many geniuses in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. This breakthrough speed did not satisfy him. Feeling the surging divine power in his body, he took a deep breath.","‘It’s still not enough. There are another four months left. I can reach the peak Abstract Stage.’ Chu Yunfan calculated the time. He had spent the last two months breaking through. There were still four months before the inner disciple competition. It was enough for him to advance further.","If he wanted to break through later, the Evolution Pill would be an option. If he consumed the pill, he would be able to advance several levels in a short time and rush into the elite disciple ranks.","However, that was like using a sledgehammer to kill a chicken.","There was only one option left, and that was to refine the sky demon heart that he had obtained from Lone Star into a Sky Demon Pill to advance further."]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 The Zodiac Fiends","paragraphs":["1679 The Zodiac Fiends","However, to make the Sky Demon Pill, there were many kinds of medicinal herbs needed. Some of them could be found in Chu Yunfan’s herb mountain, but needed to be purchased from other places, and they would not come cheap.","The spirit stones used in Grand Xia were no longer middle-grade spirit stones. Only ordinary itinerant cultivators who had no family would use low-grade spirit stones for cultivation. For the ten great sects, their disciples used middle-grade spirit stones for cultivation at the very least, and the exchange ratio between middle-grade spirit stones and low-grade spirit stones was at an astonishing 1:10,000.","Not many people used low-grade spirit stones as there was a considerable amount of impurities in them. Absorbing them was much more troublesome than absorbing middle-grade spirit stones. Whether it was efficiency or value, they were far inferior.","Chu Yunfan only had 10,000 middle-grade spirit stones in total. Of course, this was without counting his treasures. But even under such circumstances, he felt that his wealth was stretched thin and could not afford his secluded cultivation.","Chu Yunfan decided to take on some missions and soon chose a mission at Merit Hall.","“Take down the Zodiac Fiends who are running amok.” Chu Yunfan glanced at the mission description and found that it was just right for him.","The Zodiac Fiends were a group of bandits who ran around committing crimes in Grand Xia. They had committed numerous crimes. To avoid the pursuit of the Six Fan Academy of the Imperial Court, the Zodiac Fiends had fled to a large prefecture near the Flying Celestials.","Of course, the Zodiac Fiends didn’t dare to come to the Flying Celestial Prefecture where the Flying Celestial Sect was located. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be here to seek refuge, but to die.","The Flying Celestial Prefecture was the core of the Flying Celestial Sect, and that was how the Flying Celestial Prefecture got its name. The sect viewed this place with utmost importance and sent countless disciples to protect the prefecture. Once they discovered any bandits, they would kill them immediately. Even if the bandits were lucky enough to kill the first wave of disciples, they would immediately attract a second wave.","If the fringe disciples could not solve it, the inner disciples would take action. If the inner disciples could not solve it, the true disciples would take action. If the true disciples could not solve it, the grand elder and even the sect leader would step in.","There was no evil force that could survive in the Flying Celestial Prefecture. Therefore, they could only wander around the few prefectures near the Flying Celestial Prefecture, which had become a rare paradise. The Zodiac Fiends were one of these bandit organizations. They were named after the twelve zodiacs, but they committed heinous crimes.","It was written clearly on the recommended strength that it was best for elite disciples to take action. This mission was not recommended for inner disciples. Almost all of the Zodiac Fiends were Observers, and it was even said that the leader of the Zodiac Fiends, Dragon Fiend, had already reached the Void Interpretation Stage.","This mission was not something that ordinary inner disciples could handle. Several groups of inner disciples had tried to take down the Zodiac Fiends, but they all failed. From this, one could see how difficult this mission was.","Because of the Zodiac Fiends’ rampage, the Flying Celestials’ higher-ups were furious and intended to send a true disciple to personally eliminate the Zodiac Fiends. After all, even though it wasn’t in the Flying Celestial Prefecture, it was just around it. What was the difference between this and being in the Flying Celestial Prefecture?","Chu Yunfan accepted the mission without batting an eyelid.","As the disciple from the Merit Hall watched Chu Yunfan’s departing figure, he sighed. “Has he gone mad? He clearly shouldn’t can’t handle this mission.”","“Maybe he thinks that he’s invincible because he killed Lone Star,” someone said.","“Who cares? When he has suffered enough, he’ll know why we recommended elite disciples to take this mission.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what the Merit Hall disciples were saying about him. He headed straight for the Zodiac Fiends.","The Flying Celestials’ intelligence network was very powerful, and he soon found the Zodiac Fiends’ location. He soon learned why the Zodiac Fiends were able to run around and commit crimes for so long without any problems. It turned out that their base was in another dimension, and this dimension took the shape of an airship. They often hid inside the airship, and as long as they didn’t go out, very few people could find them.","In addition, the Zodiac Fiends understood that there were countless experts in the world, so they never attacked the real experts, only ordinary civilians. However, it was precisely because of this that Grand Xia was truly enraged. This was because the foundation of Grand Xia was these commoners. No one knew if there was an unprecedented genius hidden among these dead commoners. To Grand Xia, the slaughter of civilians was more infuriating than the fights between ordinary martial artists. Therefore, when they encountered such a situation, the perpetrators would all be killed without mercy.","On this airship, one could see beautiful girls lying naked in a pool of blood everywhere. The Zodiac Fiends had captured these girls for their yin energy to nourish their yang energy. They sucked these girls to death, turning them into dried corpses. Under such circumstances, their cultivation progressed rapidly. These people looked strangely shaped and very strange.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“Who is it?”","Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance finally caught the attention of the Zodiac Fiends."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 Banishing Demons","paragraphs":["1680 Banishing Demons","The Zodiac Fiends were busy sucking yin energy to nourish their yang energy. They never expected someone to appear in their secret space. Moreover, there had been no warning. Even if a top-notch expert wanted to break into their space, they would have to destroy the barrier outside. That way, the Zodiac Fiends would have time to react and not be caught off guard.","“An inner disciple of the Flying Celestials. Hahaha, another guy who doesn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!” A man with shifty eyes and the appearance of a mouse jumped out and grabbed Chu Yunfan.","Facing the inner disciples of the Flying Celestials, the Zodiac Fiends had no fear. They quickly recovered from the panic of Chu Yunfan barging in.","But before this mousey man could do anything else, Chu Yunfan grabbed his neck. The man was as fast as lightning, but in front of Chu Yunfan, he was too slow. It felt like he was brandishing a sword in front of a sword god.","This was the Rat Fiend of the Zodiac Fiends. He struggled non-stop but could not struggle free. Chu Yunfan’s hand was like an iron hoop, firmly gripping his neck and locking him in place. After a moment, he transformed into a mouse about the size of a human, constantly letting out the most tragic cries.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes revealed a hint of disgust. The Rat Fiend was a demonic cultivator. This cultivation was a type of demonic cultivation system, but it was a very strange branch. Demonic cultivators fused the bloodline of some monsters into their blood so that they could borrow the power of these demons. At first glance, it sounded similar to Chu Yunfan’s fusion with the hou, but in reality, it was like heaven and earth. It was simply incomparable.","Chu Yunfan was only borrowing the hou’s powers, but these demonic cultivators had already turned themselves into monsters.","“My hands are dirty.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","Then, a ball of flame burst out from Chu Yunfan’s hand. It was the hou’s natal flame. Although it was in a different state compared to when he was in hou form, it was enough to burn the Rat Fiend into ashes.","“Rat Fiend! You’re courting death!”","A person who looked like a monkey rushed over. His huge claws were covered in golden fur, and he was about to cut Chu Yunfan in half.","Clang!","He discovered to his horror that his claw had grabbed onto a piece of iron. He could not move.","“Eight Heavenly Dragons!” Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch.","Eight dragons appeared in the air. The dragons merged into one and hit the Monkey Fiend in the chest.","Bam!","The Moneky Fiend’s chest caved in. He immediately stopped moving. All the fiend’s internal organs had been shattered by Chu Yunfan’s fist force.","Among the Zodiac Fiends, the Mouse Fiend was the weakest. He was only an intermediate Observer, whereas the Monkey Fiend was slightly stronger. The Monkey Fiend was a late Observer.","The Zodiac Fiends were not very strong individually, but the twelve often acted together and even used array formations. Ordinary inner disciples would only be beaten until their heads were bleeding when they encountered the Zodiac Fiends. They were simply unable to deal with such existences.","However, they had to meet a super fierce person like Chu Yunfan, who could kill one with a slap. At this moment, the true leader of the Zodiac Fiends, Dragon Fiend, had a change in expression. They had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was at most at the Abstract Stage, so they did not take him seriously. They thought that it was some hot-headed Flying Celestial inner disciple who had a sense of justice and came to kill them without even investigating. They had seen this kind of situation many times and it was not surprising.","“He’s too sly. Let’s attack together!” Dragon Fiend roared.","Dragon Fiend looked like a giant python, but it had a single horn and four legs. He was a giant python that was transforming into a flood dragon. His aura was the most terrifying among the Zodiac Fiends, reaching the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","“You came just in time. Bunch of demons. I’ll wipe all of you out!”","Chu Yunfan shouted loudly. He was not afraid. He leaped up and transformed into a huge hou.","The terrifying aura of the hou spread in all directions. The blood of the Zodiac Fiends, which came from demons, trembled. It was the suppression of the level of life. It was the panic of a berserk beast facing a terrifying existence at the top of the food chain.","Even Dragon Fiend could not control his trembling. Hous fed on dragons. It was equivalent to meeting its natural enemy. How could it not be afraid?","This fear was rooted in his bones and bloodline. If Dragon Fiend was a real dragon, it could still fight the hou. However, he was just a flood dragon with a messy bloodline. Encountering the hou, it was simply a dead end.","While the Zodiac Fiends were scared half to death, Chu Yunfan made his move. His huge body, which was like a small mountain, moved. The earth shook and the mountains shook, but he was as fast as lightning.","Before the three of them could react, Pig Fiend, Ox Fiend, and Goat Fiend were torn apart by the hou. Even transformed, the Zodiac Fiends would at most be at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage. However, after Chu Yunfan transformed, his combat strength reached the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","After the three fiends were killed, the remaining fiends reacted and charged at Chu Yunfan. But how could they beat him?","The Mountain River Cauldron floated above Chu Yunfan’s head. Their attacks were useless when they landed on the cauldron. Their attacks were turned into nothingness.","Chu Yunfan’s attack was fast and ruthless. He could kill a Zodiac Fiend with a single slap. Looking from afar, it was as if a flaming divine beast was sweeping away all the demons and ghosts in the world."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 Crazily Taking on Missions","paragraphs":["1681 Crazily Taking on Missions","The Zodiac Fiends cultivated the demonic technique and had already cultivated themselves to the point where they were neither human nor ghost. The demonic energy in their bodies soared to the sky, and they were not inferior to ordinary great demons. But now that they had encountered Chu Yunfan’s hou, they were truly doomed. They had met their nemesis!","Dragon Fiend watched Chu Yunfan kill several of his comrades in a short time. His eyes instantly turned red and his anger erupted. He could see that Chu Yunfan possessed a truly high-level transformation technique. It was a technique to increase his combat strength.","Chu Yunfan would not suffer a huge side effect like him, becoming neither human nor a ghost. Immediately, Dragon Fiend’s eyes turned even redder. He had suffered so much and spent so much effort to finally master this flood dragon form, and he had even turned himself into a demon.","These disciples of large sects were only inner disciples, yet they could actually have such exquisite divine power cultivation methods. Why? Why?!","His heart was burning with anger and jealousy!","Dragon Fiend thought that Chu Yunfan’s transformation technique was a technique passed down from the Flying Celestials, so he was jealous. The disciples of these large sects had too many advantages. They were not something that itinerant cultivators like them, who were members of the demonic path, could compare to.","“It’s more than enough to kill you.”","Chu Yunfan sneered, and his huge claws pressed Snake Fiend to the ground. With a strong pull, he tore the snake into two halves. The snake struggled, but it soon stopped breathing.","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan started his crazy slaughter. These Zodiac Fiends couldn’t keep up with his speed. In just a moment, they were all killed.","The main reason was that Chu Yunfan’s killing speed was really too fast. He could kill one with just one move. Facing the hou’s strength, it would be fine if the Zodiac Fiends did not transform into their demon forms. However, the suppression from their bloodline was even more serious after taking on their demon forms.","The hou was a terrifying existence that stood at the top of the food chain. Strictly speaking, these fellows were considered the hou’s food. One could imagine how shocking the suppression was.","Soon, only Dragon Fiend was left. He was furious, but he could not keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed. Although he could hit Chu Yunfan occasionally, it was useless against the Mountain River Cauldron. His attacks were turned into nothingness by the cauldron.","“Stop, d*mn it!” Dragon Fiend roared.","Chu Yunfan stopped and looked at Dragon Fiend. He sneered and said, “Don’t worry, it’s your turn now.”","Dragon Fiend roared as he rushed forward, while Chu Yunfan, who had transformed into a hou, stood up and unleashed a set of the Eight Astonishing Punches.","Bam!","Dragon Fiend was sent flying. His entire body was covered in blood, and his scales were shattered. He looked incomparably miserable. With just one attack, Dragon Fiend knew why the other Zodiac Fiends were so vulnerable before Chu Yunfan. They were indeed not on the same level.","The other Zodiac Fiends had not even reached the Abstract Interpretation Stage, so how could they possibly stop such a terrifying Chu Yunfan?","He didn’t know why Chu Yunfan was so powerful, but he was unwilling to give up just like that. He knew that Chu Yunfan couldn’t remain in this form for a long time. He wanted to bid his time until Chu Yunfan’s transformation ended.","However, Chu Yunfan would never give him the chance. His huge body flew into the air and stomped down. “Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Bam!","“I can’t accept this!”","Dragon Fiend struggled to get up, but he saw a sword light appear in the air. This sword light flickered with lightning and instantly beheaded him.","The eyes on Dragon Fiend’s incomparably huge dragon head were wide open. He couldn’t believe it. This puny inner disciple was so terrifying. Just the various divine arts and unique skills were enough to dazzle him. He was simply floored. If he had known, he would not have fled to the vicinity of the Flying Celestials.","After killing Dragon Fiend, Chu Yunfan returned to his human form. His body was soaked in sweat. Transforming into the hou consumed a lot of energy, but compared to the previous transformation, the consumption was much smaller. His strength was increasing, and his experience was also increasing. However, this was still Chu Yunfan’s trump card. He would not easily expose it in front of others.","Because he had too many enemies, he could still catch others off guard. If others knew about it, he might be targeted.","Chu Yunfan cut off the heads of the Zodiac Fiends who had transformed back into human forms as proof of completing the mission. Then, he burned the entire airship to ashes. The demonic den was reduced to ashes in the raging fire.","After completing the mission, Chu Yunfan quickly returned to the Merit Hall and he was served by the disciple earlier.","When the disciple saw that Chu Yunfan was back after less than a day, he thought that he was right. Chu Yunfan must have not done any investigation beforehand and had retreated. After all, it was not easy for many people to find the Zodiac Fiends in a day.","“How did it go? Are you going to forfeit the mission?” The disciple asked.","“No, I’m here to report the mission is completed,” Chu Yunfan said as he threw the heads of the Zodiac Fiends onto the counter.","“What? Complete?” The disciple looked at Chu Yunfan in shock.","He immediately took the heads for verification. After a while, he came out with the results. It really was the heads of the Zodiac Fiends.","The disciple looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. This inner disciple had really done something that even elite disciples might not be able to do.","“Senior, this mission has been verified. Here are 1,000 middle-grade spirit stones.”","The disciple hurriedly handed over a spatial bag. Inside it was 1,000 middle-grade spirit stones.","After Chu Yunfan took the bag, he pointed at the rolling mission board and said, “Please give me this mission, and this one too.”"]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 Two Months, Perfecting Cultivation","paragraphs":["1682 Two Months, Perfecting Cultivation","Two months passed in the blink of an eye.","Outside the bustling Merit Hall, a figure slowly walked in, immediately attracting the attention of many Merit Hall disciples.","“The mission to kill the Old West Mountain Monster has been completed.” Chu Yunfan walked up to a disciple who was logging completed missions and handed over a hideous head.","The disciple was stunned for a moment, then quickly said, “I’ll verify it right now.”","Everyone looked over. In these two months, Chu Yunfan’s name had shocked Merit Hall. He was a mission maniac. In just two months, he had completed hundreds of missions. On average, he completed one mission a day, which was equivalent to completing a mission that an ordinary inner disciple would take several years to complete. This was absolutely shocking.","Originally, many people did not know about Chu Yunfan, but after this incident, everyone knew that there was a mission maniac among the inner disciples. Among them, there were many missions that were explicitly forbidden for inner disciples to take on because they involved Interpreters. Usually, these missions were completed by elite disciplesm, but Chu Yunfan accepted them and completed them all.","One could imagine how shocking these things were for these people.","Some calculated that in the past two months, Chu Yunfan had earned more than 200,000 yuan from various missions. He was now rich. 200,000 middle-grade spirit stones was an unimaginable amount of wealth for fringe disciples. It was also a huge sum of money for inner disciples. Even for elite disciples, such a large amount of middle-grade spirit stones was enough to make them look at each other in a different light.","All kinds of news about Chu Yunfan spread. Many people were discussing all kinds of things about him. And because of him, some people even doubted the criteria of Merit Hall’s mission evaluation. They thought that many missions that were said not to be for inner disciples could be completed by inner disciples.","There were many veteran inner disciples who believed that there was a problem with Merit Hall’s mission evaluation system and decided to take on elite disciple-leveled mission like Chu Yunfan, but the result showed that they were beaten badly. They did not have the ability to complete the missions at all. Many of them couldn’t even escape and were destroyed in the course of the mission.","This made many people give up. Everyone understood that it wasn’t that there was a problem with Merit Hall’s mission evaluation system, but that Chu Yunfan had a special skill to complete the missions. However, they couldn’t find any evidence to support this. Chu Yun had dealt with everything too cleanly and left behind no survivors. Therefore, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had the Mountain River Cauldron and the ability to transform into a hou.","Chu Yunfan was always successful in his missions. Those he went after would often look down on him because of his cultivation level, and then they would be killed by him in one strike. This was also the reason why Chu Yunfan could complete the mission so quickly.","He completed all kinds of hunting missions in the prefectures near the Flying Celestial Sect, and he would not go very far. His efficiency of completing missions was extremely high, so much so that people could barely react in time.","Soon, the disciple had finished verifying and handed a spatial bag to Chu Yunfan. “Senior Chu, there are 2,000 medium-grade spirit stones inside. It’s the reward for killing the Old West Mountain Monster.”","“Thank you.” Chu Yunfan nodded and took the spirit stones.","Many of the fringe and inner disciples present had on envious expressions. In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was a classic example of a rich man. However, they did not know that his pockets were empty. Although he earned spirit stones quickly, he spent them just as quickly. Almost all his spirit stones were spent as soon as they were earned. They were either used to purchase medicinal herbs to make the Sky Demon Pill or used for his personal cultivation. There were also the operation of the herb mountain, the growth of the Brahma Tree, and so on. All of these required a large number of middle-grade spirit stones. Therefore, other than these 2,000 medium-grade spirit stones, Chu Yunfan did not have anything else left.","What made many people feel strange was that this quest maniac did not accept another quest after completing this one. This made many people feel a little stunned. This didn’t match the image of Chu Yunfan in their hearts.","‘It’s time to make the Sky Demon Pill.’","In the past two months, he had crazily accepted missions. It was not as simple as earning 200,000 middle-grade spirit stones. The missions had also served to temper him. This was the reason why among the many missions, he chose only to pursue and kill those who were at the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","This was a very rare experience for him. Many things could only be comprehended in battle. It was impossible to comprehend it unless in battle.","After mastering all kinds of martial arts, he became more and more familiar with the use of the Mountain River Cauldron. Most importantly, his speed of transforming into a hou was slowly increasing and he could maintain the form for longer as well. From the original ten minutes, he could now maintain it for fifteen minutes. His control over the hou’s strength had improved tremendously. These were things that could not be bought.","Under such circumstances, his cultivation base had been polished until it reached the late Abstract Stage. Now, it was finally time for him to take another step forward, and there were only two months left before the inner disciple competition.","‘I will become the champion. There’s no point in participating if you don’t win,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","These past two months had naturally not been peaceful. In fact, it had been turbulent inside and outside the Flying Celestials. Chu Yunfan had lost count of the amount of times he had been ambushed.","After the news that Chu Yunfan might have the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect spread, many people became jealous. There were many people who were could not make a move, but many people on the wanted list used various methods to find Chu Yunfan. No one knew who was behind these people, but they came knocking on Chu Yunfan’s door one by one.","However, Chu Yunfan killed all those who came knocking, and many of them were bandits on the wanted list. This allowed him to easily and quickly complete his missions."]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 Sky Demon Pill Formation, Secluded Cultivation","paragraphs":["1683 Sky Demon Pill Formation, Secluded Cultivation","In these two months, Chu Yunfan had polished his own cultivation until it became solid. And now, it was finally time to reap the rewards.","Chu Yunfan returned to his residence in the Flying Celestials and entered the Mountain River Diagram. The medicinal herbs that he had purchased through various methods in the past two months were piled up like a mountain.","With the Merit Hall’s system, he had anonymously posted his requests with Merit Hall and got others to help him gather these herbs. He knew that he was now the target of public criticism, and because of these rumors, many people wouldn’t mind giving him a little trouble.","Under such circumstances, he had to be careful. He could not fail in making the Sky Demon Pill. Therefore, he put up the mission anonymously and bought the medicinal herbs one after another.","Chu Yunfan extended his hand and summoned the Mountain River Cauldron. The cauldron floated quietly in front of him. Looking at the ancient and complicated patterns on the cauldron, he wondered how long it had been baptized.","He made a hand seal, and a flame appeared out of thin air. This was an alchemic fire he had cultivated. The color of the flame was snow-white but it wasn’t snow. On the contrary, it had an extremely high temperature. An alchemist with such a cultivation base would naturally not use ordinary flames to make pills.","Chu Yunfan followed the steps in the Sky Demon Pill recipe in his memory and began to add herbs into the cauldron. Within minutes, his divine power had been consumed by half. The maintenance of this alchemic fire consumed a lot of divine power, so he quickly swallowed some recovery pills. After feeling that the speed of his replenishment could match the speed of his consumption, he relaxed.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan was using the Mountain River Cauldron to make pills. He found that the speed was simply unbelievable. Previously, when Chu Yunfan used an ordinary alchemical furnace, his efficiency was less than 1% of the efficiency of the Mountain River Cauldron.","Making the Sky Demon Pill was simple enough, but with the help of the Mountain River Cauldron, this process was made even faster. One medicinal ingredient after another was thrown in and fused in the mixture.","Seconds and minutes passed. Chu Yunfan worked day and night to make the pill. Finally, as the lid of the cauldron opened, a shocking medicinal aura rushed out. He was instantly immersed in this medicinal aura and he felt all the pores on his body open.","His divine power became even more exquisite!","Chu Yunfan spotted two Sky Demon Pills lying quietly in the cauldron. These two Sky Demon Pills didn’t look like ordinary pills. They had the shape of demons. Chu Yunfan could even vaguely see their faces.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t think it was a big deal. Many of the pills refined by teh Alchemy Emperor had been like this. They didn’t look like ordinary pills. There were even some very shocking ones that began to undergo tribulation from the moment they were made, wanting to transform into real living beings.","These pills had absorbed the spirit energy of nature and was the best of the world. Chu Yunfan had seen all kinds of pills in the shape of ferocious beasts, humans, and even plants many times in the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so he was very clear about this.","Chu Yunfan put one of the pills into a jade box to prevent the medicinal properties from leaking out and consumed the other. He looked at the Mountain River Cauldron and clicked his tongue in wonder. Without the help of the cauldron, it would have taken him at least a month to make the Sky Demon Pill. That period been greatly shortened.","As expected of a magic tool before the Alchemy Emperor reached enlightement. It was not without reason that the Violet Thunder Swords had treated the Mountain River Cauldron as one of the necessary means to pass down their sect.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged and swallowed the Sky Demon Pill. He felt as if a small person had entered his body, and it was not easy to dissolve the pill. He circulated the Emperor Method and the Celestial Devouring Art and began to refine the Sky Demon Pill.","Finally, the Sky Demon Pill turned into a torrent and rushed into every cell of Chu Yunfan. There was a surge of energy that rushed directly into his mind. This was the most dangerous step.","This was the most difficult step of the Abstract Stage. All cultivation before the Abstract Stage was related to the physical body, while the cultivation of the Abstract Stage was related to the mind. It was necessary to further stimulate the brain and develop the abilities of the brain, so as to be able to further comprehend the nature’s laws. This was all extremely dangerous. The brain was too mysterious. If one was not careful, one might turn into an idiot.","Time passed quickly as Chu Yunfan continued to comprehend the Dao and break through the barrier of the Abstract Stage.","Meanwhile, at the main hall of Astonishing Cloud Peak.","Wang Yifan’s face was ashen as he listened to the reports from his disciples. Though he had been in secluded cultivation, the disciples hadn’t stopped making moves.","When they heard that Chu Yunfan was courting death and wanted to leave the Flying Celestials, they were overjoyed. They sent many people after him, both openly and secretly. Other than the original disciples of the Flying Celestial Sect, there had been some people who were on Grand Xia’s wanted list. Each of these people had a great reputation and had committed heinous crimes, and they all had a cooperative relationship with Wang Yifan.","After all, these lawless characters were afraid that Grand Xia would suddenly come and wipe them out. They needed a stable channel of information, and Wang Yifan had some shady matters that he needed them to handle. Because of this, the two sides hit it off and had been working together for a long time.","However, these experts who were sent out were actually unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. In more than two months, Chu Yunfan had easily completed more than a hundred missions."]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 Chu Yunfan Will Never Return","paragraphs":["1684 Chu Yunfan Will Never Return","In other words, Chu Yunfan had safely entered and exited the Flying Celestials more than a hundred times, and this did not include the pursuit of others. Nobody knew how Chu Yunfan managed to avoid being hunted down by these people. There were even some vicious people on the wanted list that even elite disciples couldn’t deal with.","As long as they were targeted, they would be dead for sure. However, no one could find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, let alone those who were weaker. And even when they found him, they would be killed.","“Useless! You’re all useless! This is such a small matter, and you can’t even get it done?!” Wang Yifan said angrily, “Chu Yunfan is so big, yet you can’t find him? Are you blind?!”","“Senior Wang, we’ve tried our best to find him, but we’re always one step behind. Chu Yunfan is vigilant, and our people often disappear halfway,” the disciple said with a bitter smile.","There were many disciples who had come to Startling Cloud Peak to join Wang Yifan. Among those who came were many inner and even elite disciples. There was no shortage of manpower, but after Chu Yunfan’s continuous killings in the past two months, their numbers had taken a big hit.","Everyone now saw Chu Yunfan as a tiger’s den. It was simply a one-way trip. Ordinary inner disciples and even elite disciples would fall at Chu Yunfan’s hands if they went. Although there was no clear information that these missing disciples were related to Chu Yunfan, it was fine if it happened once or twice. After so many times, even the most stupid person would realize that they must have died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Although they didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was like a demon to the disciples of Startling Cloud Peak, devouring all those who chased after him.","Everyone came to treat this task as a chore, and no one was willing to accept this mission. They were scared of being killed by Chu Yunfan. Many people were not afraid of death, but dying in such a strange way was what everyone was most afraid of.","When Wang Yifan heard this, his breathing quickened. Dealing with Chu Yunfan was more difficult than he had anticipated. He had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously. In his heart, Chu Yunfan’s was just Yi Yunyao’s dog. The person he wanted to target and slap in the face was actually Yi Yunyao. As for Chu Yunfan, it was just a side quest.","However, these consecutive failures made him slowly pay more attention to Chu Yunfan. He had a vague feeling that Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with. If he did not make a move, he might lose control of the situation.","Wnag Yifan couldn’t directly attack because of Yi Yunyao, but in his eyes, Chu Yunfan was like a toad crawling on its feet. Chu Yunfan couldn’t hurt anyone, but the sight of him was disgusting.","“Chu Yunfan must be eliminated!” Wang Yifan’s eyes flashed with killing intent, as if he was a ferocious beast that could devour anyone at any time. “Get me Yuwen Xing.”","“Yes, Senior Wang.” The disciple quickly went down to report.","A moment later, a handsome man in his twenties strode in.","“Greetings, Senior Wang.” The man bowed to Wang Yifan.","“How’s your cultivation?” Wang Yifan said with a smile.","“Thank you for your concern, Senior Wang. I just came out of seclusion today and am only one step away from the Abstract Interpretation Stage,” Yuwen Xing said with cupped his hands.","“Pretty good. Among the many disciples who have joined me, your talent is one of the best. Last time, I didn’t allow you to participate in the inner disciple competition, but this time, I want you to do so,” Wang Yifan said.","Yu Wenxing revealed a surprised and happy expression. There were countless people like him who relied on a true disciple. The true disciples were from different factions and small sects. In the future, when these true disciples ascended to high positions and maybe even became sect leaders, they would be the core team behind these true disciples and their future glory would be limitless.","Thus, Yuwen Xing didn’t dare to disobey Wang Yifan’s words. He hadn’t participated in the last inner disciple competition, but it was different this time. His cultivation had long reached the Abstract Stage, and he was only a step away from the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Once he broke through, he could become and elite disciple.","Of course, even after becoming an elite disciple, he still wouldn’t dare to be impudent before Wang Yifan. The difference between elite disciples and true disciples was like heaven and earth.","“Thank you, Senior Wang,” Yuwen Xing said.","Wang Yifan nodded. “You have talent, so why would I stop you from participating? It’s just that your cultivation level was still far below during the last batch, so there was no point in participating. As the saying goes, to make a name for yourself, you have to surprise everyone with a single brilliant feat. If you want the sect to look at you in a different light, you have to became the champion.”","“I will never forget your painstaking help during my cultivation, Senior Wang.” Yuwen Xing quickly expressed his loyalty.","Wang Yifan smiled in satisfaction. “Winning the inner disciple competition is important, but I want you to pay attention to one particular person—Chu Yunfan. He’s cunning and pretty strong. I want you to kill him in the inner disciple competition.”","When Yuwen Xing heard this, he was startled. He had been in seclusion for half a year and had just been called out by Wang Yifan. If Wang Yifan hadn’t called him out, he might have broken through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage before coming out. Therefore, he didn’t know anything about Chu Yunfan, but for Wang Yifan to treat him so seriously, Chu Yunfan must be a handful.","Yuwen Xing said, “I understand. Don’t worry, Senior Wang. Since he has offended you, he is also my enemy. Once I see him, I will not let him go.”","Yuwen Xing had a confident expression. If it was anything else, he might not be confident, but if it was the inner disciple competition, it would be as easy as flipping his hand. He firmly believed that he was invincible within this cultivation level. Unless he encountered elite disciples, ordinary inner disciples would die if they went up against him.","“Good!” Wang Yifan said, “I shall give you the Divinity Slicer. Once you kill him, I’ll give you more.”","Wang Yifan flicked his finger and a ray of light entered Yuwen Xing’s mind. Yuwen Xing closed his eyes. He saw a shining sword in his mind. It was the Divinity Slicer he had dreamed of.","“Thank you, Senior Wang. I will do my best in the inner disciple competition to make sure that Chu Yunfan doesn’t return.”"]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 Peak of the Abstract Stage","paragraphs":["1685 Peak of the Abstract Stage","Time fly by quickly, especially during cultivation. In the blink of an eye, another month had passed. In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. The aura on his body had reached a state of perfection, and it was restrained. This was the state he was in when he had reached the peak of the Abstract Stage.","This was what he had been pursuing all along. The Alchemy Emperor had lacked in the path of cultivation because his main energy was not on martial arts. Becoming an Alchemy Emperor with the alchemy path, to be precise, was considered a different path. There was a flaw in his combat strength, and he was not as invincible as martial arts experts who became emperors.","This was exactly what Chu Yunfan was trying his best to avoid.","Along with his cultivation stepping into the peak Abstract Stage, his battle prowess also soared to the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage. At this moment, his appearance did not change, but there was a terrifying blood essence surging inside his body. It was a true peak state.","“Inner disciple competition? I’m determined to win it,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. He was determined to win the inner disciple competition. No matter who was in front of him, they could not stop him in his current state.","God would kill whoever stood in his way.","What he was thinking about now was something else. How could he take another step forward and step into the Abstract Observance Stage? That was another stage. If one said that the Abstract Stage only faintly understanding some traces of nature’s laws, then the Abstract Observance Stage was the true beginning of understanding. When one reached the Abstract Observance Stage, it would be even clearer. At that time, his battle prowess would even be comparable to elite disciples.","Elite disciples were different from the ordinary inner disciples. They were the true backbone of the Flying Celestials. Each of them had a combat strength far superior to the ordinary inner disciples. They were the true main force of the Flying Celestials’ conquests. The reason why it was rare to see traces of these disciples in the Flying Celestials was that elite disciples at this level often had to go out and serve Grand Xia.","This was the agreement made by the various sects when they first established Grand Xia. Ordinary fringe and inner disciples could be ignored, but elite disciples had to serve Grand Xia. After all, the stability of the empire was the same as the stability of the various sects. By serving Grand Xia, one would be serving the various sects and all living beings of Grand Xia.","Basically, they either entered the court as officials or led troops to various places to fight. The civil and military were divided equally. Therefore, in the Flying Celestials, the strongest disciples were naturally the true disciples, and then the inner disciples.","This was because ordinary elite disciples had their duties. It was common for them not to return to the Flying Celestials for five or even ten years.","Suddenly, a loud noise came from the courtyard outside, interrupting Chu Yunfan’s thoughts. He turned around and left the Mountain River Diagram. Then, he left the courtyard and looked at the sky outside.","The sky was filled with flying lights. However, most of them were fringe and inner disciples who had come to watch from the East District. The real protagonist was a young man in a moon-white robe. He stood tall and straight with his hands behind his back, looking at Chu Yunfan from above.","When he saw Chu Yunfan come out, the young man raised his eyebrows and asked, “Are you Chu Yunfan?”","“That’s right. Who are you?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“My name is Su Hongchang.” The young man looked at Chu Yunfan.","“It’s him. Why is he back? Is he here to participate in the inner disciple competition?”","“That must be the case. It’s said that Su Hongchang started touring Grand Xia three years ago. Now that he’s back, he must be back to win the competition.”","“That’s right. If that’s the case, then he must be here to win. Three years ago, he was already in the top ten. There’s definitely a possibility of him winning.”","The crowd started to discuss animatedly. Many veteran inner and fringe disciples had heard of Su Hongchang. His strength was extraordinary. He was one of the top ten in the inner disciple competition three years ago. Such a person could be said to be very powerful. After that, he began to tour Grand Xia. And after returning three years later, his strength would definitely be even more terrifying.","Many people understood that some people had great ambitions and wanted to become true disciples in the future, or even advance one step further. Therefore, the foundation at the Abstract Observance Stage was especially important, so they weren’t in a hurry to directly break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Instead, they had to polish and polish themselves so that their cultivation level would be flawless and their foundation would be stable.","“That’s right, I’m Chu Yunfan,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“I heard that you made a bet with Hua Xianyuan to win this year’s competition? “Su Hongchang asked as he glanced at Chu Yunfan.","“That’s right.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Su Hongchang sneered and said, “You newcomers don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth. Do they think the inner disciple competition is a game? Or are you relying on your so-called seed disciple status? Those who were qualified to enter the competition, which one of them was not a former seed disciple?”","“What does any of this have to do with you?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“That’s right. This has nothing to do with me. However, what happens next has something to do with you. I heard that you obtained an Evolution Pill,” Su Hongchang said indifferently, “Sell it to me for two hundred thousand middle-grade spirit stones.”","“Are you kidding? I’m sorry, I’m not selling it.” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","Considering the value of the Evolution Pill, it was no different from snatching it for a mere 200,000 middle-grade spirit stones. With that, Chu Yunfan turned around and left.","“You won’t sell it? This matter is not up to you. Do you think that a mere newbie disciple like you can protect the Evolution Pill? I advise you to hand it over. Otherwise, you’ll suffer the consequences.” Su Hongchang’s face darkened as he stared coldly at Chu Yunfan.","“You’re just an inner disciple. I don’t know who’s behind you, but you’re just a dog.” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 Instantly Defeating Su Hongchang","paragraphs":["1686 Instantly Defeating Su Hongchang","This pill could allow elite disciples to be reborn and increase their chances of becoming a true disciple. Even for true disciples, it was quite useful. One could imagine how many people were eyeing it covetously.","However, everyone was afraid of others and the rules of the sect, so they did not directly attack Chu Yunfan. They maintained a state of balance. But now, there was someone who couldn’t hold it in anymore, so Su Hongchang appeared. Although he was the one who appeared, Chu Yunfan knew that he was just a pretense.","Su Hongchang was only an inner disciple. Though he was at the peak among the inner disciples, he was useless against elite disciples or even true disciples. Therefore, he was only a spokesperson for one or even a few people.","Some people couldn’t come forward, so Su Hongchang came forward. That was why Chu Yunfan said that Su Hongchang was just someone else’s dog.","“You’re courting death!”","Su Hongchang was instantly enraged. His mana boiled, and his voice was like thunder. This was a special cultivation technique that he cultivated, the Lightning Body Tempering Technique. His entire cultivation was based on this technique.","The thunderous fluctuations emitted by his voice swept in Chu Yunfan’s direction. However, when these lightning fluctuations were about to touch Chu Yunfan, they disappeared without a trace. They could not cause any damage to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan turned around and looked at Su Hongchang. “Are you trying to get yourself killed?”","Everyone was in an uproar. Chu Yunfan’s courage was extraordinary. If it were them, they would not have the courage to fight Su Hongchang. Among the inner disciples, Su Hongchang was one of the top existences. If he wanted to, he could quickly become an elite disciple.","Su Hongchang looked at Chu Yunfan. His eyes were filled with coldness as he stared at Chu Yunfan. This time, he did not underestimate Chu Yunfan like before. Although Chu Yunfan seemed to only be in the Abstract Stage, just from the fact that Chu Yunfan could easily withstand his soundwave attack, he was not an ordinary inner disciple.","“200,000 middle-grade spirit stones is already a good price. Don’t be so shameless.” Su Hongchang sneered.","“I’m being shameless?” Chu Yunfan was instantly angered by Su Hongchang’s attitude.","“I’ll capture you first.”","Su Hongchang took the lead and attacked Chu Yunfan. A long blue saber had appeared in his hand. He held it in his hand. The blue saber flickered with lightning and then suddenly slashed at Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","A terrifying blue lightning dragon suddenly appeared. It was lifelike, like a real dragon. Then, the saber slashed at Chu Yunfan. The terrifying lightning lit up the world, illuminating everyone’s faces.","“What a terrifying attack. With just this, Su Hongchang would at least have the ability to get into the top ten even if he doesn’t became the champion.”","“Wasn’t he already in the top ten three years ago? This slash is too scary!”","“Right now, he’s aiming for first place, but there are too many people aiming for the first place. This time, it’s different. The higher-ups seem to have a special reward.”","Just when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was going to lose, his expression was calm as he casually grabbed out. His palm went deep into the lightning and grabbed the dragon’s neck. Then, he exerted force.","The lightning dragon was crushed, unable to affect Chu Yunfan in the slightest. The lightning dragon exploded in mid-air, and the lightning energy was swallowed by Chu Yunfan without leaving a trace.","After swallowing Su Hongchang’s full-powered attack, Chu Yunfan looked at Su Hongchang with a cold smile. At this moment, Su Hongchang finally realized that Chu Yunfan’s strength far exceeded his imagination. This made him feel like he was facing an elite disciple.","“My turn!” Chu Yunfan sneered and made a hand seal. “Mountain Wrap Seal!”","The Mountain Wrap Seal appeared in mid-air and formed the illusion of a divine mountain. Then, the divine mountain smashed down on Su Hongchang.","Su Hongchang was shocked and furious. The saber in his hand once again slashed out an electric dragon. The electric dragon soared into the sky and flew toward the divine mountain.","Boom!","The lightning dragon and the divine mountain collided. In just an instant, the lightning dragon was crushed into pieces and exploded. It couldn’t withstand the divine mountain.","Chu Yunfan’s divine mountain continued to smash down. Its aura did not decrease as it landed on Su Hongchang.","Bam!","Su Hongchang was instantly sent flying. He spat out a mouthful of blood, which sprayed into the sky, dyeing the entire sky with a rain of blood. He slammed into the ground, creating a huge hole.","Su Hongchang was covered in blood. Every inch of his skin had been shattered by the terrifying force. Blood seeped out of his skin. Countless bones in his body had been broken, and his internal organs had been ruptured.","It was just a simple Mountain Wrap Seal, but it had injured a candidate who was highly regarded by everyone to be the champion of the inner disciple competition, causing him to be unable to move.","If it was a life-and-death battle, Su Hongchang would be dead for sure.","The two sides were not on the same level. This attack completely dumbfounded everyone and realigned their impression of Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 Wealth Comes From Danger","paragraphs":["1687 Wealth Comes From Danger","This simple attack was terrifying to the extreme. The power of the Mountain Wrap Seal was unleashed to the extreme in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The entire scene fell silent.","“He’s so strong... How terrifying!” someone said in disbelief.","“How strong is Chu Yunfan?” someone asked.","“Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan have agreed to fight over the first place of the inner disciple competition. It seems like they weren’t joking.”","Some people recalled the agreement between Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan. At that time, not many people believed it. Everyone thought the same as Su Hongchang. It was just two newbies who didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth. However, it seemed like things weren’t that simple. Chu Yunfan had dealt with Su Hongchang in one move.","“He isn’t in the Abstract Observance Stage yet, right? It’s only been half a year, and his strength has risen to this level. That is terrifying,” someone said in shock.","“If Chu Yunfan is so terrifying, I’m afraid that Hua Xianyuan isn’t far off.”","Many people thought of Hua Xianyuan. In their opinion, the current Hua Xianyuan should not be too far off.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Su Hongchang and said, “Weakling. How dare you jump out in front of me. You don’t know what’s good for you.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Su Hongchang was so angry that he spat out another mouthful of blood and fainted. After all, Su Hongchang had come in an aggressive manner, but he was dealt with by Chu Yunfan with lightning speed. He couldn’t even pose a threat to Chu Yunfan. This wasn’t what he had expected.","The result of this battle was quickly spread throughout the Flying Celestials by many people who were concerned about it. This was especially true for those who were interested in the inner disciples ‘competition. Everyone knew that an extraordinary figure had appeared among the inner disciples and defeated Su Hongchang in an instant. Everyone could not help but look at him in a new light.","“Such a thing actually happened. Isn’t Chu Yunfan a new disciple? Were all the new disciples so powerful?”","“It seems like that’s the case. I heard that Hua Xianyuan’s strength has also made a breakthrough. It seems that this year’s inner disciple competition is going to be quite lively.”","“Chu Yunfan’s strength is terrifying...”","“What’s the use of having talent? As far as I know, he offended Senior Wang Yifan. You know that after offending Senior Wang, what good ending can he have?”","“That’s right, Senior Wang is a true disciple. Who does Chu Yunfan think he is?”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but neither Chu Yunfan nor Hua Xianyuan seemed to care about these discussions. They did not respond to the outside world, and even some of the older disciples’ provocations were ignored.","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to go into seclusion to consolidate his cultivation and to break through to the Abstract Observance Stage, a person arrived outside his residence.","“I am You Chuyun. I hope you’ll spare some time to meet me, Senior Chu.”","“Come in.” Chu Yunfan’s voice came from the courtyard.","Chu Yunfan heard the footsteps and turned his head. He saw a tall and slender young man walking straight toward him.","This young man was older than Chu Yunfan, but he still acknowledged Chu Yunfan as his senior without hesitation. In this world, strength was respected.","“You Chuyun?” Chu Yunfan glanced at the man. “As the saying goes, you don’t visit a temple without a reason. If you have something to say, please say it directly.”","“All right, since you’re a straightforward person, Senior Chu, I’ll get straight to the point. I hope to join you and serve you, Senior Chu,” You Chuyun said without any hesitation.","Chu Yunfan was stunned because he wasn’t expecting this to be You Chuyun’s goal.","“Tell me, why do you want to join me? Everyone knows that Wang Yifan wants to deal with me. If you join me at this time and stand on my side, I’m afraid you’ll be targeted,” Chu Yunfan said.","“As the saying goes, wealth comes from danger. The talent that you’ve shown proves that you’re genius that only appears once in a hundred years, Senior Chu. I believe that your future achievements will definitely not be as simple as being a true disciple,” You Chuyun said.","“Although many people don’t dare to get too close to you because of Senior Wang Yifan’s power, there are some people who aren’t afraid of him,” You Chuyun said with confidence.","Chu Yunfan swept a glance at You Chuyun. You Chuyun’s strength was pretty good, and he had long stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage. He was at the intermediate stage, in fact. His cultivation was even a level higher than Chu Yunfan’s.","Of course, in terms of combat strength alone, Chu Yunfan could suppress a hundred warriors of this level with one hand. Although such a disciple was not the best among the inner disciples, You Chuyun was still ranked at the top.","Originally, Chu Yunfan was still a little curious as to why You Chuyun had suddenly come to seek refuge, but now that he thought about it, he instantly understood. The reason was very simple. It was You Chuyun’s first few words—wealth comes from danger.","Because of Wang Yifan, most people wanted to draw a clear line between them, but there were always some people who were unwilling to be ordinary and wanted to take a gamble. Such things have happened many times in history. As the saying goes, when one person reaches enlightenment, their chickens and dogs ascend to heaven. If Chu Yunfan was successful, his followers would naturally benefit greatly.","The Flying Celestial Sect was huge, and there were countless inner disciples. Of course, not everyone was on the same page as Wang Yifan.","“Aren’t you afraid that Wang Yifan will target you?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I’m not afraid. It’s easy to add icing on the cake, but it’s much more difficult to send charcoal in the snow. Besides, as far as I know, you have a deep relationship with Senior Yi Yunyao. I don’t think Senior Yi will just watch Senior Wang deal with you, right?” You Chuyun said, not hiding anything.","It was clear he had done his research before coming here."]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 The Prizes for the Inner Disciple Competition","paragraphs":["1688 The Prizes for the Inner Disciple Competition","Before You Chuyun came here, he had done a risk assessment. Although Chu Yunfan was being targeted by Wang Yifan and looked like was in a dangerous situation, Wang Yifan couldn’t just attack as he pleased. And Chu Yunfan had Yi Yunyao, who was a true disciple, backing him up. This reduced the threat Wang Yifan posed to the minimum. Although it was still dangerous, it was not impossible for Chu Yunfan to come out on top.","You Chuyun answered, “Senior Chu, although you’re powerful, there are some things that are better when working together. There are many things that I can do for you. I can gather information for you. In the future, when you become a true disciple, I can help you manage your mountain residence. On top of that, after you’ve participated in the inner disciple competition, it’ll only be a matter of time before you become an elite disciple. You will surely enter the Imperial Court, whether it is in literature or martial arts. You will need your own people to help you, correct?","“Most importantly, if you intend to fight for the position of sect leader, I will not only help you gain momentum, but more importantly, whether we have enough power will test the management ability of each true disciple. After all, we can’t hand over the Flying Celestials to a martial artist who only knows how to cultivate.”","You Chuyun was straightforward, and Chu Yunfan nodded. He understood that the sect leaders of the Flying Celestials were all talented in both civil and military affairs. They were not just martial artists who only knew how to cultivate and fight. How well these true disciples managed their forces was also an important part of the assessment. Of course, there were some people who didn’t care about this and were only focused on advancing bravely in martial arts.","“Well said.” Chu Yunfan nodded and looked at You Chuyun.","When You Chuyun was talking, he had been staring at You Chuyun to make sure that You Chuyun was not lying. With Chu Yunfan’s current ability, if he couldn’t tell, then it could only be said that You Chuyun’s acting skills were too good. However, he didn’t care because he was confident that You Chuyun wouldn’t be able to withstand a single blow from him even if he wanted to counterattack.","You Chuyun’s words did make sense. Chu Yunfan had to nurture some team members.","“In that case, you shall follow me from now on. In the future, when I come into wealth, you will receive a portion,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Thank you, Senior Brother!” You Chuyun said.","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he waved his finger and a pill fell into You Chuyun’s hand. “This is the Abstract Yang Pill. It’s extremely beneficial to the cultivation of the Abstract Observance Stage. It should be sufficient to help you break through to the late Abstract Observance Stage. Consider it a greeting gift,” he said.","These were the leftover portions from when he made the Sky Demon Pill. In reality, he had quite a lot of these pills. Although the effect was pretty good for ordinary Observers, the effect for him was better than nothing. His strength was now many times stronger than an ordinary Observer, and the effect of such ordinary medicinal pills on him was slim to none.","Therefore, he made these Abstract Yang Pills to reward his future subordinates. He had not expected to put them to use so quickly. He thought that he would only be able to use it when he became an elite disciple. Although these pills were refined from the leftovers of the Sky Demon Pill, they were still rare and good things for ordinary inner disciples. They just were not very useful to Chu Yunfan.","“Thank you, Senior Chu!” You Chuyun was instantly overjoyed.","Why did so many people like to follow the strong? Even if they had to lower their heads and do things for these geniuses, it was because they could obtain all kinds of benefits. Even if it was something that these geniuses and experts did not need, just a little bit of it was a rare good thing for them.","If one had been full of pride before entering the Flying Celestials, then after entering the Flying Celestials, one would no longer have any. All of one’s pride would be polished away.","You Chuyun was a famous genius back in his birthplace. However, in the Flying Celestials, geniuses of his level could be found everywhere. There was even no lack of monstrous geniuses. Those people were the true favored sons of heaven, and it was simply impossible for them to compare with these favored sons of heaven.","Ten years of experience was enough for him to understand that rather than thinking about those useless things, it was better to obediently rely on a monster. On the contrary, his cultivation would advance faster then. Wasn’t this the most beneficial way?","If he didn’t have this Abstract Yang Pill and relied on his strength to step into the late Abstract Observance Stage, he would need at least a year’s time. Now, he only needed at most a month to advance a step further. The late Abstract Observance Stage was considered outstanding among the inner court disciples. And this was just the beginning!","“In the future, I will go through fire and water for you, Senior Brother,” You Chuyun quickly promised.","Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “I don’t need you to go through fire and water for me. There’s only one thing I need right now. Do you know who I should pay attention to in this inner disciple competition? You’ve been in the sect for longer than me, so you should know more about it than I do. Also, I heard that the rewards for this year’s competition seem to be more than before, right?”","You Chuyun hurriedly nodded. “That’s right. In the past, the rewards for the inner sect competition were just ordinary, but this time is different. I heard that Senior Wang Yifan suggested that it be several times more generous than before. Not only is there a million middle-grade spirit stones, but there’s also a Flying Celestial Fruit and a powerful top-grade spirit weapon.”","“What is the Flying Celestial Fruit?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Though, I do wonder why it’s being used as a reward this year...” You Chuyun mused."]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 After a Month, the Inner Disciple Competition Begins","paragraphs":["1689 After a Month, the Inner Disciple Competition Begins","Chu Yunfan found out that there were so many good prizes for the winner of this year’s inner disciple competition. No matter which of the prizes it was, Chu Yunfan urgently needed all of them.","This time, the rewards for the inner sect competition were so generous. It should have something to do with Wang Yifan.","“Is there any precedent for such a thing in the past?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“There are some. In the past, if a true disciple had a disciple who was particularly optimistic about participating in the inner disciple competition, they would often intervene and use their influence to increase the value of the competition prizes,” You Chuyun said.","Chu Yunfan smiled. This was interesting. From what You Chuyun said, it seemed that this had become an unspoken rule. The competition would not attract the attention of the true disciples, and the higher-ups of the sect would only pay a little attention. They did not really care for it.","Fringe and inner disciples were the foundation of a sect and it was good to have as many as possible. But to truly be able to make the higher-ups of the sect look at him, he had to be at least an elite disciple or above. This gave the true disciples a chance to intervene.","It was not difficult for Chu Yunfan to guess that the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials turned a blind eye to this. They did not care about the true disciples blatantly cultivating their own forces. This was even part of the test. No sect leader of the Flying Celestials could be appointed alone. There must be many experts behind him.","“There even have been occasions where two or three true disciple seniors would interfere in the competition all at once. When that happens, the competition becomes even more intense time,” You Chuyun said, “However, there aren’t many such occasions. To the true disciples, the inner disciples are too inferior. Unless it’s someone they think highly of, they wouldn’t interfere in such a low-level competition. After all, if they interfere wantonly, it’ll consume a lot of resources.”","Chu Yunfan immediately understood that there must be a complicated exchange of interests behind this. Otherwise, why would the higher-ups offer the Flying Celestial Fruit as a reward? There must have been some exchange of interests. Wang Yifan probably was already betting on someone to win this year’s competition.","After listening to You Chuyun’s explanation, Chu Yunfan had a clearer understanding of the upper and lower systems of the Flying Celestials. This was a world of great strife, and there were various factions within the sect. The many true disciples and elders were small factions, which formed the huge foundation of the Flying Celestials.","“Interesting. Well then, I have to win this year.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Do you know who Wang Yifan is optimistic about this time?”","“The person Senior Wang thinks highly of is Yuwen Xing. This person was from one batch earlier than you and entered the sect three years ago. Yuwen Xing is extremely talented, and it’s said that his cultivation was already unfathomable three years ago. This year, he’s participating in the competition and surely aiming to be the winner. I’m afraid that even ordinary peak Observer inner disciples will be no match for him. Senior Wang hasn’t been a true disciple for long, so there aren’t many talents in his pocket,” You Chuyun reported. He then asked, “Do you need me to find out about Yuwen Xing’s specific martial arts and abilities?”","Chu Yunfan shook his head. “No need. I don’t care to know about this Yuwen Xing. No matter what, I will make Wang Yifan suffer a double loss. You should just cultivate well during this period. When the time comes, you too will obtain a good result in the competition.”","“Yes, Senior Chu,” You Chuyun said.","He calmed the excitement in his heart. Joining Chu Yunfan was a decision he had made after thinking for a long time. Although he could join others, as the saying goes, it is better to send charcoal in the snow than to add flowers to the brocade. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was a dragon swimming in the shallow waters. It was better not to make a sound, but to amaze the world with a single brilliant feat. Therefore, he was willing to give it his all.","After You Chuyun left, Chu Yunfan continued his secluded cultivation. He was determined to win the competition. In the eyes of others, he had offended Wang Yifan and was basically dead. Only Chu Yunfan himself knew that his real enemy was Li Qianyuan.","“I’m coming, Siyu...” Chu Yunfan clenched his fists, then relaxed them. He closed his eyes and entered seclusion.","Time passed day by day, and in the blink of an eye, they disappeared without a trace. A month later, it was the day of the inner disciple competition","Clang, clang, clang!","Loud bell chimes rang out one after another. A series of hurried bell chimes came from the sky. Everyone knew that the competition was about to begin. A huge golden light appeared in the center of the sect, turning into a door. It led to a small dimensional plane. This small space was the venue for the competition.","The Flying Celestials occupied a vast area, but in reality, the sect was dozens of times or even hundreds of times larger than it looked on the outside. With the Flying Celestials’ main court as the center, many small planes were attached to it, and people traveled through them using teleportation portals. No one knew how many such dimensional planes there were in the Flying Celestials.","At the same time, a large screen appeared in the sky. On the screen was the video feed of this small plane. Through these light screens, the many disciples could watch the competition. After all, these big battles could not be seen just anytime and anywhere, especially for fringe disciples and inner disciples who did not plan to participate. They could watch and analyze, increasing their battle experience and understanding of battle."]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 The Gathering of Heroes","paragraphs":["1690 The Gathering of Heroes","“I heard that Wang Yifan personally intervened in the competition this year. Looks like the champion will probably be Yuwen Xing. The prizes are simply fantastic.”","“Sigh, these people’s talents are terrifying. In addition, they’ve even obtained the recognition of the true disciples. Once the true disciples interfere, probably no one else but their chosen person will become the winner.”","Everyone discussed animatedly. However, the person that everyone thought the most highly of was naturally Yuwen Xing. After all, if one didn’t have outstanding talent, it would be difficult for an inner disciple to make a true disciple look at him in a different light. Moreover, under the circumstances that these people were extremely talented and were fully nurtured by the true disciples, there was no doubt how terrifying they were. Judging from the past situation, as long as there was such a person, it was very rare for anyone else to become the champion. It was almost impossible.","“Yuwen Xing has only been in the sect for three years, and he’s going to become the champion of the competition on his first try.”","“What’s the big deal about the old disciples? The new disciples are getting stronger and stronger. I’m afraid that the top ten rankings will change. Don’t you know that there are two particularly powerful people among the new disciples this year? Hua Xianyuan is said to have a special physique, and his cultivation was unmatched by those at the same level. Some people even say that he has a chance of getting into the top ten in his first year. And then there’s Chu Yunfan, who had just defeated Su Hongchang, the top ten of a previous batch. Su Hongchang’s cultivation is unfathomable, yet he was easily defeated.”","“Exactly. Su Hongchang has completely fallen from grace. He probably won’t be in the mood to participate in the competition. I reckon that after this time, he’ll go into seclusion and try his best to break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage to avenge his humiliation.”","“Yes, these people are only one step away from the Abstract Interpretation Stage, but they are not in a hurry to break through. They want to lay a solid foundation and polish it. Su Hongchang probably won’t continue to endure it. As long as Chu Yunfan is still alive, he won’t be able to regain his face.”","“But I heard that Chu Yunfan hasn’t stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage yet.”","“If that’s really the case, then it’ll be interesting. Yuwen Xing, who Senior Wang Yifan thinks highly of, Hua Xianyuan, who has a special constitution and has astonishing fortuitous encounters, and Chu Yunfan, whose cultivation hasn’t even stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage yet, who crushed Su Hongchang at the Abstract Observance Stage. This batch is truly interesting!”","Many inner and fringe disciples were discussing the competitors who were participating in the inner sect competition. They people become the topic of their leisure time.","In his courtyard, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. He had heard the bell ringing.","‘A month has passed already? And I’m just one step away from making another breakthrough too.’ Chu Yunfan felt a little regretful. He felt that the opportunity to break through was right in front of him. He was about to go from the Abstract Stage to the Abstract Observance Stage. He was probably the first disciple who dared to participate in the inner sect competition with his Abstract Stage cultivation.","‘Well, it’s time then. After joining the Flying Celestials for half a year, it’s time for everyone to know who I am.’ Chu Yunfan stood up and stepped on a beam of light, heading straight for the huge light door in the sky.","Chu Yunfan was only one of the countless streams of light that crossed the sky. He could keep a low profile and no one noticed him. Soon, he passed the door, and behind it a huge arena and circles of seats around them. On these seats, were faintly discernible figures. Ordinary people couldn’t see them as if they were being blocked by something. However, Chu Yunfan could see them. They were the sect’s elite disciples.","Each of these people carried a terrifying aura. Every single one of them was high and mighty as they looked at the thousands of inner disciples who were going to participate in the competition. However, there would only be one champion in the end, and only a few people would be able to stand out.","Only a small number of people were qualified to join the elite disciples circle. The Abstract Observance Stage and the Abstract Interpretation Stage seemed like only one step away from each other, but not everyone could step into it.","Disciples like Su Hongchang continuously polished their foundation to make their foundation even more solid. This was to increase their chances of breaking through. There was no guarantee of one though. Only those who had walked far beyond the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage and had an unbelievably solid foundation could step into the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","Therefore, these elite disciples had the right to look at these inner disciples from above. After all, they had stood out from the inner disciples. It was also here that they had once leaped over the dragon gate and become elite disciples who were truly valued by the sect.","Ordinary true disciples would not care about a competition of this level, but elite disciples were different. Many of them had rushed back to participate. There were many fan favorites who participated in the competition, but their qualifications were far inferior to the followers selected by true disciples.","These people sat in a circle in the huge arena, but it didn’t seem crowded. Chu Yunfan’s gaze shifted to these inner disciples, and he saw that these several thousand disciples were truly terrifying. They were at least intermediate Observers, and there weren’t that many of them. Most of them were late Observers, and there were even quite a few peak Observers. Although these people were hiding their strength, how could they hide it from Chu Yunfan?","From among them, Chu Yunfan soon spotted Hua Xianyuan. He was dressed in a green robe and stood alone among the crowd. No one dared to stand near him and kept their distance from him.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan sensed a murderous aura. He turned around and saw a tall young man staring at him with undisguised killing intent. The killing intent in his eyes was not concealed in the slightest. On the contrary, there was a hint of provocation in his eyes as if he was looking at his prey.","Chu Yunfan looked over and met the man’s gaze, but he didn’t care. The aura on this person’s body was much stronger than an ordinary peak Observer, and he was only half a step away from stepping into the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","This was clearly Yuwen Xing."]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 The Special Competition Begins","paragraphs":["1691 The Special Competition Begins","“You’re dead meat.”","Suddenly, a cold voice sounded in Chu Yunfan’s ear. He followed the voice and saw that it was Yuwen Xing who had issued a cold threat. He had sent it to Chu Yunfan through telepathy.","“You want to kill me? You aren’t qualified.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“Is that so? If you have any last words, hurry up and leave them behind. When the competition begins, you won’t get the chance to do so when the competition begins.” Yuwen Xing sneered.","His gaze was filled with cruelty and coldness. Not to mention that this was an order from Wang Yifan, he also hated Chu Yunfan. This year, everyone knew that he had decided to be the champion. However, Chu Yunfan was so bold that he dared to make a private agreement with Hua Xianyuan to see who became the winner. Chu Yunfan treated him as if he was nothing. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was a kid who didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth.","Chu Yunfan smiled and stopped paying attention to Yuwen Xing.","Hua Xianyuan walked over to Chu Yunfan and said, “There will be a chaotic battle later. Don’t die!” he advised.","Chu Yunfan understood that Hua Xianyuan had heard some rumors. In fact, Wang Yifan didn’t bother to hide it. It would be a huge joke if a true disciple like him had to hide when dealing with an inner disciple.","“No worries.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“That’s good to hear. I will be your final opponent. Don’t die in the hands of others.” Hua Xianyuan glanced at Chu Yunfan and then turned to leave.","Suddenly, a figure arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. It was You Chuyun, and after a month of bitter cultivation, You Chuyun had stepped into the late Abstract Observance Stage, and he was pretty good among these inner disciples. At the very least, it was much better than the original situation of being at the bottom.","“Greetings, Senior Chu,” You Chuyun said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. “Work hard later and try to as high a ranking as possible.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at these inner disciples. They were all experts, but he knew that this wasn’t all of the Flying Celestials’ strength. Many of the true geniuses had avoided this year’s competition because this year’s competition boosted Yuwen Xing, who was specially promoted by Wang Yifan. Many people had probably chosen to fight in the next inner sect competition.","“Yes, Senior Chu,” You Chuyun said.","Chu Yunfan could clearly feel that some of the elite disciples were also looking at him. They were probably discussing matters related to him.","“Is that Chu Yunfan? Interesting. He’s only at the Abstract Stage, yet he dares to participate in the competition. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed that there would be someone who doesn’t know life and death.”","“Hahaha, don’t underestimate him. Although he’s only at the Abstract Stage, he managed to defeat Su Hongchang. His cultivation is probably not inferior to that of a peak Observer.”","“It doesn’t matter. If he can’t take that step, he won’t be able to become our fellow disciple. It looks like there’s only one step between an inner disciple and an elite disciple, but in fact, there’s a huge difference.”","At this moment, the elite disciples were whispering among themselves in the stands, and the target of their discussion was Chu Yunfan. Among the many inner disciples, Chu Yunfan, Hua Xianyuan, and Yuwen Xing were the ones who received the most attention. They all had various reasons that the other inner disciples could not compare to.","“The champion will probably be Yuwen Xing. The others are still too far behind.”","“That’s right. Wang Yifan has placed a huge bet on him.”","“I don’t think so. Hua Xianyuan is no ordinary person. He can barely find an opponent among those at the same level as him. Maybe he can compete with Yuwen Xing.”","“Tsk tsk, this Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan are newcomers of this year. These newbies are getting more and more powerful.”","Just as everyone was discussing, a figure flew out from among the elite disciples. Chu Yunfan looked carefully. Who else could it be but Fang Yu, whom he had seen during the entrance test?","However, compared to before, Fang Yu’s strength was even more terrifying. Back then, Fang Yu was merely a peak Observer, but now, he was a completely unfathomable Interpreter.","Chu Yunfan recalled that Fang Yu had long been an elite disciple at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. It was just that he had suffered a heavy injury previously and his cultivation had temporarily fallen to the Abstract Observance Stage. Right now, he was merely at his normal strength level.","“Quiet down now.”","Fang Yu’s voice was as loud as a bell, and the entire place fell silent.","“Welcome to the inner sect competition. This competition is held once a year, and it is a test of the achievements of the juniors. This is a rule set by the sect. At the same time, we have to select the most outstanding people to train further. As long as you enter the top 500, you will be rewarded. The top 100 will be rewarded handsomely, and those who enter the top 10 will receive special training and rewards from the sect. I think everyone should have heard about them, so I won’t say anything more about the specifics,” Fang Yu said indifferently, “It’s time for the competition to begin. However, it’s a little different this time. Five hundred tokens will appear in the arena. Ten of them will be red tokens, and the rest will be yellow tokens. Those who obtain red tokens will be able to enter the top ten.”","Everyone was in an uproar. Clearly, the rules this year were different from the previous years, causing them to raise their eyebrows. In the past, it was a battle to determine the winner and the loser, and finally, the top ten would be decided.","And this time, it was clear that everyone would fight at once. The strongest would fight for the ten red tokens, while the other thousands would fight for the remaining yellow tokens. Those who could not get tokens would be eliminated.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood why Hua Xianyuan had said that there would be a chaotic battle. There was no doubt that this was faster than a battle of skills, and the difficulty was several times higher. The winner was the best of the best.","“Quiet now. The competition is about to begin.”","Fang Yu didn’t say anything else. Chu Yunfan could feel his gaze stop on him for a moment. Immediately after, streams of light flew across the sky. Most of them were golden in color, but ten of them were crimson.","Everyone moved out."]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 Chu Yunfan’s Terrifying Combat Strength","paragraphs":["1692 Chu Yunfan’s Terrifying Combat Strength","Everyone knew that this year’s inner disciple competition was much more intense than usual. It wasn’t just one versus one. It was everyone versus everyone. But at the same time, the prizes were much higher than usual.","Among these people, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to make a move. Instead, he glanced at the sky. When he saw a red token, he stepped on a beam of light and flew toward it. At the same time, more than a dozen figures headed in the direction of the same red token. Each of them carried an incomparably powerful aura as they rose straight up. The terrifying aura formed an aura field that pushed away the surrounding inner disciples who could not dodge in time.","Each and every one of these people was a peak Observer, and only after their cultivation had reached this stage would they dare to fight for the red command token. That was because the red token represented the top ten.","“Chu Yunfan, your good luck ends here!”","A figure flashed across the sky and blocked Chu Yunfan. It was a handsome man with a medium build and a sharp gaze.","“And who are you?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“My name is Wang Ziming,” the man who had stopped Chu Yunfan said, “I heard that you took advantage of my good friend, Su Hongchang’s, surprise and ambushed him, preventing him from participating in the competition. I’m going to seek justice for him.”","Chu Yunfan was stunned. He immediately understood that this person was Su Hongchang’s good friend. However, Su Hongchang hadn’t told him the truth. What Chu Yunfan said about being ambushed was just an excuse to cover up for himself, and Wang Ziming believed it.","“I didn’t expect Wang Ziming to find Chu Yunfan right away. This is getting interesting. In terms of cultivation, Wang Ziming is stronger than Su Hongchang. Chu Yunfan won’t win so easily.”","“More importantly, the ten tokens will be gone if one isn’t careful. It’s not certain that the person with the strongest cultivation will be able to seize the ten red tokens. One has to pay attention to strategy and methods.”","Outside the arena, many inner and fringe disciples were discussing animatedly. Although their cultivation levels were not as high as the experts in the arena, they had strategic foresight.","Chu Yunfan was one of the most eye-catching disciples in this inner sect competition. It was not because of his strength, but because of his uniqueness. When he first entered the sect, he was the most special one among the many new disciples. He became one of the ten seed disciples while still in the Golden Core Stage.","Outside the arena, many new inner disciples looked at Chu Yunfan through the screen with envy. He had entered the sect at the same time as them, but he could already gallop through the competition while they did not even have the courage to participate. Probably only the seed disciples could participate in the competition. However, other than Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan, the seed disciples were too ordinary for these inner disciples. Just fighting for the top 500 spots was already very difficult.","At this moment, they felt bitter. There were just too many differences between people. If they were geniuses, then Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan were legendary monsters. How could humans compare to monsters?","At the next moment, Wang Ziming attacked Chu Yunfan. In an instant, a huge hand crossed the sky and fell on Chu Yunfan like a huge millstone. On this hand, there was a martial intent sweeping over. This was a supreme technique, the Great Flying Celestial Capturer.","This was a unique skill of the Flying Celestials, a grappling technique. Only those above the Abstract Stage could use it. The power displayed would naturally differ according to one’s cultivation level. And in Wang Ziming’s hands, it was indeed powerful.","“Just this move proves that Wang Ziming’s strength is worthy of being at the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage.”","Even the elite disciples at the Abstract Observance Stage, who were high and mighty, were impressed by this move. Ordinary inner disciples naturally weren’t enough to make them look twice, but these peak Observers were completely different. They had the potential to step into the Abstract Interpretation Stage and become elite disciples who were on par with them. Therefore, everyone would be the center of attention.","But then, Chu Yunfan’s aura also soared to the extreme, and he swung out his fist. In an instant, an asura appeared behind Chu Yunfan. It instantly tore apart the huge hand in the sky and smashed into Wang Ziming.","Bam!","This was a defensive measure of the Flying Celestials. To prevent disciples from being killed, they would be teleported out when they were in danger.","However, Wang Ziming was seriously injured by Chu Yunfan in one move!","“This... This is...”","Everyone was dumbfounded. From what they knew, Wang Ziming should have the upper hand in terms of cultivation techniques and cultivation level.","“What a terrifying punch. What kind of punch technique was that? I think I saw traces of the Great Dao in it!”","“It didn’t look like a martial arts of the sect.”","Many people were in shock."]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 Crippling Two Peak Observers With Two Slaps","paragraphs":["1693 Crippling Two Peak Observers With Two Slaps","“He’s too strong. Where did this Chu Yunfan come from?”","“Even if we were to attack, we might not be able to defeat Wang Ziming so easily.”","The power of this punch was even eye-catching to the elite disciples at the Abstract Observance Stage. The power of this punch was even close to the level that could only be unleashed by an Observer.","“How did Chu Yunfan train? He entered the Flying Celestials with us, right? Although he was strong half a year ago, he wasn’t this strong. How much time has passed? It’s only been half a year!”","Chu Yunfan’s punch stunned the new disciples. They were simply dumbfounded. They never thought that there would be such a powerful existence among them.","This also shocked the old inner disciples. Although they knew that there were two strong rookies this year, they did not expect them to be this strong. In their eyes, Wang Ziming’s cultivation was already terrifying. There were few people of the same generation who could match him. But in the end, he was severely injured by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","This was terrifying!","However, this also made these new disciples feel proud and relieved. They swept away their previous decadent aura. In the Flying Celestials, competition was everywhere. There was competition between the old disciples, competition between the new disciples, and competition between the old disciples and new disciples. The old disciples relied on their cultivation to bully the new disciples. However, there was not even a leader among the new disciples. And now, Chu Yunfan had displayed a super shocking strength, which made these new disciples feel proud.","After Chu Yunfan heavily injured Wang Ziming with a punch, he didn’t stop and flew in the direction of the red token. Although he was delayed for a moment, he still managed to make it in time. This was because the dozen inner disciples who were fighting for the red token at the same time were restraining each other. No one could successfully snatch the red token.","The moment Chu Yunfan caught up with them, two of them immediately turned around and attacked him. They turned into two torrents of energy and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","However, when everyone looked at Chu Yunfan, they saw that he didn’t even look at them. He waved and put the two energy torrents into his bag. The energy instantly disappeared without a trace.","The two disciples who had attacked instantly turned pale with fright. After all, they were peak Observers, and they understood each other quite well. When the two of them joined forces, they would even dare to fight against an Observer. Now that the two of them attacked at the same time, they actually could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Then, Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over and landed on the two of them.","“Oh no!”","They felt as if they were being targeted by a primordial vicious beast. This feeling made their hair stand on end. They were both peak Observers, and they naturally believed their first reaction very much.","They turned around and fled, but Chu Yunfan had already rushed over. He charged toward them like a golden roc. His speed didn’t seem very fast, but when he moved, he was as fast as lightning, like a fleeting shadow. This terrifying pressure swept toward the two disciples.","Other than the two of them, no one felt this terrifying pressure. Chu Yunfan’s control of his aura had reached the point of perfection. If he commanded it to be within this range, it was within this range. Not a single bit of it scattered.","The two disciples wanted to retreat, but Chu Yunfan didn’t give them a chance. Thinking of this, the two of them immediately attacked him. They were peak Observers in the end, and neither of them were simple characters. At this point, they steeled themselves and counterattacked Chu Yunfan.","The two disciples brandished swords and stabbed out two earth-shattering sword lights. These sword lights pierced through the sound barrier and enveloped Chu Yunfan. However, they saw Chu Yunfan raise his hand and grab the two sword lights without even looking at them.","‘Is he crazy?! He thinks he can catch our sword lights with his bare hands?!’ the two disciples thought.","However, they didn’t have time to think too much. Their sword lights increased in size and were about to cut Chu Yunfan down. Unexpectedly, he grabbed their sword lights with a backhand and crushed them as if these sword lights had a physical existence.","The terrifying power of the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique was truly displayed at this moment. Chu Yunfan didn’t know what special physique Hua Xianyuan had, but compared to him, any special physique was nothing.","The Thunderclap Physique had the innate ability to control thunder and lightning, and its affinity for thunder and lightning was extremely terrifying. The Imperial Physique was created by the Alchemy Emperor himself. It was a body-tempering technique that pointed directly to the Great Dao. It turned from Acquired to Innate, which was the most terrifying. It could compete with the strongest physiques and win.","‘How is this possible?!’","A phrase flashed through the two disciples’ minds. Invincible physique. This was a term used to cultivate one’s physical body to an extremely terrifying level. It did not exist in the Abstract Stage.","Their hearts were in turmoil, but Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of them and slapped them twice.","Bam!","Bam!","With two incomparably loud booms, the two of them were sent flying like kites with their strings cut. Blood flowed all over the place, and they looked like they were about to disintegrate in midair. Then, they were escorted out of the arena by two rays of light.","Merely two slaps were enough to heavily injure two peak Observers and defeat them on the spot. Just how shocking was this?","Chu Yunfan’s brutal combat strength was like a humanoid primordial fierce beast, completely stunning the Flying Celestials disciples who were watching the battle. At this moment, they finally confirmed that his combat strength had indeed reached an astonishing level."]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 Sweeping the Field","paragraphs":["1694 Sweeping the Field","“Chu Yunfan is so strong!”","“He’s just an Abstract. How is he so powerful?”","“This is terrifying. He’s like a dinosaur hiding in human form.”","“He’s simply unstoppable!”","The crowd was in an uproar. Everyone in the arena, who was crazily fighting each other, was frightened by Chu Yunfan’s brutal attack. Especially the dozen or so experts who were rushing toward the red token. They immediately stopped and looked at him warily.","Chu Yunfan’s performance stunned everyone, and they all instantly regarded him as a great enemy. If the competition between them was balanced before, Chu Yunfan was like a prehistoric beast that had suddenly barged in. It instantly broke the balance. Therefore, everyone regarded Chu Yunfan as an enemy—an opponent!","“Go!” someone shouted, and all these top experts attacked at the same time. Their target was Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","In an instant, the sky shook violently. Along with it came about a dozen peak Observers attacking all at once. All kinds of terrifying attacks swept toward Chu Yunfan. The other inner disciples avoided the attacks. They did not dare to compete with these people. They were also inner disciples, but these people’s strength was enough to suppress them. Any one of them was enough to blow them up. Only by doing so would they be qualified to compete for the last ten places.","“Hahaha, welcome everyone!”","Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He jumped up, rushed into the crowd, and threw out a punch.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","The entire world shook. Eight huge figures suddenly appeared and attacked in all directions. He and the dozens of experts launched their attacks, unafraid in the slightest.","Kaboom!","After a violent explosion, everyone saw that Chu Yunfan was still standing tall despite the siege. These Observers had unleashed terrifyingly powerful attacks. Like monstrous waves, they swept over in circles. However, Chu Yunfan was like a reef in the sea. No matter how the tide attacked, it could not shake him.","All the attacks were blocked!","Chu Yunfan’s aura was not suppressed. Instead, it became stronger and stronger as he fought. Even the Interpreter elite disciples stared wide-eyed at this terrifying scene. Even they couldn’t possibly ignore the attacks of over a dozen Observers.","In the corner of the arena, all kinds of martial arts and divine abilities soared through the sky, and there were also lights formed by various magic tools. Then, everyone saw how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. He fought against these magic tools with his bare hands. He could casually send these magic tools flying.","This was absolutely terrifying. When others fought, even if they wanted to fight against other magic tools, they would have to rely on magic tools to fight. They couldn’t fight against them like Chu Yunfan was doing with his bare hands.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. They had never seen such a violent fighting style!","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","All kinds of magical tools were blasted away by Chu Yunfan, and those peak Observer inner disciples grimaced in pain as they discovered that the magical artifacts that they were using had cracked. They looked at Chu Yunfan with shock in their eyes. Only then did they realize that he was a monster. Was he even human?","They had never seen anyone fight against a magic tool with their own bodies, let alone damage the magic tool. This was a miracle. Each of these magic tools had its own essence. These experts had spent a lot of effort to refine them. Even a small dent was enough to make them feel extremely painful.","However, they had already reached this point. They had no choice but to fight. But before they could react, the figure that was originally fighting against all of them disappeared. With a streak of purple light, Chu Yunfan disappeared, and in the next second, reappeared in front of one of them.","Boom!","With one punch, he sent this inner disciple flying. The disciple spat out a mouthful of blood before transforming into a streak of light and disappearing from the arena. The spectators held their breath. Chu Yunfan had sent this disciple flying with one punch. And he didn’t stop.","Chu Yunfan threw out the Mountain Wrap Seal. A phantom Mount Tai swelled up and smashed down toward two disciples.","Boom!","Boom!","Another two thunderous booms rang out, and these two disciples were sent flying as well, turning into two streaks of light and disappearing.","Another two peak Observer inner disciples had been eliminated.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan was like a fierce tiger descending a mountain, and as if he had entered a deserted place, he launched attack after attack on the disciples. These disciples who were usually high and mighty couldn’t withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan. Each of them was sent flying with a single move, and in just a moment, these dozen or so disciples who were contending for the position were eliminated.","For a moment, the entire arena was empty. Everyone was dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan was too fierce and scary!","The dozen or so peak Observer inner disciples were unable to stop Chu Yunfan or even injure him. Even the most blind person could see that Chu Yunfan and these disciples weren’t on the same level.","“He’s so strong... Is he already an Interpreter?”"]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 The Invincible One","paragraphs":["1695 The Invincible One","Someone said in a trembling voice. Everyone was dumbfounded. They were frightened by Chu Yunfan’s amazing combat strength. At the Abstract Observance Stage, Chu Yunfan couldn’t find any opponent.","What did it mean to be powerful? What did it mean to be an overlord? This was it!","Chu Yunfan’s performance caused the elite disciples to frown. Even they couldn’t do what he had done. To put it bluntly, if it were them back there, they would certainly be swept away by Chu Yunfan. There wouldn’t be any other outcome.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. It wasn’t that they were weak. He was just simply a monster!","“He hasn’t stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage yet, right? But he’s already so terrifying. When he crosses that line, how terrifying will he be?” an elite disciple said in shock. He still couldn’t believe the terrifying scene that had just taken place.","“How long has it been since such an overlord-level figure appeared among the inner disciples? As long as such a figure doesn’t die prematurely, he will definitely be promoted to true disciple.”","“Not only will he become a true disciple. He’s not even at the Abstract Observance Stage right now. If he becomes a true disciple, he’ll instantly become an outstanding figure among the true disciples. He’ll be someone that ordinary people can’t compare to.”","The elite disciples were shocked. Their instincts told them that Chu Yunfan would soon be able to stand side by side with them. He would surely be the winner of this competition. It would only be a matter of time before he could stand side by side with them. Even if he wasn’t the champion, based on his performance, it wouldn’t be a problem for him to be on the same level as them.","No matter how one looked at it, advancing from the Abstract Stage to the Abstract Observance Stage was far simpler than advancing from the Abstract Observance Stage to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. The path of cultivation became narrower and more difficult as one progressed. This was an unchanging principle.","The inner and fringe disciples outside the arena were all dumbfounded. They had never thought that a newbie disciple could be so powerful. Especially those new disciples who had become seed disciples at the same time as Chu Yunfan. At this moment, they had mixed feelings. Chu Yunfan had not simply left them behind by a single position. They couldn’t even see his taillights!","“I didn’t expect a monster to appear among us. A true disciple will appear from our batch.”","The new disciples were busy discussing this. Although the Flying Celestials would recruit a batch of disciples every three years, a true disciple wouldn’t necessarily come out of every batch. In fact, one true disciple would appear from every two or three batches.","If a true disciple were to appear from their batch, these disciples would be honored. At the same time, Chu Yunfan would become the backbone of their group. It was human instinct to band together, even in the Flying Celestials.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan grabbed hold of the red token and held it in the air. No one dared to snatch it from him.","In other places, fierce battles were still going on. Even if it was just for a yellow token, there were five or six people fighting for each token. The situation was extremely dangerous.","Chu Yunfan looked around and spotted You Chuyun. He was fighting for a yellow token against several other inner disciples. Among these people, You Chuyun’s cultivation was the weakest. He was almost at the point of vomiting blood. The others were trying to eliminate him first as he was the weakest.","All of them were late Observers, but You Chuyun had just stepped into this level, so his strength naturally paled compared to the others.","“D*mn it! Why is this so difficult?!” You Chuyun cursed through gritted teeth.","He had not expected the situation to be this bad. This kind of assessment method had never been seen before. They had to rely on their strength to snatch a token to get a spot.","What was worse was that many people had gathered together in small groups. Once the battle started, they quickly gathered and attacked with the strength of a group.","At this moment, You Chuyun had no other choice. The disadvantage of being alone was now clear as day.","Everyone pointed their spears at You Chuyun. In an instant, all kinds of terrifying attacks swept out, heading in You Chuyun’s direction.","Bam!","These attacks were about to land on You Chuyun and heavily injure him. Just as he was about to be sent out by the protective light, a huge hand descended from the sky, caught all the attacks, and extinguished them all. Then, this huge hand suddenly slapped out and slapped the disciples who were chasing after You Chuyun until they were seriously injured and sent out of the arena.","You Chuyun was scared silly by this scene. He didn’t know where the attack had come from, but this big hand had clearly avoided him and didn’t attack him. Before he could figure it out, he felt a terrifying suction force sucking at him.","His eyes went black, and he appeared beside a person. He took a closer look. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","How could he not understand that Chu Yunfan had saved him? Otherwise, he would surely have been eliminated. He suppressed his injuries and said to Chu Yunfan, “Thank you for saving me, Senior Chu.”","“It’s fine. You should heal up.” Chu Yunfan flicked a finger and a pill fell into You Chuyun’s hand. It was a healing pill.","You Chuyun also saw a yellow token was now in his hands and was overjoyed. However, he was even more shocked to find that Chu Yunfan had a red token. This meant that Chu Yunfan had got into the top ten.","This made You Chuyun a little dizzy. He knew that Chu Yunfan wasn’t ordinary, but he didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to rise this quickly!"]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 Instantly Defeating Yuwen Xing","paragraphs":["1696 Instantly Defeating Yuwen Xing","Chu Yunfan had only just entered the sect but he was already within the top ten in a big competition like the inner sect competition. Moreover, it didn’t take long for Chu Yunfan to defeat all his competitors. Otherwise, how could he have ended the battle so quickly and obtained a red token?","“Don’t worry about your injuries. I’ll protect you. No one will hurt you while I’m here,” Chu Yunfan said.","You Chuyun was Chu Yunfan’s first follower within the Flying Celestials. Chu Yunfan had to set an example and show everyone that if they followed him, there would be great benefits.","“Thank you, Senior Chu.” You Chuyun swallowed the pill.","“No one will hurt him? Chu Yunfan, you’re too confident.”","A figure holding a red token appeared before Chu Yunfan. Everyone focused their eyes on him. Who else could this person be other than Yuwen Xing?","Yuwen Xing flew high up in the sky and stared down at Chu Yunfan. The terrifying aura released from his body pushed all the inner disciples away.","The moment Yuwen Xing made his move, he cleared out a rather large battle space. When everyone noticed his menacing aura, they all instantly fled.","They had all seen Chu Yunfan’s might earlier. What peak Abstract Observance Stage? It was completely unable to stop Chu Yunfan’s footsteps. And Yuwen Xing was similarly menacing. How could anyone dare to stand between the two of them?","Yuwen Xing emitted a strong killing intent as he charged at Chu Yunfan.","“Why are these two people facing each other so early? Experts of this level should avoid fighting right now,” someone wondered.","It was a little strange. Why was Yuwen Xing looking for Chu Yunfan so early in the competition? Those who understood what was going on and explained. Only then did everyone understand the twist in this matter.","Chu Yunfan had offended the true disciple, Wang Yifan.","Everyone was in an uproar. It was fine if it was just Yuwen Xing, but if Wang Yifan was involved, then things would become troublesome. It was too easy for a true disciple to target an inner disciple. A true disciple could crush an inner disciple to death with just a finger.","If it were them, they would kneel before Startling Cloud Peak and beg for Wang Yifan’s forgiveness. However, Chu Yunfan did not choose this step. Instead, he chose to take it head-on. This was why Yuwen Xing had come to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. Many people could see that he represented Wang Yifan’s will. Although Wang Yifan couldn’t attack Chu Yunfan directly, with the ability of a true disciple, he had many ways to deal with Chu Yunfan.","Many people shook their heads. Even among the elite disciples, many people had thought highly of Chu Yunfan, but now they had withdrawn their evaluation. He couldn’t see the situation clearly and didn’t understand who he could and couldn’t offend. If they offended a true disciple, even they would be dead, let alone a mere inner disciple.","Yuwen Xing stared at Chu Yunfan, his eyes shining brightly. He said in a cold voice, “I heard that you’re arrogant, but you won’t get the chance to be anymore. I’m going to finish you off today.”","When many people heard this, they instantly became vigilant. They Yuwen Xing proclaim that Chu Yunfan would not live past today.","“You’re going to take me down?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “If there’s no tiger in the mountain, the monkey will claim to be the king. People like you are just frogs at the bottom of the well. Do you really think you’re invincible?”","Chu Yunfan let out a roar, and waves of divine power from his body turned into terrifying auras that swept out. After setting up a barrier to protect You Chuyun, he turned to Yuwen Xing. Their auras collided, and it was difficult to determine who was stronger.","“A frog at the bottom of a well? You dare to call me that? Watch as I kill you right here!”","Yuwen Xing made his move. He instantly exploded and turned into a stream of light that charged fiercely at Chu Yunfan. The sword in his hand swept out and headed straight for Chu Yunfan.","This attack was terrifying, and it wasn’t the slightest bit inferior to the combined strength of the dozen or so peak Observers from before, and it was even slightly stronger. This was the true strength of this competition’s favorite.","He was a half-step Interpreter. Stepping into the Abstract Interpretation Stage was only a matter of time, and it wouldn’t be long till then.","“Those who run their mouths die!”","Yuwen Xing attacked Chu Yunfan with a deadly blow, wanting to kill him right there and then. Chu Yunfan turned his hand and grabbed out at air. The surrounding spirit energy condensed into a large hand and grabbed at the sword light that was coming down.","Bam!","The sword light was broken by Chu Yunfan’s energy hand. It was instantly shattered.","Chu Yunfan’s physical body was too terrifying. It was not that he could fight against a magic tool, but that he had far surpassed ordinary magic tools and reached an unbelievable level.","“Here, take these back.” Chu Yunfan threw the broken sword lights back at Yuwen Xing.","Boom!","These sword lights returned like streams of light. Yuwen Xing did not have time to react. While still in his charging posture, he was hit. He screamed and fell to the ground like a kite with a broken string.","Everyone looked again and saw that his inner armor was instantly completely shattered. His chest was a bloody mess after being injured by his own sword light.","The entire place fell deadly silent. It was not that no one had thought that Chu Yunfan would win, but no matter what kind of victory it was, it should not have played out like this. In their opinion, even if Chu Yunfan won, it should be after a most bitter battle. Many people even thought they would destroy each other.","However, Chu Yunfan used his astonishing combat strength to slap Yuwen Xing’s face. No one won miserably and there was no mutual destruction.","Chu Yunfan simply swept forward and dominated the scene!"]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 Yuwen Xing Is Dead!","paragraphs":["1697 Yuwen Xing Is Dead!","It was another instant kill!","Within this domain, Chu Yunfan was invincible. Even a peak expert like Yuwen Xing, who was above ordinary peak Observers, was similarly unable to retaliate when he encountered Chu Yunfan.","“Impossible!” An Interpreter elite disciple jumped up from his seat as if he was completely shocked by Chu Yunfan.","“Is he in the Abstract Stage? How could the Abstract reach such a level? Then what are we? Did we live in the belly of a dog?” he said in disbelief.","The elite disciples looked at each other as if they had seen a ghost. Chu Yunfan was only in the Abstract Stage. This made them feel as if their past had been wasted.","Back then when they were at the Abstract Stage, forget about beating a peak Observers, even against ordinary Observers, they were no match. To be able to challenge someone of a higher level was already a heaven-sent genius, let alone someone of such a higher level. It simply made them feel horrified.","“Aaah!”","Yuwen Xing, who had been hit to the ground, let out a long cry. The aura around his body seemed to be about to tear the world apart. A terrifying power was released from his body and his eyes were bloodshot. At this moment, everyone could see that the injuries on his body were recovering at an astonishing speed.","His heart was burning with anger, and he wanted nothing more than to kill Chu Yunfan. He was here to kill Chu Yunfan, and he had looked down on Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would slapped him in the face and instantly dealt him a heavy blow?","This was simply a great humiliation for him.","Yuwen Xing jumped up, and a different blue sword appeared in his hand. The sword was emitting faint divine power ripples. These ripples were the fluctuations of strange runes, and they had unimaginable power.","“Isn’t this the legendary Divinity Slicer?” someone said.","“It is! I’ve seen Wang Yifan use it before. I never expected him to give it to Yuwen Xing.”","“That’s right. This Divinity Slicer is clearly meant to be used against Chu Yunfan.”","The elite disciples all widened their eyes. The Divinity Slicer was famous among them. Wang Yifan had defeated many powerful enemies with it. They naturally knew of this sword.","Now that the Divinity Slicer had appeared in Yuwen Xing’s hand, many people were stunned. They could feel the terrifying power emitted by the sword. An ordinary peak Observers probably wouldn’t even be able to block this sword.No wonder Yuwen Xing was so confident in winning.","However, they were not surprised because such situations happened from time to time. When those true disciples wanted to let someone win, they would often give them magic tools or medicinal pills. This wasn’t strange at all.","“I’m afraid there’s going to be a fierce battle. The Divinity Slicer is not an ordinary immortal sword. Chu Yunfan’s physical cultivation is amazing, but I’m afraid he won’t be able to withstand more than a few sword slashes.”","Some people sat back down, feeling that this battle had only just begun. It would not be over as soon as they thought. Although the Divinity Slicer wasn’t Yuwen Xing’s own strength, it didn’t matter. The most important thing was who would win.","“I originally planned to use this to win the competition. I didn’t expect to use it here. But it doesn’t matter.” After Yuwen Xing spat out a mouthful of blood, he regained his energetic appearance and regained his confidence. He felt that with the Divinity Slicer in hand, the world was his.","“So you’re relying on an immortal sword. No wonder.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “But even so, do you think you can turn the tables? This is ridiculous.”","“Turn the tables? I want to kill you!”","Yuwen Xing’s eyes flashed with intense killing intent. He was only following orders to kill Chu Yunfan at the beginning. He didn’t have much killing intent himself. But now, he truly wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, the guy who embarassed him.","“Divinity Slice!”","Yuwen Xing shouted, and a sword light shot out from his hand. In the air, it transformed into thousands of sword lights. The sword lights tore through the sky and headed straight for Chu Yunfan. The dense sword lights were like a torrential rain that instantly enveloped the entire area.","“Petty trick.”","Chu Yunfan felt the power of this Divinity Slicer. It had been a magic weapon used by an expert who had surpassed the Abstract Stage. It was no longer a spirit weapon. Ordinary people would be helpless against this immortal sword, but he was different.","At that moment, the Mountain River Cauldron appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head. In a flash, the cauldron absorbed the sword lights that filled the sky. The terrifying sword light that could tear the entire world apart and no ritual implement could stop it could not hurt the cauldron in the slightest. After all, that was a magic tool refined by an Alchemy Sovereign before he reached enlightenment. Although it was a magic tool refined before that, its power was not something these people could imagine.","In an instant, all these sword lights were absorbed.","“What’s that?” Some people felt their eyes blur as the phantom of a cauldron appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head. Then, the sword lights disappeared without a trace.","“That looks like a medicinal cauldron.”","Someone thought carefully for a moment and confirmed that it was indeed a medicinal cauldron. However, before they could think further, Chu Yunfan grabbed the ancient bronze cauldron and threw it out. The cauldron flew through the air, and countless sword lights flew out from it, slashing down on Yuwen Xing like a waterfall.","“D*mn it! How is this possible?!”","Yuwen Xing had never expected Chu Yunfan to have such a method, especially when he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had a magic tool that could attack and defend like the Mountain River Cauldron. He couldn’t dodge and was instantly devoured by countless sword lights.","Bam!","Yuwen Xing was slashed into a cloud of blood mist. Even the escaping light could not teleport him away in time.","“He’s dead... Yuwen Xing is dead!”","Everyone was shocked and dumbfounded as they stared at the scene in front of them.","Although he knew that his fists and legs were useless, he was dead. Moreover, he was the one who had been favored by countless people to become the champion. Countless higher-ups had paid attention to him.","When many people looked at Chu Yunfan, they felt a chill run down their spines. They gulped when they saw him kill Yuwen Xing so easily."]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 Subduing the Divinity Slicer","paragraphs":["1698 Subduing the Divinity Slicer","“Yuwen Xing is dead!”","Everyone stared at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape as if they had seen a ghost. The Flying Celestials had done well in this aspect. There had never been a problem in the past. But now, Yuwen Xing had been killed. The many methods that the Flying Celestials had originally set up were useless. They had all watched Yuwen Xing die.","Just like that, he died in front of everyone.","At this moment, everyone finally realized how dangerous the battle had been. To be precise, Yuwen Xing had died by his own hands. If those attacks had landed on Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan would be the dead one.","However, nobody knew what kind of magic treasure that cauldron was. These attacks couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Yuwen Xing did not hold back when he attacked just now. He wanted Chu Yunfan dead. Now, he was the one who had suffered.","“What just happened? He died by his own hands?”","Everyone was dumbfounded. This was the first time someone had died in an inner disciple competition.","“This is his own fault. Everyone knows that the barrier here has been specially treated. As long as the power doesn’t exceed the Abstract Observance Stage by too much, nothing should happen. However, he used the Divinity Slicer. That sword’s power exceeds the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Rather than saying that he died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, it would be better to say that he died at his own hands.”","One of the elite disciples spoke up. This was because the Flying Celestials did not have any rules that stated that one could not kill one’s opponent. After all, fists and feet had no eyes. If they really fought, anything could happen. Therefore, the Flying Celestials had only made preparations. Chu Yunfan did not violate the rules of the sect, but this matter was too shocking.","Many people also thought of this and returned to their seats. However, they immediately thought of another matter. This matter didn’t just involve Yuwen Xing alone. Behind him was the terrifying Wang Yifan.","“Chu Yunfan is in big trouble. So what if he won today? I’m afraid Senior Wang won’t let him get away with this.”","“Both sides are not simple characters. To be precise, both sides are not easy to deal with. Both of them want to kill each other, and neither of them held back.”","These elite disciples looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of fear in their eyes. It was because the shock that Chu Yunfan had given them was too great.","“If he doesn’t die young, he has a chance of becoming a true disciple.”","Some people couldn’t help but guess this. However, this was only a guess. After all, everyone knew that Wang Yifan wasn’t a magnanimous person. He probably wouldn’t let this matter go so easily.","However, there were also many people who felt extremely happy. Wang Yifan was arrogant and domineering, so there were naturally many people in the sect who disliked him. Although they couldn’t make a clear statement at this time, they felt much more favorable toward Chu Yunfan.","“Wang Yifan has suffered a double loss. The champion was decided internally beforehand, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would appear out of nowhere? Wang Yifan paid such a huge price to get the sect to agree to put up the Flying Celestial Fruit as a reward this time around.”","Even the elite disciples were shocked beyond words, not to mention the ordinary inner and fringe disciples. At this moment, they were dumbfounded as they watched Yuwen Xing being killed by Chu Yunfan on the big screen.","“He’s too strong. The number one inner disciple was just defeated!”","Many people were dumbfounded.","“I didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so powerful. Even Yuwen Xing is no match for him. Doesn’t this mean that he will soon become an elite disciple?” someone asked in disbelief.","However, no one could say it out loud. They would all firmly remembered this thin man and would never forget him for the rest of their lives.","After killing Yuwen Xing, Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand and the Divinity Slicer flew toward him.","“It’s a hallowed weapon!” Chu Yiunfan smiled.","Ordinary Abstracts used spirit weapons. Above spirit weapons were hallowed weapons. Even among the true disciples who had surpassed the Abstract Stage, not everyone could have a hallowed weapon.","Just now, Yuwen Xing was so confident that he could win the competition because of this hallowed Divinity Slicer. If used properly, it could even unleash an attack equivalent to that of a true disciple.","“This Wang Yifan so generously gave Yuwen Xing such a good item. It seems like he really hates me. Unfortunately, he never expected this sword to end up in my hands.”","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. Although the grade of the Divinity Slicer was far inferior to the Mountain River Diagram and the Mountain River Cauldron, it was very practical for him. This was especially so since he was going to use the many martial arts techniques written in the Violet Thunder Sword Scripture. He needed such a handy magic tool.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength increased by at least 50% with the Divinity Slicer. His battle prowess was already very terrifying, and he was basically invincible among Observers. Now that he had the Divinity Slicer, he could probably even contend against Interpreters.","Suddenly, the Divinity Slicer tried to fly up and escape from his palm.","“Who dares to peep at my sword?!”","A roar came from the sword. It was Wang Yifan’s voice.","“I didn’t expect Wang Yifan to still have a trick up his sleeve.” Chu Yunfan sneered and instantly understood.","Wang Yifan said that he had given the Divinity Slicer to Yuwen Xing, but in fact, he still had a trick up his sleeve. He had buried a wisp of primordial spirit in the deepest part of the Divinity Slicer. Even Yuwen Xing hadn’t noticed this. If necessary, Divinity Slicer would instantly return to Wang Yifan’s hands. This was a good plan.","Unfortunately, he met Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan grabbed the sword. Countless divine power surged out of his hand and turned into a seal. The seal instantly sealed the primordial spirit.","The Divinity Slicer, which was trembling and letting out a clear dragon roar, instantly quieted down. Then, Chu Yunfan continued his technique. In just a few moves, he wiped out the primordial spirit wisp.","The Divinity Slicer was now solidly under his control."]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 You Chuyun’s Treatment That Made Everyone Jealous","paragraphs":["1699 You Chuyun’s Treatment That Made Everyone Jealous","Chu Yunfan was swift and decisive. Without any hesitation, he subdued the Divinity Slicer.","The elite disciples were stunned.","“What is he doing? He isn’t planning to subdue the Divinity Slicer, is he?”","Some of the elite disciples were dumbfounded by Chu Yunfan’s actions.","“He’s too bold. Not only did he kill Yuwen Xing, but he also subdued the Divinity Slicer. Senior Wang surely won’t let him get away!”","“You make it sound as if Senior Wang will let him go if he doesn’t subdue the Divinity Slicer. I think Chu Yunfan is interesting. He has guts and courage. He’ll be targeted by Senior Wang anyway, so what’s there for him to worry about?”","There were people who felt that Chu Yunfan’s actions were very much to their liking and praised him. However, no matter how shocked or appreciative they were, it didn’t take long for Chu Yunfan to subdue the Divinity Slicer.","This astonishing speed shocked these elite disciples. They all knew how difficult it was to subdue a magic tool with an owner, especially when the owner’s strength far exceeded their own. However, Chu Yunfan only needed a few moves to complete the task. They didn’t know what kind of secret technique he was using. How could it be so powerful and so fast?","However, there was no doubt that at this moment, they had to look at Chu Yunfan in a new light. He, who held the Divinity Slicer, was more than enough to make them pay attention to him.","In the arena, Chu Yunfan subdued the Divinity Slicer at an astonishing speed and brought it back to his hand. This was a swordsman’s method called nurturing the sword.","There were all kinds of methods to nurture a sword recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Through nurturing a sword, one could make the sword and one’s body extremely compatible. In the end, one could even become one with the sword and reach the highest realm of the sword path. Of course, Chu Yunfan wasn’t a swordsman, but he could learn from the swordsmen’s methods.","There were many legends of sword immortals since ancient times. In these legends, these sword immortals could take the heads of enemies from thousands of miles away, and their power was shocking.","At this time, You Chuyun had recovered from his injuries. He had officially witnessed how Chu Yunfan had defeated Yuwen Xing without any difficulty. Chu Yunfan had swept through the entire way!","You Chuyun was extremely excited. He had followed the right person!","Chu Yunfan was strong, and You Chuyun was dazzled by the series of methods. Within minutes, Chu Yunfan had killed Yuwen Xing and subdued the Divinity Slicer. However, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan threw the red token that belonged to Yuwen Xing into You Chuyun’s arms.","“Take this. I don’t need two tokens,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","You Chuyun was stunned. He never thought that he would be able to obtain a red token. How could he not understand the importance of a red token? Whoever had a red token would be in the top ten of this inner sect competition.","In the competition, the top 500 would receive rewards. The rewards for the top 100 would be different. The top 10 would receive rewards, and the top 100 would receive rewards.","If he became the top ten, with those rewards, he would likely be able to break through to the peak Abstract Observance Stage in a short time. Countless people fought for such an opportunity, and many of them couldn’t even get a yellow token. However, Chu Yunfan had casually gave him a red token.","This made You Chuyun momentarily stunned.","“Thank you, Senior Chu! In the future, if you need anything, I will go through fire and water for you!” You Chuyun gave a big bow.","Chu Yunfan had given him an unprecedented future. With the rewards of the top ten, he would likely enter the Abstract Interpretation Stage. It was precisely because the rewards were so generous that countless people came to participate in the inner sect competition every year.","“It’s a small matter. As long as you are loyal to me, this is nothing,” Chu Yunfan said, “I won’t let you down by being my follower.”","You Chuyun was his first follower, so he naturally had to treat him well and distinguish him from the others. The effect of this was immediate. Not to mention the disciples who were watching from the sidelines, even the inner disciples who were fighting for the yellow token looked at You Chuyun with envy and jealousy.","“What is this You Chuyun? In terms of cultivation, he is at the bottom of our ranks. What’s so great about it?”","“That’s right, You Chuyun is simply lucky.”","“Though his cultivation has improved by leaps and bounds recently. I’m sure it has something to do with Chu Yunfan.”","“Chu Yunfan is so bold and generous. You Chuyun has only followed him for a few days and has already obtained so many benefits. If it were me, I would have done much better than him.”","Countless people cursed silently, especially many peak Observer inner disciples who were about to vomit blood when they saw this scene. These people had risked their lives to obtain a red token, and most of them could not obtain one. However, Chu Yunfan had casually given a red token to You Chuyun. In their eyes, You Chuyun was simply lucky. Of course, they would never admit that they were envious, jealous, and hateful.","Even the elite disciples who were watching were a little jealous. The rewards for the top ten this year were much more generous than in previous years. Even they were a little envious. Now, seeing that Chu Yunfan had given the rewards to You Chuyun without care, even with their cultivation, they wanted to vomit blood. This Chu Yunfan was too much.","Even if You Chuyun was at the bottom of the top ten, as long as he entered the top ten, the benefits would naturally fall into his hands.","“You Chuyun is really lucky. If we had someone to help us back then, it wouldn’t be so difficult to step into the Abstract Interpretation Stage.”","These elite disciples sighed. Although they were not as envious and jealous as the inner disciples, there was still some envy and greed in their eyes.","As time passed, the situation in the arena gradually became clear. The battles between the inner disciples also gradually come to an end. Whether it was the owners of the yellow token or the red token, the dust had settled.","The competition entered its final stage."]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 The Finals, Everyone’s Attention","paragraphs":["1700 The Finals, Everyone’s Attention","A stream of light flew into the sky above the arena. Everyone’s eyes focused on the figure at the meeting. Who else could it be but Fang Yu?","Fang Yu stood high and mighty with his hands behind his back. He looked at everyone and said, “The preliminary selection for the inner disciple competition is complete. Those who haven’t obtained the token are eliminated!”","As he spoke, Fang Yu formed a hand seal. Those disciples who did not have a token in their hands turned into flowing lights and were transported out. The place became much quieter. There were only a few hundred people left, less than one-tenth of the original number.","“The rest of the competition will be divided into those with red tokens and the yellow tokens. Those with yellow tokens will battle for the top 100. Those with red tokens will be battling for first, second, and third place,” Fang Yu said.","As soon as he finished speaking, ten figures flew out of the crowd. Everyone saw who had obtained the ten red tokens. When they looked at the sky, they were shocked. The inner and fringe disciples outside the arena were similarly shocked as well, especially the new disciples. They looked at two of the ten people with their mouths agape.","“Hua Xianyuan and Chu Yunfan made it into the top ten.”","Everyone was dumbfounded, especially the new disciples. Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan had entered the sect at the same time as them, but they were not qualified to participate in the inner disciple competition. However, Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan had already entered the top ten and might even become the champion.","What a shocking difference!","This made everyone speechless. The gap between them and Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan was even greater than the gap between ordinary people and people like them who were known as geniuses.","The entire arena and the outside were in an uproar. Among these people, Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan were eye-catching enough. However, the one who was more eye-catching was You Chuyun. Many people knew that You Chuyun had gotten lucky and obtained a red token from Chu Yunfan.","Forget about the ordinary inner disciples, but those peak Observer disciples who truly had hopes of entering the top ten were currently gnashing their teeth as they looked at You Chuyun. If it wasn’t for him, they would have had a chance. However, they didn’t dare to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. After all, Chu Yunfan had just swept through a group of peak Observer disciples and killed Yuwen Xing, and this matter had let many people know of his ruthlessness. But toward You Chuyun, they didn’t have so many misgivings.","“You Chuyun is nothing. He’s just a lucky person who followed the right backer.”","You Chuyun didn’t care about these gazes. He even raised his head proudly. He sneered at the owners of these envious, jealous, and hateful gazes.","‘This is because I have good foresight. When no one was optimistic about Senior Chu, I resolutely sided with him. If you have the ability, you should also find a backer.’","You Chuyun didn’t feel guilty in the slightest. He was only filled with boundless passion. There would definitely be a great future ahead of him.","“Juniors, come with me. Your battle arena is here.” Fang Yu waved his hand and swept everyone in.","When everyone opened their eyes, they found themselves in a small barrier. Inside the barrier were five arenas. They were clearly to be used for the competition.","Everyone looked at Fang Yu in shock, especially since many of them did not think that Fang Yu was anything extraordinary before. However, this move made them truly feel the difference between them and Fang Yu. His strength had reached an astonishing level. Even if he could not compare to a true disciple, he was not much weaker.","Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan had grave expressions on their faces. No wonder Fang Yu was qualified to preside over the entrance test and the inner disciple competition. His strength was probably outstanding among the elite disciples.","Among these ten people, there were some who were somewhat moved. Although they were very confident in their strength, they knew they would not become the champion. Being able to obtain the top ten already offered them generous rewards.","You Chuyun spoke first. He knew that his cultivation was the weakest among those who had gotten red tokens. If he went up, he would only be asking for humiliation. He might as well stop while he was ahead.","“Very well,” Fang Yu said, “If anyone else wants to withdraw, this is the time to do so.”","Hearing Fang Yu’s words, more and more people began to withdraw. In the end, only four people were left. Chu Yunfan glanced at the remaining competitors. In addition to him and Hua Xianyuan, there was a muscular man who looked like an iron tower. His skin was dark and his muscles were bulging. He looked as tall as an iron tower and was completely different from ordinary people. He had a threatening aura.","Other than him, there was a petite woman. This woman was only about 1.5 meters tall, but her figure was curvaceous and extremely attractive. However, her expression was cold and she looked terrifying. She also emitted an oppressive aura.","“In that case, the four of you will fight in pairs and the winners will fight for first place.” Fang Yu nodded.","Then, with a wave of his hand, an arena activated. The barrier and array formation on it activated at the same time, and two names appeared on it. One of them was Hua Xianyuan, and the other was Xia Houjie. It was the name of the muscular man who was like an iron tower.","“Hahahaha, I’m pretty lucky to match with a newbie. Looks like I’m going to be the champion.” Xia Houjie flew into the arena and laughed loudly. His face revealed a proud smile as he looked at Hua Xianyuan provocatively.","Hua Xianyuan did not say a word. He took a step forward and entered the arena as well."]}]);
